da operações essenciais de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Это руководство охватывает основные операции обработки PDF с использованием библиотек Python и командной строки.","ar":"يهتم هذا الدليل بالعمليات الأساسية لمعالجة ملفات PDF باستخدام مكتبات Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر","en":"Goodable is a local-first Desktop AI Workspace (Desktop Agent Runtime) powered by Claude Agent SDK, combining OS/file control, browser automation, and coding..."},"definition":{"en":"Goodable is a local-first Desktop AI Workspace (Desktop Agent Runtime) powered by Claude Agent SDK, combining OS/file control, browser automation, and coding into composable Skills (tool + app modes) to build, run, and publish real AI apps."},"features":{"zh":["PDF ","Python ","JavaScript "," "," "],"ja":["PDF ","Python ","JavaScript "," "," "],"ko":["PDF ","Python ","JavaScript "," "," "],"es":["Lectura de PDF con Python","Extracción de texto de PDF","Uso de bibliotecas como pypdf","Automatización de tareas de PDF","Creación de aplicaciones de PDF personalizadas"],"fr":["Lecture de PDF avec Python","Extraction de texte de PDF","Utilisation de bibliothèques comme pypdf","Automatisation de tâches de PDF","Création d''applications de PDF personnalisées"],"de":["Lesen von PDF mit Python","Textextraktion aus PDF","Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie pypdf","Automatisierung von PDF-Aufgaben","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten PDF-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Leitura de arquivos PDF","Extração de texto de PDF","Preenchimento de formulários PDF","Manipulação de páginas PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python para PDF","Uso de ferramentas de linha de comando para PDF"],"ru":["Чтение файлов PDF","Извлечение текста из PDF","Заполнение форм PDF","Манипуляция страницами PDF","Использование библиотек Python для PDF","Использование командной строки для PDF"],"ar":["قراءة ملفات PDF","استخراج النص من ملفات PDF","ملء الاستمارات في ملفات PDF","التلاعب بصفحات ملفات PDF","استخدام مكتبات Python لمعالجة ملفات PDF","استخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر لمعالجة ملفات PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF ","Python PDF","JavaScript PDF","PDF "," "," "],"ja":["PDF ","Python PDF","JavaScript PDF","PDF "," "," "],"ko":["PDF ","Python PDF","JavaScript PDF","PDF "," "," "],"es":["procesamiento de PDF","Python PDF","bibliotecas de PDF","extracción de texto de PDF","automatización de PDF","aplicaciones de PDF","desarrollo de PDF","PDF con Python"],"fr":["traitement de PDF","Python PDF","bibliothèques de PDF","extraction de texte de PDF","automatisation de PDF","applications de PDF","développement de PDF","PDF avec Python"],"de":["PDF-Verarbeitung","Python PDF","PDF-Bibliotheken","Textextraktion aus PDF","PDF-Automatisierung","PDF-Anwendungen","PDF-Entwicklung","PDF mit Python"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","python pdf","ferramentas de linha de comando pdf","extração de texto pdf","preenchimento de formulários pdf","manipulação de páginas pdf","bibliotecas python pdf","desenvolvimento de pdf"],"ru":["обработка pdf","python pdf","командная строка pdf","извлечение текста pdf","заполнение форм pdf","манипуляция страницами pdf","библиотеки python pdf","разработка pdf"],"ar":["معالجة ملفات pdf","python pdf","أدوات سطر الأوامر pdf","استخراج النص من ملفات pdf","ملء الاستمارات في ملفات pdf","التلاعب بصفحات ملفات pdf","مكتبات python لمعالجة ملفات pdf","تطوير ملفات pdf"]}},"owner":"ImGoodBai","repo":"goodable","repoPath":"ImGoodBai/goodable","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.876Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"Comprehensive PDF manipulation toolkit for extracting text and tables, creating new PDFs, merging/splitting documents, and handling forms. When Claude needs to fill in a PDF form or programmatically process, generate, or analyze PDF documents at scale.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:13.230Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities using Python libraries like pypdf.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Python库（如pypdf）进行高级PDF处理的文档分析代理。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用した高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas utilizando bibliotecas de Python como pypdf.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités de traitement de PDF avancées en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen unter Verwendung von Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python como pypdf.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым требуются расширенные возможности обработки PDF с использованием библиотек Python, таких как pypdf.","ar":"مثالي للعوامل تحليل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى قدرات معالجة PDF متقدمة باستخدام مكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to read and extract text from PDF documents, utilizing PdfReader and PdfWriter for seamless page manipulation and text analysis, supporting advanced features through JavaScript libraries and command-line tools.","zh":"赋予代理读取和提取PDF文档中的文本能力，利用PdfReader和PdfWriter实现无缝的页面操作和文本分析，并通过JavaScript库和命令行工具支持高级功能。","ja":"PdfReaderとPdfWriterを使用して、エージェントがPDFドキュメントからテキストを読み取り、抽出できるようにし、ページ操作とテキスト分析をシームレスに行い、JavaScriptライブラリとコマンドラインツールを通じて高度な機能をサポートします。","ko":"PdfReader와 PdfWriter를 사용하여 에이전트가 PDF 문서에서 텍스트를 읽고 추출할 수 있도록 하며, 페이지 조작과 텍스트 분석을 무결점으로 수행하며, JavaScript 라이브러리와 명령줄 도구를 통해 고급 기능을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a leer y extraer texto de documentos PDF, utilizando PdfReader y PdfWriter para una manipulación y análisis de texto de página sin problemas, y admite funciones avanzadas a través de bibliotecas de JavaScript y herramientas de línea de comandos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lire et d''extraire le texte des documents PDF, en utilisant PdfReader et PdfWriter pour une manipulation et une analyse de texte de page sans problème, et prend en charge des fonctionnalités avancées via des bibliothèques JavaScript et des outils de ligne de commande.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Text aus PDF-Dokumenten zu lesen und zu extrahieren, indem PdfReader und PdfWriter für eine nahtlose Seitenmanipulation und Textanalyse verwendet werden, und unterstützt erweiterte Funktionen durch JavaScript-Bibliotheken und Befehlszeilentools.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ler e extrair texto de documentos PDF, utilizando PdfReader e PdfWriter para manipulação de página sem interrupções e análise de texto, suportando recursos avançados por meio de bibliotecas JavaScript e ferramentas de linha de comando.","ru":"Позволяет агентам читать и извлекать текст из документов PDF, используя PdfReader и PdfWriter для бесшовной манипуляции страницами и анализа текста, поддерживая расширенные функции через библиотеки JavaScript и командные инструменты.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من قراءة و استخراج النص من مستندات PDF، باستخدام PdfReader و PdfWriter لتعامل الصفحات بسلاسة و تحليل النص، و دعم الميزات المتقدمة من خلال مكتبات JavaScript وأدوات سطر الأوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from PDF pages","Automating PDF form filling using forms.md guidance","Analyzing PDF document structures with Python"],"zh":["从PDF页面提取文本","使用forms.md指南自动填充PDF表单","使用Python分析PDF文档结构"],"ja":["PDFページからテキストを抽出する","forms.mdの指南を使用してPDFフォームを自動的に埋める","Pythonを使用してPDFドキュメントの構造を分析する"],"ko":["PDF 페이지에서 텍스트 추출","forms.md 가이드를 사용하여 PDF 양식을 자동으로 채우기","Python을 사용하여 PDF 문서 구조 분석"],"es":["Extracción de texto de páginas PDF","Automatización del llenado de formularios PDF utilizando la guía forms.md","Análisis de estructuras de documentos PDF con Python"],"fr":["Extraction de texte à partir de pages PDF","Automatisation du remplissage de formulaires PDF à l''aide de la guidance forms.md","Analyse de structures de documents PDF avec Python"],"de":["Extraktion von Text aus PDF-Seiten","Automatisierung des Ausfüllens von PDF-Formularen unter Verwendung der forms.md-Anleitung","Analyse von PDF-Dokumentstrukturen mit Python"],"pt":["Extração de texto de páginas PDF","Automação de preenchimento de formulários PDF usando orientação forms.md","Análise da estrutura de documentos PDF com Python"],"ru":["Извлечение текста из страниц PDF","Автоматизация заполнения форм PDF с помощью руководства forms.md","Анализ структуры документов PDF с помощью Python"],"ar":["استخراج النص من صفحات PDF","أتمتة تعبئة استمارات PDF باستخدام إرشادات forms.md","تحليل هيكل مستندات PDF مع بايثون"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pypdf library installation","Python compatibility required","Limited to PDF file format"],"zh":["需要安装pypdf库","需要Python兼容性","仅限PDF文件格式"],"ja":["pypdfライブラリのインストールが必要","Pythonの互換性が必要","PDFファイル形式のみ"],"ko":["pypdf 라이브러리 설치 필요","Python 호환성 필요","PDF 파일 형식만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la biblioteca pypdf","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python","Limitado al formato de archivo PDF"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de la bibliothèque pypdf","La compatibilité Python est requise","Limité au format de fichier PDF"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der pypdf-Bibliothek","Python-Kompatibilität ist erforderlich","Begrenzt auf das PDF-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Requer instalação da biblioteca pypdf","Compatibilidade com Python necessária","Limitado ao formato de arquivo PDF"],"ru":["Требуется установка библиотеки pypdf","Требуется совместимость с Python","Ограничен форматом файла PDF"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت مكتبة pypdf","متوافق مع بايثون مطلوب","محدود بتنسيق ملف PDF"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7527c4dfe4e2ea0d524a6768f607cbf5e0e23fe4424520ce49fab93791b6f7fa","qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('PeonPing/peon-ping/peon-ping-config', 'community', 'PeonPing', 'peon-ping', 'PeonPing/peon-ping', 'peon-ping-config', 0, 0, 45, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:13.846Z', '4b2ff0c13199d1cfd65c2a7930d31368464b6fe0194db14b3e064f18bf5f58a5', '{"id":"PeonPing/peon-ping/peon-ping-config","name":"peon-ping-config","description":{"zh":"Peon Ping 配置为 Claude Code 和 Codex 提供 Warcraft III Peon 语音通知，简化终端操作","ja":"Peon Ping 設定は、Claude Code と Codex に対して Warcraft III Peon の音声通知を提供し、ターミナルの操作を簡素化します","ko":"Peon Ping 설정은 Claude Code와 Codex를 위해 Warcraft III Peon 음성 알림을 제공하여 터미널 작업을 간소화합니다","es":"peon-ping-config es una herramienta de notificación de voz para Warcraft III y Claude Code que te permite mejorar tu productividad","fr":"peon-ping-config est un outil de notification vocale pour Warcraft III et Claude Code qui vous permet d''améliorer votre productivité","de":"peon-ping-config ist ein Tool für Sprachbenachrichtigungen für Warcraft III und Claude Code, das Ihre Produktivität steigert","pt":"O Peon Ping Config é uma ferramenta de IA que fornece notificações de voz para o Warcraft III e outros jogos. Ele é projetado para trabalhar com Claude Code e Codex.","ru":"ИИ Агент Peon Ping Config предоставляет голосовые уведомления для Warcraft III и других игр. Он предназначен для работы с Claude Code и Codex.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي Peon Ping Config توفر تنبيهات صوتية للعبة Warcraft III والألعاب الأخرى. تم تصميمه للعمل مع Claude Code و Codex.","en":"Warcraft III Peon voice notifications (+ more!) for Claude Code and Codex. Stop babysitting your terminal."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 Peon Ping 配置","ja":"AIエージェント Peon Ping設定","ko":"AI 에이전트 Peon Ping 설정","es":"Herramientas de AI: peon-ping-config para Claude Code","fr":"Outils d''IA : peon-ping-config pour Claude Code","de":"KI-Tools: peon-ping-config für Claude Code","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Peon Ping Config para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Peon Ping Config для Разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Peon Ping Config للمطورين","en":"peon-ping-config"},"description":{"zh":"Peon Ping 配置为 Claude Code 和 Codex 提供 Warcraft III Peon 语音通知，简化终端操作","ja":"Peon Ping 設定は、Claude Code と Codex に対して Warcraft III Peon の音声通知を提供し、ターミナルの操作を簡素化します","ko":"Peon Ping 설정은 Claude Code와 Codex를 위해 Warcraft III Peon 음성 알림을 제공하여 터미널 작업을 간소화합니다","es":"peon-ping-config es una herramienta de notificación de voz para Warcraft III y Claude Code que te permite mejorar tu productividad","fr":"peon-ping-config est un outil de notification vocale pour Warcraft III et Claude Code qui vous permet d''améliorer votre productivité","de":"peon-ping-config ist ein Tool für Sprachbenachrichtigungen für Warcraft III und Claude Code, das Ihre Produktivität steigert","pt":"O Peon Ping Config é uma ferramenta de IA que fornece notificações de voz para o Warcraft III e outros jogos. Ele é projetado para trabalhar com Claude Code ...","ru":"ИИ Агент Peon Ping Config предоставляет голосовые уведомления для Warcraft III и других игр. Он предназначен для работы с Claude Code и Codex.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي Peon Ping Config توفر تنبيهات صوتية للعبة Warcraft III والألعاب الأخرى. تم تصميمه للعمل مع Claude Code و Codex.","en":"Warcraft III Peon voice notifications (+ more!) for Claude Code and Codex. Stop babysitting your terminal."},"definition":{"en":"Warcraft III Peon voice notifications (+ more!) for Claude Code and Codex. Stop babysitting your terminal."},"features":{"zh":["Warcraft III Peon 语音通知","Claude Code 和 Codex 支持","简化终端操作","自定义配置选项"],"ja":["Warcraft III Peon の音声通知","Claude Code と Codex のサポート","ターミナルの操作の簡素化","カスタマイズ可能な設定オプション"],"ko":["Warcraft III Peon 음성 알림","Claude Code와 Codex 지원","터미널 작업의 간소화","사용자 정의 구성 옵션"],"es":["Notificaciones de voz para Warcraft III","Integración con Claude Code","Mejora de la productividad","Sin necesidad de supervisión constante","Configuración personalizada"],"fr":["Notifications vocales pour Warcraft III","Intégration avec Claude Code","Amélioration de la productivité","Pas de surveillance constante requise","Configuration personnalisée"],"de":["Sprachbenachrichtigungen für Warcraft III","Integration mit Claude Code","Produktivitätssteigerung","Keine ständige Überwachung erforderlich","Benutzerdefinierte Konfiguration"],"pt":["Notificações de voz para Warcraft III","Integração com Claude Code e Codex","Funcionalidades adicionais para melhorar a experiência do jogador","Suporte a vários jogos","Configuração personalizada"],"ru":["Голосовые уведомления для Warcraft III","Интеграция с Claude Code и Codex","Дополнительные функции для улучшения игрового опыта","Поддержка нескольких игр","Настройка под себя"],"ar":["تنبيهات صوتية للعبة Warcraft III","التكامل مع Claude Code و Codex","ميزات إضافية لتحسين تجربة اللاعب","دعم الألعاب المتعددة","التخصيص الشخصي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Peon Ping 配置","Warcraft III Peon 语音通知","Claude Code 和 Codex","终端操作简化","怎么使用 Peon Ping","Peon Ping 教程"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Peon Ping 設定","Warcraft III Peon の音声通知","Claude Code と Codex","ターミナルの操作の簡素化","Peon Ping の使い方","Peon Ping チュートリアル"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Peon Ping 설정","Warcraft III Peon 음성 알림","Claude Code와 Codex","터미널 작업의 간소화","Peon Ping 사용법","Peon Ping 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","notificaciones de voz","Warcraft III","Claude Code","productividad","configuración personalizada","peon-ping-config alternativa","cómo usar peon-ping-config"],"fr":["outils d''IA","notifications vocales","Warcraft III","Claude Code","productivité","configuration personnalisée","peon-ping-config alternative","comment utiliser peon-ping-config"],"de":["KI-Tools","Sprachbenachrichtigungen","Warcraft III","Claude Code","Produktivität","benutzerdefinierte Konfiguration","peon-ping-config Alternative","wie man peon-ping-config verwendet"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para jogos","peon ping config","warcraft iii","claude code","codex","notificações de voz","configuração personalizada","guia de instalação","alternativas ao peon ping config"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для игр","peon ping config","warcraft iii","claude code","codex","голосовые уведомления","настройка под себя","руководство по установке","альтернативы peon ping config"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للألعاب","peon ping config","warcraft iii","claude code","codex","تنبيهات صوتية","التخصيص الشخصي","دليل التثبيت","بديل لبرنامج peon ping config"]}},"owner":"PeonPing","repo":"peon-ping","repoPath":"PeonPing/peon-ping","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"peon-ping-config","description":"Update peon-ping configuration — volume, pack rotation, categories, active pack, and other settings. Use when user wants to change peon-ping settings like volume, enable round-robin, add packs to rotation, toggle sound categories, or adjust any config.","bodyPreview":"# peon-ping-config\n\nUpdate peon-ping configuration settings.\n\n## Config location\n\nThe config file is at `${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json`.\n\n## Available settings\n\n- **volume** (number, 0.0–1.0): Sound volume\n- **active_pack** (string): Current sound pack name (e.g. `\"peon\"`, `\"sc_kerrigan\"`, `\"glados\"`)\n- **enabled** (boolean): Master on/off switch\n- **pack_rotation** (array of strings): List of packs to rotate through per session. Empty `[]` uses `active_pack` on","body":"# peon-ping-config\n\nUpdate peon-ping configuration settings.\n\n## Config location\n\nThe config file is at `${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json`.\n\n## Available settings\n\n- **volume** (number, 0.0–1.0): Sound volume\n- **active_pack** (string): Current sound pack name (e.g. `\"peon\"`, `\"sc_kerrigan\"`, `\"glados\"`)\n- **enabled** (boolean): Master on/off switch\n- **pack_rotation** (array of strings): List of packs to rotate through per session. Empty `[]` uses `active_pack` only.\n- **pack_rotation_mode** (string): `\"random\"` (default) picks a random pack each session. `\"round-robin\"` cycles through in order. `\"agentskill\"` uses explicit per-session assignments from `/peon-ping-use`; invalid or missing packs fall back to `active_pack` and the stale assignment is removed.\n- **categories** (object): Toggle individual CESP sound categories:\n  - `session.start`, `task.acknowledge`, `task.complete`, `task.error`, `input.required`, `resource.limit`, `user.spam` — each a boolean\n- **annoyed_threshold** (number): How many rapid prompts trigger user.spam sounds\n- **annoyed_window_seconds** (number): Time window for the annoyed threshold\n- **silent_window_seconds** (number): Suppress task.complete sounds for tasks shorter than this many seconds\n- **session_ttl_days** (number, default: 7): Expire stale per-session pack assignments older than N days (when using agentskill mode)\n- **desktop_notifications** (boolean): Toggle notification popups independently from sounds (default: `true`)\n- **use_sound_effects_device** (boolean): Route audio through macOS Sound Effects device (`true`) or default output via afplay (`false`). Only affects macOS. Default: `true`\n\n## How to update\n\n1. Read the config file using the Read tool\n2. Edit the relevant field(s) using the Edit tool\n3. Confirm the change to the user\n\n## Common Configuration Examples\n\n### Disable desktop notification popups but keep sounds\n\n**User request:** \"Disable desktop notifications\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet `desktop_notifications: false` in config\n\n**Result:**\n- ✅ Sounds continue playing (voice reminders)\n- ❌ Desktop notification popups suppressed\n- ✅ Mobile notifications unaffected (separate toggle)\n\n**Alternative CLI command:**\n```bash\npeon notifications off\n# or\npeon popups off\n```\n\n### Adjust volume\n\n**User request:** \"Set volume to 30%\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet `volume: 0.3` in config\n\n### Enable round-robin pack rotation\n\n**User request:** \"Enable round-robin pack rotation with peon and glados\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet:\n```json\n{\n  \"pack_rotation\": [\"peon\", \"glados\"],\n  \"pack_rotation_mode\": \"round-robin\"\n}\n```\n\n## Directory pack bindings\n\nPermanently associate a sound pack with a working directory so every session in that directory uses the right pack automatically. Uses the `path_rules` config key (array of `{ \"pattern\": \"<glob>\", \"pack\": \"<name>\" }` objects).\n\n### CLI commands\n\n```bash\n# Bind a pack to the current directory\npeon packs bind <pack>\n# e.g. peon packs bind glados\n# → bound glados to /Users/dan/Frontend\n\n# Bind with a custom glob pattern (matches any dir with that name)\npeon packs bind <pack> --pattern \"*/Frontend/*\"\n\n# Auto-download a missing pack and bind it\npeon packs bind <pack> --install\n\n# Remove binding for the current directory\npeon packs unbind\n\n# Remove a specific pattern binding\npeon packs unbind --pattern \"*/Frontend/*\"\n\n# List all bindings (* marks rules matching current directory)\npeon packs bindings\n```\n\n### Manual config\n\nThe `path_rules` array in `config.json` can also be edited directly:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"path_rules\": [\n    { \"pattern\": \"/Users/dan/Frontend/*\", \"pack\": \"glados\" },\n    { \"pattern\": \"*/backend/*\", \"pack\": \"sc_kerrigan\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nPatterns use Python `fnmatch` glob syntax. First matching rule wins. Path rules override `default_pack` and `pack_rotation` but are overridden by `session_override` (agentskill) assignments.\n\n## List available packs\n\nTo show available packs, run:\n\n```bash\nbash \"${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}\"/hooks/peon-ping/peon.sh packs list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:13.846Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Voice-Enabled Agents like Claude Code and Codex needing customizable sound notifications and alerts","zh":"非常适合需要可自定义声音通知和警报的语音驱动代理，如 Claude Code 和 Codex","ja":"Claude Code や Codex など、カスタマイズ可能なサウンド通知とアラートを必要とする音声対応エージェントに最適です","ko":"Claude Code 및 Codex와 같이 사용자 정의 가능한 사운드 알림 및 경고가 필요한 음성 사용 에이전트에 이상적입니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes con capacidad de voz como Claude Code y Codex que necesitan notificaciones y alertas de sonido personalizables","fr":"Idéal pour les agents à activation vocale comme Claude Code et Codex nécessitant des notifications et des alertes sonores personnalisables","de":"Ideal für sprachgesteuerte Agenten wie Claude Code und Codex, die benutzerdefinierte Soundbenachrichtigungen und -alarme benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes com Recursos de Voz, como Claude Code e Codex, que necessitam de notificações e alertas sonoros personalizáveis","ru":"Идеально подходит для голосовых агентов, таких как Claude Code и Codex, требующих настраиваемых звуковых уведомлений и оповещений","ar":"مثالي لعميل تمكين الصوت مثل Claude Code و Codex الذي يحتاج إلى إشعارات وتنبيهات صوتية قابلة للتخصيص"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage sound volume, rotate through custom sound packs like ''peon'' or ''sc_kerrigan'', and toggle notifications on or off using a config.json file, streamlining terminal interactions with features like pack rotation and master on/off switch","zh":"使代理能够通过 config.json 文件管理音量、在 ''peon'' 或 ''sc_kerrigan'' 等自定义声音包之间轮换以及切换通知开关，通过包轮换和主开关等特性简化终端交互","ja":"config.json ファイルを使用して、音量の管理、''peon'' や ''sc_kerrigan'' などのカスタムサウンドパックのローテーション、通知のオン/オフ切り替えをエージェントが行えるようにし、パックローテーションやマスターオン/オフスイッチなどの機能でターミナル操作を効率化します","ko":"config.json 파일을 사용하여 사운드 볼륨 관리, ''peon'' 또는 ''sc_kerrigan''과 같은 사용자 정의 사운드 팩 순환, 알림 켜기/끄기 전환을 통해 에이전트를 강화하며, 팩 순환 및 마스터 온/오프 스위치와 같은 기능으로 터미널 상호 작용을 간소화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el volumen de sonido, rotar a través de paquetes de sonido personalizados como ''peon'' o ''sc_kerrigan'' y activar o desactivar notificaciones usando un archivo config.json, simplificando las interacciones de terminal con características como rotación de paquetes y conmutador master de encendido y apagado","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer le volume sonore, de faire pivoter des packs de sons personnalisés comme ''peon'' ou ''sc_kerrigan'' et de basculer les notifications sur ou hors à l''aide d''un fichier config.json, rationalisant les interactions de terminal avec des fonctionnalités comme la rotation de packs et l''interrupteur master marche/arrêt","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Lautstärke zu steuern, durch benutzerdefinierte Sound-Pakete wie ''peon'' oder ''sc_kerrigan'' zu rotieren und Benachrichtigungen mithilfe einer config.json-Datei ein- oder auszuschalten, wodurch die Terminal-Interaktionen mit Funktionen wie Paketrotation und Master-Ein-/Ausschalter rationalisiert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o volume do som, alternar entre pacotes de som personalizados como ''peon'' ou ''sc_kerrigan'' e alternar notificações ligadas ou desligadas usando um arquivo config.json, otimizando as interações de terminal com recursos como rotação de pacotes e interruptor principal ligar/desligar","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять громкостью звука, переключаться между настраиваемыми звуковыми пакетами, такими как ''peon'' или ''sc_kerrigan'', и включать/выключать уведомления с помощью файла config.json, оптимизируя взаимодействия с терминалом с функциями, такими как ротация пакетов и основной выключатель","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إدارة مستوى الصوت وتبديل بين حزم صوتية مخصصة مثل ''peon'' أو ''sc_kerrigan'' وتoggle الإشعارات على أو إيقافها باستخدام ملف config.json ، مما ي简ifies التفاعلات المحطة مع الميزات مثل دوران الحزمة ومفتاح الرئيسي تشغيل/إيقاف"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Warcraft III Peon voice notifications","Rotating through custom sound packs per session","Toggling sound notifications on or off using the enabled setting"],"zh":["配置 Warcraft III Peon 语音通知","每个会话在自定义声音包之间轮换","使用 enabled 设置切换声音通知的开关"],"ja":["Warcraft III Peon の音声通知の設定","セッションごとにカスタムサウンドパックをローテーション","enabled 設定を使用してサウンド通知のオン/オフを切り替え"],"ko":["Warcraft III Peon 음성 알림 구성","세션별 사용자 정의 사운드 팩 순환","enabled 설정을 사용하여 사운드 알림 켜기/끄기 전환"],"es":["Configuración de notificaciones de voz de Peon de Warcraft III","Rotación a través de paquetes de sonido personalizados por sesión","Activación o desactivación de notificaciones de sonido usando la configuración habilitada"],"fr":["Configuration des notifications vocales de Peon de Warcraft III","Rotation à travers des packs de sons personnalisés par session","Activation ou désactivation des notifications sonores à l''aide de la configuration activée"],"de":["Konfiguration von Warcraft-III-Peon-Sprachbenachrichtigungen","Durchlaufen benutzerdefinierter Sound-Pakete pro Sitzung","Ein- oder Ausschalten von Soundbenachrichtigungen unter Verwendung der aktivierten Einstellung"],"pt":["Configurando notificações de voz do Peon do Warcraft III","Rotacionando por pacotes de som personalizados por sessão","Alternando notificações sonoras ligadas ou desligadas usando a configuração habilitada"],"ru":["Настройка уведомлений голоса Peon из Warcraft III","Переключение между настраиваемыми звуковыми пакетами за сессию","Включение/выключение звуковых уведомлений с помощью включенной настройки"],"ar":["تكوين إشعارات صوت Peon من ووركرافت III","التبديل بين حزم صوتية مخصصة لكل جلسة","تبديل الإشعارات الصوتية على أو إيقافها باستخدام إعداد تمكين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json file","Compatible with Claude Code and Codex only"],"zh":["需要访问 ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json 文件","仅与 Claude Code 和 Codex 兼容"],"ja":["${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json ファイルへのアクセスが必要","Claude Code と Codex のみと互換性あり"],"ko":["${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json 파일에 대한 액세스 필요","Claude Code 및 Codex 전용 호환"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Compatible solo con Claude Code y Codex"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au fichier ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Compatible uniquement avec Claude Code et Codex"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Datei ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Kompatibel nur mit Claude Code und Codex"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao arquivo ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Compatível apenas com Claude Code e Codex"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","Совместимо только с Claude Code и Codex"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الملف ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json","متوافق فقط مع Claude Code و Codex"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4b2ff0c13199d1cfd65c2a7930d31368464b6fe0194db14b3e064f18bf5f58a5","qualityScore":45}');
