n Problemen","PR-fertige Patches ohne Aufsicht"],"pt":["Execução de codificação de forma automatizada","Melhoria da produtividade dos desenvolvedores","Integração com ferramentas de CI","Geração de patches e resumos PR-prontos","Execução headless sem supervisão"],"ru":["Автоматизированное кодирование","Повышение производительности разработчиков","Интеграция с инструментами CI","Генерация патчей и резюме PR-готовых","Выполнение без надзора"],"ar":["تنفيذ العمليات البرمجية بشكل تلقائي","تحسين الإنتاجية للمطورين","التكامل مع أدوات CI","توليد تصحيحات وملخصات PR-جاهزة","التنفيذ بدون إشراف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","代码自动修复","代码总结","开发效率","ghx AI智能代理","代码问题解决","自动化代码修复","CI环境支持"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コード自動修復","コードサマリー","開発効率","ghx AIエージェント","コード問題解決","自動化コード修復","CI環境サポート"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코드 자동 수정","코드 요약","개발 효율성","ghx AI 에이전트","코드 문제 해결","자동화 코드 수정","CI 환경 지원"],"es":["cómo usar ghx","qué es un agente de IA","ghx alternativa","ghx vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de ghx","guía de configuración de ghx","desarrollo de software con IA","automatización de codificación con IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser ghx","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","ghx alternative","ghx vs autres agents IA","installation de ghx","guide de configuration de ghx","développement de logiciels avec IA","automatisation de codage avec IA"],"de":["wie man ghx verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","ghx Alternative","ghx vs andere AI-Agenten","Installation von ghx","Einrichtungsanleitung für ghx","Softwareentwicklung mit AI","Automatisierung von Codierung mit AI"],"pt":["como usar ghx","o que é ghx","ferramentas de AI Agents","alternativas ao ghx","ghx vs outras ferramentas","instalar ghx","guia de configuração do ghx"],"ru":["как использовать ghx","что такое ghx","инструменты ИИ Агентов","альтернативы ghx","ghx vs другие инструменты","установить ghx","руководство по настройке ghx"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة ghx","ما هي أداة ghx","أدوات الإيمان العقلانية","بديلات أداة ghx","أداة ghx مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة ghx","دليل إعداد أداة ghx"]}},"owner":"holon-run","repo":"holon","repoPath":"holon-run/holon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.884Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ghx","description":"GitHub enhanced operations skill. Provides unified context collection and publishing commands for PR/issue workflows.","bodyPreview":"# GHX Skill\n\n`ghx` is an enhanced reliability layer on top of `gh`, used by higher-level skills.\nIt standardizes common GitHub operations and prevents common agent mistakes (especially shell escaping and multi-line payload issues).\n\nIt provides two capabilities:\n- Context collection with a stable artifact manifest\n- Publishing for PR/review/comment workflows\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR`: artifact directory (caller-provided; defaults to a temp dir when unset)\n- `GITHUB_CONTEXT","body":"# GHX Skill\n\n`ghx` is an enhanced reliability layer on top of `gh`, used by higher-level skills.\nIt standardizes common GitHub operations and prevents common agent mistakes (especially shell escaping and multi-line payload issues).\n\nIt provides two capabilities:\n- Context collection with a stable artifact manifest\n- Publishing for PR/review/comment workflows\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR`: artifact directory (caller-provided; defaults to a temp dir when unset)\n- `GITHUB_CONTEXT_DIR`: context directory (default `${GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR}/github-context`)\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` / `GH_TOKEN`: token used by `gh`\n- `DRY_RUN`: preview mode for publish commands (`true|false`)\n\n## Commands\n\nUse `scripts/ghx.sh` as the entrypoint.\n\n### Context collection\n\n```bash\nscripts/ghx.sh context collect holon-run/holon#123\nscripts/ghx.sh context collect 123 holon-run/holon\n```\n\n### Publish commands\n\n```bash\nscripts/ghx.sh review publish --pr=holon-run/holon#123 --body-file=review.md --comments-file=review.json\nscripts/ghx.sh pr create --repo=holon-run/holon --title=\"Title\" --body-file=summary.md --head=feature/x --base=main\nscripts/ghx.sh pr update --pr=holon-run/holon#123 --title=\"New title\" --body-file=summary.md\nscripts/ghx.sh pr comment --pr=holon-run/holon#123 --body-file=summary.md\n# stdin body is also supported\nscripts/ghx.sh pr comment --pr=holon-run/holon#123 --body-file=- <<''EOF''\nMultiline body from stdin.\nEOF\n```\n\n### Batch mode\n\n```bash\nscripts/ghx.sh batch run --batch=${GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR}/publish-batch.json\n```\n\nUse batch mode when one run needs multiple publish actions.\nUse direct commands for single-action publish.\n\n## Contract Boundary\n\n- Public contract for other skills:\n  - Call `ghx.sh` commands.\n  - Read `${GITHUB_CONTEXT_DIR}/manifest.json` for context artifacts.\n  - Read `${GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR}/publish-results.json` for publish execution results.\n  - Use `publish-batch.json` schema when running `ghx.sh batch run` (defined below and in `references/github-publishing.md`).\n- Integration guidance for third-party skills:\n  - Prefer direct commands for single actions.\n  - Use batch mode only when one run needs multiple publish actions.\n  - Do not depend on undocumented fields or script internals outside this documented schema.\n\n## Context Output Contract\n\n`context collect` writes:\n- `${GITHUB_CONTEXT_DIR}/manifest.json`\n- Context files under `${GITHUB_CONTEXT_DIR}/github/` (for example `pr.json`, `pr.diff`, `comments.json`)\n\n`manifest.json` is the source of truth for collected context:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"2.0\",\n  \"provider\": \"ghx\",\n  \"kind\": \"pr|issue\",\n  \"ref\": \"owner/repo#123\",\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"pr_metadata\",\n      \"path\": \"github/pr.json\",\n      \"required_for\": [\"review\"],\n      \"status\": \"present|missing|error\",\n      \"format\": \"json|text\",\n      \"description\": \"What this artifact contains\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": []\n}\n```\n\nConsumers must use `artifacts[]` instead of assuming fixed context filenames.\n\n## Publish Output Contract\n\nPublish commands write `${GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR}/publish-results.json` with per-action status and summary totals.\n\n## Batch Input Contract (Public)\n\n`ghx.sh batch run` consumes `${GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR}/publish-batch.json` (or any path passed by `--batch`).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"pr_ref\": \"owner/repo#123\",\n  \"actions\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"post_comment\",\n      \"description\": \"optional\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"body\": \"summary.md\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nSchema summary:\n- Top-level required fields: `pr_ref`, `actions`\n- Top-level optional field: `version` (default `1.0`)\n- Action required field: `type`\n- Action optional fields: `description`, `params`\n- `params` is action-specific payload; legacy inline action fields are also accepted.\n\nSupported `type` values:\n- `create_pr`\n- `update_pr`\n- `post_comment`\n- `reply_review`\n- `post_review`\n\n## Notes\n\n- Prefer `ghx` for multi-step or error-prone GitHub operations.\n- `context collect` also prints a human-readable artifact summary; this is informational only.\n- For long or multi-line text, never inline shell arguments; always write to a file and pass `--body-file`/`--comments-file`.\n- Command selection:\n  - single action: use direct commands (`review publish`, `pr create|update|comment`)\n  - multiple actions in one run: use `batch run`\n\n## Safety Rules (Text Payloads)\n\nTo reduce failure rate from quoting/newline/markdown escaping:\n\n1. Never pass large markdown/JSON payloads inline on command line.\n2. Always pass payloads via file arguments:\n   - `ghx`: `--body-file`, `--comments-file` (`--body-file=-` is allowed to read from stdin)\n   - raw `gh`: `--body-file`\n3. Apply this rule to PR reviews, PR comments/description, issue comments, and issue creation.\n\nGood:\n\n```bash\ncat > /tmp/issue-body.md <<''EOF''\n## Summary\nDetailed markdown with quotes, backticks, and newlines.\nEOF\ngh issue create --repo owner/repo --title \"Bug report\" --body-file /tmp/issue-body.md\n```\n\nBad:\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --repo owner/repo --title \"Bug report\" --body \"## Summary\nDetailed markdown with quotes, backticks, and newlines.\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:41.966Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for GitHub Automation Agents requiring reliable, headless issue-to-PR workflows.","zh":"对于需要可靠、无头 issue-to-PR 工作流的 GitHub Automation Agents 至关重要。","ja":"信頼性の高いヘッドレスな issue-to-PR ワークフローを必要とする GitHub Automation Agents に不可欠です。","ko":"신뢰할 수 있는 헤드리스 issue-to-PR 워크플로우가 필요한 GitHub Automation Agents에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de automatización de GitHub que requieren flujos de trabajo de problema a PR confiables y sin interfaz gráfica.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''automatisation GitHub nécessitant des flux de travail de problème à PR fiables et sans interface graphique.","de":"Wesentlich für GitHub-Automatisierungsagenten, die zuverlässige, headless Issue-to-PR-Workflows erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Automação GitHub que exigem fluxos de trabalho confiáveis e headless de issue para PR.","ru":"Необходим для Агентов автоматизации GitHub, требующих надежных, headless рабочих процессов от issue к PR.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء أتمتة GitHub التي تتطلب سير عمل موثوقًا وبدواجه من المشكلات إلى طلبات السحب (PR)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides a hardened reliability layer over standard `gh` CLI operations, preventing common agent failures in shell escaping and multi-line payload handling. Standardizes GitHub context collection with stable artifact manifests and enables robust PR/review/comment publishing workflows without requiring manual supervision.","zh":"为标准 `gh` CLI 操作提供了一个强化的可靠性层，防止了在 shell 转义和多行 payload 处理中常见的 agent 故障。通过稳定的 artifact manifests 标准化 GitHub context 收集，并实现了无需人工监督的、稳健的 PR/review/comment 发布工作流。","ja":"標準的な `gh` CLI 操作の上に強化された信頼性レイヤーを提供し、シェルエスケープや複数行ペイロード処理における一般的な agent 障害を防止します。安定した artifact manifests を使用して GitHub context 収集を標準化し、手動監視を必要としない堅牢な PR/review/comment 公開ワークフローを実現します。","ko":"표준 `gh` CLI 작업 위에 강화된 신뢰성 레이어를 제공하여 셸 이스케이핑 및 멀티라인 페이로드 처리에서 흔히 발생하는 agent 장애를 방지합니다. 안정적인 artifact manifests로 GitHub context 수집을 표준화하고 수동 감독 없이도 강력한 PR/review/comment 게시 워크플로우를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Proporciona una capa de confiabilidad endurecida sobre las operaciones estándar de `gh` CLI, evitando fallos comunes de los agentes en la escapada de shell y el manejo de payloads multilínea. Estandariza la recopilación de contexto de GitHub con manifestos de artefactos estables y habilita flujos de trabajo de publicación de PR/revisión/comentario robustos sin requerir supervisión manual.","fr":"Fournit une couche de fiabilité durcie sur les opérations standard `gh` CLI, empêchant les défaillances courantes des agents dans l''échappement de shell et la gestion de charges utiles multiligne. Standardise la collecte de contexte GitHub avec des manifestes d''artefacts stables et permet des flux de travail de publication de PR/examen/commentaire robustes sans supervision manuelle.","de":"Bietet eine gehärtete Zuverlässigkeitsschicht über die Standard-`gh`-CLI-Operationen, verhindert häufige Agentenfehler bei der Shell-Escapade und der Verarbeitung von Multiline-Payloads. Standardisiert die GitHub-Kontextsammlung mit stabilen Artefaktmanifesten und ermöglicht robuste PR/Überprüfungs/Kommentar-Veröffentlichungsworkflows ohne manuelle Überwachung.","pt":"Fornece uma camada de confiabilidade reforçada sobre as operações padrão da CLI `gh`, prevenindo falhas comuns de agentes em escape de shell e manipulação de payloads multi-linha. Padroniza a coleta de contexto do GitHub com manifestos de artefatos estáveis e permite fluxos de trabalho robustos de publicação de PR/review/comment sem exigir supervisão manual.","ru":"Обеспечивает усиленный уровень надежности поверх стандартных операций CLI `gh`, предотвращая распространенные сбои агентов при экранировании оболочки и обработке многострочных полезных нагрузок. Стандартизирует сбор контекста GitHub со стабильными манифестами артефактов и обеспечивает надежные рабочие процессы публикации PR/обзоров/комментариев без необходимости ручного контроля.","ar":"يوفر طبقة موثوقية معززة فوق عمليات واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) `gh` القياسية، مما يمنع أعطال الوكلاء الشائعة في الهروب من shell ومعالجة حمولات متعددة الأسطر. يقوم بتوحيد جمع سياق GitHub مع بيانات manifests مستقرة للقطات الفنية ويمكّن من سير عمل قوي لنشر طلبات السحب (PR)/المراجعات/التعليقات دون الحاجة إلى إشراف يدوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PR-ready patch generation from issues","Running headless GitHub operations in CI/CD pipelines","Collecting standardized GitHub context artifacts","Publishing code reviews and comments without agent babysitting"],"zh":["从 issue 自动化生成 PR-ready 补丁","在 CI/CD 流水线中运行无头 GitHub 操作","收集标准化的 GitHub context artifacts","无需 agent 持续监控即可发布代码审查和评论"],"ja":["issue から PR-ready パッチを自動生成","CI/CD パイプラインでのヘッドレス GitHub 操作の実行","標準化された GitHub context artifacts の収集","agent の常時監視なしでコードレビューとコメントを公開"],"ko":["issue로부터 PR-ready 패치 자동 생성","CI/CD 파이프라인에서 헤드리스 GitHub 작업 실행","표준화된 GitHub context artifacts 수집","agent의 지속적인 모니터링 없이 코드 리뷰 및 코멘트 게시"],"es":["Generación automática de parches listos para PR a partir de problemas","Ejecución de operaciones de GitHub sin interfaz gráfica en pipelines de CI/CD","Recopilación de artefactos de contexto de GitHub estandarizados","Publicación de revisiones de código y comentarios sin supervisión del agente"],"fr":["Génération automatique de correctifs prêts pour PR à partir de problèmes","Exécution d''opérations GitHub sans interface graphique dans les pipelines CI/CD","Collecte d''artefacts de contexte GitHub standardisés","Publication d''examen de code et de commentaires sans surveillance de l''agent"],"de":["Automatisierte Generierung von PR-fertigen Patches aus Problemen","Ausführung von GitHub-Operationen ohne Benutzeroberfläche in CI/CD-Pipelines","Sammlung von standardisierten GitHub-Kontextartefakten","Veröffentlichung von Code-Reviews und Kommentaren ohne Agentenüberwachung"],"pt":["Automatizando a geração de patches prontos para PR a partir de issues","Executando operações GitHub headless em pipelines de CI/CD","Coletando artefatos de contexto GitHub padronizados","Publicando revisões de código e comentários sem necessidade de monitoramento do agente"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания готовых к PR исправлений из issues","Выполнение headless операций GitHub в конвейерах CI/CD","Сбор стандартизированных артефактов контекста GitHub","Публикация рецензий кода и комментариев без необходимости присмотра за агентом"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء تصحيحات جاهزة لطلب السحب (PR) من المشكلات","تشغيل عمليات GitHub بدون واجهة (headless) في خطوط أنابيب CI/CD","جمع قطع فنية موحدة لسياق GitHub","نشر مراجعات التعليمات البرمجية والتعليقات دون الحاجة إلى مراقبة الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR environment variable for artifacts","Dependent on underlying gh CLI installation","Primarily designed for headless/CI environments"],"zh":["需要 GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR 环境变量来存放 artifacts","依赖于底层 gh CLI 的安装","主要设计用于无头/CI 环境"],"ja":["artifacts には GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR 環境変数が必要","基盤となる gh CLI のインストールに依存","主にヘッドレス/CI 環境向けに設計"],"ko":["artifacts를 위해 GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR 환경 변수 필요","기반이 되는 gh CLI 설치에 의존","주로 헤드리스/CI 환경용으로 설계됨"],"es":["Requiere la variable de entorno GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR para los artefactos","Depende de la instalación subyacente de `gh` CLI","Diseñado principalmente para entornos sin interfaz gráfica/CI"],"fr":["Nécessite la variable d''environnement GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR pour les artefacts","Dépend de l''installation sous-jacente de `gh` CLI","Conçu principalement pour les environnements sans interface graphique/CI"],"de":["Benötigt die Umgebungsvariable GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR für Artefakte","Hängt von der unterliegenden `gh`-CLI-Installation ab","Hauptsächlich für headless/CI-Umgebungen konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer a variável de ambiente GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR para artefatos","Dependente da instalação subjacente da CLI gh","Projetado principalmente para ambientes headless/CI"],"ru":["Требует переменную окружения GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR для артефактов","Зависит от базовой установки CLI gh","В первую очередь предназначен для headless/CI сред"],"ar":["يتطلب متغير البيئة GITHUB_OUTPUT_DIR للقطع الفنية","يعتمد على التثبيت الأساسي لواجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) gh","مصمم أساسًا للبيئات بدون واجهة (headless)/CI"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bb1a47edffee032ba03ed5d500e15eb527261f0c7125dc21a2b2191845f0826e","qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gannonh/kata-orchestrator/kata-help', 'community', 'gannonh', 'kata-orchestrator', 'gannonh/kata-orchestrator', 'kata-help', 0, 0, 45, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.888Z', '2026-03-02T02:10:03.694Z', 'a4dd7c68c8722d32e6bbe81e81caec4b8180cd10b9895cc595c484cdebda2346', '{"id":"gannonh/kata-orchestrator/kata-help","name":"kata-help","description":{"zh":"Kata-Help是一个用于规范驱动开发的AI代理编排框架，帮助开发者协调多个AI代理的工作流程。它通过OpenAPI规范集成，实现高效的API驱动开发和多代理系统管理。","ja":"Kata-Helpは仕様駆動開発のためのAIエージェントオーケストレーションフレームワークで、複数のAIエージェントのワークフローを調整します。OpenAPI仕様統合により、効率的なAPI駆動開発を実現します。","ko":"Kata-Help는 스펙 주도 개발을 위한 AI 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크로, 여러 AI 에이전트의 워크플로우를 조정합니다. OpenAPI 스펙 통합을 통해 효율적인 API 주도 개발을 지원합니다.","es":"kata-help es un marco de orquestación de agentes para desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones, que mejora la eficiencia y la productividad en el desarrollo de software","fr":"kata-help est un cadre d''orchestration d''agents pour développement spécifié, qui améliore l''efficacité et la productivité dans le développement de logiciels","de":"kata-help ist ein Framework für die Orchestrierung von Agenten für spezifizierte Entwicklung, das die Effizienz und Produktivität in der Softwareentwicklung verbessert","pt":"kata-help é um framework de orquestração de agentes para desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações, permitindo uma abordagem mais eficiente e escalável para o desenvolvimento de software.","ru":"kata-help - это фреймворк для оркестровки агентов для спецификаций-ориентированного разработки, позволяющий более эффективный и масштабируемый подход к разработке программного обеспечения.","ar":"kata-help هو إطار عمل لتحريك الوكلاء من أجل التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات، مما يسمح بمقاربة أكثر كفاءة ومرونة لتطوير البرمجيات.","en":"Agent orchestration framework for spec-driven development"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Kata-Help: AI代理编排框架 - 规范驱动开发","ja":"Kata-Help: 仕様駆動開発のためのAIエージェントオーケストレーション","ko":"Kata-Help: 스펙 주도 개발을 위한 AI 에이전트 오케스트레이션","es":"Herramientas de AI: kata-help para desarrollo dirigido po...","fr":"Outils IA: kata-help pour développement spécifié","de":"KI-Tools: kata-help für spezifizierte Entwicklung","pt":"Ferramentas de AI: kata-help para Desenvolvimento Dirigid...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: kata-help для Спецификаций-ориентированного Ра...","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: kata-help لإطار عمل التطوير الموج...","en":"kata-help"},"description":{"zh":"Kata-Help是一个用于规范驱动开发的AI代理编排框架，帮助开发者协调多个AI代理的工作流程。它通过OpenAPI规范集成，实现高效的API驱动开发和多代理系统管理。","ja":"Kata-Helpは仕様駆動開発のためのAIエージェントオーケストレーションフレームワークで、複数のAIエージェントのワークフローを調整します。OpenAPI仕様統合により、効率的なAPI駆動開発を実現します。","ko":"Kata-Help는 스펙 주도 개발을 위한 AI 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크로, 여러 AI 에이전트의 워크플로우를 조정합니다. OpenAPI 스펙 통합을 통해 효율적인 API 주도 개발을 지원합니다.","es":"kata-help es un marco de orquestación de agentes para desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones, que mejora la eficiencia y la productividad en el desarrollo ...","fr":"kata-help est un cadre d''orchestration d''agents pour développement spécifié, qui améliore l''efficacité et la productivité dans le développement de logiciels","de":"kata-help ist ein Framework für die Orchestrierung von Agenten für spezifizierte Entwicklung, das die Effizienz und Produktivität in der Softwareentwicklung ...","pt":"kata-help é um framework de orquestração de agentes para desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações, permitindo uma abordagem mais eficiente e escalável par...","ru":"kata-help - это фреймворк для оркестровки агентов для спецификаций-ориентированного разработки, позволяющий более эффективный и масштабируемый подход к разра...","ar":"kata-help هو إطار عمل لتحريك الوكلاء من أجل التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات، مما يسمح بمقاربة أكثر كفاءة ومرونة لتطوير البرمجيات.","en":"Agent orchestration framework for spec-driven development"},"definition":{"en":"Agent orchestration framework for spec-driven development"},"features":{"zh":["基于OpenAPI规范的代理编排","多代理系统工作流协调","规范驱动的开发方法","RESTful API集成支持","可扩展的架构设计","自动化任务处理引擎"],"ja":["OpenAPI仕様に基づくエージェントオーケストレーション","マルチエージェントシステムのワークフロー調整","仕様駆動開発アプローチ","RESTful API統合サポート","拡張可能なアーキテクチャ設計","自動化タスク処理エンジン"],"ko":["OpenAPI 스펙 기반 에이전트 오케스트레이션","다중 에이전트 시스템 워크플로우 조정","스펙 주도 개발 접근법","RESTful API 통합 지원","확장 가능한 아키텍처 설계","자동화 작업 처리 엔진"],"es":["Orquestación de agentes para desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones","Mejora de la eficiencia y la productividad en el desarrollo de software","Compatibilidad con múltiples lenguajes de programación","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes","Flexibilidad y personalización para adaptarse a las necesidades del equipo","Documentación y soporte técnico para una implementación exitosa"],"fr":["Orchestration d''agents pour développement spécifié","Amélioration de l''efficacité et de la productivité dans le développement de logiciels","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langages de programmation","Intégration avec des outils de développement existants","Flexibilité et personnalisation pour s''adapter aux besoins de l''équipe","Documentation et support technique pour une mise en œuvre réussie"],"de":["Orchestrierung von Agenten für spezifizierte Entwicklung","Verbesserung der Effizienz und Produktivität in der Softwareentwicklung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Programmiersprachen","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit für die Anpassung an die Bedürfnisse des Teams","Dokumentation und technischer Support für eine erfolgreiche Implementierung"],"pt":["Orquestração de agentes para desenvolvimento","Suporte a desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento existentes","Escalabilidade e flexibilidade","Melhoria da eficiência do desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Оркестровка агентов для разработки","Поддержка спецификаций-ориентированного разработки","Интеграция с существующими инструментами разработки","Масштабируемость и гибкость","Улучшение эффективности разработки"],"ar":["تحريك الوكلاء من أجل التطوير","دعم التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الحالية","المرونة وال قابلة للتوسيع","تحسين كفاءة التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI代理编排框架","规范驱动开发","kata-help使用教程","多AI代理协调","OpenAPI集成","kata-help vs LangChain","API驱动开发工具","kata-help安装指南","AI代理开发框架","自动化工作流工具"],"ja":["AIエージェントオーケストレーション","仕様駆動開発フレームワーク","kata-help 使い方","マルチエージェント調整","OpenAPI連携","kata-help vs LangChain","API駆動開発ツール","kata-help 導入ガイド","AIエージェント開発","自動ワークフローツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 오케스트레이션","스펙 주도 개발 프레임워크","kata-help 사용 방법","다중 에이전트 조정","OpenAPI 연동","kata-help vs LangChain","API 주도 개발 도구","kata-help 설치 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","자동화 워크플로우 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo de software","desarrollo dirigido por especificaciones","orquestación de agentes","mejora de la eficiencia en el desarrollo de software","kata-help alternativa","kata-help vs otros marcos de desarrollo","cómo usar kata-help","guía de instalación de kata-help","configuración de kata-help"],"fr":["outils IA pour développement de logiciels","développement spécifié","orchestration d''agents","amélioration de l''efficacité dans le développement de logiciels","kata-help alternative","kata-help vs autres cadres de développement","comment utiliser kata-help","guide d''installation de kata-help","configuration de kata-help"],"de":["KI-Tools für Softwareentwicklung","spezifizierte Entwicklung","Orchestrierung von Agenten","Verbesserung der Effizienz in der Softwareentwicklung","kata-help Alternative","kata-help vs andere Entwicklungsfameworks","wie man kata-help verwendet","Installationsanleitung für kata-help","Konfiguration von kata-help"],"pt":["kata-help","ferramentas de AI","desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações","orquestração de agentes","como usar kata-help","o que é kata-help","kata-help vs outros frameworks","guia de instalação do kata-help"],"ru":["kata-help","ИИ инструменты","спецификаций-ориентированное разработки","оркестровка агентов","как использовать kata-help","что такое kata-help","kata-help vs другие фреймворки","руководство по установке kata-help"],"ar":["kata-help","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات","تحريك الوكلاء","كيفية استخدام kata-help","ما هو kata-help","kata-help مقارنة بالاطارات الأخرى","دليل تثبيت kata-help"]}},"owner":"gannonh","repo":"kata-orchestrator","repoPath":"gannonh/kata-orchestrator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.888Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kata-help","description":"Show available Kata skills, displaying the usage guide, explaining skill reference, or when the user asks for help with Kata. Triggers include help, show skills, list skills, what skills, kata skills, and usage guide.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nDisplay the complete Kata skill reference with version info.\n\nFirst, read the installed version:\n\n```bash\nif [ -n \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT\" ]; then\n  cat \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/VERSION\" 2>/dev/null\nelse\n  echo \"unknown\"\nfi\n```\n\nThen output the reference content below, inserting the version at the top. Do NOT add:\n\n- Project-specific analysis\n- Git status or file context\n- Next-step suggestions\n- Any commentary beyond the reference\n  </objective>\n\n<reference>\n# Kata Skill Reference\n\n**Versi","body":"<objective>\nDisplay the complete Kata skill reference with version info.\n\nFirst, read the installed version:\n\n```bash\nif [ -n \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT\" ]; then\n  cat \"$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT/VERSION\" 2>/dev/null\nelse\n  echo \"unknown\"\nfi\n```\n\nThen output the reference content below, inserting the version at the top. Do NOT add:\n\n- Project-specific analysis\n- Git status or file context\n- Next-step suggestions\n- Any commentary beyond the reference\n  </objective>\n\n<reference>\n# Kata Skill Reference\n\n**Version:** {version from bash above}\n\n**Kata** is a spec-driven development framework for Claude Code. It creates hierarchical project plans optimized for agentic development.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. `/kata-new-project` - Initialize project (includes research, requirements, roadmap)\n2. `/kata-plan-phase 1` - Create detailed plan for first phase\n3. `/kata-execute-phase 1` - Execute the phase\n\n## Staying Updated\n\nKata evolves fast. Check for updates periodically:\n\n```\n/kata-whats-new\n```\n\nShows what changed since your installed version and how to update.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n```\n/kata-new-project → /kata-plan-phase → /kata-execute-phase → repeat\n```\n\n### Project Initialization\n\n**`/kata-new-project`**\nInitialize new project through unified flow.\n\nOne skill takes you from idea to ready-for-planning:\n\n- Deep questioning to understand what you''re building\n- Optional domain research (spawns 4 parallel researcher agents)\n- Requirements definition with v1/v2/out-of-scope scoping\n- Roadmap creation with phase breakdown and success criteria\n\nCreates all `.planning/` artifacts:\n\n- `PROJECT.md` — vision and requirements\n- `config.json` — workflow mode (interactive/yolo)\n- `research/` — domain research (if selected)\n- `REQUIREMENTS.md` — scoped requirements with REQ-IDs\n- `ROADMAP.md` — phases mapped to requirements\n- `STATE.md` — project memory\n\nUsage: `/kata-new-project`\n\n**`/kata-map-codebase`**\nMap an existing codebase for brownfield projects.\n\n- Analyzes codebase with parallel Explore agents\n- Creates `.planning/codebase/` with 7 focused documents\n- Covers stack, architecture, structure, conventions, testing, integrations, concerns\n- Use before `/kata-new-project` on existing codebases\n\nUsage: `/kata-map-codebase`\n\n### Phase Planning\n\n**`/kata-discuss-phase <number>`**\nHelp articulate your vision for a phase before planning.\n\n- Captures how you imagine this phase working\n- Creates CONTEXT.md with your vision, essentials, and boundaries\n- Use when you have ideas about how something should look/feel\n\nUsage: `/kata-discuss-phase 2`\n\n**`/kata-research-phase <number>`**\nComprehensive ecosystem research for niche/complex domains.\n\n- Discovers standard stack, architecture patterns, pitfalls\n- Creates RESEARCH.md with \"how experts build this\" knowledge\n- Use for 3D, games, audio, shaders, ML, and other specialized domains\n- Goes beyond \"which library\" to ecosystem knowledge\n\nUsage: `/kata-research-phase 3`\n\n**`/kata-listing-phase-assumptions <number>`**\nSee what Claude is planning to do before it starts.\n\n- Shows Claude''s intended approach for a phase\n- Lets you course-correct if Claude misunderstood your vision\n- No files created - conversational output only\n\nUsage: `/kata-listing-phase-assumptions 3`\n\n**`/kata-plan-phase <number>`**\nCreate detailed execution plan for a specific phase.\n\n- Generates `.planning/phases/pending/XX-phase-name/XX-YY-PLAN.md`\n- Breaks phase into concrete, actionable tasks\n- Includes verification criteria and success measures\n- Multiple plans per phase supported (XX-01, XX-02, etc.)\n\nUsage: `/kata-plan-phase 1`\nResult: Creates `.planning/phases/pending/01-foundation/01-01-PLAN.md`\n\n### Execution\n\n**`/kata-execute-phase <phase-number>`**\nExecute all plans in a phase.\n\n- Moves phase from `pending/` → `active/` → `completed/`\n- Groups plans by wave (from frontmatter), executes waves sequentially\n- Plans within each wave run in parallel via Task tool\n- Verifies phase goal after all plans complete\n- Updates REQUIREMENTS.md, ROADMAP.md, STATE.md\n\nUsage: `/kata-execute-phase 5`\n\n### Quick Mode\n\n**`/kata-execute-quick-task`**\nExecute small, ad-hoc tasks with Kata guarantees but skip optional agents.\n\nQuick mode uses the same system with a shorter path:\n\n- Spawns planner + executor (skips researcher, checker, verifier)\n- Quick tasks live in `.planning/quick/` separate from planned phases\n- Updates STATE.md tracking (not ROADMAP.md)\n\nUse when you know exactly what to do and the task is small enough to not need research or verification.\n\nUsage: `/kata-execute-quick-task`\nResult: Creates `.planning/quick/NNN-slug/PLAN.md`, `.planning/quick/NNN-slug/SUMMARY.md`\n\n### Roadmap Management\n\n**`/kata-add-phase <description>`**\nAdd new phase to end of current milestone.\n\n- Appends to ROADMAP.md\n- Uses next sequential number\n- Creates phase directory in `pending/`\n\nUsage: `/kata-add-phase \"Add admin dashboard\"`\n\n**`/kata-insert-phase <after> <description>`**\nInsert urgent work as decimal phase between existing phases.\n\n- Creates intermediate phase (e.g., 7.1 between 7 and 8)\n- Useful for discovered work that must happen mid-milestone\n- Maintains phase ordering\n\nUsage: `/kata-insert-phase 7 \"Fix critical auth bug\"`\nResult: Creates Phase 7.1\n\n**`/kata-remove-phase <number>`**\nRemove a future phase and renumber subsequent phases.\n\n- Deletes phase directory and all references\n- Renumbers all subsequent phases to close the gap\n- Only works on future (unstarted) phases\n- Git commit preserves historical record\n\nUsage: `/kata-remove-phase 17`\nResult: Phase 17 deleted, phases 18-20 become 17-19\n\n**`/kata-move-phase <phase> <operation>`**\nMove a phase between milestones or reorder within a milestone.\n\n- Cross-milestone: moves phase to target milestone, renumbers both\n- Reorder: changes phase position within milestone, renumbers all\n- Only pending phases can be moved\n\nUsage: `/kata-move-phase 3 to v1.6.0` (cross-milestone)\nUsage: `/kata-move-phase 3 before 1` (reorder within milestone)\n\n### Milestone Management\n\n**`/kata-add-milestone <name>`**\nStart a new milestone through unified flow.\n\n- Deep questioning to understand what you''re building next\n- Optional domain research (spawns 4 parallel researcher agents)\n- Requirements definition with scoping\n- Roadmap creation with phase breakdown\n\nMirrors `/kata-new-project` flow for brownfield projects (existing PROJECT.md).\n\nUsage: `/kata-add-milestone \"v2.0 Features\"`\n\n**`/kata-complete-milestone <version>`**\nArchive completed milestone and prepare for next version.\n\n- Creates MILESTONES.md entry with stats\n- Archives full details to milestones/ directory\n- Creates git tag for the release\n- Prepares workspace for next version\n\nUsage: `/kata-complete-milestone 1.0.0`\n\n### Progress Tracking\n\n**`/kata-track-progress`**\nCheck project status and intelligently route to next action.\n\n- Shows visual progress bar and completion percentage\n- Summarizes recent work from SUMMARY files\n- Displays current position and what''s next\n- Lists key decisions and open issues\n- Offers to execute next plan or create it if missing\n- Detects 100% milestone completion\n\nUsage: `/kata-track-progress`\n\n### Session Management\n\n**`/kata-resume-work`**\nResume work from previous session with full context restoration.\n\n- Reads STATE.md for project context\n- Shows current position and recent progress\n- Offers next actions based on project state\n\nUsage: `/kata-resume-work`\n\n**`/kata-pause-work`**\nCreate context handoff when pausing work mid-phase.\n\n- Creates .continue-here file with current state\n- Updates STATE.md session continuity section\n- Captures in-progress work context\n\nUsage: `/kata-pause-work`\n\n### Debugging\n\n**`/kata-debug [issue description]`**\nSystematic debugging with persistent state across context resets.\n\n- Gathers symptoms through adaptive questioning\n- Creates `.planning/debug/[slug].md` to track investigation\n- Investigates using scientific method (evidence → hypothesis → test)\n- Survives `/clear` — run `/kata-debug` with no args to resume\n- Archives resolved issues to `.planning/debug/resolved/`\n\nUsage: `/kata-debug \"login button doesn''t work\"`\nUsage: `/kata-debug` (resume active session)\n\n### Issue Management\n\n**`/kata-add-issue [description]`**\nCapture idea or task as issue from current conversation.\n\n- Extracts context from conversation (or uses provided description)\n- Creates structured issue file in `.planning/issues/open/`\n- Infers area from file paths for grouping\n- Checks for duplicates before creating\n- Updates STATE.md issue count\n\nUsage: `/kata-add-issue` (infers from conversation)\nUsage: `/kata-add-issue Add auth token refresh`\n\n**`/kata-check-issues [area]`**\nList pending issues and select one to work on.\n\n- Lists all pending issues with title, area, age\n- Optional area filter (e.g., `/kata-check-issues api`)\n- Loads full context for selected issue\n- Routes to appropriate action (work now, add to phase, brainstorm)\n- Moves issue to done/ when work begins\n\nUsage: `/kata-check-issues`\nUsage: `/kata-check-issues api`\n\n### User Acceptance Testing\n\n**`/kata-verify-work [phase]`**\nValidate built features through conversational UAT.\n\n- Extracts testable deliverables from SUMMARY.md files\n- Presents tests one at a time (yes/no responses)\n- Automatically diagnoses failures and creates fix plans\n- Ready for re-execution if issues found\n\nUsage: `/kata-verify-work 3`\n\n### Milestone Auditing\n\n**`/kata-audit-milestone [version]`**\nAudit milestone completion against original intent.\n\n- Reads all phase VERIFICATION.md files\n- Checks requirements coverage\n- Spawns integration checker for cross-phase wiring\n- Creates MILESTONE-AUDIT.md with gaps and tech debt\n\nUsage: `/kata-audit-milestone`\n\n**`/kata-plan-milestone-gaps`**\nCreate phases to close gaps identified by audit.\n\n- Reads MILESTONE-AUDIT.md and groups gaps into phases\n- Prioritizes by requirement priority (must/should/nice)\n- Adds gap closure phases to ROADMAP.md\n- Ready for `/kata-plan-phase` on new phases\n\nUsage: `/kata-plan-milestone-gaps`\n\n### Configuration\n\n**`/kata-customize`**\nManage template overrides for customizing Kata output formats.\n\n- List all customizable templates with override status\n- Copy a default template for local editing\n- Edit an override with conversational changes\n- Validate overrides against required schemas\n\nUsage: `/kata-customize`\nUsage: `/kata-customize list`\nUsage: `/kata-customize copy summary-template.md`\nUsage: `/kata-customize validate`\n\n**`/kata-configure-settings`**\nConfigure workflow toggles and model profile interactively.\n\n- Toggle researcher, plan checker, verifier agents\n- Select model profile (quality/balanced/budget)\n- Updates `.planning/config.json`\n\nUsage: `/kata-configure-settings`\n\n**`/kata-set-profile <profile>`**\nQuick switch model profile for Kata agents.\n\n- `quality` — Opus everywhere except verification\n- `balanced` — Opus for planning, Sonnet for execution (default)\n- `budget` — Sonnet for writing, Haiku for research/verification\n\nUsage: `/kata-set-profile budget`\n\n### Utility Skills\n\n**`/kata-help`**\nShow this skill reference.\n\n**`/kata-whats-new`**\nSee what''s changed since your installed version.\n\n- Shows installed vs latest version comparison\n- Displays changelog entries for versions you''ve missed\n- Highlights breaking changes\n- Provides update instructions when behind\n\nUsage: `/kata-whats-new`\n\n## Files & Structure\n\n```\n.planning/\n├── PROJECT.md            # Project vision\n├── REQUIREMENTS.md       # Scoped requirements with REQ-IDs\n├── ROADMAP.md            # Current phase breakdown\n├── STATE.md              # Project memory & context\n├── MILESTONES.md         # Completed milestone history\n├── config.json           # Workflow mode & gates\n├── templates/            # Template overrides (customized output formats)\n├── research/             # Domain research (from project init)\n├── issues/               # Captured ideas and tasks\n│   ├── open/             # Issues waiting to be worked on\n│   └── done/             # Completed issues\n├── debug/                # Active debug sessions\n│   └── resolved/         # Archived resolved issues\n├── codebase/             # Codebase map (brownfield projects)\n│   ├── STACK.md          # Languages, frameworks, dependencies\n│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md   # Patterns, layers, data flow\n│   ├── STRUCTURE.md      # Directory layout, key files\n│   ├── CONVENTIONS.md    # Coding standards, naming\n│   ├── TESTING.md        # Test setup, patterns\n│   ├── INTEGRATIONS.md   # External services, APIs\n│   └── CONCERNS.md       # Tech debt, known issues\n├── milestones/           # Archived milestone details\n├── quick/                # Quick task plans and summaries\n│   └── NNN-slug/\n│       ├── PLAN.md\n│       └── SUMMARY.md\n└── phases/\n    ├── pending/          # Phases not yet started\n    │   └── 03-next-phase/\n    │       └── 03-01-PLAN.md\n    ├── active/           # Phase currently being executed\n    │   └── 02-in-progress/\n    │       ├── 02-01-PLAN.md\n    │       └── 02-01-SUMMARY.md\n    └── completed/        # Finished phases\n        └── 01-foundation/\n            ├── 01-01-PLAN.md\n            └── 01-01-SUMMARY.md\n```\n\n## Workflow Modes\n\nSet during `/kata-new-project`:\n\n**Interactive Mode**\n\n- Confirms each major decision\n- Pauses at checkpoints for approval\n- More guidance throughout\n\n**YOLO Mode**\n\n- Auto-approves most decisions\n- Executes plans without confirmation\n- Only stops for critical checkpoints\n\nChange anytime by editing `.planning/config.json`\n\n## Planning Configuration\n\nConfigure how planning artifacts are managed in `.planning/config.json`:\n\n**`planning.commit_docs`** (default: `true`)\n\n- `true`: Planning artifacts committed to git (standard workflow)\n- `false`: Planning artifacts kept local-only, not committed\n\nWhen `commit_docs: false`:\n\n- Add `.planning/` to your `.gitignore`\n- Useful for OSS contributions, client projects, or keeping planning private\n- All planning files still work normally, just not tracked in git\n\n**`planning.search_gitignored`** (default: `false`)\n\n- `true`: Add `--no-ignore` to broad ripgrep searches\n- Only needed when `.planning/` is gitignored and you want project-wide searches to include it\n\nExample config:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"planning\": {\n    \"commit_docs\": false,\n    \"search_gitignored\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n**Starting a new project:**\n\n```\n/kata-new-project        # Unified flow: questioning → research → requirements → roadmap\n/clear\n/kata-plan-phase 1       # Create plans for first phase\n/clear\n/kata-execute-phase 1    # Execute all plans in phase\n```\n\n**Resuming work after a break:**\n\n```\n/kata-track-progress  # See where you left off and continue\n```\n\n**Adding urgent mid-milestone work:**\n\n```\n/kata-insert-phase 5 \"Critical security fix\"\n/kata-plan-phase 5.1\n/kata-execute-phase 5.1\n```\n\n**Completing a milestone:**\n\n```\n/kata-complete-milestone 1.0.0\n/clear\n/kata-add-milestone  # Start next milestone (questioning → research → requirements → roadmap)\n```\n\n**Capturing ideas during work:**\n\n```\n/kata-add-issue                    # Capture from conversation context\n/kata-add-issue Fix modal z-index  # Capture with explicit description\n/kata-check-issues                 # Review and work on issues\n/kata-check-issues api             # Filter by area\n```\n\n**Debugging an issue:**\n\n```\n/kata-debug \"form submission fails silently\"  # Start debug session\n# ... investigation happens, context fills up ...\n/clear\n/kata-debug                                    # Resume from where you left off\n```\n\n## Getting Help\n\n- Read `.planning/PROJECT.md` for project vision\n- Read `.planning/STATE.md` for current context\n- Check `.planning/ROADMAP.md` for phase status\n- Run `/kata-track-progress` to check where you''re up to\n  </reference>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:03.694Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents requiring comprehensive content analysis and spec-driven development for agent orchestration frameworks","zh":"非常适合需要全面内容分析和基于规范的开发的AI代理，以满足代理编排框架的要求","ja":"AIエージェントの包括的なコンテンツ分析と仕様駆動型開発を必要とする場合に最適であり、エージェントのオーケストレーションフレームワークに適合する","ko":"포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석 및 사양 기반 개발이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 최적이며, 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que requieren un análisis de contenido integral y un desarrollo impulsado por especificaciones para frameworks de orquestación de agentes","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une analyse de contenu complète et un développement piloté par des spécifications pour les frameworks d''orchestration d''agents","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und eine spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung für Agenten-Orchestrierungsframeworks erfordern","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que requerem análise de conteúdo abrangente e desenvolvimento baseado em especificações para frameworks de orquestração de agentes","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих комплексного анализа контента и разработки, основанной на спецификациях, для фреймворков оркестровки агентов","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يتطلب تحليل المحتوى الشامل والتنمية القائمة على المواصفات لإطارات樂ة توجيه العميل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to display complete skill references with version information, utilizing bash scripting for version detection and outputting reference content in a structured format, leveraging protocols like file I/O and string manipulation","zh":"赋予代理显示完整的技能参考，包括版本信息，利用bash脚本进行版本检测，并以结构化格式输出参考内容，利用诸如文件I/O和字符串操作等协议","ja":"エージェントがバージョン情報を含む完全なスキル参照を表示することを可能にし、バージョン検出にはbashスクリプティングを利用し、参照コンテンツを構造化された形式で出力し、ファイルI/Oや文字列操作などのプロトコルを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 버전 정보를 포함한 완전한 스킬 참조를 표시할 수 있도록 하며, 버전 감지를 위해 bash 스크립팅을 사용하고, 참조 콘텐츠를 구조화된 형식으로 출력하며, 파일 I/O나 문자열 조작 등의 프로토콜을 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mostrar referencias de habilidades completas con información de versión, utilizando scripting de bash para la detección de versiones y saliendo contenido de referencia en un formato estructurado, aprovechando protocolos como file I/O y manipulación de cadenas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''afficher des références de compétences complètes avec des informations de version, en utilisant le scripting bash pour la détection des versions et en sortant le contenu de référence dans un format structuré, en exploitant des protocoles tels que file I/O et manipulation de chaînes","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, vollständige Fähigkeitsreferenzen mit Versionsinformationen anzuzeigen, indem Bash-Scripting für die Versionserkennung verwendet wird und Referenzinhalte in einem strukturierten Format ausgegeben werden, wobei Protokolle wie Datei-E/A und Zeichenmanipulation genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita agentes a exibir referências de habilidades completas com informações de versão, utilizando script bash para detecção de versão e saída de conteúdo de referência em um formato estruturado, aproveitando protocolos como E/S de arquivo e manipulação de string","ru":"Позволяет агентам отображать полные справочные ссылки с информацией о версии, используя скрипты bash для обнаружения версии и вывода справочного контента в структурированном формате, используя протоколы seperti ввод-вывод файла и манипуляция строкой","ar":"تمكين العميل من عرض المراجع الكاملة للمهارات مع معلومات الإصدار ، باستخدام البرمجة النصية bash للكشف عن الإصدار وإخراج المحتوى المرجعي بتنسيق منظم ، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل الإدخال والإخراج الملف وعمليات السلسلة"},"useCases":{"en":["Displaying version information for installed plugins","Generating reference content for agent skills","Outputting structured data for SEO optimization"],"zh":["显示已安装插件的版本信息","生成代理技能的参考内容","输出结构化数据以优化SEO"],"ja":["インストールされたプラグインのバージョン情報を表示する","エージェントのスキルの参照コンテンツを生成する","SEO最適化のために構造化データを出力する"],"ko":["설치된 플러그인의 버전 정보를 표시하는 것","에이전트 스킬의 참조 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것","SEO 최적화를 위해 구조화된 데이터를 출력하는 것"],"es":["Mostrar información de versión para plugins instalados","Generar contenido de referencia para habilidades de agentes","Salir con datos estructurados para la optimización del SEO"],"fr":["Afficher les informations de version pour les plugins installés","Générer le contenu de référence pour les compétences des agents","Sortir des données structurées pour l''optimisation du SEO"],"de":["Anzeigen von Versionsinformationen für installierte Plugins","