 Diagrams para Desenvolvedores","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Mermaid Diagrams для разработчиков","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: رسومات Mermaid للبرمجيين","en":"mermaid-diagrams"},"description":{"zh":"Mermaid Diagrams是一个个人知识库，用于捕获和连接内容，采用Zettelkasten风格的wiki链接","ja":"Mermaid Diagramsは、Zettelkastenスタイルのwikiリンクでコンテンツをキャプチャして接続する個人用の知識ベースです","ko":"머메이드 다이어그램은 제텔카ステン 스타일의 위키 링크로 콘텐츠를 캡처하고 연결하는 개인 지식庫입니다","es":"mermaid-diagrams es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores que permite crear una base de conocimiento personal con enlaces de wiki","fr":"mermaid-diagrams est un outil d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs qui permet de créer une base de connaissances personnelles avec des liens de ...","de":"mermaid-diagrams ist ein KI-Tool für Entwickler, das die Erstellung einer persönlichen Wissensbasis mit Wiki-Links ermöglicht","pt":"Mermaid Diagrams é uma ferramenta de IA para capturar e conectar conteúdo usando links de wiki estilo Zettelkasten","ru":"Mermaid Diagrams - это инструмент ИИ для захвата и соединения контента с помощью wiki-ссылок в стиле Zettelkasten","ar":"Mermaid Diagrams هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لالتقاط وربط المحتوى باستخدام روابط ويكي بأسلوب Zettelkasten","en":"Personal knowledge base for capturing and connecting content using Zettelkasten-style wiki-links"},"definition":{"en":"Personal knowledge base for capturing and connecting content using Zettelkasten-style wiki-links"},"features":{"zh":["支持Zettelkasten风格的wiki链接","实现内容的捕获和连接","构建个人知识库","支持多种图表和图形","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["Zettelkastenスタイルのwikiリンクをサポート","コンテンツのキャプチャと接続を実現","個人用の知識ベースを構築","多種多様なグラフと図形をサポート","使いやすく、簡単に統合できます"],"ko":["제텔카스테ン 스타일의 위키 링크 지원","콘텐츠 캡처 및 연결 구현","개인 지식庫 구축","다양한 차트 및 그래프 지원","사용하기 쉽고 통합하기 쉬움"],"es":["Base de conocimiento personal","Enlaces de wiki para conectar contenido","Compatibilidad con Zettelkasten-style","Mejora de la productividad para desarrolladores","Fácil de usar y configurar"],"fr":["Base de connaissances personnelles","Liens de wiki pour relier du contenu","Compatibilité avec Zettelkasten-style","Amélioration de la productivité pour les développeurs","Facile à utiliser et à configurer"],"de":["Persönliche Wissensbasis","Wiki-Links zum Verbinden von Inhalten","Kompatibilität mit Zettelkasten-style","Verbesserung der Produktivität für Entwickler","Einfach zu bedienen und zu konfigurieren"],"pt":["Crie diagramas complexos com facilidade","Conecte conteúdo usando links de wiki estilo Zettelkasten","Otimize sua base de conhecimento pessoal","Use React, Python e Node.js para integrar com sua aplicação","Acesse via CLI para automação de tarefas"],"ru":["Создавайте сложные диаграммы с легкостью","Соедините контент с помощью wiki-ссылок в стиле Zettelkasten","Оптимизируйте вашу личную базу знаний","Используйте React, Python и Node.js для интеграции с вашим приложением","Доступ к CLI для автоматизации задач"],"ar":["أنشئ مخططات معقدة بسهولة","اربط المحتوى باستخدام روابط ويكي بأسلوب Zettelkasten","اضبط قاعدة معرفتك الشخصية","استخدم React و Python و Node.js للاندماج مع تطبيقك","أクセس إلى CLI لتحسين المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Mermaid Diagrams","什么是Zettelkasten","Mermaid Diagrams替代品","Mermaid Diagrams安装","Mermaid Diagrams设置指南","Mermaid Diagrams与Competitor比较"],"ja":["Mermaid Diagramsの使い方","Zettelkastenとは","Mermaid Diagramsの代替","Mermaid Diagramsのインストール","Mermaid Diagramsの設定ガイド","Mermaid DiagramsとCompetitorの比較"],"ko":["머메이드 다이어그램 사용법","제텔카스테是什么","머메이드 다이어그램 대안","머메이드 다이어그램 설치","머메이드 다이어그램 설정 가이드","머메이드 다이어그램과 Competitor 비교"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores","cómo usar mermaid-diagrams","qué es mermaid-diagrams","mermaid-diagrams alternativa","mermaid-diagrams vs otras herramientas","instalación de mermaid-diagrams","guía de configuración de mermaid-diagrams"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs","comment utiliser mermaid-diagrams","qu''est-ce que mermaid-diagrams","mermaid-diagrams alternative","mermaid-diagrams vs autres outils","installation de mermaid-diagrams","guide de configuration de mermaid-diagrams"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man mermaid-diagrams verwendet","was ist mermaid-diagrams","mermaid-diagrams Alternative","mermaid-diagrams vs andere Tools","Installation von mermaid-diagrams","Konfigurationsanleitung für mermaid-diagrams"],"pt":["como usar Mermaid Diagrams","o que é Mermaid Diagrams","Mermaid Diagrams alternativa","Mermaid Diagrams vs Graphviz","instalar Mermaid Diagrams","guia de configuração do Mermaid Diagrams"],"ru":["как использовать Mermaid Diagrams","что такое Mermaid Diagrams","Mermaid Diagrams альтернатива","Mermaid Diagrams vs Graphviz","установить Mermaid Diagrams","руководство по настройке Mermaid Diagrams"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Mermaid Diagrams","ما هي Mermaid Diagrams","بديل Mermaid Diagrams","Mermaid Diagrams مقابل Graphviz","تثبيت Mermaid Diagrams","دليل إعداد Mermaid Diagrams"]}},"owner":"alexanderop","repo":"second-brain-nuxt","repoPath":"alexanderop/second-brain-nuxt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.911Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mermaid-diagrams","description":"Generate Mermaid diagrams (flowcharts, sequence, class, state, ER, C4, mindmaps, gitgraph). Use when asked to create diagrams, visualize processes, document architecture, or explain systems visually. Triggers include diagram, flowchart, sequence diagram, class diagram, state diagram, ER diagram, C4, mindmap, gitgraph, visualize, draw.","bodyPreview":"# Mermaid Diagrams\n\nGenerate diagrams using Mermaid syntax. All diagrams render in markdown code blocks with `mermaid` language identifier.\n\n## Decision Guide\n\n| Use Case | Diagram Type |\n|----------|--------------|\n| Process flow, decision trees | Flowchart |\n| API calls, system interactions over time | Sequence |\n| OOP structure, domain models | Class |\n| State machines, workflows | State |\n| Database schemas, data relationships | ER |\n| Software architecture (C4 model) | C4 |\n| Brainstorming,","body":"# Mermaid Diagrams\n\nGenerate diagrams using Mermaid syntax. All diagrams render in markdown code blocks with `mermaid` language identifier.\n\n## Decision Guide\n\n| Use Case | Diagram Type |\n|----------|--------------|\n| Process flow, decision trees | Flowchart |\n| API calls, system interactions over time | Sequence |\n| OOP structure, domain models | Class |\n| State machines, workflows | State |\n| Database schemas, data relationships | ER |\n| Software architecture (C4 model) | C4 |\n| Brainstorming, hierarchical organization | Mindmap |\n| Git branching, commit history | GitGraph |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Start] --> B{Decision}\n    B -->|Yes| C[Action 1]\n    B -->|No| D[Action 2]\n    C --> E[End]\n    D --> E\n```\n\n### Sequence\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant U as User\n    participant S as Server\n    U->>S: Request\n    S-->>U: Response\n```\n\n### Class\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    Animal <|-- Dog\n    Animal : +String name\n    Animal : +makeSound()\n    Dog : +fetch()\n```\n\n### State\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Idle\n    Idle --> Processing: start\n    Processing --> Done: complete\n    Done --> [*]\n```\n\n### ER\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n    ORDER ||--|{ LINE-ITEM : contains\n```\n\n### C4 Context\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n    Person(user, \"User\", \"End user\")\n    System(app, \"Application\", \"Main system\")\n    Rel(user, app, \"Uses\")\n```\n\n### Mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Topic))\n    Branch A\n      Leaf 1\n      Leaf 2\n    Branch B\n```\n\n### GitGraph\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit\n    branch feature\n    commit\n    checkout main\n    merge feature\n```\n\n---\n\n## Flowchart Reference\n\n**Directions:** `TD` (top-down), `LR` (left-right), `BT` (bottom-top), `RL` (right-left)\n\n### Node Shapes\n\n| Shape | Syntax | Example |\n|-------|--------|---------|\n| Rectangle | `[text]` | `A[Process]` |\n| Rounded | `(text)` | `A(Start)` |\n| Stadium | `([text])` | `A([Terminal])` |\n| Diamond | `{text}` | `A{Decision}` |\n| Circle | `((text))` | `A((Event))` |\n| Hexagon | `{{text}}` | `A{{Prepare}}` |\n| Cylinder | `[(text)]` | `A[(Database)]` |\n| Subroutine | `[[text]]` | `A[[Subprocess]]` |\n| Parallelogram | `[/text/]` | `A[/Input/]` |\n| Trapezoid | `[\\text\\]` | `A[\\Manual Op\\]` |\n\n### Link Types\n\n| Type | Syntax | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| Arrow | `-->` | Solid with arrowhead |\n| Open | `---` | Solid, no arrowhead |\n| Dotted arrow | `-.->` | Dotted with arrowhead |\n| Thick arrow | `==>` | Thick with arrowhead |\n| With text | `--\\|text\\|>` | Label on link |\n| Multi-length | `---->` | Longer link (more ranks) |\n\n### Subgraphs\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph Backend[\"Backend Services\"]\n        direction LR\n        API --> DB[(Database)]\n    end\n    Client --> API\n```\n\n### Styling\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Node]:::highlight\n    classDef highlight fill:#ff9,stroke:#333\n    style A stroke-width:2px\n```\n\n---\n\n## Sequence Diagram Reference\n\n### Arrow Types\n\n| Syntax | Style |\n|--------|-------|\n| `->>` | Solid with arrowhead |\n| `-->>` | Dotted with arrowhead |\n| `-x` | Solid with cross |\n| `-)` | Async (open arrow) |\n| `<<->>` | Bidirectional |\n\n### Participants\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    actor User\n    participant API as API Server\n    participant DB as Database\n```\n\n### Activations\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    User->>+API: Request\n    API->>+DB: Query\n    DB-->>-API: Result\n    API-->>-User: Response\n```\n\n### Control Flow\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    alt Success\n        A->>B: OK\n    else Failure\n        A->>B: Error\n    end\n\n    loop Every 5s\n        A->>B: Ping\n    end\n\n    opt Optional\n        A->>B: Maybe\n    end\n```\n\n### Notes\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    Note right of A: Single note\n    Note over A,B: Spanning note\n```\n\n### Grouping with Boxes\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    box Blue Frontend\n        participant U as User\n        participant W as Web\n    end\n    box Green Backend\n        participant A as API\n    end\n```\n\n---\n\n## Class Diagram Reference\n\n### Visibility Modifiers\n\n| Symbol | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| `+` | Public |\n| `-` | Private |\n| `#` | Protected |\n| `~` | Package |\n\n### Relationships\n\n| Type | Syntax | Meaning |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| Inheritance | `<\\|--` | Extends |\n| Composition | `*--` | Strong owns |\n| Aggregation | `o--` | Weak owns |\n| Association | `-->` | Uses |\n| Dependency | `..>` | Depends on |\n| Realization | `..\\|>` | Implements |\n\n### Full Example\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    class Animal {\n        <<abstract>>\n        +String name\n        +int age\n        +makeSound()* void\n    }\n    class Dog {\n        +String breed\n        +fetch() void\n    }\n    Animal <|-- Dog\n    Dog \"1\" --> \"*\" Toy : plays with\n```\n\n### Generics\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    class List~T~ {\n        +add(T item)\n        +T get(int index)\n    }\n```\n\n### Annotations\n- `<<interface>>` - Interface\n- `<<abstract>>` - Abstract class\n- `<<service>>` - Service class\n- `<<enumeration>>` - Enum\n\n---\n\n## State Diagram Reference\n\n### Basic Syntax\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> State1\n    State1 --> State2: trigger\n    State2 --> [*]\n```\n\n### Composite States\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state Active {\n        [*] --> Running\n        Running --> Paused: pause\n        Paused --> Running: resume\n    }\n    [*] --> Active\n    Active --> [*]: stop\n```\n\n### Fork and Join\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state fork <<fork>>\n    state join <<join>>\n    [*] --> fork\n    fork --> Task1\n    fork --> Task2\n    Task1 --> join\n    Task2 --> join\n    join --> [*]\n```\n\n### Choice\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state check <<choice>>\n    [*] --> check\n    check --> Success: valid\n    check --> Error: invalid\n```\n\n### Notes\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    State1\n    note right of State1\n        Description here\n    end note\n```\n\n---\n\n## ER Diagram Reference\n\n### Cardinality\n\n| Left | Right | Meaning |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| `\\|o` | `o\\|` | Zero or one |\n| `\\|\\|` | `\\|\\|` | Exactly one |\n| `}o` | `o{` | Zero or more |\n| `}\\|` | `\\|{` | One or more |\n\n### Relationship Types\n- `--` Identifying (solid line, child depends on parent)\n- `..` Non-identifying (dashed line, independent entities)\n\n### Attributes\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    USER {\n        int id PK\n        string email UK\n        string name\n        datetime created_at\n    }\n    POST {\n        int id PK\n        int user_id FK\n        string title\n        text content\n    }\n    USER ||--o{ POST : writes\n```\n\n---\n\n## C4 Diagram Reference\n\nC4 provides 4 levels of abstraction for architecture documentation.\n\n### Diagram Types\n- `C4Context` - System context (level 1)\n- `C4Container` - Container diagram (level 2)\n- `C4Component` - Component diagram (level 3)\n- `C4Dynamic` - Interaction sequences\n- `C4Deployment` - Infrastructure layout\n\n### Elements\n\n| Element | Syntax | Use |\n|---------|--------|-----|\n| Person | `Person(alias, label, desc)` | Users |\n| Person_Ext | `Person_Ext(...)` | External users |\n| System | `System(alias, label, desc)` | Software systems |\n| System_Ext | `System_Ext(...)` | External systems |\n| SystemDb | `SystemDb(...)` | Database systems |\n| Container | `Container(alias, label, tech, desc)` | Applications |\n| ContainerDb | `ContainerDb(...)` | Container databases |\n| Component | `Component(alias, label, tech, desc)` | Internal parts |\n\n### Boundaries\n```mermaid\nC4Container\n    System_Boundary(app, \"Application\") {\n        Container(web, \"Web App\", \"React\")\n        Container(api, \"API\", \"Node.js\")\n        ContainerDb(db, \"Database\", \"PostgreSQL\")\n    }\n    Rel(web, api, \"HTTP/JSON\")\n    Rel(api, db, \"SQL\")\n```\n\n### Relationships\n- `Rel(from, to, label)` - Standard relationship\n- `Rel_U/D/L/R(...)` - Directional hints\n- `BiRel(from, to, label)` - Bidirectional\n\n### Complete C4 Context Example\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n    Person(user, \"Customer\", \"Uses the system\")\n    System(app, \"E-Commerce\", \"Online store\")\n    System_Ext(payment, \"Payment Gateway\", \"Processes payments\")\n    System_Ext(shipping, \"Shipping API\", \"Handles delivery\")\n\n    Rel(user, app, \"Browses, orders\")\n    Rel(app, payment, \"Processes payments\")\n    Rel(app, shipping, \"Ships orders\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mindmap Reference\n\nUses indentation for hierarchy. Root node required.\n\n### Node Shapes\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root((Central Topic))\n        [Square]\n        (Rounded)\n        ))Cloud((\n        {{Hexagon}}\n```\n\n### With Icons\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root((Project))\n        Tasks ::icon(fa fa-tasks)\n        Team ::icon(fa fa-users)\n```\n\n### Styling\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root\n        Important:::urgent\n        Normal\n```\n\n---\n\n## GitGraph Reference\n\n### Basic Operations\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit id: \"initial\"\n    commit id: \"feature\"\n    branch develop\n    commit\n    checkout main\n    merge develop tag: \"v1.0\"\n```\n\n### Commit Types\n- `type: NORMAL` - Default\n- `type: HIGHLIGHT` - Emphasized\n- `type: REVERSE` - Reverted\n\n### Full Example\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit id: \"init\"\n    branch feature\n    commit id: \"add-login\"\n    commit id: \"add-logout\" type: HIGHLIGHT\n    checkout main\n    commit id: \"hotfix\" type: REVERSE\n    merge feature tag: \"v1.0\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### DO\n- Keep diagrams focused (one concept per diagram)\n- Use clear, descriptive labels\n- Add direction hints (`TD`, `LR`) explicitly\n- Use subgraphs/boundaries for grouping\n- Include legends for complex diagrams\n\n### DON''T\n- Overcrowd with too many nodes (>15-20)\n- Use cryptic single-letter IDs without labels\n- Mix multiple concerns in one diagram\n- Rely on auto-layout for complex diagrams\n\n### Layout Tips\n- **Flowchart**: `LR` for processes, `TD` for hierarchies\n- **Sequence**: Order participants by interaction frequency\n- **Class**: Group related classes with namespaces\n- **C4**: Start with Context, drill down to Container/Component\n- **ER**: Place central entities in the middle\n\n### Common Fixes\n| Problem | Solution |\n|---------|----------|\n| Nodes overlap | Reduce node count, use subgraphs |\n| Links cross confusingly | Reorder nodes, change direction |\n| Text truncated | Use aliases: `A[Long Name] as short` |\n| Diagram too wide | Switch `LR` to `TD` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:21:35.170Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Management Agents needing advanced diagramming capabilities with Mermaid syntax.","zh":"Perfect for Knowledge Management Agents needing advanced diagramming capabilities with Mermaid syntax.","ja":"Knowledge Management Agents MermaidMermaid","ko":"Mermaid Mermaid ","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión del Conocimiento que necesitan capacidades de diagramación avanzadas con sintaxis Mermaid.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion des Connaissances ayant besoin de capacités de diagramme avancées avec la syntaxe Mermaid.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die erweiterte Diagrammfunktionen mit Mermaid-Syntax benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que necessitam de capacidades de diagramação avançadas com sintaxe Mermaid.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления знаниями, которым требуются расширенные возможности диаграммирования с помощью синтаксиса Mermaid.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المعرفة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات الرسم المتقدمة مع بناء الجملة Mermaid."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate flowcharts, sequence diagrams, class diagrams, and more using Markdown code blocks with the `mermaid` language identifier, supporting various diagram types such as ER, C4, and state diagrams.","zh":"Empowers agents to generate flowcharts, sequence diagrams, class diagrams, and more using Markdown code blocks with the `mermaid` language identifier, supporting various diagram types such as ER, C4, and state diagrams.","ja":"Markdown`mermaid`ER, C4, ","ko":"Markdown`mermaid`ER, C4, ","es":"Permite a los agentes generar diagramas de flujo, diagramas de secuencia, diagramas de clase y más utilizando bloques de código Markdown con el identificador de lenguaje `mermaid`, que admite varios tipos de diagramas como ER, C4 y diagramas de estado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes de flux, des diagrammes de séquence, des diagrammes de classe et plus encore en utilisant des blocs de code Markdown avec l''identifiant de langage `mermaid`, qui prend en charge les différents types de diagrammes tels que ER, C4 et diagrammes d''état.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Flussdiagramme, Sequenzdiagramme, Klassendiagramme und mehr zu generieren, indem sie Markdown-Code-Blöcke mit dem Sprachidentifikator `mermaid` verwenden, der verschiedene Diagrammtypen wie ER, C4 und Zustandsdiagramme unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar fluxogramas, diagramas de sequência, diagramas de classe e muito mais usando blocos de código Markdown com o identificador de linguagem `mermaid`, suportando vários tipos de diagramas, como ER, C4 e diagramas de estado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать блок-схемы, диаграммы последовательности, диаграммы классов и многое другое с помощью блоков кода Markdown с идентификатором языка `mermaid`, поддерживающим различные типы диаграмм, такие как ER, C4 и диаграммы состояний.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من generar Fluxogramas ورسوم توضيحية للترتيب والفئة واكثر باستخدام كتل من رمز Markdown مع معرّف اللغة `mermaid` ، ودعم أنواع مختلفة من الرسوم مثل ER و C4 ورسوم الحالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating process flow diagrams for decision guides","Visualizing API calls and system interactions over time with sequence diagrams","Creating domain models and OOP structures with class diagrams"],"zh":["Generating process flow diagrams for decision guides","Visualizing API calls and system interactions over time with sequence diagrams","Creating domain models and OOP structures with class diagrams"],"ja":["decision guides","API sequence diagrams","OOP class diagrams"],"ko":["decision guides","API sequence diagrams","OOP class diagrams"],"es":["Generar diagramas de flujo de proceso para guías de decisión","Visualizar llamadas a la API y las interacciones del sistema con el tiempo mediante diagramas de secuencia","Crear modelos de dominio y estructuras de OOP con diagramas de clase"],"fr":["Générer des diagrammes de flux de processus pour les guides de décision","Visualiser les appels d''API et les interactions du système au fil du temps à l''aide de diagrammes de séquence","Créer des modèles de domaine et des structures de OOP avec des diagrammes de classe"],"de":["Generieren von Prozessflussdiagrammen für Entscheidungsleitfäden","Visualisieren von API-Aufrufen und Systeminteraktionen im Laufe der Zeit mit Sequenzdiagrammen","Erstellen von Domänenmodellen und OOP-Strukturen mit Klassendiagrammen"],"pt":["Gerar fluxogramas de processo para guias de decisão","Visualizar chamadas de API e interações de sistema ao longo do tempo com diagramas de sequência","Criar modelos de domínio e estruturas de OOP com diagramas de classe"],"ru":["Генерировать блок-схемы процесса для руководств по принятию решений","Визуализировать вызовы API и взаимодействия системы во времени с помощью диаграмм последовательности","Создавать модели домена и структуры ООП с помощью диаграмм классов"],"ar":["توليد Fluxogramas عملية لإرشادات القرار","توجيه مكالمات API وتفاعلات النظام عبر الوقت مع رسوم توضيحية للترتيب","إنشاء نماذج المجال وهياكل البرمجة الكائنية مع رسوم الفئة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Mermaid syntax knowledge","Limited to diagram types supported by Mermaid"],"zh":["Requires Mermaid syntax knowledge","Limited to diagram types supported by Mermaid"],"ja":["Mermaid","Mermaid"],"ko":["Mermaid ","Mermaid"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la sintaxis Mermaid","Limitado a los tipos de diagramas compatibles con Mermaid"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en syntaxe Mermaid","Limité aux types de diagrammes pris en charge par Mermaid"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Mermaid-Syntax","Begrenzt auf die von Mermaid unterstützten Diagrammtypen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de sintaxe Mermaid","Limitado a tipos de diagramas suportados pelo Mermaid"],"ru":["Требует знания синтаксиса Mermaid","Ограничен типами диаграмм, поддерживаемыми Mermaid"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بناء الجملة Mermaid","محدود بنوع الرسوم المدعومة من Mermaid"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"16429fea364ce18ddf284d366f073ca2379b9af49f75471cb46e9a753e709d6a","qualityScore":45}');
