Inteligência Artificial: Polyfill para AGE...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Polyfill для AGENTS.md","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: بوليفيل ل AGENTS.md","en":"skill"},"description":{"zh":"AI智能代理工具是一个polyfill，标准化和集中AGENTS.md配置和Agent Skills支持","ja":"AIエージェントツールはpolyfillで、AGENTS.md設定とAgent Skillsサポートを標準化および集中管理します","ko":"AI 에이전트 도구는 polyfill로 AGENTS.md 구성과 에이전트 기술 지원을 표준화하고集中 관리합니다","es":"Un polyfill que estandariza y centraliza la configuración de AGENTS.md y soporte de habilidades de agentes en su repositorio","fr":"Un polyfill qui standardise et centralise la configuration de AGENTS.md et le support des compétences des agents dans votre référentiel","de":"Ein Polyfill, der die Konfiguration von AGENTS.md und die Unterstützung von Agentenfähigkeiten in Ihrem Repository standardisiert und zentralisiert","pt":"O polyfill para AGENTS.md é uma solução que padroniza e centraliza a configuração de habilidades de agentes em seu repositório, tornando mais fácil a gestão ...","ru":"Polyfill для AGENTS.md — это решение, которое стандартизирует и централизует настройку навыков агентов в вашем репозитории, делая более простым управление аг...","ar":"بوليفيل AGENTS.md هو حل يوحّد وتكامل إعدادات مهارات الوكيل في مستودعك، مما يسهل إدارة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"A \"polyfill\" that standardizes and centralizes AGENTS.md configuration and Agent Skills support within your repository."},"definition":{"en":"A \"polyfill\" that standardizes and centralizes AGENTS.md configuration and Agent Skills support within your repository."},"features":{"zh":["标准化AGENTS.md配置","集中管理Agent Skills支持","提高开发效率","简化配置和技能支持","支持多种开发环境"],"ja":["AGENTS.md設定の標準化","Agent Skillsサポートの集中管理","開発効率の向上","設定とスキルサポートの簡素化","多種の開発環境のサポート"],"ko":["AGENTS.md 구성의 표준화","에이전트 기술 지원의集中 관리","개발 효율의 향상","구성과 기술 지원의 단순화","다양한 개발 환경의 지원"],"es":["Estandarización de la configuración de AGENTS.md","Centralización del soporte de habilidades de agentes","Compatibilidad con herramientas de agentes de IA","Implementación sencilla en su repositorio","Soporte para múltiples habilidades de agentes"],"fr":["Standardisation de la configuration de AGENTS.md","Centralisation du support des compétences des agents","Compatibilité avec les outils d''agents IA","Implémentation simple dans votre référentiel","Support pour plusieurs compétences des agents"],"de":["Standardisierung der Konfiguration von AGENTS.md","Zentralisierung der Unterstützung von Agentenfähigkeiten","Kompatibilität mit KI-Agenten-Tools","Einfache Implementierung in Ihrem Repository","Unterstützung für mehrere Agentenfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Padronização da configuração de habilidades de agentes","Centralização da gestão de agentes de inteligência artificial","Suporte a AGENTS.md","Integração com repositórios","Simplificação da gestão de agentes"],"ru":["Стандартизация настройки навыков агентов","Централизация управления агентами ИИ","Поддержка AGENTS.md","Интеграция с репозиториями","Упрощение управления агентами"],"ar":["توحيد إعدادات مهارات الوكيل","تكامل إدارة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم AGENTS.md","تكامل مع المستودعات","تسهيل إدارة الوكلاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理工具","AGENTS.md配置","Agent Skills支持","开发效率","配置和技能支持","如何使用AI智能代理工具","AI智能代理工具安装","AI智能代理工具设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントツール","AGENTS.md設定","Agent Skillsサポート","開発効率","設定とスキルサポート","AIエージェントツールの使い方","AIエージェントツールのインストール","AIエージェントツールの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 도구","AGENTS.md 구성","에이전트 기술 지원","개발 효율","구성과 기술 지원","AI 에이전트 도구 사용법","AI 에이전트 도구 설치","AI 에이전트 도구 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de agentes de IA","polyfill para AGENTS.md","cómo usar herramientas de agentes de IA","qué es un polyfill","alternativas a herramientas de agentes de IA","instalación de herramientas de agentes de IA","guía de configuración de AGENTS.md"],"fr":["outils d''agents IA","polyfill pour AGENTS.md","comment utiliser les outils d''agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un polyfill","alternatives aux outils d''agents IA","installation des outils d''agents IA","guide de configuration de AGENTS.md"],"de":["KI-Agenten-Tools","Polyfill für AGENTS.md","wie man KI-Agenten-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Polyfill","Alternativen zu KI-Agenten-Tools","Installation von KI-Agenten-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für AGENTS.md"],"pt":["como usar polyfill para AGENTS.md","o que é polyfill para AGENTS.md","ferramentas de inteligência artificial","agentes de inteligência artificial","polyfill para AGENTS.md alternative","polyfill para AGENTS.md vs outros","instalar polyfill para AGENTS.md","guia de configuração polyfill para AGENTS.md"],"ru":["как использовать polyfill для AGENTS.md","что такое polyfill для AGENTS.md","инструменты искусственного интеллекта","агенты искусственного интеллекта","polyfill для AGENTS.md альтернатива","polyfill для AGENTS.md vs другие","установить polyfill для AGENTS.md","руководство по настройке polyfill для AGENTS.md"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام بوليفيل AGENTS.md","ما هو بوليفيل AGENTS.md","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بوليفيل AGENTS.md بديل","بوليفيل AGENTS.md مقابل غيره","تثبيت بوليفيل AGENTS.md","دليل إعداد بوليفيل AGENTS.md"]}},"owner":"nevir","repo":"agentfill","repoPath":"nevir/agentfill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.922Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# /skill\n\nCreate or update portable agent skills in `.agents/skills/` that work across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other agents supporting the [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io).\n\n## Determine the Mode\n\n**Creating a new skill** — the user wants a skill that doesn''t exist yet. Follow the full workflow below.\n\n**Updating an existing skill** — the user wants to modify a skill in `.agents/skills/`. Read the existing SKILL.md and supporting files first, then apply changes following","body":"# /skill\n\nCreate or update portable agent skills in `.agents/skills/` that work across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other agents supporting the [Agent Skills specification](https://agentskills.io).\n\n## Determine the Mode\n\n**Creating a new skill** — the user wants a skill that doesn''t exist yet. Follow the full workflow below.\n\n**Updating an existing skill** — the user wants to modify a skill in `.agents/skills/`. Read the existing SKILL.md and supporting files first, then apply changes following the same quality principles.\n\n## Creating a New Skill\n\n### Step 1: Understand\n\nAsk the user to describe what they want the skill to do. Gather:\n\n- **Purpose**: What task does this skill help with?\n- **Trigger**: When should an agent activate this skill? What would the user say?\n- **Examples**: 2-3 concrete examples of the skill in action (input/output or before/after)\n\nIf the user is vague, suggest concrete examples to refine the scope. A good skill is focused — it does one thing well. If the request covers multiple distinct tasks, suggest splitting into separate skills.\n\n### Step 2: Research\n\nBefore writing the skill:\n\n- Search for existing patterns, conventions, and code related to the skill''s domain\n- Check `.agents/skills/` for existing skills that might overlap\n- Identify project-specific conventions the skill should follow\n- Note any tools, scripts, or references the skill might need to bundle\n\n### Step 3: Plan\n\nDesign the skill and present the plan to the user before writing:\n\n- **Name**: lowercase-hyphenated, 1-64 characters, descriptive. This becomes the `/slash-command`.\n- **Description**: 1-2 sentences covering WHAT it does and WHEN to use it. Include keywords matching how users naturally phrase the request. This is the most important field — it determines when agents auto-activate the skill.\n- **Instructions outline**: Key steps, rules, and examples. Only include information the agent doesn''t already know.\n- **Supporting files**: Decide what goes in SKILL.md vs `references/`:\n  - **In SKILL.md**: Rules and content the agent needs in every or most activations\n  - **In references/**: Content needed only in specific scenarios (e.g., \"when creating a new script from scratch\")\n  - Each reference file needs a clear trigger condition — not just \"overflow\"\n  - Multiple focused files are better than one monolithic reference\n\n### Step 4: Create\n\nCreate the skill directory and files:\n\n1. Create `.agents/skills/<name>/`\n2. Write `SKILL.md` with YAML frontmatter and markdown body\n3. Add supporting files as needed (`references/`, `scripts/`, `assets/`)\n\nUse the SKILL.md template below. For the full frontmatter reference, read `references/skill-specification.md`.\n\n**SKILL.md template:**\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: <lowercase-hyphenated-name>\ndescription: >-\n  <What it does>. <When to use it — include trigger keywords>.\n---\n\n# <Skill Title>\n\n<Brief overview — 1-2 sentences.>\n\n## <Main workflow or instructions>\n\n<Steps, rules, examples. Only include what the agent doesn''t already know.>\n```\n\n**Key rules:**\n- Keep the body under 500 lines (aim for under 200 for workflow skills; up to 400 for style/rules skills)\n- Use universal frontmatter fields (`name`, `description`) for portability\n- Agent-specific fields (like Claude''s `allowed-tools`) are safe to add but will be ignored by other agents\n- Use input/output examples — they''re more effective than descriptions\n- Reference supporting files from the body so the agent knows when to load them\n\n### Step 5: Validate\n\nRun the validation script to check structure and frontmatter:\n\n```sh\n.agents/skills/skill/scripts/validate-skill.sh .agents/skills/<name>\n```\n\nAlso verify manually:\n\n- [ ] `name` is lowercase-hyphenated, 1-64 characters\n- [ ] `description` explains WHAT and WHEN (includes trigger keywords)\n- [ ] Body is focused — no information the agent already knows\n- [ ] No unnecessary agent-specific assumptions in instructions\n- [ ] Supporting files are referenced from SKILL.md\n- [ ] Scripts are executable (`chmod +x`)\n\n### Step 6: Test\n\nSuggest the user test the skill:\n\n1. Start a new agent session (skills are discovered at session start)\n2. Ask the agent to perform the task the skill handles\n3. Verify the skill activates and produces correct results\n4. If it doesn''t activate, check the description for missing trigger keywords\n\n## Updating an Existing Skill\n\n1. **Read** the existing SKILL.md and all supporting files\n2. **Understand** what changes are needed and why\n3. **Update** the files, keeping the same quality principles (conciseness, portability, good description)\n4. **Validate** with the validation script\n5. **Note**: Claude Code hot-reloads skill changes (v2.1.0+) — no restart needed\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Description Quality Matters Most\n\nThe description determines whether agents auto-activate the skill. Write it as if explaining to a colleague when they should reach for this tool. Include the 3-5 most natural phrasings a user would use.\n\n### Concise is Key\n\nOnly include information the agent doesn''t already know. If the agent can figure something out from context, don''t spell it out. Challenge every paragraph.\n\n### Portability First\n\nSkills in `.agents/skills/` are shared across all configured agents. Stick to universal frontmatter fields. Describe actions rather than naming agent-specific tools. Use forward slashes for paths.\n\n### One Skill, One Job\n\nEach skill should have a focused purpose. If a skill tries to do too many things, it will either trigger too broadly or its instructions will be too vague to be useful. Split into separate skills instead.\n\n### Right-Size Your References\n\nNot all content belongs in `references/`. If the agent needs content in most activations, it belongs in SKILL.md. Reference files are for content needed only in specific scenarios.\n\n**In SKILL.md** (loaded every activation):\n- Core rules, conventions, and patterns\n- Examples of correct/incorrect usage\n- Common decision guidance\n\n**In focused reference files** (loaded on demand):\n- Full code templates (e.g., \"read when creating a new script from scratch\")\n- Detailed rules for uncommon scenarios (e.g., \"read when formatting tables\")\n- Extended examples for edge cases\n\n**Reference file guidelines:**\n- Each file should have a clear load trigger stated in SKILL.md\n- Name files by scenario: `new-script-template.md` not `full-guide.md`\n- Multiple small files (50-150 lines each) beat one large file\n- A reference that''s always loaded defeats the purpose — merge it into SKILL.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:21.481Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing standardized skill configuration and support across multiple platforms.","zh":"适用于需要在多个平台上标准化技能配置和支持的AI代理。","ja":"複数のプラットフォームで標準化されたスキル構成とサポートが必要なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"다중 플랫폼에서 표준화된 스킬 구성 및 지원이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una configuración de habilidades estandarizada y soporte en múltiples plataformas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA ayant besoin d''une configuration de compétences standardisée et d''un support sur plusieurs plateformes.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine standardisierte Fähigkeitskonfiguration und Unterstützung auf mehreren Plattformen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de configuração de habilidades padronizadas e suporte em várias plataformas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих стандартизированной конфигурации навыков и поддержки на нескольких платформах.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوين مهارات معياري ودعم عبر منصات متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage portable skills using the Agent Skills specification, supporting seamless integration with Claude Code, Gemini CLI, and other compatible agents, while utilizing the `.agents/skills/` directory for centralized skill management.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理使用Agent Skills规范的便携式技能的能力，支持与Claude Code、Gemini CLI和其他兼容代理的无缝集成，同时利用`.agents/skills/`目录进行集中式技能管理。","ja":"エージェントはAgent Skillsの仕様を使用したポータブルなスキルの作成と管理を可能にし、Claude Code、Gemini CLI、その他の互換性のあるエージェントとのシームレスな統合をサポートし、`.agents/skills/`ディレクトリを使用した集中管理を利用する。","ko":"에이전트는 에이전트 스킬 사양을 사용하여 이식 가능한 스킬을 만들고 관리할 수 있으며, Claude Code, Gemini CLI 및 기타 호환 에이전트와의无縫な 통합을 지원하며, `.agents/skills/` 디렉토리를 사용하여集中 스킬 관리를 활용할 수 있다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar habilidades portátiles utilizando la especificación de habilidades del agente, lo que admite una integración sin problemas con Claude Code, Gemini CLI y otros agentes compatibles, mientras utiliza el directorio `.agents/skills/` para la gestión centralizada de habilidades.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des compétences portables en utilisant la spécification de compétences de l''agent, ce qui prend en charge une intégration transparente avec Claude Code, Gemini CLI et d''autres agents compatibles, tout en utilisant le répertoire `.agents/skills/` pour la gestion centralisée des compétences.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, portable Fähigkeiten zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie die Agent Skills-Spezifikation verwenden, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Claude Code, Gemini CLI und anderen kompatiblen Agents ermöglicht, während das Verzeichnis `.agents/skills/` für die zentrale Fähigkeitsverwaltung verwendet wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e gerenciem habilidades portáteis usando a especificação de Habilidades do Agente, com suporte à integração perfeita com Claude Code, Gemini CLI e outros agentes compatíveis, utilizando o diretório `.agents/skills/` para gerenciamento centralizado de habilidades.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять переносимыми навыками, используя спецификацию навыков агента, с поддержкой бесшовной интеграции с Claude Code, Gemini CLI и другими совместимыми агентами, используя директорию `.agents/skills/` для централизованного управления навыками.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء وإدارة مهارات قابلة للنقل باستخدام مواصفات مهارات الوكيل، مع دعم التكامل السلس مع Claude Code وGemini CLI ووكلاء متوافقين آخرين، مع استخدام الدليل `.agents/skills/` لإدارة المهارات المركزية."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new skills for cross-platform compatibility","Updating existing skills to adhere to the Agent Skills specification","Standardizing skill configurations across multiple agent platforms"],"zh":["为跨平台兼容性创建新的技能","更新现有的技能以遵循Agent Skills规范","在多个代理平台上标准化技能配置"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム互換性のために新しいスキルを作成する","既存のスキルを更新してAgent Skillsの仕様に従う","複数のエージェントプラットフォームでスキル構成を標準化する"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 위한 새로운 스킬 생성","기존의 스킬을 에이전트 스킬 사양에 따라 업데이트함","다중 에이전트 플랫폼에서 스킬 구성 표준화"],"es":["Crear nuevas habilidades para la compatibilidad entre plataformas","Actualizar habilidades existentes para que cumplan con la especificación de habilidades del agente","Estandarizar configuraciones de habilidades en varias plataformas de agentes"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles compétences pour la compatibilité entre les plateformes","Mettre à jour des compétences existantes pour qu''elles soient conformes à la spécification de compétences de l''agent","Standardiser les configurations de compétences sur plusieurs plateformes d''agents"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Fähigkeiten für die Kompatibilität zwischen Plattformen","Aktualisieren bestehender Fähigkeiten, um die Agent Skills-Spezifikation einzuhalten","Standardisieren von Fähigkeitskonfigurationen auf mehreren Agent-Plattformen"],"pt":["Criar novas habilidades para compatibilidade entre plataformas","Atualizar habilidades existentes para atender à especificação de Habilidades do Agente","Padronizar configurações de habilidades em várias plataformas de agentes"],"ru":["Создание новых навыков для совместимости между платформами","Обновление существующих навыков для соответствия спецификации навыков агента","Стандартизация конфигураций навыков на нескольких платформах агентов"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات جديدة لتحقيق التوافق بين المنصات","تحديث المهارات الحالية لتوافقها مع مواصفات مهارات الوكيل","توحيد تكوين المهارات عبر منصات وكلاء متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the Agent Skills specification","Limited to agents supporting the Agent Skills specification"],"zh":["需要遵循Agent Skills规范","仅限支持Agent Skills规范的代理"],"ja":["Agent Skillsの仕様に従う必要がある","Agent Skillsの仕様をサポートするエージェントのみ"],"ko":["에이전트 스킬 사양을 따라야 함","에이전트 스킬 사양을 지원하는 에이전트만 해당"],"es":["Requiere el cumplimiento de la especificación de habilidades del agente","Limitado a agentes que admiten la especificación de habilidades del agente"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect de la spécification de compétences de l''agent","Limité aux agents qui prennent en charge la spécification de compétences de l''agent"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Agent Skills-Spezifikation","Begrenzt auf Agents, die die Agent Skills-Spezifikation unterstützen"],"pt":["Exige aderência à especificação de Habilidades do Agente","Limitado a agentes que suportam a especificação de Habilidades do Agente"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения спецификации навыков агента","Ограничен агентами, поддерживающими спецификацию навыков агента"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع مواصفات مهارات الوكيل","محدود بالوكلاء الذين يدعمون مواصفات مهارات الوكيل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2a832e482ce790961b446226bc13d0ed7701facf32c522ced914c06eefa6c5ac","qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Aias/red-cliff-record/rcr-backend', 'community', 'Aias', 'red-cliff-record', 'Aias/red-cliff-record', 'rcr-backend', 0, 0, 45, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.923Z', '2026-03-02T02:26:26.881Z', '641d679890673282006d147c38d38baf556c9c4f970ccf6a64436a1628ec88a9', '{"id":"Aias/red-cliff-record/rcr-backend","name":"rcr-backend","description":{"zh":"rcr-backend是一个本地优先、自主数据管理的个人知识管理工具，继承了barnsworthburning的精髓","ja":"rcr-backendは、ローカルファースト、データ所有の個人知識管理ツールであり、barnsworthburningの精神的後継者","ko":"rcr-backend는 로컬 우선, 데이터 소유의 개인 지식 관리 도구로, barnsworthburning의 정수를 이어받은 기술","es":"rcr-backend es una herramienta de gestión de conocimiento personal de código abierto que permite a los usuarios gestionar sus datos de forma local","fr":"rcr-backend est un outil de gestion des connaissances personnelles open source qui permet aux utilisateurs de gérer leurs données de manière locale","de":"rcr-backend ist ein Open-Source-Tool für persönliches Wissensmanagement, das es Benutzern ermöglicht, ihre Daten lokal zu verwalten","pt":"O rcr-backend é uma abordagem local-first para gerenciamento de conhecimento pessoal, permitindo que você mantenha o controle sobre seus dados.","ru":"rcr-backend - это местный подход к управлению личными знаниями, позволяющий вам владеть своими данными.","ar":"rcr-backend هو نهج محلي أول للتعامل مع المعرفة الشخصية، يتيح لك الحفاظ على سيطرتك على بياناتك.","en":"A local-first, own-your-data approach to personal knowledge management. The spiritual successor to barnsworthburning. "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"个人知识管理AI工具 - rcr-backend","ja":"AIエージェント - rcr-backend","ko":"개인 지식 관리 AI 에이전트 - rcr-backend","es":"Herramientas de inteligencia artificial para gestión de c...","fr":"Outils d''agents IA pour la gestion des connaissances pers...","de":"KI-Tools für persönliches Wissensmanagement - rcr-backend","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: rcr-backend para Gerenciamento de Conh...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: rcr-backend для управления личными знаниями","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: rcr-backend لإدارة المعرفة الشخصية","en":"rcr-backend"},"description":{"zh":"rcr-backend是一个本地优先、自主数据管理的个人知识管理工具，继承了barnsworthburning的精髓","ja":"rcr-backendは、ローカルファースト、データ所有の個人知識管理ツールであり、barnsworthburningの精神的後継者","ko":"rcr-backend는 로컬 우선, 데이터 소유의 개인 지식 관리 도구로, barnsworthburning의 정수를 이어받은 기술","es":"rcr-backend es una herramienta de gestión de conocimiento personal de código abierto que permite a los usuarios gestionar sus datos de forma local","fr":"rcr-backend est un outil de gestion des connaissances personnelles open source qui permet aux utilisateurs de gérer leurs données de manière locale","de":"rcr-backend ist ein Open-Source-Tool für persönliches Wissensmanagement, das es Benutzern ermöglicht, ihre Daten lokal zu verwalten","pt":"O rcr-backend é uma abordagem local-first para gerenciamento de conhecimento pessoal, permitindo que você mantenha o controle sobre seus dados.","ru":"rcr-backend - это местный подход к управлению личными знаниями, позволяющий вам владеть своими данными.","ar":"rcr-backend هو نهج محلي أول للتعامل مع المعرفة الشخصية، يتيح لك الحفاظ على سيطرتك على بياناتك.","en":"A local-first, own-your-data approach to personal knowledge management. The spiritual successor to barnsworthburning. "},"definition":{"en":"A local-first, own-your-data approach to personal knowledge management. The spiritual successor to barnsworthburning. "},"features":{"zh":["本地优先数据管理","自主数据所有权","个人知识管理","继承barnsworthburning的精髓","支持多种开发语言"],"ja":["ローカルファーストデータ管理","データ所有権の自主性","個人知識管理","barnsworthburningの精神的後継","多種開発言語のサポート"],"ko":["로컬 우선 데이터 관리","데이터 소유권의 자율성","개인 지식 관리","barnsworthburning의 정수를 이어받은 기술","다양한 개발 언어 지원"],"es":["Gestión de conocimiento personal con enfoque en datos locales","Código abierto y personalizable","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Seguridad y privacidad de los datos","Facilidad de uso y configuración"],"fr":["Gestion des connaissances personnelles avec une approche de données locales","Code open source et personnalisable","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Sécurité et confidentialité des données","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration"],"de":["Persönliches Wissensmanagement mit Fokus auf lokale Daten","Open-Source-Code und anpassbar","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Sicherheit und Datenschutz","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Abordagem local-first para gerenciamento de conhecimento","Controle total sobre seus dados","Sucessor espiritual do barnsworthburning","Ferramenta de IA para gerenciamento de conhecimento pessoal","Privacidade e segurança de dados"],"ru":["Местный подход к управлению личными знаниями","Полный контроль над своими данными","Духовный преемник barnsworthburning","Инструмент ИИ для управления личными знаниями","Конфиденциальность и безопасность данных"],"ar":["نهج محلي أول للتعامل مع المعرفة الشخصية","سيطرة كاملة على بياناتك","الخليفة الروحي لبarnsworthburning","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي لإدارة المعرفة الشخصية","الخصوصية وأمان البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["个人知识管理工具","AI工具","本地优先数据管理","自主数据所有权","rcr-backend安装","rcr-backend教程","rcr-backend替代品"],"ja":["個人知識管理ツール","AIエージェント","ローカルファーストデータ管理","データ所有権の自主性","rcr-backendのインストール","rcr-backendのチュートリアル","rcr-backendの代替"],"ko":["개인 지식 관리 도구","AI 에이전트","로컬 우선 데이터 관리","데이터 소유권의 자율성","rcr-backend 설치","rcr-backend 가이드","rcr-backend 대체"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","gestión de conocimiento personal","datos locales","código abierto","desarrollo de software","seguridad de datos","privacidad de datos","rcr-backend alternativa","rcr-backend vs barnsworthburning"],"fr":["outils d''agents IA","gestion des connaissances personnelles","données locales","code open source","développement de logiciels","sécurité des données","confidentialité des données","rcr-backend alternative","rcr-backend vs barnsworthburning"],"de":["KI-Tools","persönliches Wissensmanagement","lokale Daten","Open-Source-Code","Software-Entwicklung","Daten-Sicherheit","Datenschutz","rcr-backend Alternative","rcr-backend vs barnsworthburning"],"pt":["como usar rcr-backend","o que é rcr-backend","ferramentas de ia para gerenciamento de conhecimento","rcr-backend vs barnsworthburning","instalar rcr-backend","guia de configuração do rcr-backend","alternativas ao rcr-backend"],"ru":["как использовать rcr-backend","что такое rcr-backend","инструменты ИИ для управления знаниями","rcr-backend vs barnsworthburning","установить rcr-backend","руководство по настройке rcr-backend","альтернативы rcr-backend"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام rcr-backend","ما هو rcr-backend","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لإدارة المعرفة","rcr-backend مقابل barnsworthburning","تثبيت rcr-backend","دليل إعداد رcr-backend","بديلات rcr-backend"]}},"owner":"Aias","repo":"red-cliff-record","repoPath":"Aias/red-cliff-record","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.923Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rcr-backend","description":"Database, API, and integration conventions for Red Cliff Record. Use when working with Drizzle ORM, tRPC routers, database migrations, integration syncs, or media alt-text workflows in this project. Triggers on database queries, API routes, Drizzle v2, tRPC, Zod validation, integration work, or `rcr media` commands.","bodyPreview":"# RCR Backend\n\nSupplements global `typescript-guidelines` skill.\n\n## Drizzle ORM\n\n- **Always use Drizzle v2 query syntax** for reads: `db.query.<table>.findMany/findFirst` (not `db.select().from()`)\n  - Provides object-style `where`, built-in `with` for relations, and `columns` selection\n- Avoid raw SQL — use query builder APIs instead of `sql` template literals\n- Mutations: `db.insert()`, `db.update()`, `db.delete()`\n- Always upsert with `.onConflictDoUpdate()` on insertions\n- External-source P","body":"# RCR Backend\n\nSupplements global `typescript-guidelines` skill.\n\n## Drizzle ORM\n\n- **Always use Drizzle v2 query syntax** for reads: `db.query.<table>.findMany/findFirst` (not `db.select().from()`)\n  - Provides object-style `where`, built-in `with` for relations, and `columns` selection\n- Avoid raw SQL — use query builder APIs instead of `sql` template literals\n- Mutations: `db.insert()`, `db.update()`, `db.delete()`\n- Always upsert with `.onConflictDoUpdate()` on insertions\n- External-source PKs: `integer(''id'').primaryKey()` (not `serial`)\n- Never edit Drizzle meta files (`snapshot.json`, `_journal.json`) — they''re generated by `drizzle-kit`\n\n## tRPC\n\n- Routers live in `src/server/api/routers/`\n- Zod v4 for input validation\n- Client hooks from `src/app/trpc.ts`\n- Invalidate queries after mutations\n\n## Integrations\n\nCanonical guide: `INTEGRATIONS.md`.\n\n- Sync logic wrapped by `runIntegration`; exposed via `rcr sync <name>`\n- File convention: `types.ts` (Zod schemas), `client.ts` (API client), `sync.ts` (orchestration)\n- Respect rate limits; batch where needed; upsert for idempotency\n\n## Database Management\n\nCanonical operations: `README.md` and `src/server/db/db-manager.sh`.\n\n- `bun run db:generate` to generate migration files (safe for agent)\n- `bun run db:studio` for database inspection\n- Never run migrations (`bun run db:migrate`, `bunx drizzle-kit migrate`) — always provide the command for the user to run\n- Never run destructive operations without explicit user permission\n- Backups are named by environment (`prod-{timestamp}.dump`, `dev-{timestamp}.dump`), not database name\n\n## Agent Workflow: Media Alt Text\n\nThe `rcr media` commands support CLI-based alt text updates. Workflow for looped agents:\n\n1. **List** images needing alt text:\n   ```bash\n   rcr media list --type=image --alt-text=false --limit=100 --order=recordCreatedAt\n   ```\n2. **Get** item with parent record context:\n   ```bash\n   rcr media get <id> --with-record\n   ```\n   Returns media item plus `record: { id, title, type, mediaCaption, url }`.\n3. **Update**:\n   ```bash\n   rcr media update <id> ''{\"altText\": \"Description of the image\"}''\n   ```\n\n**Parallel processing**: pre-assign media IDs per agent to avoid overlap. Parent fetches a batch, splits into chunks, each subagent processes its assigned IDs.\n\nSchema: `media` table has `altText` (nullable), `url`, `type`, `width`, `height`, `recordId` (FK). ~4,090 images total.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:26.881Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript-based AI Agents needing advanced local-first data management capabilities with Drizzle ORM.","zh":"非常适合需要高级本地优先数据管理功能的基于TypeScript的AI代理，使用Drizzle ORM。","ja":"TypeScriptベースのAIエージェントに高級なローカルファーストのデータ管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。Drizzle ORMを使用します。","ko":"고급 로컬 우선 데이터 관리 기능이 필요한 TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Drizzle ORM을 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA basados en TypeScript que necesitan capacidades de gestión de datos de primera localización avanzadas con Drizzle ORM.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur TypeScript nécessitant des capacités de gestion de données locales avancées avec Drizzle ORM.","de":"Perfekt für auf TypeScript basierende KI-Agents, die erweiterte lokale Datenverwaltungsfunktionen mit Drizzle ORM benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de dados locais avançadas com Drizzle ORM.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности управления локальными данными с помощью Drizzle ORM.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المستندة إلى TypeScript التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة البيانات المحلية المتقدمة مع Drizzle ORM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage personal knowledge with a local-first approach, utilizing Drizzle v2 query syntax for efficient reads and mutations, and providing object-style where clauses, built-in with relations, and columns selection through APIs like db.query and db.insert.","zh":"赋予代理以本地优先的方式管理个人知识的能力，利用Drizzle v2查询语法进行高效的读取和变异，并提供带有关系和列选择的对象样式where子句，通过API如db.query和db.insert进行构建。","ja":"エージェントがローカルファーストのアプローチで個人の知識を管理する能力を提供します。Drizzle v2クエリ構文を使用して効率的な読み取りとミューテーションを行い、関係や列選択を含むオブジェクトスタイルのWHERE句を提供し、db.queryやdb.insertなどのAPIを使用して構築します。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 우선 접근 방식으로 개인 지식을 관리할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. Drizzle v2 쿼리 구문을 사용하여 효율적인 읽기 및 변경을 수행하고 관계 및 열 선택을 포함하는 객체 스타일 WHERE 절을 제공하며 db.query 및 db.insert와 같은 API를 사용하여 구축합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar conocimientos personales con un enfoque de primera localización, utilizando la sintaxis de consulta de Drizzle v2 para lecturas y mutaciones eficientes, y proporcionando cláusulas de estilo de objeto, relaciones integradas y selección de columnas a través de API como db.query y db.insert.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les connaissances personnelles avec une approche locale première, en utilisant la syntaxe de requête Drizzle v2 pour des lectures et des mutations efficaces, et en fournissant des clauses de style d''objet, des relations intégrées et une sélection de colonnes via des API comme db.query et db.insert.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, persönliche Kenntnisse mit einem lokalen Ansatz zu verwalten, indem sie die Drizzle v2-Abfragesyntax für effiziente Lese- und Schreibvorgänge verwenden und Objekt-Style-Where-Klauseln, integrierte Beziehungen und Spaltenauswahl durch APIs wie db.query und db.insert bereitstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o conhecimento pessoal com uma abordagem local-primeiro, utilizando a sintaxe de consulta Drizzle v2 para leituras e mutações eficientes, e fornecendo cláusulas where de estilo de objeto, relações incorporadas e seleção de colunas por meio de APIs como db.query e db.insert.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять личными знаниями с локально-ориентированным подходом, использую синтаксис запросов Drizzle v2 для эффективного чтения и изменений, и предоставляя объектные где-условия, встроенные отношения и выбор столбцов через API, такие как db.query и db.insert.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة المعرفة الشخصية بالمقاربة المحلية أولاً، باستخدام بناء جملة استعلام Drizzle v2 من أجل عمليات قراءة وتبديل فعالة، وتوفير شرط حيث بنية كائنية، وعلاقات مدمجة، واختيار أعمدة من خلال واجهات برمجة التطبيقات مثل db.query و db.insert."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating data upserts with onConflictDoUpdate","Generating efficient database queries using Drizzle v2 syntax","Building local-first personal knowledge management systems"],"zh":["使用onConflictDoUpdate自动执行数据upsert","使用Drizzle v2语法生成高效的数据库查询","使用Drizzle构建本地优先的个人知识管理系统"],"ja":["onConflictDoUpdateを使用してデータのupsertを自動化する","Drizzle v2構文を使用して効率的なデータベースクエリを生成する","Drizzleを使用してローカルファーストの個人知識管理システムを構築する"],"ko":["onConflictDoUpdate를 사용하여 데이터 업서트를 자동화하는こと","Drizzle v2 구문을 사용하여 효율적인 데이터베이스 쿼리를 생성하는 것","Drizzle를 사용하여 로컬 우선 개인 지식 관리 시스템을 구축하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de datos con onConflictDoUpdate","Generar consultas de base de datos eficientes mediante la sintaxis de Drizzle v2","Crear sistemas de gestión de conocimientos personales de primera localización"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de données avec onConflictDoUpdate","Générer des requêtes de base de données efficaces à l''aide de la syntaxe Drizzle v2","Créer des systèmes de gestion des connaissances personnelles de première localisation"],"de":["Automatisieren von Datenaktualisierungen mit onConflictDoUpdate","Erstellen effizienter Datenbankabfragen mit der Drizzle v2-Syntax","Erstellen lokaler persönlicher Wissensmanagementsysteme"],"pt":["Automatizar upserts de dados com onConflictDoUpdate","Gerar consultas de banco de dados eficientes usando a sintaxe Drizzle v2","Construir sistemas de gerenciamento de conhecimento pessoal local-primeiro"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления данных с onConflictDoUpdate","Генерировать эффективные запросы к базе данных, используя синтаксис Drizzle v2","Строить локально-ориентированные системы управления личными знаниями"],"ar":["توتير تحديثات البيانات باستخدام onConflictDoUpdate","توليد استفسارات قاعدة البيانات الفعالة باستخدام بناء الجملة Drizzle v2","بناء نظم إدارة المعرفة الشخصية المحلية أولاً"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Dependent on Drizzle ORM v2","Avoids raw SQL in favor of query builder APIs"],"zh":["需要TypeScript环境","依赖Drizzle ORM v2","避免使用原始SQL，推荐使用查询构建器API"],"ja":["TypeScript環境が必要","Drizzle ORM v2に依存","生SQLを避け、クエリビルダAPIを使用する"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요함","Drizzle ORM v2에 의존함","원시 SQL을 피하고 쿼리 빌더 API를 사용하는 것"],"es":["Requiere entorno de TypeScript","Dependiente de Drizzle ORM v2","Evita SQL sin procesar a favor de APIs de generadores de consultas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","Dépendant de Drizzle ORM v2","Évite le SQL brut au profit des API de générateurs de requêtes"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Abhängig von Drizzle ORM v2","Vermeidet rohes SQL zugunsten von Abfrage-Generator-APIs"],"pt":["Exige ambiente TypeScript","Dependente do Drizzle ORM v2","Evita SQL bruto em favor de APIs de construtor de consultas"],"ru":["Требует среды TypeScript","Зависит от Drizzle ORM v2","Избегает сырого SQL в пользу API-интерфейсов запросов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript","يعتمد على Drizzle ORM v2","يتجنب SQL الخام لصالح واجهات برمجة التطبيقات لمصنع الاستعلامات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"641d679890673282006d147c38d38baf556c9c4f970ccf6a64436a1628ec88a9","qualityScore":45}');
