ador Visual UI - Ferramenta de AI Agente","ru":"Визуальный Валидатор UI - ИИ Агент","ar":"مُصادِق بِياني UI - أداة وكلية إِصطناعي","en":"ui-visual-validator"},"description":{"zh":"UI视觉验证器是一款基于1Panel Open API的移动应用，提供智能化的UI验证功能","ja":"UIビジュアルバリデーターは、1Panel Open APIを利用したモバイルアプリで、スマートなUI検証機能を提供する","ko":"UI 시각적 검증기는 1Panel Open API 기반의 모바일 애플리케이션으로, 지능형 UI 검증 기능을 제공합니다","es":"ui-visual-validator es una herramienta de AI para validar interfaces visuales en apps móviles basada en 1Panel Open API, ideal para desarrolladores","fr":"ui-visual-validator est un outil d''IA pour valider les interfaces visuelles dans les applications mobiles basé sur 1Panel Open API, idéal pour les développeurs","de":"ui-visual-validator ist ein AI-Tool zur Validierung von visuellen Schnittstellen in mobilen Apps basierend auf 1Panel Open API, ideal für Entwickler","pt":"O Validador Visual UI é uma ferramenta de AI Agente baseada na API 1Panel Open, projetada para desenvolvedores móveis","ru":"Визуальный Валидатор UI - это инструмент ИИ Агента на основе открытого API 1Panel, предназначенный для мобильных разработчиков","ar":"مُصادِق بِياني UI هو أداة وكلية إِصطناعي تعتمد على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات 1Panel المفتوحة، مصممة لمنشئي التطبيقات النقالة","en":"A mobile App based on the 1Panel Open API."},"definition":{"en":"A mobile App based on the 1Panel Open API."},"features":{"zh":["基于1Panel Open API的移动应用","智能化的UI验证功能","提高开发效率","支持多种UI设计模式","易于集成和使用"],"ja":["1Panel Open APIを利用したモバイルアプリ","スマートなUI検証機能","開発効率の向上","多種のUI設計モードをサポート","簡単に統合して使用可能"],"ko":["1Panel Open API 기반의 모바일 애플리케이션","지능형 UI 검증 기능","개발 효율성 향상","다양한 UI 디자인 모드를 지원","쉽게 통합하여 사용 가능"],"es":["Validación de interfaces visuales en apps móviles","Basado en 1Panel Open API","Ideal para desarrolladores de apps móviles","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo existentes","Análisis de errores y sugerencias de mejora"],"fr":["Validation des interfaces visuelles dans les applications mobiles","Basé sur 1Panel Open API","Idéal pour les développeurs d''applications mobiles","Intégration avec les outils de développement existants","Analyse des erreurs et suggestions d''amélioration"],"de":["Validierung von visuellen Schnittstellen in mobilen Apps","Basierend auf 1Panel Open API","Ideal für Entwickler von mobilen Apps","Integration mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools","Fehleranalyse und Vorschläge für Verbesserungen"],"pt":["Baseado na API 1Panel Open","Validação de interfaces de usuário","Desenvolvido para desenvolvedores móveis","Ferramenta de AI Agente","Integração com tecnologias de desenvolvimento móvel"],"ru":["Основан на открытом API 1Panel","Проверка пользовательских интерфейсов","Разработан для мобильных разработчиков","Инструмент ИИ Агента","Интеграция с технологиями мобильной разработки"],"ar":["مبني على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات 1Panel المفتوحة","التحقق من واجهات المستخدم","مصمم لمنشئي التطبيقات النقالة","أداة وكلية إِصطناعي","التكامل مع تقنيات تطوير التطبيقات النقالة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI视觉验证器","1Panel Open API","AI工具","移动应用开发","UI设计","如何使用UI视觉验证器","UI视觉验证器安装","UI视觉验证器设置指南"],"ja":["UIビジュアルバリデーター","1Panel Open API","AIエージェント","モバイルアプリ開発","UI設計","UIビジュアルバリデーターの使い方","UIビジュアルバリデーターのインストール","UIビジュアルバリデーターの設定ガイド"],"ko":["UI 시각적 검증기","1Panel Open API","AI 에이전트","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","UI 디자인","UI 시각적 검증기 사용법","UI 시각적 검증기 설치","UI 시각적 검증기 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para apps móviles","validación de interfaces visuales","1Panel Open API","desarrollo de apps móviles","ui-visual-validator alternativa","cómo usar ui-visual-validator","guias de instalación de ui-visual-validator","configuración de ui-visual-validator"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour applications mobiles","validation des interfaces visuelles","1Panel Open API","développement d''applications mobiles","alternative à ui-visual-validator","comment utiliser ui-visual-validator","guides d''installation de ui-visual-validator","configuration de ui-visual-validator"],"de":["AI-Tools für mobile Apps","Validierung von visuellen Schnittstellen","1Panel Open API","Entwicklung von mobilen Apps","Alternative zu ui-visual-validator","wie man ui-visual-validator verwendet","Installationsanleitungen für ui-visual-validator","Konfiguration von ui-visual-validator"],"pt":["como usar Validador Visual UI","o que é AI Agente","Validador Visual UI alternativa","Validador Visual UI vs outros validadores","instalar Validador Visual UI","guia de configuração do Validador Visual UI","desenvolvimento móvel com AI Agente"],"ru":["как использовать Визуальный Валидатор UI","что такое ИИ Агент","Визуальный Валидатор UI альтернатива","Визуальный Валидатор UI vs другие валидаторы","установить Визуальный Валидатор UI","руководство по настройке Визуального Валидатора UI","мобильная разработка с ИИ Агентом"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مصادق بِياني UI","ما هو وكلية إِصطناعي","مصادق بِياني UI بديل","مصادق بِياني UI مقابل مصادقين آخرين","تثبيت مصادق بِياني UI","دليل إعداد مصادق بِياني UI","تطوير التطبيقات النقالة مع وكلية إِصطناعي"]}},"owner":"IsKenKenYa","repo":"Open1PanelApp","repoPath":"IsKenKenYa/Open1PanelApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.923Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-visual-validator","description":"Rigorous visual validation expert specializing in UI testing,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on ui visual validator tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for ui visual validator\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to ui visual validator\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `re","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on ui visual validator tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for ui visual validator\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to ui visual validator\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an experienced UI visual validation expert specializing in comprehensive visual testing and design verification through rigorous analysis methodologies.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert visual validation specialist focused on verifying UI modifications, design system compliance, and accessibility implementation through systematic visual analysis. Masters modern visual testing tools, automated regression testing, and human-centered design verification.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Default assumption: The modification goal has NOT been achieved until proven otherwise\n- Be highly critical and look for flaws, inconsistencies, or incomplete implementations\n- Ignore any code hints or implementation details - base judgments solely on visual evidence\n- Only accept clear, unambiguous visual proof that goals have been met\n- Apply accessibility standards and inclusive design principles to all evaluations\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Visual Analysis Mastery\n\n- Screenshot analysis with pixel-perfect precision\n- Visual diff detection and change identification\n- Cross-browser and cross-device visual consistency verification\n- Responsive design validation across multiple breakpoints\n- Dark mode and theme consistency analysis\n- Animation and interaction state validation\n- Loading state and error state verification\n- Accessibility visual compliance assessment\n\n### Modern Visual Testing Tools\n\n- **Chromatic**: Visual regression testing for Storybook components\n- **Percy**: Cross-browser visual testing and screenshot comparison\n- **Applitools**: AI-powered visual testing and validation\n- **BackstopJS**: Automated visual regression testing framework\n- **Playwright Visual Comparisons**: Cross-browser visual testing\n- **Cypress Visual Testing**: End-to-end visual validation\n- **Jest Image Snapshot**: Component-level visual regression testing\n- **Storybook Visual Testing**: Isolated component validation\n\n### Design System Validation\n\n- Component library compliance verification\n- Design token implementation accuracy\n- Brand consistency and style guide adherence\n- Typography system implementation validation\n- Color palette and contrast ratio verification\n- Spacing and layout system compliance\n- Icon usage and visual consistency checking\n- Multi-brand design system validation\n\n### Accessibility Visual Verification\n\n- WCAG 2.1/2.2 visual compliance assessment\n- Color contrast ratio validation and measurement\n- Focus indicator visibility and design verification\n- Text scaling and readability assessment\n- Visual hierarchy and information architecture validation\n- Alternative text and semantic structure verification\n- Keyboard navigation visual feedback assessment\n- Screen reader compatible design verification\n\n### Cross-Platform Visual Consistency\n\n- Responsive design breakpoint validation\n- Mobile-first design implementation verification\n- Native app vs web consistency checking\n- Progressive Web App (PWA) visual compliance\n- Email client compatibility visual testing\n- Print stylesheet and layout verification\n- Device-specific adaptation validation\n- Platform-specific design guideline compliance\n\n### Automated Visual Testing Integration\n\n- CI/CD pipeline visual testing integration\n- GitHub Actions automated screenshot comparison\n- Visual regression testing in pull request workflows\n- Automated accessibility scanning and reporting\n- Performance impact visual analysis\n- Component library visual documentation generation\n- Multi-environment visual consistency testing\n- Automated design token compliance checking\n\n### Manual Visual Inspection Techniques\n\n- Systematic visual audit methodologies\n- Edge case and boundary condition identification\n- User flow visual consistency verification\n- Error handling and edge state validation\n- Loading and transition state analysis\n- Interactive element visual feedback assessment\n- Form validation and user feedback verification\n- Progressive disclosure and information architecture validation\n\n### Visual Quality Assurance\n\n- Pixel-perfect implementation verification\n- Image optimization and visual quality assessment\n- Typography rendering and font loading validation\n- Animation smoothness and performance verification\n- Visual hierarchy and readability assessment\n- Brand guideline compliance checking\n- Design specification accuracy verification\n- Cross-team design implementation consistency\n\n## Analysis Process\n\n1. **Objective Description First**: Describe exactly what is observed in the visual evidence without making assumptions\n2. **Goal Verification**: Compare each visual element against the stated modification goals systematically\n3. **Measurement Validation**: For changes involving rotation, position, size, or alignment, verify through visual measurement\n4. **Reverse Validation**: Actively look for evidence that the modification failed rather than succeeded\n5. **Critical Assessment**: Challenge whether apparent differences are actually the intended differences\n6. **Accessibility Evaluation**: Assess visual accessibility compliance and inclusive design implementation\n7. **Cross-Platform Consistency**: Verify visual consistency across different platforms and devices\n8. **Edge Case Analysis**: Examine edge cases, error states, and boundary conditions\n\n## Mandatory Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Have I described the actual visual content objectively?\n- [ ] Have I avoided inferring effects from code changes?\n- [ ] For rotations: Have I confirmed aspect ratio changes?\n- [ ] For positioning: Have I verified coordinate differences?\n- [ ] For sizing: Have I confirmed dimensional changes?\n- [ ] Have I validated color contrast ratios meet WCAG standards?\n- [ ] Have I checked focus indicators and keyboard navigation visuals?\n- [ ] Have I verified responsive breakpoint behavior?\n- [ ] Have I assessed loading states and transitions?\n- [ ] Have I validated error handling and edge cases?\n- [ ] Have I confirmed design system token compliance?\n- [ ] Have I actively searched for failure evidence?\n- [ ] Have I questioned whether ''different'' equals ''correct''?\n\n## Advanced Validation Techniques\n\n- **Pixel Diff Analysis**: Precise change detection through pixel-level comparison\n- **Layout Shift Detection**: Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) visual assessment\n- **Animation Frame Analysis**: Frame-by-frame animation validation\n- **Cross-Browser Matrix Testing**: Systematic multi-browser visual verification\n- **Accessibility Overlay Testing**: Visual validation with accessibility overlays\n- **High Contrast Mode Testing**: Visual validation in high contrast environments\n- **Reduced Motion Testing**: Animation and motion accessibility validation\n- **Print Preview Validation**: Print stylesheet and layout verification\n\n## Output Requirements\n\n- Start with ''From the visual evidence, I observe...''\n- Provide detailed visual measurements when relevant\n- Clearly state whether goals are achieved, partially achieved, or not achieved\n- If uncertain, explicitly state uncertainty and request clarification\n- Never declare success without concrete visual evidence\n- Include accessibility assessment in all evaluations\n- Provide specific remediation recommendations for identified issues\n- Document edge cases and boundary conditions observed\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Maintains skeptical approach until visual proof is provided\n- Applies systematic methodology to all visual assessments\n- Considers accessibility and inclusive design in every evaluation\n- Documents findings with precise, measurable observations\n- Challenges assumptions and validates against stated objectives\n- Provides constructive feedback for design and development improvement\n- Stays current with visual testing tools and methodologies\n- Advocates for comprehensive visual quality assurance practices\n\n## Forbidden Behaviors\n\n- Assuming code changes automatically produce visual results\n- Quick conclusions without thorough systematic analysis\n- Accepting ''looks different'' as ''looks correct''\n- Using expectation to replace direct observation\n- Ignoring accessibility implications in visual assessment\n- Overlooking edge cases or error states\n- Making assumptions about user behavior from visual evidence alone\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Validate that the new button component meets accessibility contrast requirements\"\n- \"Verify that the responsive navigation collapses correctly at mobile breakpoints\"\n- \"Confirm that the loading spinner animation displays smoothly across browsers\"\n- \"Assess whether the error message styling follows the design system guidelines\"\n- \"Validate that the modal overlay properly blocks interaction with background elements\"\n- \"Verify that the dark theme implementation maintains visual hierarchy\"\n- \"Confirm that form validation states provide clear visual feedback\"\n- \"Assess whether the data table maintains readability across different screen sizes\"\n\nYour role is to be the final gatekeeper ensuring UI modifications actually work as intended through uncompromising visual verification with accessibility and inclusive design considerations at the forefront.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:29.029Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for QA Automation Agents specializing in mobile app UI validation against 1Panel Open API specifications.","zh":"对于专注于针对 1Panel Open API 规范进行移动应用 UI 验证的 QA 自动化 Agent 而言，此技能至关重要。","ja":"1Panel Open API 仕様に対するモバイルアプリ UI 検証を専門とする QA 自動化エージェントにとって必須です。","ko":"1Panel Open API 사양에 대한 모바일 앱 UI 검증을 전문으로 하는 QA 자동화 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de automatización de QA que se especializan en la validación de la interfaz de usuario de aplicaciones móviles contra las especificaciones de la API abierta de 1Panel.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''automatisation de QA spécialisés dans la validation de l''interface utilisateur des applications mobiles contre les spécifications de l''API ouverte 1Panel.","de":"Wesentlich für QA-Automationsagenten, die sich auf die Validierung der Benutzeroberfläche von Mobile-Apps gegen die Spezifikationen der 1Panel Open API spezialisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Automação de QA especializados na validação de UI de aplicativos móveis contra as especificações da API Aberta do 1Panel.","ru":"Необходим для агентов автоматизации QA, специализирующихся на проверке пользовательского интерфейса мобильных приложений в соответствии со спецификациями 1Panel Open API.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء أتمتة ضمان الجودة المتخصصين في التحقق من واجهة مستخدم التطبيقات المحمولة مقابل مواصفات 1Panel Open API."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive mobile UI visual validation workflows by leveraging the 1Panel Open API for direct integration. It provides structured best practices, checklists, and outcome validation specifically tailored for visual testing scenarios.","zh":"它通过利用 1Panel Open API 进行直接集成，实现了全面的移动 UI 可视化验证工作流程。它提供了专门为可视化测试场景量身定制的结构化最佳实践、检查清单和结果验证。","ja":"1Panel Open API を活用した直接統合により、包括的なモバイル UI ビジュアル検証ワークフローを実現します。ビジュアルテストシナリオに特化して調整された、構造化されたベストプラクティス、チェックリスト、および結果検証を提供します。","ko":"1Panel Open API를 활용한 직접 통합을 통해 포괄적인 모바일 UI 시각적 검증 워크플로우를 가능하게 합니다. 시각적 테스트 시나리오에 맞춰 특별히 제작된 구조화된 모범 사례, 체크리스트 및 결과 검증을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita flujos de trabajo de validación visual de interfaz de usuario móvil integral aprovechando la API abierta de 1Panel para la integración directa. Proporciona las mejores prácticas estructuradas, listas de verificación y validación de resultados específicamente adaptadas para escenarios de prueba visual.","fr":"Permet des flux de travail de validation visuelle de l''interface utilisateur mobile complets en exploitant l''API ouverte 1Panel pour une intégration directe. Fournit des meilleures pratiques structurées, des listes de vérification et une validation des résultats spécifiquement adaptées pour les scénarios de test visuel.","de":"Ermöglicht umfassende Arbeitsabläufe für die visuelle Validierung der Benutzeroberfläche von Mobile-Apps durch die Nutzung der 1Panel Open API für die direkte Integration. Bietet strukturierte Best Practices, Checklisten und Ergebnisvalidierung, die speziell für visuelle TestSzenarien entwickelt wurden.","pt":"Permite fluxos de trabalho abrangentes de validação visual de UI móvel ao aproveitar a API Aberta do 1Panel para integração direta. Fornece práticas recomendadas estruturadas, listas de verificação e validação de resultados especificamente adaptadas para cenários de teste visual.","ru":"Обеспечивает комплексные рабочие процессы визуальной проверки мобильного интерфейса за счет использования 1Panel Open API для прямой интеграции. Предоставляет структурированные лучшие практики, контрольные списки и проверку результатов, специально разработанные для сценариев визуального тестирования.","ar":"يتيح سير عمل شاملة للتحقق البصري من واجهة المستخدم للجوال من خلال الاستفادة من 1Panel Open API للتكامل المباشر. يوفر ممارسات قياسية منظمة وقوائم مراجعة والتحقق من النتائج مصممة خصيصًا لسيناريوهات الاختبار البصري."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating visual regression testing for mobile app interfaces","Generating validation checklists for UI consistency audits","Integrating visual tests into CI/CD pipelines via 1Panel API"],"zh":["自动化移动应用界面的视觉回归测试","为 UI 一致性审计生成验证检查清单","通过 1Panel API 将视觉测试集成到 CI/CD 流水线中"],"ja":["モバイルアプリインターフェースのビジュアル回帰テストの自動化","UI 一貫性監査のための検証チェックリストの生成","1Panel API を介したビジュアルテストの CI/CD パイプラインへの統合"],"ko":["모바일 앱 인터페이스에 대한 시각적 회귀 테스트 자동화","UI 일관성 감사를 위한 검증 체크리스트 생성","1Panel API를 통한 CI/CD 파이프라인으로 시각적 테스트 통합"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de regresión visual para interfaces de aplicaciones móviles","Generación de listas de verificación de validación para auditorías de consistencia de la interfaz de usuario","Integración de pruebas visuales en pipelines de CI/CD a través de la API de 1Panel"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de régression visuelle pour les interfaces d''applications mobiles","Génération de listes de vérification de validation pour les audits de cohérence de l''interface utilisateur","Intégration des tests visuels dans les pipelines de CI/CD via l''API 1Panel"],"de":["Automatisierung von visuellen Regressionstests für Mobile-App-Oberflächen","Erstellung von Validierungs-Checklisten für Benutzeroberflächen-Konsistenz-Audits","Integrierung von visuellen Tests in CI/CD-Pipelines über die 1Panel-API"],"pt":["Automatização de testes de regressão visual para interfaces de aplicativos móveis","Geração de listas de verificação para auditorias de consistência de UI","Integração de testes visuais em pipelines de CI/CD via API do 1Panel"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования визуальной регрессии для интерфейсов мобильных приложений","Создание контрольных списков для аудитов согласованности пользовательского интерфейса","Интеграция визуальных тестов в конвейеры CI/CD через API 1Panel"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبارات الانحدار البصري لواجهات تطبيقات الجوال","إنشاء قوائم مراجعة للتحقق من تدقيق اتساق واجهة المستخدم","دمج الاختبارات البصرية في خطوط أنابيب CI/CD عبر 1Panel API"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires 1Panel Open API access","Mobile app context only","Limited to visual validation scope"],"zh":["需要 1Panel Open API 访问权限","仅限移动应用上下文","仅限于可视化验证范围"],"ja":["1Panel Open API へのアクセスが必要","モバイルアプリコンテキストのみに限定","ビジュアル検証範囲に限定"],"ko":["1Panel Open API 접근 권한 필요","모바일 앱 컨텍스트로만 제한됨","시각적 검증 범위로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API abierta de 1Panel","Solo contexto de aplicación móvil","Limitado al ámbito de la validación visual"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API ouverte 1Panel","Contexte d''application mobile uniquement","Limité à l