ign는 React를 기반으로 하는 백엔드 관리 프로젝트의 기본 구조로서 Antd v6와 Vite를 사용하여 구축","es":"Ant Design es una infraestructura básica para proyectos de administración de backend con React y Vite","fr":"Ant Design est une infrastructure de base pour les projets de gestion de backend avec React et Vite","de":"Ant Design ist eine grundlegende Infrastruktur für Backend-Verwaltungsprojekte mit React und Vite","pt":"Ant Design é uma infraestrutura de projeto de gerenciamento de backend baseada em React, AntD v6 e Vite","ru":"Ant Design - это базовая инфраструктура проекта управления бэкендом на основе React, AntD v6 и Vite","ar":"Ant Design هو بنية تحتية لمشروع إدارة الخلفية dựa على React، AntD v6 و Vite","en":"一个后台管理项目基础架构，基于react antd v6 vite"},"definition":{"en":"一个后台管理项目基础架构，基于react antd v6 vite"},"features":{"zh":["基于React的后台管理项目基础架构","使用Antd v6和Vite进行构建","高效的开发体验","支持多种布局和主题","易于扩展和自定义"],"ja":["Reactを基盤とするバックエンド管理プロジェクトの基礎構造","Antd v6とViteを使用して構築","効率的な開発体験","複数のレイアウトとテーマをサポート","拡張性とカスタマイズ性が高い"],"ko":["React를 기반으로 하는 백엔드 관리 프로젝트의 기본 구조","Antd v6와 Vite를 사용하여 구축","효율적인 개발 경험","다양한 레이아웃과 테마를 지원","확장성과 커스터마이징이 용이"],"es":["Basado en React y Vite","Infraestructura de backend lista para usar","Componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizables","Compatibilidad con antd v6","Soporte para proyectos de administración de backend"],"fr":["Basé sur React et Vite","Infrastructure de backend prête à l''emploi","Composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisables","Compatibilité avec antd v6","Prise en charge des projets de gestion de backend"],"de":["Basierend auf React und Vite","Backend-Infrastruktur sofort einsatzbereit","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten anpassbar","Kompatibilität mit antd v6","Unterstützung für Backend-Verwaltungsprojekte"],"pt":["Baseado em React","Integração com AntD v6","Suporte a Vite","Infraestrutura de gerenciamento de backend","Desenvolvimento rápido e eficiente"],"ru":["Основан на React","Интеграция с AntD v6","Поддержка Vite","Базовая инфраструктура проекта управления бэкендом","Быстрое и эффективное развитие"],"ar":["مبني على React","التكامل مع AntD v6","دعم Vite","بنية تحتية لمشروع إدارة الخلفية","التطوير السريع والفعال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ant Design","React","Antd v6","Vite","后台管理项目","AI智能工具","高效开发","如何使用Ant Design","Ant Design教程"],"ja":["Ant Design","React","Antd v6","Vite","バックエンド管理プロジェクト","AIエージェント","効率的な開発","Ant Designの使い方","Ant Designチュートリアル"],"ko":["Ant Design","React","Antd v6","Vite","백엔드 관리 프로젝트","AI 에이전트","효율적인 개발","Ant Design 사용법","Ant Design 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo utilizar Ant Design con React","alternativas a Ant Design","Ant Design vs Material-UI","instalación de Ant Design","guía de configuración de Ant Design","proyectos de administración de backend con React"],"fr":["comment utiliser Ant Design avec React","alternatives à Ant Design","Ant Design vs Material-UI","installation d''Ant Design","guide de configuration d''Ant Design","projets de gestion de backend avec React"],"de":["wie man Ant Design mit React verwendet","Alternativen zu Ant Design","Ant Design vs Material-UI","Installation von Ant Design","Konfigurationsanleitung für Ant Design","Backend-Verwaltungsprojekte mit React"],"pt":["como usar Ant Design","o que é Ant Design","alternativas ao Ant Design","Ant Design vs Material UI","instalar Ant Design","guia de configuração do Ant Design"],"ru":["как использовать Ant Design","что такое Ant Design","альтернативы Ant Design","Ant Design vs Material UI","установить Ant Design","руководство по настройке Ant Design"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Ant Design","ما هو Ant Design","بديلات Ant Design","Ant Design مقابل Material UI","تثبيت Ant Design","دليل إعداد Ant Design"]}},"owner":"wtyang","repo":"basic-antd-vite","repoPath":"wtyang/basic-antd-vite","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.930Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ant-design","description":"Ant Design ecosystem guidance covering antd 6.x, Ant Design Pro 5/ProComponents, and Ant Design X v2 (AI/chat UI). Use when making component/layout decisions, theming/tokens, SSR, routing/access, CRUD patterns, or AI chat UI integrations.","bodyPreview":"# Ant Design\n\n## S - Scope\n\n- Target: antd@^6 with React 18-19, plus ant-design-pro@^5 / @ant-design/pro-components and @ant-design/x@^2 when applicable.\n- Cover: core components, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y, performance, Pro layouts/routing/access/CRUD, and X (AI/chat UI) patterns.\n- Avoid: undocumented APIs, internal `.ant-*` class coupling, or cross-version mixing without explicit request.\n\n### Default assumptions (when not specified)\n\n- Language: TypeScript.\n- Styling: prefer tokens","body":"# Ant Design\n\n## S - Scope\n\n- Target: antd@^6 with React 18-19, plus ant-design-pro@^5 / @ant-design/pro-components and @ant-design/x@^2 when applicable.\n- Cover: core components, theming/tokens, css-in-js, SSR, a11y, performance, Pro layouts/routing/access/CRUD, and X (AI/chat UI) patterns.\n- Avoid: undocumented APIs, internal `.ant-*` class coupling, or cross-version mixing without explicit request.\n\n### Default assumptions (when not specified)\n\n- Language: TypeScript.\n- Styling: prefer tokens, `classNames`, and `styles`; avoid global overrides.\n- Provider: a single `ConfigProvider` at app root, unless isolation is required.\n- Dependencies: do not add new packages unless required or requested.\n\n### Scope rules (must follow)\n\n- Use only officially documented antd APIs and patterns.\n- Do not invent props, events, or component names.\n- Use only officially documented Pro/X APIs and patterns.\n- Assume v6 by default; do not mix v5 APIs unless explicitly requested.\n- Do not add global `.ant-*` overrides; prefer tokens and component tokens.\n- Keep examples short; no long, multi-screen samples in the main skill.\n- Do not rely on internal `.ant-*` classes or DOM details; if unavoidable, state risk and alternatives.\n- Theme priority is fixed: global tokens -> component tokens -> alias tokens.\n- For SSR, provide the minimal provider setup and verification points (hydration, style order, duplication).\n- Route complex issues to `Reference` files; main skill gives only decisions and entry points.\n\n### Complex triggers (must open a `Reference`)\n\n- More than 3 interaction states or cross-field linkage (Form).\n- Remote search, large data, or custom rendering (Select).\n- Server sorting/filtering/pagination, virtualization, fixed columns/headers (Table).\n- Async load, checkStrictly, or virtualization (Tree).\n- Controlled `fileList`, `customRequest`, preview/auth edge cases (Upload).\n- SSR style order, streaming/hydration errors, or performance bottlenecks.\n- Pro layouts, route-driven menus, or access control (Layout/Access).\n- ProTable/ProForm with request coupling, dynamic fields, or perf tuning.\n- X streaming, tool rendering, or Markdown extensions beyond the defaults.\n\n### `Reference` index (Chinese)\n\n| Topic           | Description                                          | `Reference`                           |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| Core v6         | Version scope, migration notes, theming/SSR overview | `references/antd-v6.md`               |\n| Legacy v5       | Existing v5 projects and migration guardrails        | `references/antd-v5.md`               |\n| Form advanced   | Dynamic forms, dependencies, validation perf         | `references/form-advanced.md`         |\n| Table advanced  | Sorting/filtering/virtualization patterns            | `references/table-advanced.md`        |\n| Upload advanced | Controlled upload, customRequest, edge cases         | `references/upload-advanced.md`       |\n| Select advanced | Remote search, tags, rendering and a11y              | `references/select-advanced.md`       |\n| Tree advanced   | Async load, checkStrictly, virtual                   | `references/tree-advanced.md`         |\n| Pro v5          | Pro 5 scope and baseline guidance                    | `references/pro-v5.md`                |\n| Pro layout      | Layouts, menus, access, multi-layout patterns        | `references/pro-layout-advanced.md`   |\n| ProTable        | Query/table coupling, request patterns, perf         | `references/protable-advanced.md`     |\n| ProForm         | Step forms, dynamic fields, table linkage            | `references/proform-advanced.md`      |\n| X v2            | X v2 scope and baseline guidance                     | `references/x-v2.md`                  |\n| X components    | Message/tool component patterns                      | `references/x-components-advanced.md` |\n| X SDK           | Streaming integration and state model                | `references/x-sdk-advanced.md`        |\n| X Markdown      | X Markdown extensions and rendering                  | `references/x-markdown-advanced.md`   |\n\n### Reference routing rule\n\n- Do not expand advanced topics in the main skill.\n- Jump to a `Reference` if any condition matches:\n  - More than 3 interaction states.\n  - Async flows or large data sets.\n  - Virtualization or performance tuning.\n  - Complex accessibility requirements.\n\n## P - Process\n\n### 1) Identify the layer first\n\n- Core antd UI, Pro admin app, or X chat/agent UI?\n- If Pro or X is involved, route to the relevant `Reference` when complexity triggers match.\n\n### 2) Clarify context before advising\n\n- Framework and rendering: Next.js / Umi / Vite? CSR / SSR / streaming?\n- antd version: confirm v6 if unclear.\n- Theming depth: small token changes or component-level overrides?\n- Data scale: large lists/tables/trees/selects?\n- Interaction complexity: controlled state, linkage, async, auth, upload flows?\n\n### 3) Provider minimal set\n\n- CSR: usually `ConfigProvider` only.\n- SSR or strict style order: add `StyleProvider` as per `references/antd-v6.md`.\n- One app, one root provider; local themes only for isolation needs.\n\n### 4) Component selection rules (core antd)\n\n- Form: prefer `Form` as source of truth unless external state is required.\n- Overlay: `Modal` for blocking flows; `Drawer` for side context or long content.\n- Lists: structured data uses `Table`, light lists use `List`; `Table` needs stable `rowKey`.\n- Large data: use virtualization (see `references/table-advanced.md`).\n- Select: local filter uses `filterOption`; remote search uses `showSearch` + `filterOption={false}` + `onSearch` (see `references/select-advanced.md`).\n- Upload: controlled flow uses `fileList`; complex flow uses `customRequest` (see `references/upload-advanced.md`).\n\n### 5) Pro decision shortcuts (when Pro is in scope)\n\n- Routes are the menu source of truth; avoid hand-built menus.\n- Access control is page-first; UI hides are secondary; backend still enforces.\n- CRUD uses ProTable/ProForm schemas as the source of truth (see Pro references).\n\n### 6) X decision shortcuts (when X is in scope)\n\n- Model messages/tools as serializable data; JSX is a pure view.\n- Streaming needs stable keys, throttled updates, and scroll management (see X references).\n\n### 7) Theming decision chain\n\n1. Use global tokens for most cases.\n2. Use component tokens or `classNames`/`styles` for differences.\n3. Only if unavoidable, use scoped CSS overrides and state the risk.\n4. Never rely on global `.ant-*` overrides.\n\n### 8) Shunt complexity to `Reference`\n\n- If any complex trigger matches, provide decision + minimal skeleton + `Reference` path.\n- Details live in the corresponding `references/*.md`.\n\n### 9) a11y and performance checks\n\n- a11y: keyboard access, focus management for overlays, icon buttons with `aria-label`, not color-only states.\n- perf: stable keys, memoized columns, avoid frequent setState, use virtualization and throttling as needed.\n\n## O - Output\n\n### Output should include (as needed)\n\n- Component and layout recommendations with 1-3 sentence rationale.\n- Minimal provider and theming strategy.\n- SSR, perf, and a11y risks with concrete mitigations.\n- Pro: route/layout plan, access model, and ProTable/ProForm schema when relevant.\n- X: message/tool schema and streaming state model when relevant.\n- A `Reference` path when complex triggers match.\n- Advice only (no code) when the request is selection or decision guidance.\n\n### Output forbidden\n\n- Inventing antd APIs, tokens, or relying on internal classes without calling out risk.\n- Replacing tokens with global CSS overrides.\n- Vague SSR/hydration advice without verification points.\n\n### Regression checklist (prefer 5-10 items)\n\n- [ ] Provider: one root `ConfigProvider`; SSR style order is controlled.\n- [ ] Theming: tokens first, no broad global `.ant-*` overrides.\n- [ ] Form: validation and linkage are within `Form` and reproducible.\n- [ ] Table: stable `rowKey`; pagination/sort/filter entry points are consistent.\n- [ ] Select: remote search disables local filter; a11y checks pass.\n- [ ] Upload: controlled vs uncontrolled mode is clear; failure and retry flows defined.\n- [ ] Overlays: close and destroy behavior is defined (`destroyOnClose` etc).\n- [ ] Performance: stable keys and memoization; virtualization or throttling when needed.\n- [ ] Pro: route-driven menus/access are consistent with backend enforcement.\n- [ ] X: streaming state, stop/retry, and tool rendering are deterministic.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:30:07.378Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced React UI component integration with ant-design v6 and Vite","zh":"适合需要高级 React UI 组件集成的前端代理，特别是 ant-design v6 和 Vite","ja":"React の高度な UI コンポーネント統合が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに適しています。特に ant-design v6 と Vite","ko":"고급 React UI 컴포넌트 통합이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. 특히 ant-design v6 및 Vite","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una integración avanzada de componentes de interfaz de usuario de React con ant-design v6 y Vite","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une intégration avancée de composants d''interface utilisateur React avec ant-design v6 et Vite","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration von React-Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit ant-design v6 und Vite benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Frontend Agents que precisam de integração avançada de React UI component com ant-design v6 e Vite","ru":"Идеально для Frontend Agents, которые нуждают в интеграции React UI компонентов с ant-design v6 и Vite","ar":"يتميز Frontend Agents الذي يحتاج إلى إدماج UI React UI component متقدم مع ant-design v6 و Vite"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build responsive, accessible, and performant user interfaces using antd core components, theming/tokens, and css-in-js, while leveraging SSR, a11y, and Pro layouts for complex applications, including AI/chat UI patterns with @ant-design/x","zh":"赋予代理构建响应式、可访问和高性能用户界面的能力，使用 antd 核心组件、主题/令牌和 css-in-js，同时利用 SSR、a11y 和 Pro 布局复杂应用，包括 AI/聊天 UI 模式与 @ant-design/x","ja":"エージェントが反応性、可達性、パフォーマンスの高いユーザー インターフェイスを構築する能力を付与します。antd コア コンポーネント、テーマ/トークン、css-in-js を使用しながら、SSR、a11y、Pro レイアウトを使用して複雑なアプリケーションを構築します。さらに、@ant-design/x を使用した AI/チャット UI パターンも含まれます","ko":"에이전트가 반응형, 접근성 및 성능이 뛰어난 사용자 인터페이스를 구축할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. antd 핵심 구성 요소, 테마/토큰 및 css-in-js를 사용하여 SSR, a11y 및 Pro 레이아웃을 활용하여 복잡한 애플리케이션을 구축합니다. 또한 @ant-design/x를 사용한 AI/채팅 UI 패턴도 포함됩니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces de usuario responsivas, accesibles y de alto rendimiento utilizando componentes básicos de antd, temas/tokens y css-in-js, mientras aprovecha SSR, a11y y diseños Pro para aplicaciones complejas, incluidos patrones de interfaz de usuario de AI/chat con @ant-design/x","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces utilisateur réactives, accessibles et performantes en utilisant les composants de base d''antd, la mise en page/thèmes et css-in-js, tout en exploitant SSR, a11y et les dispositions Pro pour les applications complexes, y compris les modèles d''interface utilisateur d''AI/chat avec @ant-design/x","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, responsive, zugängliche und leistungsstarke Benutzeroberflächen zu erstellen, indem sie antd-Kernkomponenten, Designs/Token und css-in-js verwenden, während sie SSR, a11y und Pro-Layouts für komplexe Anwendungen nutzen, einschließlich AI/Chat-Benutzeroberflächenmuster mit @ant-design/x","pt":"Empodera agentes a construir interfaces de usuário responsivas, acessíveis e performantes usando antd core components, theming/tokens e css-in-js, enquanto aproveita SSR, a11y e Pro layouts para aplicações complexas, incluindo AI/chat UI patterns com @ant-design/x","ru":"Эмподера агентов создать интерфейсы пользователя responsivas, acessíveis e performantes, используя antd core components, theming/tokens и css-in-js, при этом используя SSR, a11y и Pro layouts для сложных приложений, включая AI/chat UI patterns с @ant-design/x","ar":"يمنح agents بناء واجهات مستخدم responsivas, acessíveis و performantes باستخدام antd core components, theming/tokens و css-in-js, بينما يستفد من SSR, a11y و Pro layouts لأPLICATIONS معقدة, بما في ذلك AI/chat UI patterns مع @ant-design/x"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating responsive layouts with ant-design Pro components","Customizing antd themes and tokens for branding consistency","Optimizing performance in React applications using antd''s SSR capabilities"],"zh":["使用 ant-design Pro 组件生成响应式布局","自定义 antd 主题和令牌以保持品牌一致性","使用 antd 的 SSR 功能优化 React 应用程序的性能"],"ja":["antd Pro コンポーネントを使用して反応性レイアウトを生成する","antd テーマとトークンをカスタマイズしてブランドの一貫性を維持する","antd の SSR 機能を使用して React アプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["ant-design Pro 구성 요소를 사용하여 반응형 레이아웃을 생성하는 것","antd 테마 및 토큰을 사용자 정의하여 브랜드 일관성을 유지하는 것","antd의 SSR 기능을 사용하여 React 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Generar diseños responsivos con componentes de ant-design Pro","Personalizar temas y tokens de antd para la coherencia de la marca","Optimizar el rendimiento en aplicaciones de React utilizando las capacidades de SSR de antd"],"fr":["Générer des dispositions réactives avec des composants de ant-design Pro","Personnaliser les thèmes et les tokens d''antd pour la cohérence de la marque","Optimiser les performances dans les applications React en utilisant les capacités de SSR d''antd"],"de":["Erstellen von responsiven Layouts mit ant-design Pro-Komponenten","Anpassen von antd-Themen und -Token für eine konsistente Markenidentität","Optimieren der Leistung in React-Anwendungen unter Verwendung der SSR-Funktionen von antd"],"pt":["Gerando layouts responsivos com ant-design Pro components","Personalizando antd themes e tokens para consistência de marca","Otimizando performance em React aplicações usando antd''s SSR capabilities"],"ru":["Генерируя layouts responsivos с ant-design Pro компонентами","Персонализируя antd themes и tokens для consistência de marca","Отимизируя performance em React aplicações usando antd''s SSR capabilities"],"ar":["توليد layouts responsivos مع ant-design Pro components","تخصيص antd themes و tokens لتحقيق consistência de marca","تحسين performance في React aplicações باستخدام antd''s SSR capabilities"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React 18-19 and antd@^6","Avoids undocumented APIs and internal `.ant-*` class coupling","Limited to specific versions of ant-design-pro and @ant-design/x"],"zh":["需要 React 18-19 和 antd@^6","避免未记录的 API 和内部 `.ant-*` 类耦合","仅限于 ant-design-pro 和 @ant-design/x 的特定版本"],"ja":["React 18-19 と antd@^6 が必要","未記載の API と内部 `.ant-*` クラスのカップリングを避ける","ant-design-pro と @ant-design/x の特定のバージョンに限定される"],"ko":["React 18-19 및 antd@^6이 필요","기록되지 않은 API 및 내부 `.ant-*` 클래스 결합을 피함","ant-design-pro 및 @ant-design/x의 특정 버전에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere React 18-19 y antd@^6","Evita API no documentadas y acoplamiento interno de clases `.ant-*`","Limitado a versiones específicas de ant-design-pro y @ant-design/x"],"fr":["Nécessite React 18-19 et antd@^6","Évite les API non documentées et le couplage interne des classes `.ant-*`","Limité à des versions spécifiques de ant-design-pro et @ant-design/x"],"de":["Benötigt React 18-19 und antd@^6","Vermeidet nicht dokumentierte APIs und interne `.ant-*`-Klassenkopplung","Begrenzt auf spezifische Versionen von ant-design-pro und @ant-design/x"],"pt":["Requer React 18-19 e antd@^6","Evita APIs não documentados e internal `.ant-*` class coupling","Limitado a versões específicas de ant-design-pro e @ant-design/x"],"ru":["Требует React 18-19 e antd@^6","Избегает APIs não documentados e internal `.ant-*` class coupling","Ограничено до версий ant-design-pro и @ant-design/x"],"ar":["يتطلب React 18-19 و antd@^6","ي избегает APIs não documentados و internal `.ant-*` class coupling","ي محدود إلى إصدارات معينة من ant-design-pro و @ant-design/x"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3de78173aa90423d2b0e34ac82abf787b8ce260f92749f425ed970504fd48301","qualityScore":45}');
