de code garantie","Budgets de tokens configurables","Artéfacts auditable"],"de":["Spec-Driven Development","Claude Code Workflows","Garantierte Code-Qualität","Konfigurierbare Token-Budgets","Auditable Artefakte"],"pt":["Spec-Driven Development","Claude Code workflows","Portas de qualidade","Orçamentos de tokens","Artifacts auditáveis"],"ru":["Spec-Driven Development","Claude Code workflows","Качественные ворота","Бюджеты токенов","Аудиторские артефакты"],"ar":["Spec-Driven Development","Claude Code workflows","بوابات الجودة","ميزانيات الرموز","أدلة تدقيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","任务状态同步","Spec-Driven Development","Claude Code","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","タスクステータス同期","Spec-Driven Development","Claude Code","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","태스크 상태 동기화","Spec-Driven Development","Claude Code","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar task-status-sync","qué es Spec-Driven Development","alternativas a Claude Code","task-status-sync vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de task-status-sync","guía de configuración de task-status-sync","desarrollo de productos con AI","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser task-status-sync","quoi est le Spec-Driven Development","alternatives à Claude Code","task-status-sync vs autres outils d''IA","installation de task-status-sync","guide de configuration de task-status-sync","développement de produits avec l''IA","outils d''IA pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man task-status-sync verwendet","was ist Spec-Driven Development","alternativen zu Claude Code","task-status-sync vs andere KI-Tools","installation von task-status-sync","konfigurationsanleitung für task-status-sync","produktentwicklung mit KI","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar task-status-sync","o que é Spec-Driven Development","task-status-sync alternativa","task-status-sync vs Claude Code","instalar task-status-sync","guia de configuração do task-status-sync"],"ru":["как использовать task-status-sync","что такое Spec-Driven Development","альтернатива task-status-sync","task-status-sync vs Claude Code","установить task-status-sync","руководство по настройке task-status-sync"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام task-status-sync","ما هو Spec-Driven Development","بديل task-status-sync","task-status-sync مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت task-status-sync","دليل إعداد task-status-sync"]}},"owner":"marcusgoll","repo":"Spec-Flow","repoPath":"marcusgoll/Spec-Flow","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.956Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"task-status-sync","description":"Enforce atomic task status updates through task-tracker commands only. Prevent manual edits to NOTES.md and tasks.md that break synchronization. Auto-trigger when detecting Edit/Write attempts to task files, task completion mentions, or status update discussions. Auto-convert manual edit attempts to equivalent task-tracker commands. Validate task-tracker usage and auto-fix common mistakes.","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nMaintain atomic synchronization between tasks.md checkboxes and NOTES.md completion markers by enforcing task-tracker command usage and preventing manual file edits that cause data inconsistencies.\n</objective>\n\n<quick_start>\n<enforcement_model>\n**Intercept and convert manual edits to task-tracker commands:**\n\n1. **Detect attempt**: Monitor for Edit/Write tool usage on NOTES.md or tasks.md\n2. **Extract intent**: Parse what change the user/Claude wants to make\n3. **Convert to command*","body":"<objective>\nMaintain atomic synchronization between tasks.md checkboxes and NOTES.md completion markers by enforcing task-tracker command usage and preventing manual file edits that cause data inconsistencies.\n</objective>\n\n<quick_start>\n<enforcement_model>\n**Intercept and convert manual edits to task-tracker commands:**\n\n1. **Detect attempt**: Monitor for Edit/Write tool usage on NOTES.md or tasks.md\n2. **Extract intent**: Parse what change the user/Claude wants to make\n3. **Convert to command**: Generate equivalent task-tracker command\n4. **Execute atomically**: Run task-tracker to update both files simultaneously\n5. **Provide feedback**: Explain the conversion and show the result\n\n**Example workflow:**\n```\nUser: \"Mark T001 as completed\"\n\n❌ BLOCKED: Direct edit to tasks.md\n✅ AUTO-CONVERTED: .spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh mark-done-with-notes -TaskId T001\n\nResult:\n- tasks.md: - [X] T001 Create database schema\n- NOTES.md: ✅ T001: Create database schema - est (2025-11-19 10:30)\n```\n</enforcement_model>\n\n<allowed_operations>\n**✅ Permitted (read-only):**\n- Read NOTES.md to understand progress\n- Read tasks.md to see task list\n- Read error-log.md to diagnose failures\n\n**✅ Permitted (through task-tracker):**\n- Mark tasks complete: `mark-done-with-notes`\n- Mark tasks in progress: `mark-in-progress`\n- Mark tasks failed: `mark-failed`\n- Sync status: `sync-status`\n- Get next task: `next`\n- Get summary: `summary`\n- Validate: `validate`\n\n**❌ Blocked (auto-converted):**\n- Direct Edit/Write to tasks.md\n- Direct Edit/Write to NOTES.md\n- Manual checkbox changes ([ ] → [X])\n- Manual completion markers (✅ T001)\n</allowed_operations>\n\n<task_tracker_commands>\n**Available task-tracker.sh / task-tracker.ps1 actions:**\n\n```bash\n# Get current status\n.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh status -Json\n\n# Mark task completed with full details\n.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh mark-done-with-notes \\\n  -TaskId T001 \\\n  -Notes \"Created Message model with validation\" \\\n  -Evidence \"pytest: 25/25 passing\" \\\n  -Coverage \"92% (+8%)\" \\\n  -CommitHash \"abc123\" \\\n  -Duration \"15min\"\n\n# Mark task in progress\n.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh mark-in-progress -TaskId T002\n\n# Mark task failed\n.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh mark-failed \\\n  -TaskId T003 \\\n  -ErrorMessage \"Tests failing: ImportError on MessageService\"\n\n# Sync tasks.md to NOTES.md (migration utility)\n.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh sync-status\n\n# Get next available task\n.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh next -Json\n\n# Get phase-wise summary\n.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh summary -Json\n\n# Validate task file structure\n.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh validate -Json\n```\n\nSee [references/task-tracker-api.md](references/task-tracker-api.md) for complete API reference.\n</task_tracker_commands>\n</quick_start>\n\n<workflow>\n<detection_phase>\n**1. Monitor Tool Usage**\n\nWatch for these patterns that indicate task status updates:\n\n**Direct file edits:**\n- `Edit(file_path: \"*/tasks.md\", ...)`\n- `Edit(file_path: \"*/NOTES.md\", ...)`\n- `Write(file_path: \"*/tasks.md\", ...)`\n- `Write(file_path: \"*/NOTES.md\", ...)`\n\n**Verbal indicators:**\n- \"Mark T001 as complete\"\n- \"Update task status for T002\"\n- \"Task T003 is done\"\n- \"Completed T004\"\n- \"T005 failed\"\n\n**Checkbox change patterns:**\n- `old_string: \"- [ ] T001\"` → `new_string: \"- [X] T001\"`\n- Adding ✅ markers to NOTES.md manually\n</detection_phase>\n\n<interception_phase>\n**2. Intercept and Block Manual Edits**\n\nWhen Edit/Write detected on tasks.md or NOTES.md:\n\n```\n⛔ MANUAL EDIT BLOCKED\n\nFile: specs/001-feature/tasks.md\nAttempted change: Mark T001 as [X] completed\n\n❌ Reason: Manual edits break atomic sync between tasks.md and NOTES.md\n\n✅ Solution: Use task-tracker command instead\n\nAuto-converting to:\n  .spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh mark-done-with-notes -TaskId T001\n\nThis atomically updates:\n  - tasks.md checkbox: - [X] T001\n  - NOTES.md marker: ✅ T001: ... - est (2025-11-19 10:30)\n  - Progress summary in tasks.md (if update-tasks-summary.ps1 exists)\n```\n\nDo NOT execute the manual edit. Instead, proceed to conversion phase.\n</interception_phase>\n\n<conversion_phase>\n**3. Convert Manual Edit to Task-Tracker Command**\n\n**Parse the intended change:**\n\nExtract from Edit/Write tool parameters:\n- `TaskId`: T### from checkbox pattern or ✅ marker\n- `NewStatus`: Infer from checkbox ([X] = completed, [~] = in-progress, [ ] = pending)\n- `Notes`: Extract from NOTES.md addition or Edit context\n- `ErrorMessage`: Extract if marking failed\n\n**Generate equivalent command:**\n\n```javascript\n// Pseudo-logic\nif (newStatus === ''X'' || intent === ''mark complete'') {\n  command = ''mark-done-with-notes''\n  params = {\n    TaskId: extractedTaskId,\n    Notes: extractedNotes || \"\",\n    Duration: \"est\"  // Default if not specified\n  }\n}\nelse if (newStatus === ''~'' || intent === ''mark in progress'') {\n  command = ''mark-in-progress''\n  params = { TaskId: extractedTaskId }\n}\nelse if (intent === ''mark failed'' || errorMessage present) {\n  command = ''mark-failed''\n  params = {\n    TaskId: extractedTaskId,\n    ErrorMessage: extractedErrorMessage\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Validation before execution:**\n\nCheck that:\n- TaskId exists in tasks.md\n- Status transition is valid (pending → in-progress → completed)\n- Required fields present (e.g., ErrorMessage for mark-failed)\n\nIf validation fails, auto-fix where possible:\n- Missing TaskId → Extract from context or ask user\n- Invalid transition → Warn and suggest correct flow\n- Missing ErrorMessage → Prompt for details\n\nSee [references/conversion-logic.md](references/conversion-logic.md) for detailed conversion rules.\n</conversion_phase>\n\n<execution_phase>\n**4. Execute Task-Tracker Command**\n\n```bash\n# Platform detection\nif (platform === ''win32'') {\n  script = ''.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh''  # Uses WSL or delegates to PS\n} else if (platform === ''linux'' || platform === ''darwin'') {\n  script = ''.spec-flow/scripts/bash/task-tracker.sh''\n}\n\n# Execute with Bash tool\nBash(`${script} ${command} -TaskId ${TaskId} [additional params] -Json`)\n```\n\n**Parse JSON output:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Success\": true,\n  \"TaskId\": \"T001\",\n  \"Message\": \"Task T001 marked complete in both tasks.md and NOTES.md\",\n  \"TasksFile\": \"specs/001-feature/tasks.md\",\n  \"NotesFile\": \"specs/001-feature/NOTES.md\",\n  \"PhaseMarker\": \"[RED]\"\n}\n```\n\n**Provide feedback:**\n\n```\n✅ TASK STATUS UPDATED ATOMICALLY\n\nTask T001 marked complete:\n  - tasks.md: Updated checkbox to [X]\n  - NOTES.md: Added completion marker\n  - Phase: [RED] (TDD red phase)\n\nFiles synchronized:\n  - specs/001-feature/tasks.md\n  - specs/001-feature/NOTES.md\n\nNext steps:\n  - Run: task-tracker.sh next\n  - Continue with T002\n```\n</execution_phase>\n\n<validation_phase>\n**5. Validate Task-Tracker Usage**\n\n**Common mistakes to auto-fix:**\n\n| Mistake | Detection | Auto-fix |\n|---------|-----------|----------|\n| Wrong TaskId format (T1 instead of T001) | Regex: `^T\\d{1,2}$` | Pad with zeros: T001 |\n| Invalid status transition (pending → completed) | Check current status | Insert mark-in-progress first |\n| Missing duration | Duration field empty | Default to \"est\" |\n| Missing notes on completion | Notes empty for mark-done-with-notes | Prompt: \"Add implementation summary\" |\n| TaskId doesn''t exist | Not found in Parse-TasksFile | List available task IDs |\n| Marking already-completed task | IsCompleted = true | Warn: \"Already complete, skip or force?\" |\n\n**TDD validation:**\n\nCheck if test task completed before implementation:\n- If marking T002 (implement) complete but T001 (test) is pending → warn\n- Recommendation: \"Complete T001 (test) before T002 (implement) for TDD\"\n\n**Parallel safety:**\n\n- If more than 2 tasks in-progress → warn: \"Exceeds parallel limit (2)\"\n- If file path conflicts detected → block: \"T002 and T003 both modify `app.py`\"\n\nSee [references/validation-rules.md](references/validation-rules.md) for complete validation logic.\n</validation_phase>\n</workflow>\n\n<anti_patterns>\n**Avoid these mistakes that break sync:**\n\n**1. Manual checkbox edits**\n```markdown\n❌ BAD (manual edit to tasks.md):\n- [X] T001 Create database schema\n\n✅ GOOD (task-tracker command):\ntask-tracker.sh mark-done-with-notes -TaskId T001 -Notes \"Created schema\"\n```\n\n**2. Adding NOTES.md markers manually**\n```markdown\n❌ BAD (manual edit to NOTES.md):\n✅ T001: Created database schema\n\n✅ GOOD (task-tracker handles NOTES.md):\ntask-tracker.sh mark-done-with-notes -TaskId T001\n# Atomically updates both files\n```\n\n**3. Inconsistent states**\n```markdown\n❌ BAD (tasks.md says pending, NOTES.md says complete):\ntasks.md: - [ ] T001 Create schema\nNOTES.md: ✅ T001: Created schema\n\n✅ GOOD (atomic update ensures consistency):\nBoth files updated simultaneously via task-tracker\n```\n\n**4. Skipping in-progress marker**\n```markdown\n❌ BAD (pending → completed without in-progress):\nCan lose tracking of what''s actively being worked on\n\n✅ GOOD (mark in-progress first):\n1. task-tracker.sh mark-in-progress -TaskId T001\n2. [implement task]\n3. task-tracker.sh mark-done-with-notes -TaskId T001\n```\n\n**5. Missing task completion evidence**\n```markdown\n❌ BAD (no evidence of completion):\n✅ T001 - est (timestamp)\n\n✅ GOOD (include evidence, coverage, commit):\n✅ T001: Created Message model - 15min (2025-11-19 10:30)\n  - Evidence: pytest: 25/25 passing\n  - Coverage: 92% (+8%)\n  - Committed: abc123\n```\n</anti_patterns>\n\n<success_criteria>\n**Task status sync is working correctly when:**\n\n- ✓ All task completions use task-tracker commands\n- ✓ tasks.md checkboxes and NOTES.md markers are always synchronized\n- ✓ No manual edits to tasks.md or NOTES.md occur\n- ✓ Attempted manual edits are auto-converted to task-tracker commands\n- ✓ Task-tracker validation catches and fixes common mistakes\n- ✓ TDD flow is enforced (tests before implementation)\n- ✓ Parallel task limit (2) is respected\n- ✓ File path conflicts are detected and prevented\n- ✓ Error log entries are created for failed tasks\n- ✓ Progress summary stays updated with velocity metrics\n\n**Detection working when:**\n- Edit/Write attempts to tasks.md are intercepted\n- Verbal task completion mentions are recognized\n- Checkbox change patterns are detected\n- Auto-conversion generates correct task-tracker commands\n\n**Validation working when:**\n- Invalid task IDs are caught and corrected\n- Invalid status transitions are prevented or guided\n- TDD violations are warned\n- Parallel safety limits are enforced\n</success_criteria>\n\n<reference_guides>\nFor detailed implementation and troubleshooting:\n\n- **[references/task-tracker-api.md](references/task-tracker-api.md)** - Complete task-tracker command reference with examples\n- **[references/conversion-logic.md](references/conversion-logic.md)** - Manual edit → task-tracker command conversion rules\n- **[references/validation-rules.md](references/validation-rules.md)** - Task status validation and auto-fix logic\n- **[references/file-formats.md](references/file-formats.md)** - tasks.md and NOTES.md structure and patterns\n</reference_guides>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:47:05.719Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents needing precise task status synchronization across Spec-Driven Development pipelines.","zh":"非常适合需要跨Spec-Driven Development管道进行精确任务状态同步的工作流自动化Agent。","ja":"Spec-Driven Developmentパイプライン全体で正確なタスク状態の同期を必要とするワークフロー自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Spec-Driven Development 파이프라인 전반에 걸쳐 정확한 작업 상태 동기화가 필요한 워크플로우 자동화 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de flujo de trabajo que necesitan una sincronización precisa del estado de las tareas en pipelines de desarrollo basados en especificaciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de workflow nécessitant une synchronisation précise de l''état des tâches dans les pipelines de développement basés sur des spécifications.","de":"Ideal für Workflow-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine präzise Aufgabenstatus-Synchronisierung in spezifikationsgetriebenen Entwicklungspipelines benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que necessitam de sincronização precisa do status da tarefa em pipelines de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Especificações.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, которым требуется точная синхронизация статуса задач в конвейерах разработки, управляемой спецификациями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل آلي لتحسين تدفق العمل الذي يحتاج إلى تنسيق دقيق لمراحل المهام عبر أنابيب التطوير الموجهة بالمواصفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain atomic synchronization between tasks.md checkboxes and NOTES.md completion markers by enforcing task-tracker command usage, preventing manual file edits, and utilizing quality gates, token budgets, and auditable artifacts through Claude Code workflows.","zh":"通过强制使用task-tracker命令、防止手动文件编辑，并利用Claude Code工作流中的质量门、token预算和可审计工件，使Agent能够维护tasks.md复选框与NOTES.md完成标记之间的原子级同步。","ja":"task-trackerコマンドの使用を強制し、手動でのファイル編集を防止し、Claude Codeワークフローを通じた品質ゲート、トークンバジェット、監査可能な成果物を利用することで、エージェントがtasks.mdのチェックボックスとNOTES.mdの完了マーカー間のアトミックな同期を維持できるようにします。","ko":"task-tracker 명령어 사용을 강제하고, 수동 파일 편집을 방지하며, Claude Code 워크플로우를 통한 품질 게이트, 토큰 예산 및 감사 가능 산출물을 활용함으로써, 에이전트가 tasks.md 체크박스와 NOTES.md 완료 마커 사이의 원자적 동기화를 유지할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener una sincronización atómica entre casillas de tareas.md y marcadores de finalización de NOTAS.md al imponer el uso de comandos de seguimiento de tareas, prevenir ediciones manuales de archivos y utilizar puertas de calidad, presupuestos de tokens y artefactos auditables a través de flujos de trabajo de Claude Code.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une synchronisation atomique entre les cases à cocher des tâches.md et les marqueurs de fin de NOTAS.md en imposant l''utilisation de commandes de suivi de tâches, en empêchant les éditions manuelles de fichiers et en utilisant des portes de qualité, des budgets de jetons et des artefacts auditable via des flux de travail Claude Code.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine atomare Synchronisation zwischen Aufgaben.md-Checkboxen und NOTAS.md-Fertigstellungsmarkern aufrechtzuerhalten, indem sie die Verwendung von Aufgaben-Tracker-Befehlen erzwingen, manuelle Dateibearbeitungen verhindern und Qualitätstore, Token-Budgets und überprüfbare Artefakte über Claude-Code-Workflows nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter a sincronização atômica entre as caixas de seleção do tasks.md e os marcadores de conclusão do NOTES.md, aplicando o uso de comandos de acompanhamento de tarefas, prevenindo edições manuais de arquivos e utilizando portões de qualidade, orçamentos de tokens e artefatos auditáveis por meio de fluxos de trabalho do Claude Code.","ru":"Позволяет агентам поддерживать атомарную синхронизацию между флажками tasks.md и маркерами завершения NOTES.md, обеспечивая использование команд отслеживания задач, предотвращая ручное редактирование файлов и используя ворота качества, бюджеты токенов и аудиторские артефакты через рабочие процессы Claude Code.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على التزامن الذري بين مربعات اختيار tasks.md وأعلام إكمال NOTES.md من خلال فرض استخدام أوامر تتبع المهام ومنع تحرير الملفات يدويًا واستخدام بوابات الجودة وميزانيات الرموز والمنتجات القابلة للتدقيق من خلال سير عمل كلود كود."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task status updates across multiple files","Enforcing consistent task tracking through command usage","Debugging data inconsistencies caused by manual file edits"],"zh":["跨多个文件自动化任务状态更新","通过命令使用强制执行一致的任务跟踪","调试由手动文件编辑引起的数据不一致"],"ja":["複数ファイルにわたるタスク状態更新の自動化","コマンド使用による一貫したタスク追跡の強制","手動ファイル編集が原因のデータ不整合のデバッグ"],"ko":["여러 파일에 걸친 작업 상태 업데이트 자동화","명령어 사용을 통한 일관된 작업 추적 강제","수동 파일 편집으로 인한 데이터 불일치 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones del estado de las tareas en varios archivos","Imponer un seguimiento de tareas coherente a través del uso de comandos","Depurar inconsistencias de datos causadas por ediciones manuales de archivos"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de l''état des tâches dans plusieurs fichiers","Imposer un suivi de tâches cohérent via l''utilisation de commandes","Déboguer les incohérences de données causées par des éditions manuelles de fichiers"],"de":["Automatisieren der Aufgabenstatusaktualisierungen in mehreren Dateien","Durchsetzen einer konsistenten Aufgabenverfolgung durch Befehlsverwendung","Fehlersuche bei Dateninkonsistenzen, die durch manuelle Dateibearbeitungen verursacht werden"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de status de tarefas em vários arquivos","Impor acompanhamento de tarefas consistente por meio do uso de comandos","Depurar inconsistências de dados causadas por edições manuais de arquivos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления статуса задач в нескольких файлах","Обеспечить согласованное отслеживание задач посредством использования команд","Отладить несоответствия данных, вызванные ручным редактированием файлов"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات تلقائية لمراحل المهام عبر عدة ملفات","فرض تتبع متسق للمهام من خلال استخدام الأوامر","تصحيح عدم تطابق البيانات الناتج عن تحرير الملفات يدويًا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code workflow integration","Limited to tasks.md and NOTES.md file formats","Needs Spec-Driven Development pipeline setup"],"zh":["需要Claude Code工作流集成","仅限于tasks.md和NOTES.md文件格式","需要Spec-Driven Development管道设置"],"ja":["Claude Codeワークフローの統合が必要","tasks.mdおよびNOTES.mdファイル形式に限定","Spec-Driven Developmentパイプラインの設定が必要"],"ko":["Claude Code 워크플로우 통합 필요","tasks.md 및 NOTES.md 파일 형식으로 제한됨","Spec-Driven Development 파이프라인 설정 필요"],"es":["Requiere integración con flujos de trabajo de Claude Code","Limitado a formatos de archivo tasks.md y NOTAS.md","Necesita configuración de pipeline de desarrollo basado en especificaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec des flux de travail Claude Code","Limité aux formats de fichier tasks.md et NOTAS.md","Nécessite une configuration de pipeline de développement basé sur des spécifications"],"de":["Benötigt Integration in Claude-Code-Workflows","Begrenzt auf Dateiformate tasks.md und NOTAS.md","Benötigt Einrichtung einer spezifikationsgetriebenen Entwicklungspipeline"],"pt":["Requer integração com o fluxo de trabalho do Claude Code","Limitado aos formatos de arquivo tasks.md e NOTES.md","Necessita de configuração do pipeline de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Especificações"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с рабочим процессом Claude Code","Ограничен форматами файлов tasks.md и NOTES.md","Требует настройки конвейера разработки, управляемой спецификациями"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع سير عمل كلود كود","محدود بصيغ الملفات tasks.md وNOTES.md","يحتاج إلى إعداد أنابيب التطوير الموجهة بالمواصفات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a42c515692d6e5eb842a9cc7ef5a7e2a4600fed8b9442c6e233246a0d57b5c2c","qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('zby/llm-do/decomplect-py', 'community', 'zby', 'llm-do', 'zby/llm-do', 'decomplect-py', 0, 0, 45, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.968Z', '2026-03-02T02:53:10.518Z', 'c7495484fe8ff66f28289d8233864cbb63eb16e274bf7044c07bf1274fd8262c', '{"id":"zby/llm-do/decomplect-py","name":"decomplect-py","description":{"zh":"decomplect-py是一个AI智能工具，允许您使用LLM探索和Python稳定代码","ja":"decomplect-pyはAIエージェントであり、LLMで探索し、Pythonでコードを安定化する","ko":"decomplect-py는 AI 에이전트로서 LLM로 탐색하고 Python으로 코드를 안정화하는 도구","es":"decomplect-py es una herramienta de AI que permite a los desarrolladores explorar y estabilizar su código con Python","fr":"decomplect-py est un outil d''IA qui permet aux développeurs d''explorer et de stabiliser leur code avec Python","de":"decomplect-py ist ein KI-Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, ihren Code mit Python zu erkunden und zu stabilisieren","pt":"O decomplect-py é uma ferramenta de IA que combina a exploração com LLM e a estabilização com código Python. Aprenda a refatorar entre trabalhadores e ferramentas","ru":"ИИ Агент decomplect-py - это инструмент, который объединяет исследование с LLM и стабилизацию с помощью кода Python. Узнайте, как рефакторить между работниками и инструментами","ar":"برنامج decomplect-py هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي التي تجمع بين الاستكشاف مع LLM وتثبيت مع كود Python. تعرف على كيفية إعادة هيكلة بين العمال والأدوات","en":"\"Extend with llm, stabilise with code\" - Prompts when you''re exploring, Python when you''re certain. Workers and tools form one function space—refactor between them."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具 decomplect-py - 扩展LLM，稳定代码","ja":"AIエージェント decomplect-py - LLMを拡張、コードを安定化","ko":"AI 에이전트 decomplect-py - LLM 확장, 코드 안정화","es":"Herramientas de AI: decomplect-py para Desarrolladores","fr":"Outils d''IA : decomplect-py pour les Développeurs","de":"KI-Tools: decomplect-py für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: decomplect-py - Extensão com LLM","ru":"ИИ Агенты: decomplect-py - Расширение с LLM","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: decomplect-py - تمديد مع LLM","en":"decomplect-py"},"description":{"zh":"decomplect-py是一个AI智能工具，允许您使用LLM探索和Python稳定代码","ja":"decomplect-pyはAIエージェントであり、LLMで探索し、Pythonでコードを安定化する","ko":"decomplect-py는 AI 에이전트로서 LLM로 탐색하고 Python으로 코드를 안정화하는 도구","es":"decomplect-py es una herramienta de AI que permite a los desarrolladores explorar y estabilizar su código con Python","fr":"decomplect-py est un outil d''IA qui permet aux développeurs d''explorer et de stabiliser leur code avec Python","de":"decomplect-py ist ein KI-Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, ihren Code mit Python zu erkunden und zu stabilisieren","pt":"O decomplect-py é uma ferramenta de IA que combina a exploração com LLM e a estabilização com código Python. Aprenda a refatorar entre trabalhadores e ferram...","ru":"ИИ Агент decomplect-py - это инструмент, который объединяет исследование с LLM и стабилизацию с помощью кода Python. Узнайте, как рефакторить между работника...","ar":"برنامج decomplect-py هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي التي تجمع بين الاستكشاف مع LLM وتثبيت مع كود Python. تعرف على كيفية إعادة هيكلة بين العمال والأدوات","en":"\"Extend with llm, stabilise with code\" - Prompts when you''re exploring, Python when you''re certain. Workers and tools form one function space—refactor betwee..."},"definition":{"en":"\"Extend with llm, stabilise with code\" - Prompts when you''re exploring, Python when you''re certain. Workers and tools form one function space—refactor between them."},"features":{"zh":["LLM探索","Python代码稳定","workers和工具的无缝衔接","函数空间的重构","代码的简化和优化"],"ja":["LLM探索","Pythonコード安定化","ワーカーとツールの無縫接続","関数空間のリファクタリング","コードの簡素化と最適化"],"ko":["LLM 탐색","Python 코드 안정화","워커와 툴의 무결점 연결","함수 공간의 리팩토링","코드의 단순화와 최적화"],"es":["Exploración con llm","Estabilización con código Python","Refactorización entre Workers y herramientas","Integración con función de espacio","Desarrollo de código flexible y escalable"],"fr":["Exploration avec llm","Stabilisation avec du code Python","Refactorisation entre les Workers et les outils","Intégration avec la fonction d''espace","Développement de code flexible et évolutif"],"de":["Erkundung mit llm","Stabilisierung mit Python-Code","Refaktorisierung zwischen Workers und Tools","Integration mit Funktionenraum","Entwicklung von flexiblen und skalierbaren Code"],"pt":["Extensão com LLM para exploração","Estabilização com código Python","Refatoração entre trabalhadores e ferramentas","Integração com funcionalidades de código","Suporte a desenvolvedores para criar soluções personalizadas"],"ru":["Расширение с LLM для исследования","Стабилизация с помощью кода Python","Рефакторинг между работниками и инструментами","Интеграция с функциональностями кода","Поддержка разработчиков для создания индивидуальных решений"],"ar":["تمديد مع LLM للاستكشاف","تثبيت مع كود Python","إعادة هيكلة بين العمال والأدوات","التكامل مع وظائف الكود","دعم المطورين لإنشاء حلول مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用decomplect-py","什么是LLM","decomplect-py替代品","decomplect-py vs 其他AI工具","decomplect-py安装","decomplect-py设置指南","Python代码优化","AI智能工具"],"ja":["decomplect-pyの使い方","LLMとは","decomplect-pyの代替","decomplect-py vs その他のAIツール","decomplect-pyのインストール","decomplect-pyの設定ガイド","Pythonコードの最適化","AIエージェント"],"ko":["decomplect-py 사용법","LLM이란","decomplect-py 대체품","decomplect-py vs 다른 AI 툴","decomplect-py 설치","decomplect-py 설정 가이드","Python 코드 최적화","AI 에이전트"],"es":["cómo usar decomplect-py","qué es decomplect-py","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","decomplect-py vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de decomplect-py","guía de configuración de decomplect-py","desarrollo de código con Python","herramientas de AI para Python"],"fr":["comment utiliser decomplect-py","qu''est-ce que decomplect-py","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","decomplect-py vs autres outils d''IA","installation de decomplect-py","guide de configuration de decomplect-py","développement de code avec Python","outils d''IA pour Python"],"de":["wie man decomplect-py verwendet","was ist decomplect-py","KI-Tools für Entwickler","decomplect-py vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von decomplect-py","Konfigurationsleitfaden für decomplect-py","Code-Entwicklung mit Python","KI-Tools für Python"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","decomplect-py","llm","python","desenvolvimento de software","como usar decomplect-py","o que é decomplect-py","alternativas para decomplect-py","guias de instalação decomplect-py"],"ru":["ии агенты","decomplect-py","llm","python","разработка программного обеспечения","как использовать decomplect-py","что такое decomplect-py","альтернативы decomplect-py","руководства по установке decomplect-py"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","decomplect-py","llm","python","تطوير البرمجيات","كيفية استخدام decomplect-py","ما هو decomplect-py","بديلات decomplect-py","دلائل تركيب decomplect-py"]}},"owner":"zby","repo":"llm-do","repoPath":"zby/llm-do","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.968Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"decomplect-py","description":"Architectural code analysis for Python design quality. Evaluates simplicity (Rich Hickey), functional core/imperative shell (Gary Bernhardt), and coupling (Constantine & Yourdon). Use for design review or architectural assessment of Python code.","bodyPreview":"# Decomplect-Py\n\nArchitectural analysis for Python design quality.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/decomplect-py                # Run all 3 analyzers in parallel\n/decomplect-py --simplicity   # Specific analyzer\n/decomplect-py --fcis         # Specific analyzer\n/decomplect-py --coupling     # Specific analyzer\n```\n\n## Analyzers\n\n| Analyzer | Question |\n|----------|----------|\n| **simplicity-analyzer** | Is this truly simple or just easy? |\n| **fcis-analyzer** | Is pure logic separated from I/O? |\n| **coupling-a","body":"# Decomplect-Py\n\nArchitectural analysis for Python design quality.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/decomplect-py                # Run all 3 analyzers in parallel\n/decomplect-py --simplicity   # Specific analyzer\n/decomplect-py --fcis         # Specific analyzer\n/decomplect-py --coupling     # Specific analyzer\n```\n\n## Analyzers\n\n| Analyzer | Question |\n|----------|----------|\n| **simplicity-analyzer** | Is this truly simple or just easy? |\n| **fcis-analyzer** | Is pure logic separated from I/O? |\n| **coupling-analyzer** | Are modules well-separated? |\n\n## What It Checks\n\n| Pillar | Focus |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Simplicity** | Values over state, decomplected concerns |\n| **FCIS** | Functional core (pure), imperative shell (I/O) |\n| **Coupling** | High cohesion, low coupling |\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Reviewing Python system design\n- Before major refactoring\n- Assessing architectural quality\n- Checking if code is \"Rich Hickey approved\"\n\n## Supported Languages\n\n- Python (`.py` files only)\n\n## Python-Specific Patterns\n\n- `dataclasses(frozen=True)` and `NamedTuple` for immutable values\n- Mutable default argument anti-patterns\n- Django/Flask view architecture\n- Circular import detection\n- Module-level state analysis\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\n- [Rich Hickey Principles](reference/rich-hickey.md)\n- [Functional Core/Imperative Shell](reference/fcis.md)\n- [Cohesion & Coupling](reference/coupling.md)\n\n## See Also\n\n- `/decomplect` - Analysis for TypeScript/Go/Rust\n- `/unslopify` - Tactical code cleanup\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:53:10.518Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced code quality assessment and architectural analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级代码质量评估和架构分析能力的Python分析代理。","ja":"Pythonコードの分析エージェントが高度なコード品質の評価とアーキテクチャ分析の機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 코드 품질 평가 및 아키텍처 분석 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan una evaluación avanzada de la calidad del código y capacidades de análisis arquitectónico.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Python nécessitant une évaluation avancée de la qualité du code et des capacités d''analyse architecturale.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Code-Qualitätsbewertung und Architekturanalyse-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de avaliação avançada da qualidade do código e capacidades de análise arquitetônica.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым требуются расширенные возможности оценки качества кода и архитектурного анализа.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليلية بايثون التي تحتاج إلى تقييم متقدم لجودة الشفرة وقدرات التحليل المعماري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refactor Python code using simplicity, FCIS, and coupling analyzers, ensuring separation of pure logic from I/O operations and promoting code simplicity and stability.","zh":"赋予代理重构Python代码的能力，使用简单性、FCIS和耦合分析器，确保纯逻辑与I/O操作的分离，促进代码的简单性和稳定性。","ja":"シンプルさ、FCIS、カップリング分析器を使用してPythonコードをリファクタリングするエージェントをエンパワーメントします。純粋なロジックとI/O操作の分離を保証し、コードのシンプルさと安定性を促進します。","ko":"단순성, FCIS, 결합 분석기를 사용하여 Python 코드를 리팩터링하는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 순수한 논리와 I/O 연산의 분리를 보장하고 코드의 단순성과 안정성을 촉진합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refactorizar el código Python utilizando la simplicidad, los analizador de FCIS y acoplamiento, garantizando la separación de la lógica pura de las operaciones de E/S y promoviendo la simplicidad y estabilidad del código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de refactoriser le code Python en utilisant la simplicité, les analyseurs FCIS et de couplage, en garantissant la séparation de la logique pure des opérations d''E/S et en promouvant la simplicité et la stabilité du code.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Python-Code unter Verwendung von Einfachheit, FCIS- und Kopplungsanalyse zu refaktorisieren, um die Trennung der reinen Logik von den E/A-Operationen sicherzustellen und die Einfachheit und Stabilität des Codes zu fördern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a refactorar o código Python usando simplicidade, analisadores FCIS e acoplamento, garantindo a separação da lógica pura das operações de I/O e promovendo a simplicidade e estabilidade do código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью рефакторинга кода Python с использованием простоты, анализаторов FCIS и связности, обеспечивая разделение чистой логики от операций ввода/вывода и содействуя простоте и стабильности кода.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إعادة هيكلة код Python باستخدام البساطة، ومحلل FCIS، وتحليل الارتباط، مما يضمن فصل المنطق النقي من عمليات الإدخال/الإخراج وتعزيز بساطة الاستقرار الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring complex Python modules for simplicity","Analyzing code coupling for dependency optimization","Validating FCIS compliance for improved code maintainability"],"zh":["为简单性而重构复杂的Python模块","分析代码耦合以优化依赖","验证FCIS合规性以提高代码的可维护性"],"ja":["シンプルさのために複雑なPythonモジュールをリファクタリングする","コードのカップリングを分析して依存関係を最適化する","コードの保守性を向上させるためにFCISの準拠を検証する"],"ko":["단순성을 위해 복잡한 Python 모듈을 리팩터링하는 것","코드 결합을 분석하여 의존성을 최적화하는 것","코드의 유지 보수성을 향상시키기 위해 FCIS 준수를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Reestructuración de módulos Python complejos para la simplicidad","Análisis del acoplamiento del código para la optimización de dependencias","Validación de la conformidad con FCIS para una mejor mantenibilidad del código"],"fr":["Réorganisation de modules Python complexes pour la simplicité","Analyse du couplage du code pour l''optimisation des dépendances","Validation de la conformité FCIS pour une meilleure maintenabilité du code"],"de":["Umstrukturierung komplexer Python-Module für Einfachheit","Analyse der Code-Kopplung für Abhängigkeits-Optimierung","Überprüfung der FCIS-Konformität für eine verbesserte Code-Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Reestruturação de módulos Python complexos para simplicidade","Análise de acoplamento de código para otimização de dependência","Validação da conformidade FCIS para melhoria da manutenção de código"],"ru":["Рефакторинг сложных модулей Python для простоты","Анализ связности кода для оптимизации зависимостей","Проверка соответствия FCIS для улучшения поддержки кода"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة وحدات Python المعقدة من أجل البساطة","تحليل الارتباط الشفرة لتحسين التبعيات","التحقق من مطابقة FCIS لتحسين صيانة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to Python code analysis"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限于Python代码分析"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Pythonコードの分析のみ"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다","Python 코드 분석에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno Python","Limitado al análisis de código Python"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité à l''analyse de code Python"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Python-Code-Analyse"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Limitado à análise de código Python"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Ограничен анализом кода Python"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بتحليل код Python"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c7495484fe8ff66f28289d8233864cbb63eb16e274bf7044c07bf1274fd8262c","qualityScore":45}');
