":"أدوات الإي الأجنت: project-workflow","en":"project-workflow"},"description":{"zh":"DodaTech团队审批的AI智能代理，安全扫描并适用于远程环境，用于优化项目工作流程","ja":"DodaTechチームが承認したAIエージェント。セキュリティスキャン済みでリモート環境向け。プロジェクトワークフローの最適化に利用","ko":"DodaTech팀이 승인한 AI 에이전트. 보안 스캔되어 원격 환경을 위한 것으로, 프로젝트 워크플로우를 최적화하는 데 사용","es":"Las habilidades del agente de flujo de trabajo de proyecto, aprobadas por el equipo de DodaTech, analizadas de seguridad y listas para entornos remotos.","fr":"Les compétences de l''agent de workflow de projet, approuvées par l''équipe DodaTech, analysées pour la sécurité et prêtes pour les environnements distants.","de":"Die Fähigkeiten des Projekt-Workflow-Agents, von DodaTech-Team genehmigt, Sicherheitsüberprüfung und bereit für Remote-Umgebungen.","pt":"O project-workflow é uma habilidade de agente aprovada pela equipe DodaTech, projetada para melhorar o fluxo de trabalho em ambientes remotos","ru":"Project-workflow - это навык агента, одобренный командой DodaTech, предназначенный для улучшения рабочего процесса в удаленных средах","ar":"برنامج project-workflow هو مهارة وسيط معتمدة من فريق DodaTech، مصممة لتحسين تدفق العمل في البيئات عن بُعد","en":"DodaTech team-approved agent skills, security-scanned and ready for remote environments"},"definition":{"en":"DodaTech team-approved agent skills, security-scanned and ready for remote environments"},"features":{"zh":["安全扫描和审批","远程环境支持","项目工作流程优化","AI技术集成","高效的自动化流程"],"ja":["セキュリティスキャンと承認","リモート環境対応","プロジェクトワークフローの最適化","AI技術の統合","効率的な自動化プロセス"],"ko":["보안 스캔과 승인","원격 환경 지원","프로젝트 워크플로우 최적화","AI 기술 통합","효율적인 자동화 프로세스"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo","Gestión de proyectos","Seguridad verificada","Preparado para entornos remotos","Aprobado por el equipo de DodaTech","Fácil integración"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail","Gestion de projet","Sécurité vérifiée","Prêt pour les environnements distants","Approuvé par l''équipe DodaTech","Intégration facile"],"de":["Automatisierung von Arbeitsflüssen","Projektverwaltung","Überprüfte Sicherheit","Bereit für Remote-Umgebungen","Vom DodaTech-Team genehmigt","Einfache Integration"],"pt":["Segurança e aprovação da equipe DodaTech","Otimização do fluxo de trabalho em ambientes remotos","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Automatização de tarefas e processos","Melhoria da produtividade e eficiência"],"ru":["Безопасность и одобрение команды DodaTech","Оптимизация рабочего процесса в удаленных средах","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Автоматизация задач и процессов","Повышение производительности и эффективности"],"ar":["أمان وموافقة فريق DodaTech","تحسين تدفق العمل في البيئات عن بُعد","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تأتمة المهام والعمليات","تحسين الإنتاجية والكفاءة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","项目工作流程","安全扫描","远程环境","AI技术","自动化流程","如何使用AI代理","AI代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","プロジェクトワークフロー","セキュリティスキャン","リモート環境","AI技術","自動化プロセス","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","프로젝트 워크플로우","보안 스캔","원격 환경","AI 기술","자동화 프로세스","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de flujo de trabajo","qué es un agente de flujo de trabajo","herramientas de flujo de trabajo alternativas","herramientas de flujo de trabajo vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de flujo de trabajo","guía de configuración de herramientas de flujo de trabajo","desarrollo de proyectos con herramientas de flujo de trabajo","mejores prácticas para herramientas de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils de workflow","quoi est un outil de workflow","outils de workflow alternatifs","outils de workflow vs concurrents","installation d''outils de workflow","guide de configuration d''outils de workflow","développement de projets avec des outils de workflow","meilleures pratiques pour les outils de workflow"],"de":["wie man Projekt-Workflow-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Projekt-Workflow-Tool","Projekt-Workflow-Tool-Alternativen","Projekt-Workflow-Tool vs Konkurrenten","Installation von Projekt-Workflow-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für Projekt-Workflow-Tools","Projektentwicklung mit Projekt-Workflow-Tools","beste Praktiken für Projekt-Workflow-Tools"],"pt":["como usar project-workflow","o que é project-workflow","ferramentas de AI Agents","project-workflow vs jira","instalar project-workflow","guia de configuração do project-workflow","alternativas ao project-workflow"],"ru":["как использовать project-workflow","что такое project-workflow","инструменты ИИ Агентов","project-workflow vs jira","установить project-workflow","руководство по настройке project-workflow","альтернативы project-workflow"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام برنامج project-workflow","ما هو برنامج project-workflow","أدوات الإي الأجنت","برنامج project-workflow مقابل jira","تثبيت برنامج project-workflow","دليل إعداد برنامج project-workflow","بديل برنامج project-workflow"]}},"owner":"fefogarcia","repo":"approved-skills","repoPath":"fefogarcia/approved-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.974Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-workflow","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Project Workflow Skill\n\n9 integrated slash commands for complete project lifecycle automation: idea validation → planning → execution → session management → context preservation → release.\n\n**Time savings**: 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle\n\n## Installation\n\n**Marketplace**: `/plugin install project-workflow@jezweb-skills`\n\n**Manual**: Copy `commands/*.md` to `~/.claude/commands/`\n\n## The 9 Commands\n\n### 1. `/explore-idea` - Pre-Planning Exploration\n\n**Use when**: Rough idea that needs tech","body":"# Project Workflow Skill\n\n9 integrated slash commands for complete project lifecycle automation: idea validation → planning → execution → session management → context preservation → release.\n\n**Time savings**: 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle\n\n## Installation\n\n**Marketplace**: `/plugin install project-workflow@jezweb-skills`\n\n**Manual**: Copy `commands/*.md` to `~/.claude/commands/`\n\n## The 9 Commands\n\n### 1. `/explore-idea` - Pre-Planning Exploration\n\n**Use when**: Rough idea that needs tech stack validation, scope management, or research before planning.\n\n**Creates**: PROJECT_BRIEF.md with validated decisions → hands off to /plan-project\n\n**Time savings**: 10-15 min\n\n---\n\n### 2. `/plan-project` - Generate Project Planning Docs\n\n**Use when**: Starting new project with clear requirements, or after /explore-idea.\n\n**Creates**: IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, SESSION.md, DATABASE_SCHEMA.md (if needed), API_ENDPOINTS.md (if needed), ARCHITECTURE.md\n\n**Invokes**: project-planning skill\n\n**Time savings**: 5-7 min\n\n---\n\n### 3. `/plan-feature` - Add Features to Existing Projects\n\n**Use when**: Adding feature to existing project with SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md.\n\n**Does**: Generates new phases via project-planning skill, integrates into IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md with renumbering, updates SESSION.md.\n\n**Time savings**: 7-10 min\n\n---\n\n### 4. `/wrap-session` - End-of-Session Checkpoint\n\n**Use when**: Context full (>150k tokens), end of work session, or before task switch.\n\n**Does**: Task agent analyzes session → updates SESSION.md (progress, Next Action, blockers) → git checkpoint commit → formatted handoff summary.\n\n**Time savings**: 2-3 min\n\n---\n\n### 5. `/continue-session` - Start-of-Session Context Loading\n\n**Use when**: Starting new session or after /wrap-session checkpoint.\n\n**Does**: Explore agent loads SESSION.md + planning docs → shows git history + session summary (phase, progress, Next Action, blockers) → optionally opens file → asks permission to continue.\n\n**Time savings**: 1-2 min\n\n---\n\n### 6. `/workflow` - Interactive Workflow Guide\n\n**Use when**: First time user, unsure which command to use, or need quick reference.\n\n**Does**: Shows all 9 commands → context-aware guidance with decision trees → offers to execute appropriate command.\n\n---\n\n### 7. `/release` - Pre-Release Safety Checks\n\n**Use when**: Ready to push to public GitHub or create release.\n\n**8 Phases**:\n1. **Critical Safety** (BLOCKERS): Secrets scan (gitleaks), personal artifacts check, git remote verification\n2. **Documentation** (REQUIRED): LICENSE, README (>100 words), CONTRIBUTING.md (>500 LOC), CODE_OF_CONDUCT (>1000 LOC)\n3. **Configuration**: .gitignore, package.json, git branch warning\n4. **Quality** (NON-BLOCKING): Build test, npm audit, large files (>1MB)\n5. **Report**: Blockers/warnings/recommendations + safe to release verdict\n6-8. **Auto-Fix & Publish**: Fix issues, release prep commit, optional git tag + GitHub release\n\n**Time savings**: 10-15 min\n\n---\n\n### 8. `/brief` - Context Preservation Document\n\n**Use when**: Before clearing context, to preserve key decisions and requirements for future sessions.\n\n**Creates**: `docs/brief-[slug].md` with extracted information from current conversation.\n\n**Does**: Analyzes conversation → extracts what''s being built, decisions made, technical details → creates organized markdown file → optionally creates GitHub issue for tracking.\n\n**Time savings**: 3-5 min\n\n---\n\n### 9. `/reflect` - Capture Operational Knowledge\n\n**Use when**: Before context compaction, after completing significant work, or when valuable learnings accumulated.\n\n**Does**: Reviews conversation → identifies workflows discovered, patterns learned, tool sequences, corrections made → routes each learning to appropriate destination (rules, CLAUDE.md, skills, docs) → optionally suggests automation (scripts, commands, custom agents).\n\n**Key Feature**: Considers whether processes should become custom agents when they require reasoning/decisions, benefit from parallel execution, or involve research/exploration.\n\n**Time savings**: 5-10 min\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Examples\n\n**Full**: /explore-idea → /plan-project → work → /wrap-session → /continue-session → /plan-feature (if needed) → repeat → /reflect → /release\n\n**Quick** (clear requirements): /plan-project → work → /wrap-session → /continue-session → /release\n\n**Context Preservation**: /brief (before clearing context), /reflect (capture learnings)\n\n**Helpers**: /workflow (guidance), /plan-feature (add feature), /release (publish)\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n**project-planning**: Invoked by /plan-project and /plan-feature (generates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, DATABASE_SCHEMA.md, API_ENDPOINTS.md)\n\n**project-session-management**: SESSION.md protocol for /wrap-session and /continue-session\n\n**Claude Code agents**: /wrap-session (Task agent), /continue-session + /explore-idea (Explore agent)\n\n---\n\n## Command Relationships\n\n```\nEXPLORATION PHASE\n/explore-idea (optional)\n    ↓\n    Creates PROJECT_BRIEF.md\n    ↓\nPLANNING PHASE\n/plan-project (reads PROJECT_BRIEF.md if exists)\n    ↓\n    Creates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md + SESSION.md\n    ↓\nEXECUTION PHASE\nWork on phases\n    ↓\n/wrap-session (when context full)\n    ↓\n    Updates SESSION.md, git checkpoint\n    ↓\n/continue-session (new session)\n    ↓\n    Loads SESSION.md, continues work\n    ↓\n/plan-feature (when need new features)\n    ↓\n    Adds phases to IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n    ↓\nContinue wrap → resume cycle\n    ↓\nCONTEXT PRESERVATION\n/brief (before clearing context)\n    ↓\n    Creates docs/brief-[slug].md\n    ↓\n/reflect (capture learnings)\n    ↓\n    Routes knowledge to rules, docs, CLAUDE.md\n    ↓\nRELEASE PHASE\n/release (when ready to publish)\n    ↓\n    Safety checks → GitHub release\n\nHELPER\n/workflow (anytime)\n    ↓\n    Interactive guidance\n```\n\n---\n\n## Time Savings Breakdown\n\n| Command | Time Saved | Tasks Automated |\n|---------|------------|-----------------|\n| `/explore-idea` | 10-15 min | Research, validation, scope management, tech stack evaluation |\n| `/plan-project` | 5-7 min | Planning doc generation, git setup, phase structuring |\n| `/plan-feature` | 7-10 min | Feature planning, phase integration, doc updates |\n| `/wrap-session` | 2-3 min | SESSION.md updates, git checkpoint, handoff summary |\n| `/continue-session` | 1-2 min | Context loading, git history review, next action display |\n| `/workflow` | Instant | Navigation, decision trees, command selection |\n| `/release` | 10-15 min | Secret scanning, doc validation, build testing, release creation |\n| `/brief` | 3-5 min | Context extraction, decisions capture, markdown generation |\n| `/reflect` | 5-10 min | Learning extraction, knowledge routing, automation suggestions |\n\n**Total per project lifecycle:** 45-70 minutes\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**All**: Claude Code CLI, git repo (recommended)\n\n**/plan-feature**: Existing SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n\n**/wrap-session, /continue-session**: SESSION.md (created by /plan-project)\n\n**/release**: Git repo with commits, package.json (Node.js), remote URL (for publishing)\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**/plan-project \"No project description\"**: Use /explore-idea first or discuss project with Claude\n\n**/plan-feature \"Prerequisites not met\"**: Run /plan-project first (creates SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md)\n\n**/wrap-session \"No git repository\"**: Run `git init`\n\n**/continue-session \"SESSION.md not found\"**: Run /plan-project\n\n**/release \"Secrets detected\"**: Add to .gitignore, remove from git history\n\n---\n\n## Version History\n\n**1.1.0** (2026-01-11)\n- Added `/brief` command for context preservation\n- Added `/reflect` command for capturing operational knowledge\n- `/reflect` now suggests custom agents for processes requiring reasoning\n- Total commands: 9\n\n**1.0.0** (2025-11-12)\n- Initial release\n- 7 integrated slash commands\n- Plugin marketplace distribution\n- Command bundling via plugin.json\n\n---\n\n**Issues**: https://github.com/jezweb/claude-skills/issues | **Author**: Jeremy Dawes (jeremy@jezweb.net) | **License**: MIT\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:00.085Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated project lifecycle control","zh":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated project lifecycle control","ja":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated project lifecycle control","ko":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing automated project lifecycle control","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Tareas que necesitan control de ciclo de vida de proyecto automatizado","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de tâches ayant besoin d''un contrôle de cycle de vie de projet automatisé","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die eine automatisierte Projekt-Lebenszyklus-Kontrolle benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de controle de ciclo de vida de projeto automatizado","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, которым требуется автоматизированный контроль жизненного цикла проекта","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المهام الذين يحتاجون إلى التحكم التلقائي في دورة حياة المشروع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate the entire project lifecycle using 9 integrated slash commands, streamlining idea validation, planning, execution, and release, while preserving context and managing sessions, leveraging Markdown files for seamless integration","zh":"Empowers agents to automate the entire project lifecycle using 9 integrated slash commands, streamlining idea validation, planning, execution, and release, while preserving context and managing sessions, leveraging Markdown files for seamless integration","ja":"Empowers agents to automate the entire project lifecycle using 9 integrated slash commands, streamlining idea validation, planning, execution, and release, while preserving context and managing sessions, leveraging Markdown files for seamless integration","ko":"Empowers agents to automate the entire project lifecycle using 9 integrated slash commands, streamlining idea validation, planning, execution, and release, while preserving context and managing sessions, leveraging Markdown files for seamless integration","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar todo el ciclo de vida del proyecto utilizando 9 comandos slash integrados, racionalizando la validación de ideas, la planificación, la ejecución y la publicación, mientras se preserva el contexto y se gestionan las sesiones, aprovechando archivos Markdown para una integración sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser l''ensemble du cycle de vie du projet en utilisant 9 commandes slash intégrées, rationalisant la validation des idées, la planification, l''exécution et la publication, tout en préservant le contexte et en gérant les sessions, en exploitant les fichiers Markdown pour une intégration transparente","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den gesamten Projekt-Lebenszyklus mithilfe von 9 integrierten Slash-Befehlen zu automatisieren, wodurch die Ideenvalidierung, Planung, Ausführung und Veröffentlichung rationalisiert werden, während der Kontext erhalten und die Sitzungen verwaltet werden, indem Markdown-Dateien für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar todo o ciclo de vida do projeto usando 9 comandos slash integrados, simplificando a validação de ideias, planejamento, execução e lançamento, preservando o contexto e gerenciando sessões, aproveitando arquivos Markdown para integração sem problemas","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать весь жизненный цикл проекта, используя 9 интегрированных команд slash, оптимизируя проверку идей, планирование, выполнение и выпуск, сохраняя контекст и управляя сессиями, используя файлы Markdown для бесшовной интеграции","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تلقين دورة حياة المشروع بالكامل باستخدام 9 أوامر شرطة متكاملة، وبذلك يُبسط التحقق من الأفكار والتخطيط والتنفيذ والإصدار، مع الحفاظ على السياق وإدارة الجلسات، واستغلال ملفات Markdown من أجل التكامل السلس"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project planning and execution workflows","Streamlining idea validation and concept development","Managing project sessions and preserving context for efficient collaboration"],"zh":["Automating project planning and execution workflows","Streamlining idea validation and concept development","Managing project sessions and preserving context for efficient collaboration"],"ja":["Automating project planning and execution workflows","Streamlining idea validation and concept development","Managing project sessions and preserving context for efficient collaboration"],"ko":["Automating project planning and execution workflows","Streamlining idea validation and concept development","Managing project sessions and preserving context for efficient collaboration"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de planificación y ejecución de proyectos","Racionalización de la validación de ideas y el desarrollo de conceptos","Gestión de sesiones de proyecto y preservación del contexto para una colaboración eficiente"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de planification et d''exécution de projets","Rationalisation de la validation des idées et du développement de concepts","Gestion des sessions de projet et préservation du contexte pour une collaboration efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung von Projekt-Planungs- und -Ausführungs-Workflows","Rationalisierung der Ideenvalidierung und Konzeptentwicklung","Verwaltung von Projekt-Sitzungen und Erhaltung des Kontexts für eine effiziente Zusammenarbeit"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de planejamento e execução de projetos","Simplificar a validação de ideias e desenvolvimento de conceitos","Gerenciar sessões de projeto e preservar o contexto para colaboração eficiente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы планирования и выполнения проектов","Оптимизировать проверку идей и разработку концепций","Управлять проектными сессиями и сохранять контекст для эффективного сотрудничества"],"ar":["تلقين سير عمل تخطيط المشاريع وتنفيذها","تبسيط التحقق من الأفكار وتطوير المفاهيم","إدارة جلسات المشروع والحفاظ على السياق من أجل التعاون الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation via marketplace or manual command installation","Limited to remote environments with approved agent skills and security scanning"],"zh":["Requires installation via marketplace or manual command installation","Limited to remote environments with approved agent skills and security scanning"],"ja":["Requires installation via marketplace or manual command installation","Limited to remote environments with approved agent skills and security scanning"],"ko":["Requires installation via marketplace or manual command installation","Limited to remote environments with approved agent skills and security scanning"],"es":["Requiere instalación vía marketplace o instalación de comandos manuales","Limitado a entornos remotos con habilidades de agente aprobadas y análisis de seguridad"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation via le marketplace ou une installation de commandes manuelles","Limité aux environnements distants avec des compétences d''agent approuvées et une analyse de sécurité"],"de":["Erfordert Installation über den Marketplace oder manuelle Befehlsinstallation","Begrenzt auf Remote-Umgebungen mit genehmigten Agentenfähigkeiten und Sicherheitsanalyse"],"pt":["Requer instalação via marketplace ou instalação de comando manual","Limitado a ambientes remotos com habilidades de agente aprovadas e verificação de segurança"],"ru":["Требует установки через marketplace или ручной установки команды","Ограничен для удаленных сред с одобренными навыками агента и проверкой безопасности"],"ar":["يتطلب التثبيت عبر سوق التطبيقات أو تثبيت الأمر اليدوي","محدود للبيئات البعيدة ذات مهارات الوكيل المعتمدة والفحص الأمني"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fccd42a49848b65d2902f2c5361f5d6df35e8f3576742d0df7874ef4b1fda9ff","qualityScore":45}');
