هي أداة request-enhancer","أداة request-enhancer بديلة","أداة request-enhancer مقابل أدوات منافسة","تثبيت أداة request-enhancer","دليل إعداد أداة request-enhancer","تطوير البرمجيات مع أداة request-enhancer","أدوات زيادة الإنتاجية للمطورين"]}},"owner":"SlySlayer32","repo":"dashboard-link-saas","repoPath":"SlySlayer32/dashboard-link-saas","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.019Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"request-enhancer","description":"Automatically rewrites, expands, and enhances user requests using proper linguistics and structured input for optimal vibe coding and SaaS development results","version":"2.0","bodyPreview":"# Request Enhancer Skill v2.0\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\nThis skill automatically transforms user requests into well-structured, detailed prompts that follow best practices for vibe coding and SaaS development. It enhances clarity, adds context, and structures requests for optimal AI assistance.\r\n\r\n**Key Improvements in v2.0:**\r\n- Integrated with CleanConnect memory bank system\r\n- Enhanced business focus for non-technical founder\r\n- Automatic V1 checklist mapping\r\n- Risk assessment and mitigation strategi","body":"# Request Enhancer Skill v2.0\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\nThis skill automatically transforms user requests into well-structured, detailed prompts that follow best practices for vibe coding and SaaS development. It enhances clarity, adds context, and structures requests for optimal AI assistance.\r\n\r\n**Key Improvements in v2.0:**\r\n- Integrated with CleanConnect memory bank system\r\n- Enhanced business focus for non-technical founder\r\n- Automatic V1 checklist mapping\r\n- Risk assessment and mitigation strategies\r\n- Progress tracking integration\r\n\r\n## Enhancement Process\r\n\r\n### 1. Request Analysis\r\n- Identify the core intent and objectives\r\n- Detect implicit requirements and assumptions\r\n- Assess technical complexity and domain\r\n- Identify missing context that would be helpful\r\n\r\n### 2. Linguistic Enhancement\r\n- Improve clarity and specificity\r\n- Add proper technical terminology where appropriate\r\n- Structure sentences for unambiguous interpretation\r\n- Ensure professional yet approachable tone\r\n\r\n### 3. Structural Improvements\r\n- Add clear objectives and success criteria\r\n- Include relevant context about the project/environment\r\n- Specify constraints and preferences\r\n- Organize into logical sections with clear headings\r\n\r\n### 4. Best Practices Integration\r\n- Include relevant architectural considerations\r\n- Add security and performance implications\r\n- Suggest testing strategies\r\n- Reference project-specific standards and patterns\r\n\r\n## Enhanced Request Template v2.0\r\n\r\n```markdown\r\n## Objective\r\n[Clear, specific statement of what needs to be accomplished]\r\n\r\n## Business Context\r\n- **User**: Non-technical founder building CleanConnect SaaS\r\n- **Goal**: [Business outcome this enables]\r\n- **Impact**: [Why this matters for the business]\r\n- **Timeline**: [Urgency level: Immediate/This week/Soon]\r\n\r\n## Project Context\r\n- **Project**: CleanConnect - Multi-tenant SaaS for workforce management\r\n- **Tech Stack**: Hono + Supabase + React + TypeScript + pnpm\r\n- **Current Phase**: [Foundation/V1 Build/V2]\r\n- **Recent Progress**: [What was just completed]\r\n\r\n## V1 Checklist Mapping\r\n- **Checklist Item**: [Exact item from plan/]\r\n- **Phase Number**: [Current phase from plan/PLAN_INDEX.md]\r\n- **Complexity**: [Simple/Medium/Complex]\r\n- **Estimated Time**: [Time estimate in hours]\r\n- **Dependencies**: [What needs to be done first]\r\n\r\n## Requirements\r\n### Must-Haves (Non-negotiable)\r\n- [Critical requirements that must be met]\r\n\r\n### Should-Haves (Important)\r\n- [Important features that should be included]\r\n\r\n### Could-Haves (Nice to have)\r\n- [Optional features if time permits]\r\n\r\n## Technical Constraints\r\n- Must follow Zapier-style layering\r\n- All database queries scoped by organizationId\r\n- No vendor SDK calls outside adapters/\r\n- Use fixed tech stack only\r\n- Validate inputs with Zod\r\n\r\n## Risk Assessment\r\n- **Risk Level**: [Low/Medium/High]\r\n- **Potential Issues**: [What could go wrong]\r\n- **Mitigation**: [How we''ll prevent problems]\r\n- **Confidence**: [1-10 confidence level]\r\n\r\n## Success Criteria\r\n- [Measurable outcomes that indicate success]\r\n- [How to verify the implementation works]\r\n- [What the user should be able to do]\r\n\r\n## Testing Strategy\r\n- **Unit Tests**: [What needs unit testing]\r\n- **Integration Tests**: [What needs integration testing]\r\n- **Manual Testing**: [How to manually verify]\r\n\r\n## Next Steps\r\n1. [Immediate first action]\r\n2. [What needs to be decided]\r\n3. [What I need from you]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Implementation Guidelines v2.0\r\n\r\nWhen enhancing requests:\r\n\r\n1. **Founder-First Communication**: \r\n   - Use simple, non-technical language\r\n   - Focus on business outcomes\r\n   - Provide confidence levels\r\n   - Celebrate small wins\r\n\r\n2. **Memory Integration**: \r\n   - Check activeContext.md for current work\r\n   - Reference previous decisions\r\n   - Maintain continuity\r\n   - Update memory after completion\r\n\r\n3. **Risk-Aware Planning**: \r\n   - Always assess risk level\r\n   - Provide mitigation strategies\r\n   - Flag potential blockers early\r\n   - Offer backup options\r\n\r\n4. **Architecture Compliance**: \r\n   - Enforce Zapier-style layering\r\n   - Ensure tenant scoping\r\n   - Use fixed tech stack\r\n   - Follow established patterns\r\n\r\n5. **Progress Tracking**: \r\n   - Map to V1 checklist\r\n   - Estimate complexity realistically\r\n   - Track completion percentage\r\n   - Document lessons learned\r\n\r\n## Example Transformations\r\n\r\n### Before:\r\n\"make a user login thing\"\r\n\r\n### After:\r\n```markdown\r\n## Objective\r\nImplement a secure user authentication system with login and registration functionality for the CleanConnect SaaS platform.\r\n\r\n## Context\r\n- Project: CleanConnect - Multi-tenant SaaS for workforce management\r\n- Tech Stack: Hono (backend) + Supabase (database/auth) + React (frontend) + TypeScript\r\n- Current State: Basic project structure exists, Supabase configured\r\n- Business Impact: Critical for user onboarding and data security\r\n\r\n## Requirements\r\n### Functional Requirements\r\n- User registration with email verification\r\n- Login with email/password\r\n- Password reset functionality\r\n- Session management with JWT tokens\r\n- Multi-tenant isolation by organizationId\r\n\r\n### Technical Requirements\r\n- Use Supabase Auth for authentication\r\n- Implement RLS policies for data isolation\r\n- Secure session handling with httpOnly cookies\r\n- Rate limiting on auth endpoints\r\n- OAuth providers (Google, Microsoft) for enterprise\r\n\r\n### Constraints\r\n- Must follow existing authentication patterns in AGENTS.md\r\n- All database queries must be scoped by organizationId\r\n- No vendor SDK calls outside adapters layer\r\n\r\n## Success Criteria\r\n- Users can register and verify email\r\n- Login works with correct credentials\r\n- Invalid attempts are properly handled\r\n- Sessions persist correctly across refreshes\r\n- Data isolation between organizations is enforced\r\n\r\n## Preferred Approach\r\n- Follow the authentication flow outlined in docs/ARCHITECTURE_BLUEPRINT.md\r\n- Use Zod for input validation\r\n- Implement proper error handling with stable error codes\r\n- Add comprehensive logging for security events\r\n\r\n## Testing Strategy\r\n- Unit tests for auth utilities\r\n- Integration tests for login/registration flows\r\n- Security tests for common vulnerabilities\r\n- Test multi-tenant data isolation\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Automatic Invocation\r\n\r\n**CRITICAL: This skill runs AUTOMATICALLY on EVERY user message before any other processing.**\r\n\r\nThis skill is triggered:\r\n- On ALL user messages (no exceptions)\r\n- Before any other tool or skill runs\r\n- Even for seemingly simple requests\r\n\r\nThe only exceptions are:\r\n- Messages starting with `/no-enhance`\r\n- Messages to other agents/skills that explicitly bypass enhancement\r\n\r\n## Enhancement Rules for CleanConnect v2.0\r\n\r\n### Mandatory Fields to Add:\r\n1. **Business Context**: Why this matters for the founder\r\n2. **Risk Assessment**: Risk level and mitigation strategies\r\n3. **Phase Number**: From plan/PLAN_INDEX.md (not just V1)\r\n4. **Dependencies**: What needs to be done first\r\n5. **Confidence Level**: 1-10 scale for success\r\n\r\n### Auto-Correction Logic:\r\n- If request is vague → Enhance with business context\r\n- If request lacks risk → Add risk assessment\r\n- If request jumps ahead → Realign to current phase\r\n- If request is too broad → Break into smaller tasks\r\n- If request lacks testing → Add comprehensive testing strategy\r\n- If request ignores constraints → Add technical constraints section\r\n\r\n### Memory Integration:\r\n- Check `.windsurf/active/activeContext.md` for current work\r\n- Reference previous decisions from memory bank\r\n- Maintain continuity across sessions\r\n- Update memory after task completion\r\n\r\n### Founder-Friendly Output:\r\n- Use analogies instead of technical terms\r\n- Focus on outcomes and business value\r\n- Provide clear next steps\r\n- Include celebration points for progress\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\n- This skill runs before any other processing\r\n- The enhanced request becomes the new prompt for Cascade\r\n- Users can still manually invoke with @request-enhancer\r\n- Enhancements are conservative - when in doubt, keep it simple\r\n- v2.0 includes improved business focus and risk management\r\n- Integrated with memory bank for context continuity\r\n- Designed specifically for non-technical founder workflow\r\n\r\n## Version History\r\n\r\n- v1.0: Initial implementation with basic enhancement\r\n- v2.0: Added business focus, risk assessment, memory integration, and founder-friendly communication\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:11:51.561Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing advanced request structuring for optimal SaaS development and vibe coding","zh":"非常适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要高级请求结构来实现最优的SaaS开发和vibe编码","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeのようなAIエージェントに最適で、高度なリクエスト構造が必要な最適なSaaS開発とvibeコーディング","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 최적화되어 있으며, 최적의 SaaS 개발과 vibe 코딩을 위해 고급 요청 구조가 필요함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan una estructuración de solicitudes avanzada para un desarrollo de SaaS óptimo y codificación de vibra","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant une structuration de demande avancée pour un développement SaaS optimal et un codage de vibe","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die eine erweiterte Anfragestruktur für eine optimale SaaS-Entwicklung und Vibe-Codierung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de estruturação avançada de solicitações para desenvolvimento de SaaS óptimo e codificação de vibe","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходима продвинутая структуризация запросов для оптимального развития SaaS и кодирования настроений","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى بنية متقدمة لطلبات للحصول على تطوير SaaS أمثل وتشفير المزاج"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform user requests into well-structured, detailed prompts using CleanConnect memory bank system, automatic V1 checklist mapping, and risk assessment strategies, enhancing clarity and context for optimal AI assistance via SMS-based daily dashboards","zh":"赋予代理将用户请求转化为结构化、详细的提示，使用CleanConnect内存银行系统、自动V1检查清单映射和风险评估策略，增强清晰度和上下文以实现最优的AI辅助，通过基于SMS的每日仪表板","ja":"CleanConnectメモリバンクシステム、自動V1チェックリストマッピング、リスク評価戦略を使用して、ユーザーのリクエストを構造化された詳細なプロンプトに変換することで、エージェントに力をかため、AIアシスタンスの明確性とコンテキストを最適化し、SMSベースの毎日ダッシュボードを介して最適なAIアシスタンスを提供する","ko":"CleanConnect 메모리 뱅크 시스템, 자동 V1 체크리스트 매핑, 위험 평가 전략을 사용하여 사용자의 요청을 구조화된詳細한 프롬프트로 변환함으로써 에이전트에게 강화하여, 최적의 AI 지원을 위한 명확성과 컨텍스트를 강화하고, SMS 기반의 일일 대시보드를 통해 최적의 AI 지원을 제공함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar las solicitudes de los usuarios en instrucciones detalladas y bien estructuradas utilizando el sistema de banco de memoria CleanConnect, el mapeo de lista de verificación automática V1 y las estrategias de evaluación de riesgos, lo que mejora la claridad y el contexto para una asistencia de IA óptima a través de paneles de instrumentos diarios basados en SMS","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les demandes des utilisateurs en invites détaillées et bien structurées en utilisant le système de banque de mémoire CleanConnect, la mise en correspondance automatique de la liste de vérification V1 et les stratégies d''évaluation des risques, améliorant ainsi la clarté et le contexte pour une assistance IA optimale via des tableaux de bord quotidiens basés sur SMS","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Benutzeranfragen in detaillierte und gut strukturierte Anweisungen umzuwandeln, indem sie das CleanConnect-Speichersystem, die automatische V1-Prüfliste-Zuordnung und Risikobewertungsstrategien verwenden, wodurch Klarheit und Kontext für eine optimale KI-Unterstützung über SMS-basierte Tagesdashboard verbessert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar os pedidos dos usuários em prompts detalhados e bem estruturados, utilizando o sistema de banco de memória CleanConnect, mapeamento automático de lista de verificação V1 e estratégias de avaliação de riscos, melhorando a clareza e o contexto para assistência de IA óptima via dashboards diários baseados em SMS","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать запросы пользователей в хорошо структурированные и подробные подсказки, используя систему банка памяти CleanConnect, автоматическое сопоставление контрольного списка V1 и стратегии оценки рисков, улучшая ясность и контекст для оптимальной помощи ИИ через ежедневные панели на основе SMS","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من تحويل طلبات المستخدم إلى مطالبات مفصلة ومنظمة جيدًا، باستخدام نظام بنك الذاكرة CleanConnect وmapping التلقائي لقائمة التحقق V1 واستراتيجيات تقييم المخاطر، مما يحسن الوضوح والسياق للمساعدة الاصطناعية الأمثل عبر لوحات تحكم يومية تعتمد على الرسائل القصيرة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating request clarification for non-technical founders","Generating detailed prompts for SaaS platform development","Enhancing business focus in AI-driven projects"],"zh":["为非技术创始人自动化请求澄清","为SaaS平台开发生成详细的提示","增强AI驱动项目中的业务焦点"],"ja":["非技術の創設者に対するリクエストの明確化を自動化する","SaaSプラットフォーム開発のため詳細なプロンプトを生成する","AI駆動プロジェクトにおけるビジネスフォーカスを強化する"],"ko":["비기술 창업자에 대한 요청 명확화를 자동화함","SaaS 플랫폼 개발을 위한詳細한 프롬프트 생성","AI 주도 프로젝트에서의 비즈니스 포커스 강화"],"es":["Automatización de la aclaración de solicitudes para fundadores no técnicos","Generación de instrucciones detalladas para el desarrollo de plataformas SaaS","Mejora del enfoque empresarial en proyectos impulsados por IA"],"fr":["Automatisation de la clarification des demandes pour les fondateurs non techniques","Génération d''invites détaillées pour le développement de plateformes SaaS","Amélioration de la concentration commerciale dans les projets impulsés par l''IA"],"de":["Automatisierung der Anfrageklärung für nicht-technische Gründer","Erzeugung detaillierter Anweisungen für die Entwicklung von SaaS-Plattformen","Verbesserung der Geschäftsorientierung in KI-getriebenen Projekten"],"pt":["Automatizar a clarificação de solicitações para fundadores não técnicos","Gerar prompts detalhados para desenvolvimento de plataforma de SaaS","Melhorar o foco empresarial em projetos impulsionados por IA"],"ru":["Автоматизировать уточнение запросов для не технических основателей","Генерировать подробные подсказки для разработки платформы SaaS","Улучшать деловую направленность в проектах, управляемых ИИ"],"ar":["تحسين تلقائي لتوضيح الطلبات للمؤسسين غير التقنيين","توليد مطالبات مفصلة لتطوير منصة SaaS","تحسين التركيز التجاري في المشاريع التي تقودها الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with CleanConnect memory bank system","Optimized for SaaS development and vibe coding"],"zh":["需要与CleanConnect内存银行系统集成","优化用于SaaS开发和vibe编码"],"ja":["CleanConnectメモリバンクシステムとの統合が必要","SaaS開発とvibeコーディングの最適化"],"ko":["CleanConnect 메모리 뱅크 시스템과의 통합이 필요함","SaaS 개발과 vibe 코딩을 위한 최적화"],"es":["Requiere integración con el sistema de banco de memoria CleanConnect","Optimizado para el desarrollo de SaaS y codificación de vibra"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le système de banque de mémoire CleanConnect","Optimisé pour le développement SaaS et le codage de vibe"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit dem CleanConnect-Speichersystem","Optimiert für SaaS-Entwicklung und Vibe-Codierung"],"pt":["Exige integração com o sistema de banco de memória CleanConnect","Otimizado para desenvolvimento de SaaS e codificação de vibe"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с системой банка памяти CleanConnect","Оптимизирован для разработки SaaS и кодирования настроений"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع نظام بنك الذاكرة CleanConnect","مُحسّن لتنمية SaaS وتشفير المزاج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"66d964746b011870ffae5f722872a09f509dd9e8fdea9527eb1b0bda6ed2b3cc","qualityScore":45}');
