i ist ein GPU-CLI-Tool mit öffentlicher Dokumentation und Problemen","pt":"A gpu-cli é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para GPU, com documentação e problemas públicos disponíveis.","ru":"ИИ Агент gpu-cli - это командная строка для GPU с общедоступной документацией и проблемами.","ar":"أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي gpu-cli هي سطر أوامر للوحدات العصبونية، مع توثيق ومشاكل عامة متاحة.","en":"Public facing GPU cli docs and issues "},"definition":{"en":"Public facing GPU cli docs and issues "},"features":{"zh":["公共文档","问题跟踪","GPU 资源管理","命令行界面","优化 GPU 性能"],"ja":["パブリックドキュメント","問題追跡","GPU リソース管理","CLI インターフェース","GPU パフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["공개 문서","문제 추적","GPU 리소스 관리","명령줄 인터페이스","GPU 성능 최적화"],"es":["Acceso a documentación pública","Informe de problemas y soluciones","Compatibilidad con línea de comandos","Soporte para desarrolladores","Actualizaciones y mejoras constantes"],"fr":["Accès à la documentation publique","Rapport de problèmes et de solutions","Compatibilité avec la ligne de commande","Support pour les développeurs","Mises à jour et améliorations constantes"],"de":["Zugriff auf öffentliche Dokumentation","Bericht über Probleme und Lösungen","Kompatibilität mit der Kommandozeile","Support für Entwickler","Ständige Updates und Verbesserungen"],"pt":["Interface de linha de comando para GPU","Documentação pública disponível","Problemas e soluções comuns","Suporte a várias GPUs","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Командная строка для GPU","Общедоступная документация","Распространенные проблемы и решения","Поддержка нескольких GPU","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["واجهة سطر أوامر للوحدات العصبونية","توثيق عام متاح","مشاكل وحلول شائعة","دعم للوحدات العصبونية المتعددة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["gpu-cli","AI工具","GPU命令行工具","如何使用gpu-cli","gpu-cli安装","gpu-cli替代品"],"ja":["gpu-cli","AIエージェント","GPU CLI","gpu-cliの使い方","gpu-cliのインストール","gpu-cliの代替"],"ko":["gpu-cli","AI 에이전트","GPU 명령줄 도구","gpu-cli 사용법","gpu-cli 설치","gpu-cli 대체"],"es":["herramientas de AI","gpu-cli","cómo usar gpu-cli","qué es gpu-cli","alternativas a gpu-cli","gpu-cli vs CUDA","instalación de gpu-cli","guía de configuración de gpu-cli"],"fr":["outils AI","gpu-cli","comment utiliser gpu-cli","qu''est-ce que gpu-cli","alternatives à gpu-cli","gpu-cli vs CUDA","installation de gpu-cli","guide de configuration de gpu-cli"],"de":["KI-Tools","gpu-cli","wie man gpu-cli verwendet","was ist gpu-cli","Alternativen zu gpu-cli","gpu-cli vs CUDA","Installation von gpu-cli","Konfigurationsanleitung für gpu-cli"],"pt":["como usar gpu-cli","o que é gpu-cli","gpu-cli alternativa","gpu-cli vs cuda","instalar gpu-cli","guia de configuração gpu-cli"],"ru":["как использовать gpu-cli","что такое gpu-cli","gpu-cli альтернатива","gpu-cli vs cuda","установить gpu-cli","руководство по настройке gpu-cli"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام gpu-cli","ما هي gpu-cli","بديل gpu-cli","gpu-cli مقابل cuda","تثبيت gpu-cli","دليل إعداد gpu-cli"]}},"owner":"gpu-cli","repo":"gpu","repoPath":"gpu-cli/gpu","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.041Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gpu-cli","description":"Run ML training, LLM inference, and ComfyUI workflows on remote NVIDIA GPUs (A100, H100, RTX 4090). Cloud GPU compute with smart file sync — prefix any command with gpu to run it remotely.","version":"0.14.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# GPU CLI\n\nGPU CLI runs local commands on remote NVIDIA GPUs by prefixing with `gpu`. It provisions a pod, syncs your code, streams logs, and syncs outputs back: `uv run python train.py` becomes `gpu run uv run python train.py`.\n\n## Quick diagnostics\n\n```bash\ngpu doctor --json       # Check if setup is healthy (daemon, auth, provider keys)\ngpu status --json       # See running pods and costs\ngpu inventory --json    # See available GPUs and pricing\n```\n\n## Command families\n\n### Getting started\n\n|","body":"# GPU CLI\n\nGPU CLI runs local commands on remote NVIDIA GPUs by prefixing with `gpu`. It provisions a pod, syncs your code, streams logs, and syncs outputs back: `uv run python train.py` becomes `gpu run uv run python train.py`.\n\n## Quick diagnostics\n\n```bash\ngpu doctor --json       # Check if setup is healthy (daemon, auth, provider keys)\ngpu status --json       # See running pods and costs\ngpu inventory --json    # See available GPUs and pricing\n```\n\n## Command families\n\n### Getting started\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu login` | Browser-based authentication |\n| `gpu logout [-y]` | Remove session |\n| `gpu init [--gpu-type T] [--force]` | Initialize project config |\n| `gpu upgrade` | Open subscription upgrade page |\n\n### Running code\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu run <command>` | Execute on remote GPU (main command) |\n| `gpu run -d <command>` | Run detached (background) |\n| `gpu run -a <job_id>` | Reattach to running job |\n| `gpu run --cancel <job_id>` | Cancel a running job |\n| `gpu status [--json]` | Show project status, pods, costs |\n| `gpu logs [-j JOB] [-f] [--tail N] [--json]` | View job output |\n| `gpu attach <job_id>` | Reattach to job output stream |\n| `gpu stop [POD_ID] [-y]` | Stop active pod |\n\nKey `gpu run` flags: `--gpu-type`, `--gpu-count <1-8>`, `--min-vram`, `--rebuild`, `-o/--output`, `--no-output`, `--sync`, `-p/--publish <PORT>`, `-e <KEY=VALUE>`, `-i/--interactive`.\n\n### GPU inventory\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu inventory [--available] [--min-vram N] [--max-price P] [--json]` | List GPUs with pricing |\n\n### Volumes\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu volume list [--detailed] [--json]` | List network volumes |\n| `gpu volume create [--name N] [--size GB] [--datacenter DC]` | Create volume |\n| `gpu volume delete <VOL> [--force]` | Delete volume |\n| `gpu volume extend <VOL> --size <GB>` | Increase size |\n| `gpu volume set-global <VOL>` | Set default volume |\n| `gpu volume status [--volume V] [--json]` | Volume usage |\n| `gpu volume migrate <VOL> --to <DC>` | Migrate to datacenter |\n| `gpu volume sync <SRC> <DEST>` | Sync between volumes |\n\n### Vault (encrypted storage)\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu vault list [--json]` | List encrypted output files |\n| `gpu vault export <PATH> <DEST>` | Export decrypted file |\n| `gpu vault stats [--json]` | Storage usage stats |\n\n### Configuration\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu config show [--json]` | Show merged config |\n| `gpu config validate` | Validate against schema |\n| `gpu config schema` | Print JSON schema |\n| `gpu config set <KEY> <VALUE>` | Set global config option |\n| `gpu config get <KEY>` | Get global config value |\n\n### Authentication\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu auth login [--profile P]` | Authenticate with cloud provider |\n| `gpu auth logout` | Remove credentials |\n| `gpu auth status` | Show auth status |\n| `gpu auth add <HUB>` | Add hub credentials (hf, civitai) |\n| `gpu auth remove <HUB>` | Remove hub credentials |\n| `gpu auth hubs` | List configured hubs |\n\n### Organizations\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu org list` | List organizations |\n| `gpu org create <NAME>` | Create organization |\n| `gpu org switch [SLUG]` | Set active org context |\n| `gpu org invite <EMAIL>` | Invite member |\n| `gpu org service-account create --name N` | Create service token |\n| `gpu org service-account list` | List service accounts |\n| `gpu org service-account revoke <ID>` | Revoke token |\n\n### LLM inference\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu llm run [--ollama\\|--vllm] [--model M] [-y]` | Launch LLM inference |\n| `gpu llm info [MODEL] [--url URL] [--json]` | Show model info |\n\n### ComfyUI workflows\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu comfyui list [--json]` | Browse available workflows |\n| `gpu comfyui info <WORKFLOW> [--json]` | Show workflow details |\n| `gpu comfyui validate <WORKFLOW> [--json]` | Pre-flight checks |\n| `gpu comfyui run <WORKFLOW>` | Run workflow on GPU |\n| `gpu comfyui generate \"<PROMPT>\"` | Text-to-image generation |\n| `gpu comfyui stop [WORKFLOW] [--all]` | Stop ComfyUI pod |\n\n### Notebooks\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu notebook [FILE] [--run] [--new NAME]` | Run Marimo notebook on GPU |\n\nAlias: `gpu nb`\n\n### Serverless endpoints\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu serverless deploy [--template T] [--json]` | Deploy endpoint |\n| `gpu serverless status [ENDPOINT] [--json]` | Endpoint status |\n| `gpu serverless logs [ENDPOINT]` | View request logs |\n| `gpu serverless list [--json]` | List all endpoints |\n| `gpu serverless delete [ENDPOINT]` | Delete endpoint |\n| `gpu serverless warm [--cpu\\|--gpu]` | Pre-warm endpoint |\n\n### Templates\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu template list [--json]` | Browse official templates |\n| `gpu template clear-cache` | Clear cached templates |\n\n### Daemon control\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu daemon status [--json]` | Show daemon health |\n| `gpu daemon start` | Start daemon |\n| `gpu daemon stop` | Stop daemon |\n| `gpu daemon restart` | Restart daemon |\n| `gpu daemon logs [-f] [-n N]` | View daemon logs |\n\n### Tools and utilities\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `gpu dashboard` | Interactive TUI for pods and jobs |\n| `gpu doctor [--json]` | Diagnostic checks |\n| `gpu agent-docs` | Print agent reference to stdout |\n| `gpu update [--check]` | Update CLI |\n| `gpu changelog [VERSION]` | View release notes |\n| `gpu issue [\"desc\"]` | Report issue |\n| `gpu desktop` | Desktop app management |\n| `gpu support` | Open community Discord |\n\n## Common workflows\n\n1. **Setup**: `gpu login` then `gpu init`\n2. **Run job**: `gpu run python train.py --epochs 10`\n3. **With specific GPU**: `gpu run --gpu-type \"RTX 4090\" python train.py`\n4. **Detached job**: `gpu run -d python long_training.py` then `gpu status --json`\n5. **Check status**: `gpu status --json`\n6. **View logs**: `gpu logs --json`\n7. **Stop pods**: `gpu stop -y`\n8. **LLM inference**: `gpu llm run --ollama --model llama3 -y`\n9. **ComfyUI**: `gpu comfyui run flux_schnell`\n10. **Diagnose issues**: `gpu doctor --json`\n\n`gpu run` is pod-reuse oriented: after a command completes, the next `gpu run` reuses the existing pod until you `gpu stop` or cooldown ends.\n\n## JSON output\n\nMost commands support `--json` for machine-readable output. Structured data goes to stdout; human-oriented status and progress messages go to stderr.\n\nCommands with `--json`: `status`, `logs`, `doctor`, `inventory`, `config show`, `daemon status`, `volume list`, `volume status`, `vault list`, `vault stats`, `comfyui list`, `comfyui info`, `comfyui validate`, `serverless deploy`, `serverless status`, `serverless list`, `template list`, `llm info`.\n\n## Exit codes\n\n| Code | Meaning | Recovery |\n|---|---|---|\n| `0` | Success | Proceed |\n| `1` | General error | Read stderr |\n| `2` | Usage error | Fix command syntax |\n| `10` | Auth required | `gpu auth login` |\n| `11` | Quota exceeded | `gpu upgrade` or wait |\n| `12` | Not found | Check resource ID |\n| `13` | Daemon unavailable | `gpu daemon start`, retry |\n| `14` | Timeout | Retry |\n| `15` | Cancelled | Re-run if needed |\n| `130` | Interrupted | Re-run if needed |\n\n## Configuration\n\n- Project config: `gpu.toml`, `gpu.jsonc`, or `pyproject.toml [tool.gpu]`\n- Global config: `~/.gpu-cli/config.toml` (via `gpu config set/get`)\n- Sync model: `.gitignore` controls upload; `outputs` patterns control download\n- Secrets and credentials must stay in the OS keychain, never plaintext project files\n- CI env vars: `GPU_RUNPOD_API_KEY`, `GPU_SSH_PRIVATE_KEY`, `GPU_SSH_PUBLIC_KEY`\n\n## References\n\n- Project generation and task setup: `references/create.md`\n- Debugging and common failures: `references/debug.md`\n- Config schema and field examples: `references/config.md`\n- Cost and GPU selection guidance: `references/optimize.md`\n- Persistent storage and volumes: `references/volumes.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:23:11.653Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents requiring remote NVIDIA GPU acceleration for compute-intensive tasks","zh":"适合需要远程NVIDIA GPU加速来执行计算密集型任务的AI代理","ja":"リモートNVIDIA GPUの高速化が必要な計算集中タスクを実行するためのAIエージェントに適しています","ko":"원격 NVIDIA GPU 가속이 필요한 계산 집중 작업을 실행하는 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que requieren aceleración de NVIDIA GPU remota para tareas intensivas en cómputo","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA nécessitant une accélération NVIDIA GPU à distance pour des tâches intensives en calcul","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die eine Remote-NVIDIA-GPU-Beschleunigung für rechenintensive Aufgaben benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA que exigem aceleração de GPU NVIDIA remota para tarefas intensivas de computação","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, требующих удаленного ускорения NVIDIA GPU для вычислительно-емких задач","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تسريع NVIDIA GPU عن بُعد لمهام الحوسبة الكثيفة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run local commands on remote NVIDIA GPUs, stream logs, and sync outputs using the `gpu` prefix, while providing quick diagnostics via `gpu doctor`, `gpu status`, and `gpu inventory` commands, utilizing JSON output for seamless integration","zh":"赋予代理在远程NVIDIA GPU上运行本地命令、流式传输日志和同步输出的能力，使用`gpu`前缀，同时提供快速诊断功能，通过`gpu doctor`、`gpu status`和`gpu inventory`命令，利用JSON输出实现无缝集成","ja":"`gpu`プレフィックスを使用して、リモートNVIDIA GPUでローカルコマンドを実行し、ログをストリーミングし、出力を同期する機能をエージェントに与え、`gpu doctor`、`gpu status`、`gpu inventory`コマンドを使用した迅速な診断を提供し、JSON出力を使用してシームレスな統合を実現する","ko":"`gpu` 접두사를 사용하여 원격 NVIDIA GPU에서 로컬 명령을 실행하고 로그를 스트리밍하고 출력을 동기화하는 기능을 에이전트에 제공하며 `gpu doctor`, `gpu status`, `gpu inventory` 명령을 사용한 빠른 진단을 제공하고 JSON 출력을 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar comandos locales en NVIDIA GPUs remotas, transmitir registros y sincronizar salidas utilizando el prefijo `gpu`, mientras proporciona una diagnóstica rápida a través de los comandos `gpu doctor`, `gpu status` y `gpu inventory`, utilizando la salida JSON para una integración sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des commandes locales sur des NVIDIA GPUs à distance, de diffuser des journaux et de synchroniser les sorties en utilisant le préfixe `gpu`, tout en fournissant un diagnostic rapide via les commandes `gpu doctor`, `gpu status` et `gpu inventory`, en utilisant la sortie JSON pour une intégration transparente","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, lokale Befehle auf Remote-NVIDIA-GPUs auszuführen, Protokolle zu streamen und Ausgaben mit dem `gpu`-Präfix zu synchronisieren, während eine schnelle Diagnose über die Befehle `gpu doctor`, `gpu status` und `gpu inventory` bereitgestellt wird, unter Verwendung von JSON-Ausgaben für eine nahtlose Integration","pt":"Habilita agentes a executar comandos locais em GPUs NVIDIA remotas, transmitir logs e sincronizar saídas usando o prefixo `gpu`, enquanto fornece diagnósticos rápidos via comandos `gpu doctor`, `gpu status` e `gpu inventory`, utilizando saída JSON para integração transparente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать локальные команды на удаленных GPU NVIDIA, передавать журналы и синхронизировать выходные данные с помощью префикса `gpu`, обеспечивая быструю диагностику через команды `gpu doctor`, `gpu status` и `gpu inventory`, используя вывод JSON для бесшовной интеграции","ar":"يُمكن وكلاء من تشغيل أوامر محلية على وحدات معالجة الرسومات NVIDIA عن بُعد، وبث السجلات وتنسيق الإخراج باستخدام بادئة `gpu`، مع تقديم تشخيص سريع عبر أوامر `gpu doctor` و `gpu status` و `gpu inventory`، باستخدام إخراج JSON من أجل التكامل السلس"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating machine learning model training on remote GPUs","Debugging GPU-accelerated applications using `gpu doctor`","Optimizing resource allocation with `gpu inventory` and `gpu status`"],"zh":["在远程GPU上自动化机器学习模型训练","使用`gpu doctor`调试GPU加速应用","使用`gpu inventory`和`gpu status`优化资源分配"],"ja":["リモートGPU上での機械学習モデルトレーニングの自動化","`gpu doctor`を使用したGPUアクセラレーションアプリケーションのデバッグ","`gpu inventory`と`gpu status`を使用したリソース割り当ての最適化"],"ko":["원격 GPU에서 기계 학습 모델 훈련을 자동화","`gpu doctor`를 사용하여 GPU 가속 애플리케이션을 디버깅","`gpu inventory`와 `gpu status`를 사용하여 리소스 할당을 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar el entrenamiento de modelos de aprendizaje automático en GPUs remotas","Depurar aplicaciones con aceleración de GPU utilizando `gpu doctor`","Optimizar la asignación de recursos con `gpu inventory` y `gpu status`"],"fr":["Automatiser la formation de modèles d''apprentissage automatique sur des GPUs à distance","Déboguer des applications accélérées par GPU à l''aide de `gpu doctor`","Optimiser l''allocation de ressources avec `gpu inventory` et `gpu status`"],"de":["Automatisieren des Trainings von Machine-Learning-Modellen auf Remote-GPUs","Debuggen von GPU-beschleunigten Anwendungen mit `gpu doctor`","Optimieren der Ressourcenzuweisung mit `gpu inventory` und `gpu status`"],"pt":["Automatizar treinamento de modelos de aprendizado de máquina em GPUs remotas","Depurar aplicações aceleradas por GPU usando `gpu doctor`","Otimizar alocação de recursos com `gpu inventory` e `gpu status`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обучение моделей машинного обучения на удаленных GPU","Отлаживать приложения, ускоренные с помощью GPU, используя `gpu doctor`","Оптимизировать распределение ресурсов с помощью `gpu inventory` и `gpu status`"],"ar":["أتمتة تدريب نماذج التعلم الآلي على وحدات معالجة الرسومات البعيدة","تصحيح أخطاء التطبيقات التي تعمل بالgpu باستخدام `gpu doctor`","تحسين تخصيص الموارد باستخدام `gpu inventory` و `gpu status`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires NVIDIA GPU provider keys","Dependent on daemon and authentication setup"],"zh":["需要NVIDIA GPU提供者密钥","依赖于守护进程和身份验证设置"],"ja":["NVIDIA GPUプロバイダーキーが必要","デーモンと認証設定に依存する"],"ko":["NVIDIA GPU 공급자 키가 필요","데몬 및 인증 설정에 의존"],"es":["Requiere claves de proveedor de NVIDIA GPU","Dependiente de la configuración de daemon y autenticación"],"fr":["Nécessite des clés de fournisseur de NVIDIA GPU","Dépend de la configuration du démon et de l''authentification"],"de":["Benötigt NVIDIA-GPU-Anbieterschlüssel","Abhängig von Daemon- und Authentifizierungseinrichtung"],"pt":["Exige chaves de provedor de GPU NVIDIA","Dependente de configuração de daemon e autenticação"],"ru":["Требует ключей провайдера GPU NVIDIA","Зависит от настройки демона и аутентификации"],"ar":["يتطلب مفاتيح مزود GPU NVIDIA","يعتمد على إعداد الدايمون والتحقق من الهوية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c91139ea2d07263dbc37f9b4b3889baf0c1676b4116dedd81d4fcb11eea03b46","qualityScore":45}');
