n Kohlenstoff","wie man repo-doc-audit verwendet","was ist die Kohlenstoffbilanz","repo-doc-audit Alternative","repo-doc-audit vs andere Tools","Installation von repo-doc-audit","Einrichtungsanleitung für repo-doc-audit"],"pt":["como usar repo-doc-audit","o que é contabilidade de carbono","ferramentas de contabilidade de carbono","repo-doc-audit vs outras ferramentas","instalar repo-doc-audit","guia de configuração repo-doc-audit","desenvolvimento de software para contabilidade de carbono"],"ru":["как использовать repo-doc-audit","что такое учет углерода","инструменты учета углерода","repo-doc-audit vs другие инструменты","установить repo-doc-audit","руководство по настройке repo-doc-audit","разработка программного обеспечения для учета углерода"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات المحاسبة الكربونية المفتوحة","ما هي محاسبة الكربون","أدوات محاسبة الكربون","أدوات المحاسبة الكربونية المفتوحة vs أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أدوات المحاسبة الكربونية المفتوحة","دليل إعداد أدوات المحاسبة الكربونية المفتوحة","تطوير البرمجيات لمحاسبة الكربون"]}},"owner":"Open-Earth-Foundation","repo":"CityCatalyst","repoPath":"Open-Earth-Foundation/CityCatalyst","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.046Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"repo-doc-audit","description":"One-off full repository audit for documentation health (docstrings, README, architecture, scripts conventions). Use explicitly when requested.","bodyPreview":"# repo-doc-audit\n\nThis is a **one-off**, repo-wide documentation audit. It is intentionally **not** automatic because it can be expensive and noisy.\n\n## When to use\n\n- Use this skill when the user asks for a **full repo documentation audit** or “is everything up to date?”\n- Use after large refactors, restructurings, or major feature additions.\n\n## Goal\n\nProduce an actionable report (and optionally fixes) across:\n\n- `README.md` accuracy (setup/run/config/troubleshooting)\n- `architecture.md` accur","body":"# repo-doc-audit\n\nThis is a **one-off**, repo-wide documentation audit. It is intentionally **not** automatic because it can be expensive and noisy.\n\n## When to use\n\n- Use this skill when the user asks for a **full repo documentation audit** or “is everything up to date?”\n- Use after large refactors, restructurings, or major feature additions.\n\n## Goal\n\nProduce an actionable report (and optionally fixes) across:\n\n- `README.md` accuracy (setup/run/config/troubleshooting)\n- `architecture.md` accuracy (diagrams and component naming)\n- Script docstrings and runnable-script conventions\n- Consistency between dependency docs (`pyproject.toml`, `requirements.txt`, and lockfiles such as `uv.lock` / `poetry.lock`)\n- Presence of `.env.example` entries for documented env vars\n\n## Audit method (recommended)\n\n### 1) Establish repo “truth” from code and configs\n\n- Identify real entrypoints (commands in `README.md`, modules with `__main__`, top-level scripts).\n- Identify configuration files that control runtime (e.g., model/provider selection, pipeline toggles).\n- Identify output folders and naming conventions from code paths.\n\n### 2) Read and validate key docs against truth\n\n- `README.md`\n  - Commands exist and match actual flags/paths.\n  - Setup instructions match dependency source of truth policy.\n  - Output structure matches code behavior.\n- `architecture.md`\n  - Components referenced exist in the repo.\n  - Diagrams reflect current flow and naming.\n- Module-level READMEs (if present in modules)\n  - Do they describe actual behavior and entrypoints?\n\n### 3) Script/docstring audit (repo-wide)\n\nFor any file that looks runnable (heuristics):\n\n- Located under a `scripts/` folder, OR\n- Mentioned in docs as an entrypoint, OR\n- Contains `if __name__ == \"__main__\":`, OR\n- Imports `argparse` and defines `main()`\n\nCheck:\n\n- Top-level module docstring exists and covers:\n  - Brief\n  - Inputs (each CLI flag should have a short purpose + expected format; env vars should explain what they control)\n  - Outputs\n  - Usage from project root (`python -m ...`)\n- Uses `argparse` for CLI (when runnable).\n- Has `__main__` guard.\n- Avoids side effects at import time.\n- Logging: uses `logging` (not `print`) except intentional CLI UX.\n- Imports: prefer **absolute imports**.\n- Paths: prefer `pathlib.Path`.\n\nAdditionally (repo-wide): check that **every function and method** has a docstring.\n\n- Trivial functions/methods: one-liner docstring is acceptable.\n- Non-trivial or side-effecting functions/methods: docstring should explain inputs/outputs, side effects, and raised exceptions when non-obvious.\n\n### 4) Produce an output report\n\nDeliver a report with:\n\n- **Summary**: 3–6 bullets of highest-impact issues\n- **Findings** grouped by document/file\n- **Fix suggestions**: concrete edits (small, scoped)\n- **Optional automated fixes**:\n  - Only apply if user asked you to fix; otherwise just report.\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- Do not try to enforce style consistency beyond correctness.\n- Do not rewrite large sections unless necessary for accuracy.\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:24:10.313Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring comprehensive repository documentation audits for open-source projects like carbon accounting for cities","zh":"适用于需要对开源项目（如城市碳核算）进行综合仓库文档审计的代码审查代理","ja":"オープンソースプロジェクト（例：都市の炭素会計）に対する包括的なリポジトリ文書化監査を必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適","ko":"오픈소스 프로젝트(예: 도시 탄소 계산)에 대한 포괄적인 저장소 문서 감사가 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren auditorías de documentación de repositorio integrales para proyectos de código abierto como la contabilidad de carbono para ciudades","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Révision de Code nécessitant des audits de documentation de référentiel complets pour les projets open-source comme la comptabilité carbone pour les villes","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die umfassende Repository-Dokumentationsaudits für Open-Source-Projekte wie Kohlenstoffbilanzierung für Städte erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem auditorias de documentação de repositório abrangentes para projetos de código aberto, como contabilidade de carbono para cidades","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, требующих всесторонних аудитов документации репозитория для открытых проектов, таких как учет углерода для городов","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراجعة الشفرة التي تتطلب عمليات تدقيق شاملة لوثائق المستودع لمشاريع مفتوحة المصدر مثل محاسبة الكربون للمدن"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to produce actionable reports on README.md and architecture.md accuracy, ensuring up-to-date documentation across setup, run, config, and troubleshooting sections, leveraging markdown files like README.md and architecture.md","zh":"赋予代理生成README.md和architecture.md准确性的可行报告，确保设置、运行、配置和故障排除部分的文档是最新的，利用README.md和architecture.md等markdown文件","ja":"README.mdとarchitecture.mdの精度に関する実行可能なレポートをエージェントが生成できるようにし、セットアップ、実行、構成、およびトラブルシューティングのセクションにわたる最新のドキュメントを保証するために、README.mdやarchitecture.mdなどのMarkdownファイルを利用する","ko":"README.md 및 architecture.md의 정확도에 대한 실행 가능한 보고서를 생성하기 위한 에이전트를 활성화하여 설정, 실행, 구성 및 문제 해결 섹션에 걸쳐 최신 문서를 보장하며, README.md 및 architecture.md와 같은 마크다운 파일을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a producir informes operativos sobre la precisión de README.md y architecture.md, asegurando la documentación actualizada en las secciones de configuración, ejecución, configuración y solución de problemas, aprovechando archivos markdown como README.md y architecture.md","fr":"Permet aux agents de produire des rapports opérationnels sur la précision de README.md et architecture.md, en garantissant une documentation à jour dans les sections de configuration, exécution, configuration et dépannage, en exploitant les fichiers markdown tels que README.md et architecture.md","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, operative Berichte über die Genauigkeit von README.md und architecture.md zu erstellen, indem sie sicherstellen, dass die Dokumentation in den Bereichen Einrichtung, Ausführung, Konfiguration und Fehlerbehebung auf dem neuesten Stand ist, indem sie Markdown-Dateien wie README.md und architecture.md nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes produzam relatórios eficazes sobre a precisão dos arquivos README.md e architecture.md, garantindo documentação atualizada em seções como configuração, execução, configuração e solução de problemas, utilizando arquivos markdown como README.md e architecture.md","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью производить эффективные отчеты о точности файлов README.md и architecture.md, обеспечивая актуальность документации по разделам настройки, запуска, конфигурации и устранения неполадок, используя файлы markdown, такие как README.md и architecture.md","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنتاج تقارير قابلة للتنفيذ حول دقة ملفات README.md وarchitecture.md، مما يضمن توثيقًا محدثًا عبر أقسام الإعداد والتشغيل والتهيئة وتصحيح الأخطاء، باستخدام ملفات markdown مثل README.md وarchitecture.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing repository documentation after major refactorings","Validating README.md accuracy for setup and troubleshooting","Generating reports on architecture.md for open-source carbon accounting projects"],"zh":["在主要重构后审计仓库文档","验证README.md的设置和故障排除准确性","为开源碳核算项目生成architecture.md报告"],"ja":["メジャーリファクタリング後にリポジトリ文書を監査する","README.mdの設定とトラブルシューティングの正確性を検証する","オープンソース炭素会計プロジェクトのアーキテクチャmdについて報告を生成する"],"ko":["주요 리팩토링 후 저장소 문서를 감사","README.md의 설정 및 문제 해결 정확성을 검증","오픈소스 탄소 계산 프로젝트에 대한 아키텍처md 보고서 생성"],"es":["Auditoría de la documentación del repositorio después de refactorizaciones importantes","Validación de la precisión de README.md para la configuración y la solución de problemas","Generación de informes sobre architecture.md para proyectos de contabilidad de carbono de código abierto"],"fr":["Audit de la documentation du référentiel après des refactorisations majeures","Validation de la précision de README.md pour la configuration et la résolution des problèmes","Génération de rapports sur architecture.md pour les projets de comptabilité carbone open-source"],"de":["Auditing der Repository-Dokumentation nach umfangreichen Refactorings","Validierung der Genauigkeit von README.md für die Einrichtung und die Fehlerbehebung","Erstellung von Berichten über architecture.md für Open-Source-Kohlenstoffbilanzierungsprojekte"],"pt":["Auditoria de documentação de repositório após refatorações principais","Validação da precisão do arquivo README.md para configuração e solução de problemas","Geração de relatórios sobre o arquivo architecture.md para projetos de contabilidade de carbono de código aberto"],"ru":["Проверка документации репозитория после основных рефакторингов","Проверка точности файла README.md для настройки и устранения неполадок","Генерация отчетов о файле architecture.md для открытых проектов учета углерода"],"ar":["تدقيق وثائق المستودع بعد إعادة هيكلة رئيسية","التحقق من دقة ملف README.md للتهيئة وتصحيح الأخطاء","توليد تقارير حول ملف architecture.md لمشاريع محاسبة الكربون مفتوحة المصدر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Intentionally not automatic due to potential expense and noise","Requires manual invocation for full repo documentation audit"],"zh":["故意不自动化以避免潜在的开支和噪音","需要手动调用以进行全面的仓库文档审计"],"ja":["潜在的なコストとノイズを避けるために意図的に自動化されていない","完全なリポジトリ文書化監査を行うために手動での呼び出しが必要"],"ko":["잠재적인 비용 및 노イズ를 피하기 위해 의도적으로 자동화되지 않음","전체 저장소 문서 감사 수행을 위해 수동 호출 필요"],"es":["Intencionalmente no automático debido al posible gasto y ruido","Requiere invocación manual para una auditoría de documentación de repositorio completa"],"fr":["Intentionnellement non automatique en raison du coût et du bruit potentiels","Nécessite une invocation manuelle pour un audit de documentation de référentiel complet"],"de":["Bewusst nicht automatisch aufgrund der möglichen Kosten und des Rauschens","Benötigt manuelle Ausführung für eine vollständige Repository-Dokumentationsprüfung"],"pt":["Intencionalmente não automático devido ao potencial de despesa e ruído","Exige invocação manual para auditoria completa da documentação do repositório"],"ru":["Намеренно не автоматический из-за потенциальных затрат и шума","Требует ручного вызова для полной проверки документации репозитория"],"ar":["عمدا غير تلقائي بسبب التكلفة والضوضاء المحتملة","يتطلب استدعاء يدوي لتدقيق كامل لوثائق المستودع"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dddbda7cd0f9ca909104d04068e1c815a797167fc76855e220964ab4d48f5d5d","qualityScore":45}');
