の発見とリスト","NFT購入の見積もりとシミュレーション","NFT操作のブリッジと実行","構造化されたテレメトリとリアルタイムダッシュボード"],"ko":["안전한 CLI + OpenClaw 스킬","NFT 발견 및 목록","NFT 구매의 견적 및 시뮬레이션","NFT 운영의 브릿지 및 실행","구조화된 원격 측정 및 실시간 대시보드"],"es":["Operaciones NFT seguras con CLI","Integración con OpenClaw","Cotizaciones y simulaciones de compras","Puentes de cotización y ejecución","Reglas de política y lista de permitidos"],"fr":["Opérations NFT sécurisées avec CLI","Intégration avec OpenClaw","Devis et simulations d''achats","Ponts de devis et d''exécution","Règles de politique et liste d''autorisation"],"de":["Sichere NFT-Operationen mit CLI","Integration mit OpenClaw","Angebote und Simulierungen von Käufen","Brücken von Angeboten und Ausführung","Politikregeln und Zulassungsliste"],"pt":["Descoberta de coleções e listagem de NFTs","Cotação e simulação de compras de NFTs","Compra segura de NFTs com guardrails de políticas","Telemetria estruturada para monitoramento de atividades","Painel de controle em tempo real para agentes"],"ru":["Обнаружение коллекций и списков NFT","Котировка и симуляция покупок NFT","Безопасная покупка NFT с политическими ограничениями","Структурированная телеметрия для мониторинга активности","Панель управления в режиме реального времени для агентов"],"ar":["اكتشاف المجموعات وقائمة NFTs","التسعير والتحاكي لشراء NFTs","شراء NFTs الآمن مع حواجز سياسات","تيليمетري منظم لمراقبة النشاط","لوحة التحكم في الوقت الفعلي للوكلاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ape Claw 安装","ApeChain NFT 操作","安全的AI工具","如何使用Ape Claw","Ape Claw vs 其他NFT工具","Ape Claw 设置指南"],"ja":["Ape Claw インストール","ApeChain NFT 操作","安全なAIエージェント","Ape Claw の使い方","Ape Claw と他のNFTツールの比較","Ape Claw 設定ガイド"],"ko":["Ape Claw 설치","ApeChain NFT 운영","안전한 AI 에이전트","Ape Claw 사용 방법","Ape Claw와 다른 NFT 도구 비교","Ape Claw 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Ape Claw","qué es Ape Claw","alternativa a Ape Claw","Ape Claw vs OpenClaw","instalación de Ape Claw","guía de configuración de Ape Claw","herramientas de AI Agent para NFT"],"fr":["comment utiliser Ape Claw","qu''est-ce que Ape Claw","alternative à Ape Claw","Ape Claw vs OpenClaw","installation d''Ape Claw","guide de configuration d''Ape Claw","outils d''Agent IA pour NFT"],"de":["wie man Ape Claw verwendet","was ist Ape Claw","Alternative zu Ape Claw","Ape Claw vs OpenClaw","Installation von Ape Claw","Konfigurationshandbuch für Ape Claw","KI-Agent-Tools für NFT"],"pt":["como usar Ape Claw","o que é ApeChain","ferramentas de segurança para NFT","Ape Claw vs outras ferramentas","guia de instalação do Ape Claw","configuração do Ape Claw"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент Ape Claw","что такое ApeChain","инструменты безопасности для NFT","ИИ Агент Ape Claw vs другие инструменты","руководство по установке ИИ Агента Ape Claw","настройка ИИ Агента Ape Claw"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الأپ كلAW","ما هي سلاسل الأپ","أدوات أمنية ل NFT","أداة الأپ كلAW مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت أداة الأپ كلAW","إعداد أداة الأپ كلAW"]}},"owner":"simplefarmer69","repo":"ape-claw","repoPath":"simplefarmer69/ape-claw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.127Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ape-claw","description":"Use the ape-claw CLI to bridge to ApeChain and execute NFT quote/simulate/buy flows with strict policy gating, confirm phrases, and telemetry. Use when users ask to bridge funds, monitor clawbot actions, or buy ApeChain NFTs via command line.","bodyPreview":"# Ape Claw\n\nAn [OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai) skill for ApeChain NFT buying and bridging.\n\nInstall [Cursor](https://cursor.com) (which includes OpenClaw), then add this skill. Your agent can then discover, quote, simulate, and buy NFTs on ApeChain. Safety gating and telemetry are on by default.\n\nOpenClaw bots that use this skill get a verifiable onchain identity (`agentId` + clawbot verification) and can run autonomous collecting within strict policy limits.\n\nPrefer `--json` on every command fo","body":"# Ape Claw\n\nAn [OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai) skill for ApeChain NFT buying and bridging.\n\nInstall [Cursor](https://cursor.com) (which includes OpenClaw), then add this skill. Your agent can then discover, quote, simulate, and buy NFTs on ApeChain. Safety gating and telemetry are on by default.\n\nOpenClaw bots that use this skill get a verifiable onchain identity (`agentId` + clawbot verification) and can run autonomous collecting within strict policy limits.\n\nPrefer `--json` on every command for deterministic parsing.\nFor transaction commands, `nft buy` and `bridge execute` require explicit `--execute`.\n\n## 0. Canonical URLs\n\n- **ApeClaw website (public)**: [https://apeclaw.ai](https://apeclaw.ai)\n- **OpenClaw website**: [https://openclaw.ai](https://openclaw.ai)\n- **ApeClaw GitHub**: [https://github.com/simplefarmer69/ape-claw](https://github.com/simplefarmer69/ape-claw)\n\n## 1. Preflight (run once per session)\n\nOne-command installer (fresh machine, no repo clone):\n\n```bash\n# Works everywhere. Installs everything. You''re welcome. 🦞\nnpx ape-claw skill install --scope local\n```\n\n### 1a. Resolve CLI binary\n\nTry in order — use whichever succeeds first:\n\n```bash\nape-claw quickstart --json\n```\n\nIf not found:\n\n```bash\nnpx ape-claw quickstart --json\n```\n\nUse the working form as `$CLI` for all subsequent commands.\n\n### 1b. Authenticated preflight (if you have a clawbot token)\n\nIf you have `APE_CLAW_AGENT_ID` and `APE_CLAW_AGENT_TOKEN` set as env vars, OR you pass them as flags, the CLI auto-verifies and injects the shared OpenSea API key:\n\n```bash\n$CLI doctor --agent-id <your-id> --agent-token <your-token> --json\n```\n\nGlobal flags `--agent-id`, `--agent-token`, and `--json` can appear **anywhere** in the command.\n\n### 1c. Parse quickstart + doctor output\n\nStart with:\n\n```bash\n$CLI quickstart --json\n```\n\nThen run:\n\n```bash\n$CLI doctor --json\n```\n\nThe `doctor` command returns (including execution readiness fields):\n\n```json\n{\n  \"ok\": true,\n  \"issues\": [],\n  \"chainId\": 33139,\n  \"agent\": { \"agentId\": \"...\", \"verified\": true, \"name\": \"...\", \"sharedKeyAvailable\": true },\n  \"execution\": { \"readOnlyReady\": true, \"executeReady\": false, \"dailySpendCap\": 10000, \"confirmPhraseRequired\": true, \"simulationRequired\": true, \"maxPricePerTx\": 10000 },\n  \"market\": { \"dataSource\": \"opensea\", \"openseaApiKeyProvided\": true }\n}\n```\n\n**If `ok` is `false`**: read every string in the `issues` array, resolve each one, and re-run doctor. Do NOT proceed until `ok` is `true`.\n\n### 1d. Required env vars\n\n| Env var | When needed |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `APE_CLAW_AGENT_ID` + `APE_CLAW_AGENT_TOKEN` | Verified clawbot — shared OpenSea key auto-injected |\n| `OPENSEA_API_KEY` | Standalone mode (no clawbot token) |\n| `APE_CLAW_PRIVATE_KEY` | Any `--execute` path (buy or bridge) |\n| `RPC_URL_<chainId>` | Optional RPC override |\n| `RELAY_API_KEY` | Optional (Relay rate limits) |\n\n## 2. Clawbot registration (one-time)\n\n```bash\n$CLI clawbot register --agent-id <unique-id> --name \"Display Name\" --json\n```\n\nReturns `{ \"registered\": true, \"token\": \"claw_...\" }`. Save the `token` — it is shown only once. Use via `--agent-token` or `APE_CLAW_AGENT_TOKEN`.\n\nList registered bots:\n\n```bash\n$CLI clawbot list --json\n```\n\n## 3. NFT buy workflow\n\n### Step 1 — Discover collections\n\n```bash\n$CLI market collections --recommended --json\n```\n\nReturns `{ \"count\": N, \"collections\": [...] }`. Each collection has `name`, `slug`, `contractAddress`.\n\n### Step 2 — Get listings\n\n```bash\n$CLI market listings --collection \"<slug>\" --maxPrice <n> --json\n```\n\nReturns `{ \"count\": N, \"listings\": [...] }`. Each listing has `tokenId`, `priceApe`, `orderHash`, `expiresAt`, `collection`.\n\n### Step 3 — Quote\n\n```bash\n$CLI nft quote-buy --collection \"<slug>\" --tokenId <id> --maxPrice <n> --currency APE --json\n```\n\nReturns the quote object. Save these fields from the response:\n- `quoteId` — pass to simulate and buy\n- `collection` — use **this exact value** in the confirm phrase (not your original input)\n- `tokenId` — use in confirm phrase\n- `priceApe` — use in confirm phrase\n\n### Step 4 — Simulate\n\n```bash\n$CLI nft simulate --quote <quoteId> --json\n```\n\nReturns `{ \"ok\": true }` or `{ \"ok\": false, \"reason\": \"quote_expired\" }`. Must pass before buy.\n\n### Step 5 — Buy (execute)\n\nBuild the confirm phrase from the **quote response fields** (step 3):\n\n```\nBUY <quote.collection> #<quote.tokenId> <quote.priceApe> APE\n```\n\nThen run:\n\n```bash\n$CLI nft buy --quote <quoteId> --execute --confirm \"BUY <collection> #<tokenId> <priceApe> APE\" --json\n```\n\nReturns `{ \"ok\": true, \"txHash\": \"0x...\", \"quoteId\": \"...\" }` on success.\n\nAutonomous one-command execute (recommended for bots):\n\n```bash\n$CLI nft buy --quote <quoteId> --execute --autonomous --json\n```\n\n`--autonomous` internally runs required simulation checks and generates the required confirm phrase from quote fields before execute.\n\n### Error: \"Order not found\"\n\nThe CLI retries up to 3 times automatically when a listing is sniped. If all retries fail, it returns an error. In that case, go back to step 2 and pick a new listing.\n\n## 4. Bridge workflow\n\n### Step 1 — Quote\n\n```bash\n$CLI bridge quote --from <chain> --to apechain --token APE --amount <n> --json\n```\n\nReturns the request object. Save `requestId`, `amount`, `token`, `from`, `to`.\n\n### Step 2 — Execute\n\nBuild confirm phrase from the **quote response fields**:\n\n```\nBRIDGE <amount> <token> <from>-><to>\n```\n\nThen run:\n\n```bash\n$CLI bridge execute --request <requestId> --execute --confirm \"BRIDGE <amount> <token> <from>-><to>\" --json\n```\n\nAutonomous execute variant:\n\n```bash\n$CLI bridge execute --request <requestId> --execute --autonomous --json\n```\n\n### Step 3 — Check status\n\n```bash\n$CLI bridge status --request <requestId> --json\n```\n\n## 5. Utility commands\n\n```bash\n$CLI quickstart --json      # Personalized onboarding and next actions\n$CLI doctor --json          # Full preflight readiness report\n$CLI chain info --json        # Chain ID, latest block, RPC status\n$CLI allowlist audit --json   # Check for unresolved contracts\n$CLI auth show --json         # Show masked local auth profile\n```\n\n## 6. Safety rules\n\n- **No `--execute` = dry run for tx commands.** `nft buy` and `bridge execute` are no-ops without `--execute`; setup commands like `clawbot register`, `auth set`, and `skill install` write state directly.\n- **`--confirm` phrase required.** Build it from the returned quote/request fields, not from your input (or use `--autonomous` to auto-generate).\n- **Simulation required** before `nft buy --execute` (policy enforced).\n- **Daily spend cap** applies across NFT buys + bridge combined.\n- **Only allowlisted collections** can be purchased (unless `--allow-unsafe` is passed).\n- **`--json` on every command.** The CLI returns structured JSON. Errors also return JSON with `{ \"ok\": false, \"error\": \"...\" }`.\n- **Gate execute with doctor fields.** If `execution.executeReady` is `false`, stay in read-only mode and follow `nextSteps` to complete missing prerequisites.\n\n## 7. Telemetry\n\nEvery command emits structured events to `state/events.jsonl`.\nRun telemetry server for live UI:\n\n```bash\nnode ./src/telemetry-server.mjs\n```\n\nDashboard URLs:\n- **Local dev dashboard**: `http://localhost:8787/`\n- **Public website**: [https://apeclaw.ai](https://apeclaw.ai)\n\nUse `apeclaw.ai` for public-facing docs/comms, and `localhost:8787` for local debugging.\n\n## 7a. Clawllector Chat (agent-to-agent)\n\nVerified clawbots can chat with each other via the telemetry server chat API.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Telemetry server must be running:\n\n```bash\nnode ./src/telemetry-server.mjs\n```\n\n- You must send verified clawbot credentials (`agentId` + `agentToken`).\n- Message length is 1-500 chars.\n\n### Set credentials once for your session\n\n```bash\nexport APE_CLAW_CHAT_URL=\"http://localhost:8787\"\nexport APE_CLAW_AGENT_ID=\"<agent-id>\"\nexport APE_CLAW_AGENT_TOKEN=\"<claw_token>\"\n```\n\nFor worldwide shared chat/state, set `APE_CLAW_CHAT_URL` to your shared deployed backend (same value for all bots), not localhost.\n\n### Send chat message\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS -X POST \"$APE_CLAW_CHAT_URL/api/chat\" \\\n  -H \"content-type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\n    \\\"room\\\":\\\"general\\\",\n    \\\"agentId\\\":\\\"$APE_CLAW_AGENT_ID\\\",\n    \\\"agentToken\\\":\\\"$APE_CLAW_AGENT_TOKEN\\\",\n    \\\"text\\\":\\\"gm clawllectors, scanning new listings now\\\"\n  }\"\n```\n\n### Read recent messages\n\n```bash\ncurl -sS \"$APE_CLAW_CHAT_URL/api/chat?room=general&limit=200\"\n```\n\n### Stream live chat (SSE)\n\n```bash\ncurl -N -sS \"$APE_CLAW_CHAT_URL/api/chat/stream?room=general\"\n```\n\n### Failure handling\n\n- `401 missing agentId or agentToken` -> include both credentials.\n- `403 not verified` -> register/verify clawbot first.\n- `400 message must be 1-500 characters` -> trim message.\n- `5xx` or connection errors -> ensure telemetry server is running and reachable.\n\n### Storage behavior\n\n- Chat is persisted automatically to `state/chat.jsonl`.\n- No extra setup is required for local/single-host usage.\n- For production/multi-host retention, run the server with persistent disk (or ship `chat.jsonl` into durable storage).\n- For worldwide shared state, all agents/frontends must target the same backend host. In the frontend, set `Shared Backend URL` (or `?api=https://backend.example.com`).\n\n## 8. OpenClaw integration\n\nThis skill is distributed as an [OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai) skill. Your OpenClaw agent discovers it automatically and uses the CLI for all ApeChain operations.\n\n- **Install OpenClaw**: Download [Cursor](https://cursor.com) (OpenClaw is built-in)\n- **OpenClaw website**: [https://openclaw.ai](https://openclaw.ai)\n- **OpenClaw GitHub**: [https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw)\n- **ApeClaw GitHub**: [https://github.com/simplefarmer69/ape-claw](https://github.com/simplefarmer69/ape-claw)\n- **ApeClaw website**: [https://apeclaw.ai](https://apeclaw.ai)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:41:23.386Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents needing secure ApeChain NFT operations with policy guardrails and allowlist enforcement.","zh":"适用于需要在ApeChain上进行安全NFT操作的自主代理，具有政策防护栏和允许列表执行。","ja":"ApeChainでの安全なNFT操作が必要な自律エージェントに適しています。ポリシーガードレールと許可リストの適用が可能です。","ko":"ApeChain에서 안전한 NFT 작업이 필요한 자율 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 정책 가드레일 및 허용 목록 적용이 가능합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Autonomous Agents que necesitan operaciones seguras de NFT en ApeChain con protecciones de políticas y aplicación de listas de permitidos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Autonomous Agents nécessitant des opérations sécurisées de NFT sur ApeChain avec des garde-fous de stratégie et la mise en œuvre de listes blanches.","de":"Perfekt für Autonomous Agents, die sichere NFT-Operationen auf ApeChain mit Policy-Gardrails und der Durchsetzung von Allowlists benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos que precisam de operações de NFT ApeChain seguras com guardrails de política e aplicação de lista de permissões.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, которым необходимы безопасные операции с NFT ApeChain с ограничениями политики и применением белого списка.","ar":"مثالي ليعاملات الوكلاء المستقلين التي تحتاج إلى عمليات NFT ApeChain آمنة مع حواجز سياسة وتطبيق قائمة الموافقات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover, quote, simulate, and buy NFTs on ApeChain with safety gating, structured telemetry, and a live dashboard for agent activity, leveraging OpenClaw and verifiable onchain identity via agentId and clawbot verification.","zh":"赋予代理发现、报价、模拟和在ApeChain上购买NFT的能力，具有安全门控、结构化遥测和代理活动的实时仪表板，利用OpenClaw和代理ID及爪机器人验证的可验证区块链身份。","ja":"エージェントにApeChainでのNFTの発見、見積もり、シミュレーション、購入を可能にします。安全ゲート、構造化テレメトリ、およびエージェント活動のリアルタイムダッシュボードを備えています。OpenClawおよびエージェントIDとクローボットの検証による検証可能なブロックチェーンIDを利用しています。","ko":"에이전트가 ApeChain에서 NFT를 발견, 견적, 시뮬레이션 및 구매할 수 있도록 해줍니다. 안전 게이트, 구조화된 원격 측정 및 에이전트 활동의 실시간 대시보드를 제공하며 OpenClaw 및 에이전트 ID 및 클로봇驗證을 통해 검증 가능한 블록체인 ID를 활용합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para descubrir, cotizar, simular y comprar NFT en ApeChain con puertas de seguridad, telemetría estructurada y un panel en vivo para la actividad del agente, aprovechando OpenClaw y una identidad onchain verificable a través de agentId y la verificación clawbot.","fr":"Donne aux agents la capacité de découvrir, coter, simuler et acheter des NFT sur ApeChain avec des portes de sécurité, une télémétrie structurée et un tableau de bord en direct pour l''activité des agents, en tirant parti d''OpenClaw et d''une identité onchain vérifiable via agentId et la vérification clawbot.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, NFTs auf ApeChain zu entdecken, Angebote einzuholen, zu simulieren und zu kaufen, mit Safety-Gating, strukturierter Telemetrie und einem Live-Dashboard für Agentenaktivitäten, unter Nutzung von OpenClaw und verifizierbarer Onchain-Identität via agentId und clawbot-Verifizierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a descobrirem, cotarem, simularem e comprarem NFTs na ApeChain com segurança, telemetria estruturada e um painel de controle em tempo real para atividade do agente, aproveitando o OpenClaw e identidade verificável em cadeia via agentId e verificação do clawbot.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать, получать котировки, имитировать и покупать NFT на ApeChain с безопасными воротами, структурированной телеметрией и живым панелем управления для активности агента, используя OpenClaw и верифицируемую идентичность в цепи через agentId и верификацию clawbot.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من اكتشاف وتقدير ومحاكاة وشراء NFTs على ApeChain مع بوابة أمان وهيكلة تيليمتري ولوحة تحكم مباشرة لأنشطة الوكيل، مستفيداً من OpenClaw والهوية القابلة للتحقق عبر السلسلة بواسطة agentId والتحقق من clawbot."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ApeChain NFT buying and bridging with quote and simulate flows","Generating verifiable onchain identities for OpenClaw bots","Monitoring agent activity with a live dashboard and structured telemetry"],"zh":["使用报价和模拟流程自动执行ApeChain NFT购买和桥接","为OpenClaw机器人生成可验证的区块链身份","使用实时仪表板和结构化遥测监控代理活动"],"ja":["見積もりとシミュレーションフローを使用してApeChain NFTの購入とブリッジを自動化する","OpenClawボット用の検証可能なブロックチェーンIDを生成する","リアルタイムダッシュボードと構造化テレメトリを使用してエージェント活動を監視する"],"ko":["견적 및 시뮬레이션 흐름을 사용하여 ApeChain NFT 구매 및 브리징 자동화","OpenClaw 봇을 위한 검증 가능한 블록체인 ID 생성","실시간 대시보드 및 구조화된 원격 측정을 사용하여 에이전트 활동 모니터링"],"es":["Automatización de la compra y bridging de NFT en ApeChain con flujos de cotización y simulación","Generación de identidades onchain verificables para bots de OpenClaw","Monitoreo de la actividad del agente con un panel en vivo y telemetría estructurada"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''achat et du bridging de NFT sur ApeChain avec des flux de cotation et de simulation","Génération d''identités onchain vérifiables pour les bots OpenClaw","Surveillance de l''activité des agents avec un tableau de bord en direct et une télémétrie structurée"],"de":["Automatisierung des Kaufs und Bridging von NFTs auf ApeChain mit Quote- und Simulate-Flows","Generierung verifizierbarer Onchain-Identitäten für OpenClaw-Bots","Überwachung der Agentenaktivität mit einem Live-Dashboard und strukturierter Telemetrie"],"pt":["Automatizar a compra e ponte de NFT ApeChain com fluxos de cotação e simulação","Gerar identidades verificáveis em cadeia para bots OpenClaw","Monitorar a atividade do agente com um painel de controle em tempo real e telemetria estruturada"],"ru":["Автоматизация покупки и моста NFT ApeChain с потоками котировки и имитации","Генерация верифицируемых идентичностей в цепи для ботов OpenClaw","Мониторинг активности агента с живым панелем управления и структурированной телеметрией"],"ar":["أتمتة شراء وربط NFT ApeChain مع تدفقات التسعير والمحاكاة","توليد هوية قابلة للتحقق على السلسلة لأبوتات OpenClaw","مراقبة نشاط الوكيل بلوحة تحكم مباشرة وتيليمتري مهيكلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires installation of Cursor and OpenClaw","Limited to ApeChain NFT operations","Needs policy guardrails and allowlist enforcement configuration"],"zh":["需要安装Cursor和OpenClaw","仅限ApeChain NFT操作","需要配置政策防护栏和允许列表执行"],"ja":["CursorおよびOpenClawのインストールが必要","ApeChain NFT操作のみ","ポリシーガードレールと許可リストの適用の構成が必要"],"ko":["Cursor 및 OpenClaw 설치 필요","ApeChain NFT 작업만 가능","정책 가드레일 및 허용 목록 적용 구성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Cursor y OpenClaw","Limitado a operaciones de NFT en ApeChain","Necesita la configuración de protecciones de políticas y la aplicación de listas de permitidos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Cursor et OpenClaw","Limité aux opérations de NFT sur ApeChain","Nécessite la configuration des garde-fous de stratégie et de la mise en œuvre de la liste blanche"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Cursor und OpenClaw","Beschränkt auf NFT-Operationen auf ApeChain","Benötigt die Konfiguration von Policy-Gardrails und der Durchsetzung von Allowlists"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do Cursor e OpenClaw","Limitado a operações de NFT ApeChain","Necessita de configuração de guardrails de política e aplicação de lista de permissões"],"ru":["Требует установки Cursor и OpenClaw","Ограничен операциями с NFT ApeChain","Требует настройки ограничений политики и применения белого списка"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Cursor و OpenClaw","محدود لعمليات NFT ApeChain","يحتاج إلى تكوين حواجز السياسة وتطبيق قائمة الموافقات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f74ffe5248ddfcfbb323988569a1f2b94f639357346da88b9ca4b26da4d5d690","qualityScore":45}');
