e código","Gestión de ramas y fusiones"],"fr":["Gestion de référentiels","Création de demandes d''extraction","Suivi des problèmes","Automatisation des flux de travail de CI/CD","Recherche et analyse de code","Gestion de branches et de fusions"],"de":["Repository-Verwaltung","Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Nachverfolgung von Problemen","Automatisierung von CI/CD-Workflows","Code-Suche und -Analyse","Verwaltung von Branches und Zusammenführungen"],"pt":["Criação de repositórios","Gerenciamento de pull requests","Gerenciamento de issues","Automação de fluxos de trabalho","Busca de código","Gerenciamento de branches"],"ru":["Создание репозиториев","Управление pull requests","Управление issues","Автоматизация рабочих процессов","Поиск кода","Управление ветками"],"ar":["إنشاء مستودعات","إدارة طلبات السحب","إدارة القضايا","تنفيذ عمليات آليّة للعمل","بحث الرمز","إدارة الفروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub 自动化","仓库管理","Pull Request","Issue 跟踪","分支管理","CI/CD 自动化","代码搜索","Claude Code"],"ja":["GitHub 自動化","リポジトリ管理","Pull Request","Issue フォローアップ","ブランチ管理","CI/CD 自動化","コード検索","Claude Code"],"ko":["GitHub 자동화","저장소 관리","Pull Request","이슈 추적","분기 관리","CI/CD 자동화","코드 검색","Claude Code"],"es":["automatización de GitHub","gestión de repositorios","creación de solicitudes de extracción","seguimiento de problemas","automatización de flujos de trabajo de CI/CD","búsqueda de código","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","productividad de desarrollo"],"fr":["automatisation de GitHub","gestion de référentiels","création de demandes d''extraction","suivi des problèmes","automatisation des flux de travail de CI/CD","recherche de code","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","productivité de développement"],"de":["GitHub-Automatisierung","Repository-Verwaltung","Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Nachverfolgung von Problemen","Automatisierung von CI/CD-Workflows","Code-Suche","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Entwicklungsproduktivität"],"pt":["automação de github","github automation","criação de repositórios","gerenciamento de pull requests","gerenciamento de issues","automação de fluxos de trabalho","busca de código","gerenciamento de branches"],"ru":["автоматизация github","github automation","создание репозиториев","управление pull requests","управление issues","автоматизация рабочих процессов","поиск кода","управление ветками"],"ar":["تنفيذ عمليات آليّة على github","github automation","إنشاء مستودعات","إدارة طلبات السحب","إدارة القضايا","تنفيذ عمليات آليّة للعمل","بحث الرمز","إدارة الفروع"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.570Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-automation","description":"自动化 GitHub 操作。当用户需要管理仓库、创建 PR、处理 Issue、自动化 CI/CD 或进行代码审查时使用此技能。","bodyPreview":"# GitHub 自动化操作\n\n## 功能说明\n此技能专门用于自动化 GitHub 平台的各种操作，包括：\n- 仓库管理和文件操作\n- Pull Request 创建和审查\n- Issue 管理和追踪\n- 分支管理和合并\n- CI/CD 工作流自动化\n- 代码搜索和分析\n\n## 使用场景\n- \"创建一个新的 GitHub 仓库\"\n- \"提交代码并创建 Pull Request\"\n- \"批量处理 GitHub Issues\"\n- \"自动化代码审查流程\"\n- \"搜索代码库中的特定代码\"\n- \"管理 GitHub Actions 工作流\"\n\n## 核心功能模块\n\n### 1. 仓库管理\n- **创建仓库**：创建新的公开或私有仓库\n- **Fork 仓库**：Fork 其他仓库到自己账户\n- **搜索仓库**：按关键词搜索仓库\n- **文件操作**：读取、创建、更新文件\n- **批量提交**：一次提交多个文件\n\n### 2. Pull Request 管理\n- **创建 PR**：从分支创建 Pull Request\n- **审查 PR**：添加评论和审查意见\n- **合并 PR**：合并","body":"# GitHub 自动化操作\n\n## 功能说明\n此技能专门用于自动化 GitHub 平台的各种操作，包括：\n- 仓库管理和文件操作\n- Pull Request 创建和审查\n- Issue 管理和追踪\n- 分支管理和合并\n- CI/CD 工作流自动化\n- 代码搜索和分析\n\n## 使用场景\n- \"创建一个新的 GitHub 仓库\"\n- \"提交代码并创建 Pull Request\"\n- \"批量处理 GitHub Issues\"\n- \"自动化代码审查流程\"\n- \"搜索代码库中的特定代码\"\n- \"管理 GitHub Actions 工作流\"\n\n## 核心功能模块\n\n### 1. 仓库管理\n- **创建仓库**：创建新的公开或私有仓库\n- **Fork 仓库**：Fork 其他仓库到自己账户\n- **搜索仓库**：按关键词搜索仓库\n- **文件操作**：读取、创建、更新文件\n- **批量提交**：一次提交多个文件\n\n### 2. Pull Request 管理\n- **创建 PR**：从分支创建 Pull Request\n- **审查 PR**：添加评论和审查意见\n- **合并 PR**：合并 Pull Request\n- **查看变更**：获取 PR 的文件变更\n- **状态检查**：查看 CI/CD 状态\n\n### 3. Issue 管理\n- **创建 Issue**：创建新的问题或任务\n- **更新 Issue**：修改状态、标签、负责人\n- **搜索 Issue**：按条件筛选 Issue\n- **添加评论**：在 Issue 中添加讨论\n- **批量操作**：批量处理多个 Issue\n\n### 4. 分支管理\n- **创建分支**：从指定分支创建新分支\n- **查看提交**：列出分支的提交历史\n- **分支保护**：配置分支保护规则\n- **合并策略**：选择合并方式（merge、squash、rebase）\n\n### 5. 代码搜索\n- **搜索代码**：在仓库中搜索代码片段\n- **搜索 Issue**：搜索问题和 PR\n- **搜索用户**：查找 GitHub 用户\n- **高级查询**：使用 GitHub 搜索语法\n\n## 工作流程\n\n### 标准开发流程\n1. **创建分支**：从 main 创建功能分支\n2. **开发代码**：编写和测试代码\n3. **提交变更**：提交文件到分支\n4. **创建 PR**：创建 Pull Request\n5. **代码审查**：团队审查代码\n6. **合并代码**：合并到主分支\n\n### 自动化发布流程\n1. **监听事件**：监听 push 或 tag 事件\n2. **运行测试**：执行自动化测试\n3. **构建项目**：编译和打包\n4. **创建 Release**：发布新版本\n5. **部署应用**：自动部署到生产环境\n\n### Issue 管理流程\n1. **创建 Issue**：报告问题或需求\n2. **分配任务**：指定负责人\n3. **添加标签**：分类和优先级\n4. **跟踪进度**：更新状态\n5. **关闭 Issue**：完成后关闭\n\n## 最佳实践\n\n### 提交规范\n- 使用清晰的提交信息\n- 遵循 Conventional Commits 规范\n- 一次提交解决一个问题\n- 包含必要的测试和文档\n\n### PR 规范\n- 提供详细的 PR 描述\n- 关联相关的 Issue\n- 确保 CI 检查通过\n- 及时响应审查意见\n- 保持 PR 大小适中\n\n### 分支策略\n- 使用 Git Flow 或 GitHub Flow\n- 保护主分支\n- 定期同步上游分支\n- 及时删除已合并的分支\n\n### 安全实践\n- 不提交敏感信息\n- 使用 GitHub Secrets 管理密钥\n- 启用双因素认证\n- 定期审查权限设置\n\n## 常用代码示例\n\n### 1. 创建仓库并提交文件\n```javascript\n// 创建仓库\nconst repo = await createRepository({\n  name: \"my-project\",\n  description: \"项目描述\",\n  private: false,\n  autoInit: true\n});\n\n// 批量提交文件\nawait pushFiles({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  branch: \"main\",\n  files: [\n    {\n      path: \"README.md\",\n      content: \"# My Project\\n\\n项目说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      path: \"src/index.js\",\n      content: \"console.log(''Hello World'');\"\n    }\n  ],\n  message: \"Initial commit\"\n});\n```\n\n### 2. 创建分支和 Pull Request\n```javascript\n// 创建新分支\nawait createBranch({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  branch: \"feature/new-feature\",\n  from_branch: \"main\"\n});\n\n// 提交代码到新分支\nawait createOrUpdateFile({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  path: \"src/feature.js\",\n  content: \"// 新功能代码\",\n  message: \"Add new feature\",\n  branch: \"feature/new-feature\"\n});\n\n// 创建 Pull Request\nawait createPullRequest({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  title: \"添加新功能\",\n  head: \"feature/new-feature\",\n  base: \"main\",\n  body: \"## 变更说明\\n- 添加了新功能\\n- 更新了文档\"\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Issue 管理\n```javascript\n// 创建 Issue\nconst issue = await createIssue({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  title: \"修复登录问题\",\n  body: \"## 问题描述\\n用户无法登录\\n\\n## 复现步骤\\n1. 打开登录页面\\n2. 输入凭证\\n3. 点击登录\",\n  labels: [\"bug\", \"high-priority\"],\n  assignees: [\"developer1\"]\n});\n\n// 添加评论\nawait addIssueComment({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  issue_number: issue.number,\n  body: \"正在调查此问题\"\n});\n\n// 更新 Issue\nawait updateIssue({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  issue_number: issue.number,\n  state: \"closed\",\n  labels: [\"bug\", \"fixed\"]\n});\n```\n\n### 4. 代码审查\n```javascript\n// 获取 PR 详情\nconst pr = await getPullRequest({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  pull_number: 123\n});\n\n// 获取 PR 文件变更\nconst files = await getPullRequestFiles({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  pull_number: 123\n});\n\n// 创建审查\nawait createPullRequestReview({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  pull_number: 123,\n  body: \"代码看起来不错，有几点建议\",\n  event: \"COMMENT\",\n  comments: [\n    {\n      path: \"src/index.js\",\n      line: 10,\n      body: \"建议添加错误处理\"\n    }\n  ]\n});\n\n// 合并 PR\nawait mergePullRequest({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  pull_number: 123,\n  merge_method: \"squash\",\n  commit_title: \"feat: 添加新功能\"\n});\n```\n\n### 5. 搜索和查询\n```javascript\n// 搜索代码\nconst codeResults = await searchCode({\n  q: \"function login repo:username/my-project\"\n});\n\n// 搜索 Issue\nconst issueResults = await searchIssues({\n  q: \"is:open label:bug repo:username/my-project\",\n  sort: \"created\",\n  order: \"desc\"\n});\n\n// 搜索仓库\nconst repoResults = await searchRepositories({\n  query: \"react stars:>1000 language:javascript\"\n});\n```\n\n## GitHub Actions 集成\n\n### 自动化测试\n```yaml\nname: CI\non: [push, pull_request]\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n      - name: Run tests\n        run: npm test\n```\n\n### 自动化部署\n```yaml\nname: Deploy\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n      - name: Deploy\n        run: ./deploy.sh\n```\n\n## 集成场景\n\n### 1. 自动化代码审查\n- 监听 PR 创建事件\n- 运行代码质量检查\n- 自动添加审查评论\n- 标记需要改进的地方\n\n### 2. Issue 自动分类\n- 监听 Issue 创建\n- 分析 Issue 内容\n- 自动添加标签\n- 分配给合适的人员\n\n### 3. 发布管理\n- 监听版本标签\n- 生成变更日志\n- 创建 GitHub Release\n- 通知团队成员\n\n### 4. 依赖更新\n- 定期检查依赖更新\n- 创建更新 PR\n- 运行测试验证\n- 自动合并安全更新\n\n## 注意事项\n- 遵守 GitHub API 速率限制\n- 使用 Personal Access Token 认证\n- 正确处理 API 错误和重试\n- 保护敏感信息和密钥\n- 遵循开源项目贡献指南\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:19:50.832Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring streamlined GitHub workflow automation and repository management.","zh":"适用于需要简化 GitHub 工作流自动化和仓库管理的 DevOps 代理。","ja":"GitHub のワークフロー自動化とリポジトリ管理をストリームライン化する必要がある DevOps エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 워크플로 자동화 및 리포지토리 관리를 간소화해야 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren una automatización de flujo de trabajo de GitHub y administración de repositorios optimizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une automation du workflow GitHub et une gestion de référentiels optimisés.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine optimierte Automatisierung des GitHub-Workflows und eine Repository-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem automação de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub e gerenciamento de repositório simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих оптимизированной автоматизации рабочего процесса GitHub и управления репозиторием.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء DevOps التي تتطلب تسهيل 자동 للعملية العاملة لجيت هاب وإدارة المستودع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate GitHub operations, including CI/CD workflow automation, Pull Request creation, and Issue management, utilizing GitHub Actions and APIs for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理自动化 GitHub 操作的能力，包括 CI/CD 工作流自动化、Pull Request 创建和问题管理，利用 GitHub Actions 和 API 实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントに GitHub 操作の自動化能力を付与し、CI/CD ワークフロー自動化、Pull Request の作成、課題管理などを GitHub Actions と API を使用してシームレスに統合します。","ko":"에이전트에 GitHub 작업을 자동화 할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 CI/CD 워크플로 자동화, 풀 요청 생성, 이슈 관리 등을 GitHub Actions 및 API를 사용하여無縫に統合합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar operaciones de GitHub, incluyendo la automatización del flujo de trabajo de CI/CD, la creación de solicitudes de extracción y la administración de incidencias, utilizando GitHub Actions y API para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations GitHub, y compris l''automatisation du workflow CI/CD, la création de demandes d''extraction et la gestion des problèmes, en utilisant GitHub Actions et API pour une intégration sans interruption.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, GitHub-Operationen zu automatisieren, einschließlich der Automatisierung von CI/CD-Workflows, der Erstellung von Pull-Requests und der Verwaltung von Issues, unter Verwendung von GitHub Actions und APIs für eine nahtlose Integration.","pt":"Habilita agentes a automatizar operações do GitHub, incluindo automação de fluxo de trabalho de CI/CD, criação de Solicitações de Pull e gerenciamento de problemas, utilizando ações e APIs do GitHub para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции GitHub, включая автоматизацию рабочего процесса CI/CD, создание запросов на Pull и управление проблемами, используя действия и API GitHub для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تسهيل عمليات جيت هاب، بما في ذلك автоматизация عملية CI/CD، وإنشاء طلبات السحب وإدارة المشكلات، باستخدام إجراءات وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات لجيت هاب من أجل التكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating repository creation and management","Streamlining Pull Request creation and review processes","Batch processing GitHub Issues for efficient tracking","Searching and analyzing codebases for specific snippets"],"zh":["自动化仓库创建和管理","简化 Pull Request 创建和审查过程","批量处理 GitHub 问题以实现高效跟踪","搜索和分析代码库以查找特定代码片段"],"ja":["リポジトリの作成と管理を自動化する","Pull Request の作成とレビューのプロセスをストリームライン化する","GitHub の課題をバッチ処理して効率的に追跡する","コードベースを検索して特定のコードスニペットを分析する"],"ko":["리포지토리 생성 및 관리를 자동화하는 것","풀 요청 생성 및审查 프로세스를 간소화하는 것","GitHub 이슈를 일괄 처리하여 효율적으로 추적하는 것","코드베이스를 검색하여 특정 코드 조각을 분석하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la creación y administración de repositorios","Optimización de los procesos de creación y revisión de solicitudes de extracción","Procesamiento por lotes de problemas de GitHub para un seguimiento eficiente","Búsqueda y análisis de bases de código para fragmentos de código específicos"],"fr":["Automation de la création et de la gestion de référentiels","Optimisation des processus de création et d''examen des demandes d''extraction","Traitement par lot des problèmes GitHub pour un suivi efficace","Recherche et analyse de bases de code pour des extraits de code spécifiques"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung und Verwaltung von Repositories","Optimierung der Prozesse für die Erstellung und Überprüfung von Pull-Requests","Batchverarbeitung von GitHub-Problemen für eine effiziente Nachverfolgung","Suche und Analyse von Codebasen nach bestimmten Code-Snippets"],"pt":["Automatizar criação e gerenciamento de repositórios","Simplificar processos de criação e revisão de Solicitações de Pull","Processamento em lote de problemas do GitHub para acompanhamento eficiente","Pesquisar e analisar código-fonte para trechos específicos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание и управление репозиториями","Упростить процессы создания и рассмотрения запросов на Pull","Пакетная обработка проблем GitHub для эффективного отслеживания","Поиск и анализ исходного кода для определенных фрагментов"],"ar":["توسيط автомاتي لإنشاء وإدارة المستودعات","تسهيل عمليات إنشاء ومراجعة طلبات السحب","معالجة الدفعات لمشاكل جيت هاب من أجل تتبع فعال","البحث والتحليل لتدوين المصدر لقطع معينة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access and authentication","Limited to GitHub platform operations"],"zh":["需要 GitHub API 访问和身份验证","仅限 GitHub 平台操作"],"ja":["GitHub API へのアクセスと認証が必要","GitHub プラットフォーム操作のみ"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스 및 인증이 필요","GitHub 플랫폼 작업만"],"es":["Requiere acceso y autenticación de la API de GitHub","Limitado a operaciones de la plataforma GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès et une authentification à l''API GitHub","Limité aux opérations de la plate-forme GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff und Authentifizierung auf die GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf Operationen der GitHub-Plattform"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do GitHub e autenticação","Limitado a operações da plataforma GitHub"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API GitHub и аутентификации","Ограничен операциями платформы GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لجيت هاب والتحقق","محدود لعمليات منصة جيت هاب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"02ae85a1a3437f52fbea300a7007ec11ca27a597fa86fe6ac9d8bbe9666eff28","qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YPYT1/All-skills/github-kb', 'community', 'YPYT1', 'All-skills', 'YPYT1/All-skills', 'github-kb', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-20T04:13:19.571Z', '2026-02-20T04:23:00.870Z', '8d62830e2d00b0b63fe36620febd451b583dbcfad38acf354a1d77942401e303', '{"id":"YPYT1/All-skills/github-kb","name":"github-kb","description":{"zh":"GitHub 知识库管理工具，用于管理和搜索 GitHub 项目。支持设置环境变量和使用 gh CLI","ja":"GitHub ナレッジベース管理ツールは、GitHub プロジェクトを管理および検索するために使用されます。環境変数の設定と gh CLI の使用をサポート","ko":"GitHub 지식庫 관리 도구는 GitHub 프로젝트를 관리 및 검색하는 데 사용됩니다. 환경 변수 설정 및 gh CLI 사용 지원","es":"La base de conocimientos de GitHub es una herramienta para gestionar y buscar proyectos en un repositorio local","fr":"La base de connaissances GitHub est un outil pour gérer et rechercher des projets dans un référentiel local","de":"Die GitHub-Wissensbasis ist ein Tool zur Verwaltung und Suche von Projekten in einem lokalen Repository","pt":"O GitHub Knowledge Base é uma ferramenta para gerenciar conhecimento e realizar buscas no GitHub","ru":"База знаний GitHub - это инструмент для управления знаниями и поиска в GitHub","ar":"قاعدة معرفة جيثب هي أداة لإدارة المعرفة والبحث في جيثب","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"GitHub 知识库管理","ja":"GitHub ナレッジベース管理","ko":"GitHub 지식庫 관리","es":"GitHub Knowledge Base: gestión de conocimientos","fr":"Base de connaissances GitHub : gestion des connaissances","de":"GitHub-Wissensbasis: Wissensmanagement","pt":"GitHub Knowledge Base: Gerenciamento de Conhecimento","ru":"База знаний GitHub: Управление знаниями","ar":"قاعدة معرفة جيثب: إدارة المعرفة","en":"github-kb"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub 知识库管理工具，用于管理和搜索 GitHub 项目。支持设置环境变量和使用 gh CLI","ja":"GitHub ナレッジベース管理ツールは、GitHub プロジェクトを管理および検索するために使用されます。環境変数の設定と gh CLI の使用をサポート","ko":"GitHub 지식庫 관리 도구는 GitHub 프로젝트를 관리 및 검색하는 데 사용됩니다. 환경 변수 설정 및 gh CLI 사용 지원","es":"La base de conocimientos de GitHub es una herramienta para gestionar y buscar proyectos en un repositorio local","fr":"La base de connaissances GitHub est un outil pour gérer et rechercher des projets dans un référentiel local","de":"Die GitHub-Wissensbasis ist ein Tool zur Verwaltung und Suche von Projekten in einem lokalen Repository","pt":"O GitHub Knowledge Base é uma ferramenta para gerenciar conhecimento e realizar buscas no GitHub","ru":"База знаний GitHub - это инструмент для управления знаниями и поиска в GitHub","ar":"قاعدة معرفة جيثب هي أداة لإدارة المعرفة والبحث في جيثب","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"definition":{"en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"features":{"zh":["支持设置环境变量","使用 gh CLI 进行搜索","管理本地 GitHub 知识库","支持私有仓库","轻松搜索 GitHub 项目"],"ja":["環境変数の設定をサポート","gh CLI を使用して検索","ローカル GitHub ナレッジベースを管理","プライベートリポジトリをサポート","GitHub プロジェクトを簡単に検索"],"ko":["환경 변수 설정 지원","gh CLI를 사용하여 검색","로컬 GitHub 지식庫 관리","사립 저장소를 지원","GitHub 프로젝트를 쉽게 검색"],"es":["Gestión de un repositorio de conocimientos de GitHub local","Búsqueda de proyectos con gh CLI","Configuración de variables de entorno para el acceso a repositorios privados","Catalogación de proyectos con descripciones breves en GITHUB_KB.md","Personalización del camino del directorio de la base de conocimientos"],"fr":["Gestion d''une base de connaissances GitHub locale","Recherche de projets avec gh CLI","Configuration de variables d''environnement pour l''accès aux référentiels privés","Catalogage de projets avec des descriptions brèves dans GITHUB_KB.md","Personnalisation du chemin du répertoire de la base de connaissances"],"de":["Verwaltung eines lokalen GitHub-Wissensrepositories","Suche von Projekten mit gh CLI","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen für den Zugriff auf private Repositorys","Katalogisierung von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen in GITHUB_KB.md","Anpassung des Pfads des Wissensrepository-Verzeichnisses"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de base de conhecimento local","Busca via CLI do GitHub","Suporte a repositórios privados","Configuração de variáveis de ambiente","Catalogação de projetos com descrições breves"],"ru":["Управление локальной базой знаний","Поиск через CLI GitHub","Поддержка приватных репозиториев","Настройка переменных среды","Каталогизация проектов с краткими описаниями"],"ar":["إدارة قاعدة معرفة محلية","البحث من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر لجيثب","دعم للمستودعات الخاصة","تكوين متغيرات البيئة","فهرسة المشاريع مع описات موجزة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub 知识库管理","GitHub 项目管理","gh CLI","环境变量设置","私有仓库管理","GitHub 搜索"],"ja":["GitHub ナレッジベース管理","GitHub プロジェクト管理","gh CLI","環境変数設定","プライベートリポジトリ管理","GitHub 検索"],"ko":["GitHub 지식庫 관리","GitHub 프로젝트 관리","gh CLI","환경 변수 설정","사립 저장소 관리","GitHub 검색"],"es":["github knowledge base","gestión de conocimientos","búsqueda de proyectos","gh cli","repositorio local","variables de entorno","acceso a repositorios privados"],"fr":["base de connaissances github","gestion des connaissances","recherche de projets","gh cli","référentiel local","variables d''environnement","accès aux référentiels privés"],"de":["github-wissensbasis","wissensmanagement","suche von projekten","gh cli","lokales repository","umgebungsvariablen","zugriff auf private repositorys"],"pt":["github knowledge base","gerenciamento de conhecimento","busca no github","cli do github","repositórios privados","variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["база знаний github","управление знаниями","поиск в github","cli github","приватные репозитории","переменные среды"],"ar":["قاعدة معرفة جيثب","إدارة المعرفة","البحث في جيثب","واجهة سطر الأوامر لجيثب","المستودعات الخاصة","متغيرات البيئة"]}},"owner":"YPYT1","repo":"All-skills","repoPath":"YPYT1/All-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.571Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-kb","description":"Manage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Use when users ask about repos, PRs, issues, request to clone GitHub repositories, explore codebases, or need information about GitHub projects. Supports searching GitHub via gh CLI and managing local KB with GITHUB_KB.md catalog. Configure via GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH environment variables.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GIT","body":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GITHUB_KB_PATH=\"/your/path/github-kb\"\n```\n\n**Token Privacy:** Never hardcode tokens. Inject via environment variables or container secrets.\n\n## GitHub CLI (gh)\n\n**Requirement:** GitHub CLI must be installed and authenticated.\n\n**Installation:**\n- **macOS:** `brew install gh`\n- **Linux:** `apt install gh` or see [official install guide](https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/docs/install_linux.md)\n- **Windows:** `winget install GitHub.cli`\n\n**Authentication:**\n```bash\n# Interactive login\ngh auth login\n\n# Or use token from GITHUB_TOKEN env var\ngh auth login --with-token <(echo \"$GITHUB_TOKEN\")\n```\n\n**Verify:** `gh auth status`\n\nIf `gh` is not installed or not authenticated, skip search operations and use only local KB features.\n\n### Searching Repos\n\n```bash\n# Search repos by keyword\ngh search repos <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search repos \"typescript cli\" --limit 10\ngh search repos \"language:python stars:>1000\" --limit 20\ngh search repos \"topic:mcp\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by programming language\n- `stars:<n>` or `stars:><n>` - Filter by star count\n- `topic:<name>` - Filter by topic\n- `user:<owner>` - Search within a user''s repos\n- `org:<org>` - Search within an organization\n\n### Searching Issues\n\n```bash\ngh search issues \"react hooks bug\" --limit 20\ngh search issues \"repo:facebook/react state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search issues \"language:typescript label:bug\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed` - Filter by issue state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `comments:<n>` or `comments:><n>` - Filter by comment count\n\n### Searching Pull Requests\n\n```bash\n# Search PRs\ngh search prs <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search prs \"repo:vercel/next.js state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search prs \"language:go is:merged\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed|merged` - Filter by PR state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `is:merged|unmerged` - Filter by merge status\n\n### Viewing PR/Issue Details\n\n```bash\n# View issue/PR details\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\n\n# View with comments\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\n```\n\n## Local Knowledge Base Workflow\n\n### Querying About a Repo in KB\n\n1. Read GITHUB_KB.md to understand what projects exist\n2. Locate the project directory under ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/\n\n### Cloning a New Repo to KB\n\n1. Search GitHub if the full repo name is not known\n2. Clone to KB directory:\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<name>.git ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/<name>\n   ```\n3. Generate project description: Read README or key files to understand the project\n4. Update GITHUB_KB.md: Add entry for the new repo following the existing format:\n   ```markdown\n   ### [<name>](/<name>)\n   Brief one-line description of what the project does. Additional context if useful (key features, tech stack, etc.).\n   ```\n5. Confirm completion: Tell user the repo was cloned and where to find it\n\n### Default Clone Location\n\nIf user says \"clone X\" without specifying a directory, default to ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/.\n\n## GITHUB_KB.md Format\n\nThe catalog file follows this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nThis directory contains X GitHub projects covering various domains.\n\n---\n\n## Category Name\n\n### [project-name](/project-name)\nBrief description of the project.\n```\n\nMaintain categorization and consistent formatting when updating.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:23:00.870Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing unified access to GitHub repositories and knowledge bases via the gh CLI.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 gh CLI 统一访问 GitHub 仓库和知识库的 AI 代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリとナレッジベースへの統一されたアクセスが必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 저장소 및 지식 베이스에 대한統一された 액세스가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan acceso unificado a los repositorios de GitHub y bases de conocimiento a través de la CLI de gh.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin d''un accès unifié aux référentiels GitHub et aux bases de connaissances via la CLI gh.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die einen einheitlichen Zugriff auf GitHub-Repositorys und Wissensbasen über die gh-CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de acesso unificado a repositórios e bases de conhecimento do GitHub via a CLI do gh.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуется единый доступ к репозиториям и базам знаний GitHub через CLI gh.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى الوصول الموحد إلى مستودعات GitHub وقواعد المعرفة عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر gh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage a local GitHub knowledge base, providing GitHub search capabilities and cataloging projects with brief descriptions using environment variables like GITHUB_TOKEN for private repository access.","zh":"赋予代理管理本地 GitHub 知识库的能力，提供 GitHub 搜索功能，并使用环境变量（如 GITHUB_TOKEN）对项目进行编目和简要描述，以实现对私有仓库的访问。","ja":"エージェントにローカルな GitHub ナレッジベースを管理する能力を与え、GitHub 検索機能を提供し、環境変数（例：GITHUB_TOKEN）を使用してプロジェクトをカタログ化し、プライベート リポジトリにアクセスします。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 GitHub 지식베이스를 관리할 수 있도록 하며 GitHub 검색 기능을 제공하고 환경 변수(GITHUB_TOKEN 등)를 사용하여 프로젝트를 카탈로그화하고、私有 저장소에 액세스할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes administrar una base de conocimiento de GitHub local, proporcionando capacidades de búsqueda de GitHub y catalogación de proyectos con descripciones breves utilizando variables de entorno como GITHUB_TOKEN para el acceso a repositorios privados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer une base de connaissances GitHub locale, en fournissant des capacités de recherche GitHub et en cataloguant les projets avec des descriptions brèves en utilisant des variables d''environnement comme GITHUB_TOKEN pour l''accès aux référentiels privés.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, eine lokale GitHub-Wissensbasis zu verwalten, indem es GitHub-Suchfunktionen und die Katalogisierung von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen unter Verwendung von Umgebungsvariablen wie GITHUB_TOKEN für den Zugriff auf private Repositorys bereitstellt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar uma base de conhecimento local do GitHub, fornecendo capacidades de pesquisa do GitHub e catalogação de projetos com descrições breves usando variáveis de ambiente como GITHUB_TOKEN para acesso a repositórios privados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять локальной базой знаний GitHub, обеспечивая возможности поиска GitHub и каталогизации проектов с краткими описаниями с использованием переменных среды, таких как GITHUB_TOKEN, для доступа к частным репозиториям.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة قاعدة معرفة محلية لجيت هاب، وتوفير قدرات البحث في جيت هاب وتسجيل المشاريع مع описات موجزة باستخدام متغيرات بيئية مثل GITHUB_TOKEN للوصول إلى المستودعات الخاصة."},"useCases":{"en":["Cataloging projects with brief descriptions in GITHUB_KB.md","Searching GitHub repositories via gh CLI","Managing local knowledge base directories with GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"zh":["在 GITHUB_KB.md 中对项目进行编目和简要描述","通过 gh CLI 搜索 GitHub 仓库","使用 GITHUB_KB_PATH 管理本地知识库目录"],"ja":["GITHUB_KB.md にプロジェクトをカタログ化し簡単な説明を追加する","gh CLI経由で GitHub リポジトリを検索する","GITHUB_KB_PATH を使用してローカルナレッジベース ディレクトリを管理する"],"ko":["GITHUB_KB.md에 프로젝트를 카탈로그화하고 간단한 설명을 추가하는 것","gh CLI를 통해 GitHub 저장소를 검색하는 것","GITHUB_KB_PATH를 사용하여 로컬 지식베이스 디렉토리를 관리하는 것"],"es":["Catalogación de proyectos con descripciones breves en GITHUB_KB.md","Búsqueda de repositorios de GitHub a través de la CLI de gh","Administración de directorios de la base de conocimiento local con GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"fr":["Catalogage de projets avec des descriptions brèves dans GITHUB_KB.md","Recherche de référentiels GitHub via la CLI gh","Gestion des répertoires de la base de connaissances locale avec GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"de":["Katalogisierung von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen in GITHUB_KB.md","Suche von GitHub-Repositorys über die gh-CLI","Verwaltung von lokalen Wissensbasisverzeichnissen mit GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"pt":["Catalogação de projetos com descrições breves em GITHUB_KB.md","Pesquisa de repositórios do GitHub via CLI do gh","Gerenciamento de diretórios de base de conhecimento local com GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ru":["Каталогизация проектов с краткими описаниями в GITHUB_KB.md","Поиск репозиториев GitHub через CLI gh","Управление локальными каталогами базы знаний с помощью GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ar":["تسجيل المشاريع مع описات موجزة في GITHUB_KB.md","البحث في مستودعات جيت هاب عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","إدارة دليل قاعدة المعرفة المحلية مع GITHUB_KB_PATH"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Personal Access Token for private repositories","Needs environment variables set for GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 个人访问令牌来访问私有仓库","需要设置 GITHUB_TOKEN 和 GITHUB_KB_PATH 等环境变量"],"ja":["プライベート リポジトリにアクセスするために GitHub パーソナル アクセス トークンが必要","GITHUB_TOKEN および GITHUB_KB_PATH などの環境変数を設定する必要がある"],"ko":["개인 저장소에 액세스하기 위해 GitHub 개인 액세스 토큰이 필요함","GITHUB_TOKEN 및 GITHUB_KB_PATH 등의 환경 변수를 설정해야 함"],"es":["Requiere un token de acceso personal de GitHub para los repositorios privados","Necesita variables de entorno configuradas para GITHUB_TOKEN y GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''accès personnel GitHub pour les référentiels privés","Nécessite des variables d''environnement configurées pour GITHUB_TOKEN et GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"de":["Benötigt ein GitHub-Personal-Zugriffstoken für private Repositorys","Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen, die für GITHUB_TOKEN und GITHUB_KB_PATH konfiguriert sind"],"pt":["Requer Token de Acesso Pessoal do GitHub para repositórios privados","Necessita de variáveis de ambiente configuradas para GITHUB_TOKEN e GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ru":["Требует личного токена доступа GitHub для частных репозиториев","Требует настройки переменных среды для GITHUB_TOKEN и GITHUB_KB_PATH"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز الوصول الشخصي لجيت هاب للمستودعات الخاصة","يحتاج إلى تعيين متغيرات البيئة ل GITHUB_TOKEN و GITHUB_KB_PATH"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8d62830e2d00b0b63fe36620febd451b583dbcfad38acf354a1d77942401e303","qualityScore":45}');
