إدارة المستودعات","التكامل مع CI/CD","تحليل الشفرة","إدارة المشكلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub 自动化工具","AI 工具","仓库管理","PR 创建","Issue 处理","CI/CD 自动化","代码审查","GitHub API","自动化脚本"],"ja":["GitHub 自動化ツール","AI エージェント","リポジトリ管理","PR 作成","Issue 処理","CI/CD 自動化","コードレビュー","GitHub API","自動化スクリプト"],"ko":["GitHub 자동화 도구","AI 에이전트","저장소 관리","PR 생성","이슈 처리","CI/CD 자동화","코드 검토","GitHub API","자동화 스크립트"],"es":["herramientas de automatización de GitHub","cómo usar GitHub","qué es la automatización de GitHub","alternativas a GitHub","GitHub vs GitLab","instalación de GitHub","guía de configuración de GitHub"],"fr":["outils d''automatisation GitHub","comment utiliser GitHub","qu''est-ce que l''automatisation GitHub","alternatives à GitHub","GitHub vs GitLab","installation de GitHub","guide de configuration de GitHub"],"de":["GitHub-Automatisierungstools","wie man GitHub verwendet","was ist die GitHub-Automatisierung","Alternativen zu GitHub","GitHub vs GitLab","Installation von GitHub","Konfigurationsanleitung für GitHub"],"pt":["ferramentas de automação do github","como usar o github","o que é ia","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","github vs gitlab","instalar github","guia de configuração do github"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для GitHub","автоматизация операций на GitHub","что такое ИИ","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","GitHub vs GitLab","установка GitHub","руководство по настройке GitHub"],"ar":["أدوات الإدارة الآلية على GitHub","كيفية استخدام GitHub","ما هو الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","GitHub vs GitLab","تثبيت GitHub","دليل إعداد GitHub"]}},"owner":"NeverSight","repo":"skills_feed","repoPath":"NeverSight/skills_feed","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.572Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-automation","description":"自动化 GitHub 操作。当用户需要管理仓库、创建 PR、处理 Issue、自动化 CI/CD 或进行代码审查时使用此技能。","bodyPreview":"# GitHub 自动化操作\n\n## 功能说明\n此技能专门用于自动化 GitHub 平台的各种操作，包括：\n- 仓库管理和文件操作\n- Pull Request 创建和审查\n- Issue 管理和追踪\n- 分支管理和合并\n- CI/CD 工作流自动化\n- 代码搜索和分析\n\n## 使用场景\n- \"创建一个新的 GitHub 仓库\"\n- \"提交代码并创建 Pull Request\"\n- \"批量处理 GitHub Issues\"\n- \"自动化代码审查流程\"\n- \"搜索代码库中的特定代码\"\n- \"管理 GitHub Actions 工作流\"\n\n## 核心功能模块\n\n### 1. 仓库管理\n- **创建仓库**：创建新的公开或私有仓库\n- **Fork 仓库**：Fork 其他仓库到自己账户\n- **搜索仓库**：按关键词搜索仓库\n- **文件操作**：读取、创建、更新文件\n- **批量提交**：一次提交多个文件\n\n### 2. Pull Request 管理\n- **创建 PR**：从分支创建 Pull Request\n- **审查 PR**：添加评论和审查意见\n- **合并 PR**：合并","body":"# GitHub 自动化操作\n\n## 功能说明\n此技能专门用于自动化 GitHub 平台的各种操作，包括：\n- 仓库管理和文件操作\n- Pull Request 创建和审查\n- Issue 管理和追踪\n- 分支管理和合并\n- CI/CD 工作流自动化\n- 代码搜索和分析\n\n## 使用场景\n- \"创建一个新的 GitHub 仓库\"\n- \"提交代码并创建 Pull Request\"\n- \"批量处理 GitHub Issues\"\n- \"自动化代码审查流程\"\n- \"搜索代码库中的特定代码\"\n- \"管理 GitHub Actions 工作流\"\n\n## 核心功能模块\n\n### 1. 仓库管理\n- **创建仓库**：创建新的公开或私有仓库\n- **Fork 仓库**：Fork 其他仓库到自己账户\n- **搜索仓库**：按关键词搜索仓库\n- **文件操作**：读取、创建、更新文件\n- **批量提交**：一次提交多个文件\n\n### 2. Pull Request 管理\n- **创建 PR**：从分支创建 Pull Request\n- **审查 PR**：添加评论和审查意见\n- **合并 PR**：合并 Pull Request\n- **查看变更**：获取 PR 的文件变更\n- **状态检查**：查看 CI/CD 状态\n\n### 3. Issue 管理\n- **创建 Issue**：创建新的问题或任务\n- **更新 Issue**：修改状态、标签、负责人\n- **搜索 Issue**：按条件筛选 Issue\n- **添加评论**：在 Issue 中添加讨论\n- **批量操作**：批量处理多个 Issue\n\n### 4. 分支管理\n- **创建分支**：从指定分支创建新分支\n- **查看提交**：列出分支的提交历史\n- **分支保护**：配置分支保护规则\n- **合并策略**：选择合并方式（merge、squash、rebase）\n\n### 5. 代码搜索\n- **搜索代码**：在仓库中搜索代码片段\n- **搜索 Issue**：搜索问题和 PR\n- **搜索用户**：查找 GitHub 用户\n- **高级查询**：使用 GitHub 搜索语法\n\n## 工作流程\n\n### 标准开发流程\n1. **创建分支**：从 main 创建功能分支\n2. **开发代码**：编写和测试代码\n3. **提交变更**：提交文件到分支\n4. **创建 PR**：创建 Pull Request\n5. **代码审查**：团队审查代码\n6. **合并代码**：合并到主分支\n\n### 自动化发布流程\n1. **监听事件**：监听 push 或 tag 事件\n2. **运行测试**：执行自动化测试\n3. **构建项目**：编译和打包\n4. **创建 Release**：发布新版本\n5. **部署应用**：自动部署到生产环境\n\n### Issue 管理流程\n1. **创建 Issue**：报告问题或需求\n2. **分配任务**：指定负责人\n3. **添加标签**：分类和优先级\n4. **跟踪进度**：更新状态\n5. **关闭 Issue**：完成后关闭\n\n## 最佳实践\n\n### 提交规范\n- 使用清晰的提交信息\n- 遵循 Conventional Commits 规范\n- 一次提交解决一个问题\n- 包含必要的测试和文档\n\n### PR 规范\n- 提供详细的 PR 描述\n- 关联相关的 Issue\n- 确保 CI 检查通过\n- 及时响应审查意见\n- 保持 PR 大小适中\n\n### 分支策略\n- 使用 Git Flow 或 GitHub Flow\n- 保护主分支\n- 定期同步上游分支\n- 及时删除已合并的分支\n\n### 安全实践\n- 不提交敏感信息\n- 使用 GitHub Secrets 管理密钥\n- 启用双因素认证\n- 定期审查权限设置\n\n## 常用代码示例\n\n### 1. 创建仓库并提交文件\n```javascript\n// 创建仓库\nconst repo = await createRepository({\n  name: \"my-project\",\n  description: \"项目描述\",\n  private: false,\n  autoInit: true\n});\n\n// 批量提交文件\nawait pushFiles({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  branch: \"main\",\n  files: [\n    {\n      path: \"README.md\",\n      content: \"# My Project\\n\\n项目说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      path: \"src/index.js\",\n      content: \"console.log(''Hello World'');\"\n    }\n  ],\n  message: \"Initial commit\"\n});\n```\n\n### 2. 创建分支和 Pull Request\n```javascript\n// 创建新分支\nawait createBranch({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  branch: \"feature/new-feature\",\n  from_branch: \"main\"\n});\n\n// 提交代码到新分支\nawait createOrUpdateFile({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  path: \"src/feature.js\",\n  content: \"// 新功能代码\",\n  message: \"Add new feature\",\n  branch: \"feature/new-feature\"\n});\n\n// 创建 Pull Request\nawait createPullRequest({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  title: \"添加新功能\",\n  head: \"feature/new-feature\",\n  base: \"main\",\n  body: \"## 变更说明\\n- 添加了新功能\\n- 更新了文档\"\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Issue 管理\n```javascript\n// 创建 Issue\nconst issue = await createIssue({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  title: \"修复登录问题\",\n  body: \"## 问题描述\\n用户无法登录\\n\\n## 复现步骤\\n1. 打开登录页面\\n2. 输入凭证\\n3. 点击登录\",\n  labels: [\"bug\", \"high-priority\"],\n  assignees: [\"developer1\"]\n});\n\n// 添加评论\nawait addIssueComment({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  issue_number: issue.number,\n  body: \"正在调查此问题\"\n});\n\n// 更新 Issue\nawait updateIssue({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  issue_number: issue.number,\n  state: \"closed\",\n  labels: [\"bug\", \"fixed\"]\n});\n```\n\n### 4. 代码审查\n```javascript\n// 获取 PR 详情\nconst pr = await getPullRequest({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  pull_number: 123\n});\n\n// 获取 PR 文件变更\nconst files = await getPullRequestFiles({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  pull_number: 123\n});\n\n// 创建审查\nawait createPullRequestReview({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  pull_number: 123,\n  body: \"代码看起来不错，有几点建议\",\n  event: \"COMMENT\",\n  comments: [\n    {\n      path: \"src/index.js\",\n      line: 10,\n      body: \"建议添加错误处理\"\n    }\n  ]\n});\n\n// 合并 PR\nawait mergePullRequest({\n  owner: \"username\",\n  repo: \"my-project\",\n  pull_number: 123,\n  merge_method: \"squash\",\n  commit_title: \"feat: 添加新功能\"\n});\n```\n\n### 5. 搜索和查询\n```javascript\n// 搜索代码\nconst codeResults = await searchCode({\n  q: \"function login repo:username/my-project\"\n});\n\n// 搜索 Issue\nconst issueResults = await searchIssues({\n  q: \"is:open label:bug repo:username/my-project\",\n  sort: \"created\",\n  order: \"desc\"\n});\n\n// 搜索仓库\nconst repoResults = await searchRepositories({\n  query: \"react stars:>1000 language:javascript\"\n});\n```\n\n## GitHub Actions 集成\n\n### 自动化测试\n```yaml\nname: CI\non: [push, pull_request]\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n      - name: Run tests\n        run: npm test\n```\n\n### 自动化部署\n```yaml\nname: Deploy\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v2\n      - name: Deploy\n        run: ./deploy.sh\n```\n\n## 集成场景\n\n### 1. 自动化代码审查\n- 监听 PR 创建事件\n- 运行代码质量检查\n- 自动添加审查评论\n- 标记需要改进的地方\n\n### 2. Issue 自动分类\n- 监听 Issue 创建\n- 分析 Issue 内容\n- 自动添加标签\n- 分配给合适的人员\n\n### 3. 发布管理\n- 监听版本标签\n- 生成变更日志\n- 创建 GitHub Release\n- 通知团队成员\n\n### 4. 依赖更新\n- 定期检查依赖更新\n- 创建更新 PR\n- 运行测试验证\n- 自动合并安全更新\n\n## 注意事项\n- 遵守 GitHub API 速率限制\n- 使用 Personal Access Token 认证\n- 正确处理 API 错误和重试\n- 保护敏感信息和密钥\n- 遵循开源项目贡献指南\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:22:15.626Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing automated GitHub repository management and CI/CD workflow optimization.","zh":"适用于需要自动化GitHub仓库管理和CI/CD工作流优化的DevOps代理。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントがGitHubリポジトリの管理とCI/CDワークフローの最適化を自動化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 GitHub 저장소 관리 및 CI/CD 워크플로 최적화가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una gestión automática de repositorios de GitHub y una optimización del flujo de trabajo de CI/CD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''une gestion automatisée des référentiels GitHub et d''une optimisation du workflow CI/CD.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte GitHub-Repository-Verwaltung und eine Optimierung des CI/CD-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de gerenciamento automático de repositórios GitHub e otimização de fluxos de trabalho CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым требуется автоматическое управление репозиториями GitHub и оптимизация рабочих процессов CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مستودع GitHub التلقائي وتحسين سير عمل CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate GitHub Actions workflows, manage Pull Requests, and perform code analysis using GitHub APIs and webhooks, streamlining development and deployment processes.","zh":"赋予代理自动化GitHub Actions工作流、管理Pull请求并使用GitHub API和Webhook进行代码分析，简化开发和部署流程。","ja":"エージェントにGitHub Actionsワークフローを自動化し、プルリクエストを管理し、GitHub APIとWebhookを使用してコード分析を行うことを可能にし、開発とデプロイのプロセスを合理化します。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub Actions 워크플로를 자동화하고 풀 요청을 관리하며 GitHub API 및 웹후크를 사용하여 코드 분석을 수행하여 개발 및 배포 프로세스를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions, gestionar solicitudes de extracción y realizar análisis de código utilizando GitHub APIs y webhooks, lo que simplifica los procesos de desarrollo y despliegue.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail GitHub Actions, de gérer les demandes d''extraction et d''effectuer des analyses de code à l''aide des API GitHub et des webhooks, ce qui rationalise les processus de développement et de déploiement.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, GitHub Actions-Workflows zu automatisieren, Pull-Requests zu verwalten und Code-Analysen mithilfe von GitHub-APIs und Webhooks durchzuführen, wodurch die Entwicklungs- und Bereitstellungsprozesse rationalisiert werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho GitHub Actions, gerenciar solicitações de pull e realizar análise de código usando GitHub APIs e webhooks, otimizando processos de desenvolvimento e implantação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать рабочие процессы GitHub Actions, управлять запросами на включение и проводить анализ кода с использованием GitHub API и веб-хуков, оптимизируя процессы разработки и развертывания.","ar":"يُمكن العميل من تلقين عمليات GitHub Actions، وإدارة طلبات السحب، وأداء تحليل الشفرة باستخدام GitHub APIs وwebhooks، وتبسيط عمليات التطوير والنشر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily repository backups and synchronization","Generating and managing Pull Requests for code reviews","Debugging and optimizing CI/CD pipelines using GitHub Actions"],"zh":["自动化每日仓库备份和同步","生成和管理代码审查的Pull请求","使用GitHub Actions调试和优化CI/CD管道"],"ja":["毎日のリポジトリのバックアップと同期の自動化","コードレビューのプルリクエストの生成と管理","GitHub Actionsを使用したCI/CDパイプラインのデバッグと最適化"],"ko":["일일 저장소 백업 및 동기화 자동화","코드 리뷰를 위한 풀 요청 생성 및 관리","GitHub Actions를 사용한 CI/CD 파이프라인 디버깅 및 최적화"],"es":["Automatización de copias de seguridad y sincronización diarias del repositorio","Generación y administración de solicitudes de extracción para revisiones de código","Depuración y optimización de tuberías de CI/CD mediante GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Automatisation des sauvegardes et de la synchronisation quotidiennes du référentiel","Génération et gestion des demandes d''extraction pour les examens de code","Débogage et optimisation des pipelines de CI/CD à l''aide de GitHub Actions"],"de":["Automatisierung von täglichen Repository-Sicherungskopien und -Synchronisation","Erzeugung und Verwaltung von Pull-Requests für Code-Reviews","Fehlerbehebung und Optimierung von CI/CD-Pipelines mithilfe von GitHub Actions"],"pt":["Automatizar backups e sincronização diários de repositórios","Gerar e gerenciar solicitações de pull para revisões de código","Depurar e otimizar pipelines CI/CD usando GitHub Actions"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ежедневные резервное копирование и синхронизацию репозиториев","Генерировать и управлять запросами на включение для обзора кода","Отлаживать и оптимизировать конвейеры CI/CD с использованием GitHub Actions"],"ar":["تلقين نسخة احتياطية يومية وتزامن المستودعات","توليد وإدارة طلبات السحب لاستعراض الشفرة","تصحيح أخطاء وتحسين خطوط أنابيب CI/CD باستخدام GitHub Actions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API token or OAuth authentication","Limited to GitHub platform only"],"zh":["需要GitHub API令牌或OAuth身份验证","仅限于GitHub平台"],"ja":["GitHub APIトークンまたはOAuth認証が必要","GitHubプラットフォームのみに制限"],"ko":["GitHub API 토큰 또는 OAuth 인증이 필요","GitHub 플랫폼만으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere un token de API de GitHub o autenticación OAuth","Limitado a la plataforma de GitHub solo"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''API GitHub ou une authentification OAuth","Limité à la plateforme GitHub uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt ein GitHub-API-Token oder OAuth-Authentifizierung","Begrenzt auf die GitHub-Plattform nur"],"pt":["Exige token de API do GitHub ou autenticação OAuth","Limitado à plataforma GitHub apenas"],"ru":["Требует токена API GitHub или аутентификации OAuth","Ограничен только платформой GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز وصول API GitHub أو مصادقة OAuth","محدود منصة GitHub فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"02ae85a1a3437f52fbea300a7007ec11ca27a597fa86fe6ac9d8bbe9666eff28","qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dotCMS/core/triage', 'community', 'dotCMS', 'core', 'dotCMS/core', 'triage', 936, 481, 44, '2026-02-25T07:45:00Z', '2026-02-26T08:27:14.685Z', 'd0655da305e66634744aecb1ea3031d692afa7e7f7c6b89bd875291062995971', '{"id":"dotCMS/core/triage","name":"triage","description":{"zh":"triage是企业级视觉无头内容管理系统，提供GraphQL、Java和开源等特点，帮助开发者高效管理内容","ja":"triageはエンタープライズ向けのビジュアルヘッドレスコンテンツ管理システムで、GraphQL、Java、オープンソースなどを搭載し、開発者のコンテンツ管理を効率化","ko":"triage는 기업용 시각적 헤드리스 콘텐츠 관리 시스템으로 GraphQL, Java, 오픈소스 등의 기능을 제공하여 개발者の 콘텐츠 관리를 효율화합니다","es":"El sistema de gestión de contenido visual headless para empresas ofrece una solución escalable y flexible","fr":"Le système de gestion de contenu headless pour les entreprises offre une solution évolutique et flexible","de":"Das headless Content Management System für Unternehmen bietet eine skalierbare und flexible Lösung","pt":"O triage é um sistema de gerenciamento de conteúdo headless para empresas, oferecendo recursos avançados como GraphQL e CMS.","ru":"Triage - визуальная головоломка для предприятий, предлагающая передовые функции, такие как GraphQL и CMS.","ar":"triage نظام إدارة المحتوى بدون رأس للمؤسسات، يقدم ميزات متقدمة مثل GraphQL و CMS.","en":"The Visual Headless Content Management System for Enterprises"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理_triage：企业级视觉无头内容管理系统","ja":"AIエージェント_triage：エンタープライズ向けビジュアルヘッドレスコンテンツ管理システム","ko":"AI 에이전트_triage: 기업용 시각적 헤드리스 콘텐츠 관리 시스템","es":"Herramientas de triage AI: Sistema de gestión de contenido","fr":"Outils d''agent de triage: Système de gestion de contenu","de":"AI-Triage-Tools: Headless Content Management System","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: triage - Sistema de Gerenciamento de C...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: triage - Визуальная Головоломка для Предприятий","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: triage - نظام إدارة المحتوى بدون رأس","en":"triage"},"description":{"zh":"triage是企业级视觉无头内容管理系统，提供GraphQL、Java和开源等特点，帮助开发者高效管理内容","ja":"triageはエンタープライズ向けのビジュアルヘッドレスコンテンツ管理システムで、GraphQL、Java、オープンソースなどを搭載し、開発者のコンテンツ管理を効率化","ko":"triage는 기업용 시각적 헤드리스 콘텐츠 관리 시스템으로 GraphQL, Java, 오픈소스 등의 기능을 제공하여 개발者の 콘텐츠 관리를 효율화합니다","es":"El sistema de gestión de contenido visual headless para empresas ofrece una solución escalable y flexible","fr":"Le système de gestion de contenu headless pour les entreprises offre une solution évolutique et flexible","de":"Das headless Content Management System für Unternehmen bietet eine skalierbare und flexible Lösung","pt":"O triage é um sistema de gerenciamento de conteúdo headless para empresas, oferecendo recursos avançados como GraphQL e CMS.","ru":"Triage - визуальная головоломка для предприятий, предлагающая передовые функции, такие как GraphQL и CMS.","ar":"triage نظام إدارة المحتوى بدون رأس للمؤسسات، يقدم ميزات متقدمة مثل GraphQL و CMS.","en":"The Visual Headless Content Management System for Enterprises"},"definition":{"en":"The Visual Headless Content Management System for Enterprises"},"features":{"zh":["视觉化的内容管理界面","GraphQL支持","基于Java的架构","开源和可扩展","支持多种内容格式"],"ja":["ビジュアルなコンテンツ管理インターフェース","GraphQLサポート","Javaベースのアーキテクチャ","オープンソース且つ拡張可能","多種コンテンツフォーマットのサポート"],"ko":["시각적인 콘텐츠 관리 인터페이스","GraphQL 지원","Java 기반의 아키텍처","오픈소스 및 확장 가능","다양한 콘텐츠 형식 지원"],"es":["Arquitectura headless para una mayor flexibilidad","Soporte para GraphQL y otras tecnologías de API","Desarrollo de aplicaciones personalizadas con Java","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como DotCMS","Escalabilidad y flexibilidad para empresas de todos los tamaños"],"fr":["Architecture headless pour une plus grande flexibilité","Prise en charge de GraphQL et d''autres technologies d''API","Développement d''applications personnalisées avec Java","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que DotCMS","Évolutivité et flexibilité pour les entreprises de toutes tailles"],"de":["Headless-Architektur für eine größere Flexibilität","Unterstützung für GraphQL und andere API-Technologien","Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Anwendungen mit Java","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie DotCMS","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität für Unternehmen aller Größen"],"pt":["Sistema de gerenciamento de conteúdo headless","Suporte a GraphQL","Integração com CMS","Plataforma de nuvem","Código aberto"],"ru":["Визуальная головоломка для предприятий","Поддержка GraphQL","Интеграция с CMS","Облачная платформа","Открытый код"],"ar":["نظام إدارة المحتوى بدون رأس","دعم GraphQL","تكامل مع CMS","منصة سحابية","كود مفتوح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用triage","什么是视觉无头内容管理系统","triage替代品","triage与其他CMS的比较","triage安装指南","triage设置教程","GraphQL在triage中的应用","Java开发triage"],"ja":["triageの使い方","ビジュアルヘッドレスコンテンツ管理システムとは","triageの代替","triageと他のCMSの比較","triageのインストールガイド","triageの設定方法","GraphQLをtriageで使用する","Javaでtriageを開発する"],"ko":["triage 사용 방법","시각적 헤드리스 콘텐츠 관리 시스템이란","triage 대체품","triage와 다른 CMS 비교","triage 설치 가이드","triage 설정 방법","GraphQL을 triage에서 사용하는 방법","Java로 triage 개발하기"],"es":["herramientas de triage AI","sistema de gestión de contenido headless","GraphQL para desarrolladores","cómo usar DotCMS","alternativas a DotCMS","instalación de Java para desarrolladores","guía de configuración de GraphQL"],"fr":["outils d''agent de triage","système de gestion de contenu headless","GraphQL pour les développeurs","comment utiliser DotCMS","alternatives à DotCMS","installation de Java pour les développeurs","guide de configuration de GraphQL"],"de":["AI-Triage-Tools","headless Content Management System","GraphQL für Entwickler","wie man DotCMS verwendet","Alternativen zu DotCMS","Java-Installation für Entwickler","GraphQL-Konfigurationshandbuch"],"pt":["como usar triage","o que é sistema de gerenciamento de conteúdo headless","triage vs dotcms","instalar triage","guias de configuração do triage","alternativas ao triage"],"ru":["как использовать triage","что такое визуальная головоломка для предприятий","triage vs dotcms","установить triage","руководства по настройке triage","альтернативы triage"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام triage","ما هو نظام إدارة المحتوى بدون رأس","triage vs dotcms","تثبيت triage","دلائل إعداد triage","بديل triage"]}},"owner":"dotCMS","repo":"core","repoPath":"dotCMS/core","stars":936,"forks":481,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T07:45:00Z","topics":["cloud","cms","content","content-management-system","dotcms","dxp","graphql","headless-cms","java","opensouce"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"triage","description":"Triage GitHub issues using the AI triage pipeline. Fetches the next issue from the Needs Triage project column (or a specific issue), creates an agent team to validate completeness, detect duplicates, and research the codebase in parallel, then presents a triage proposal for human approval before posting anything to GitHub.","bodyPreview":"# AI Issue Triage\n\nYou are now the triage orchestrator. Follow these steps exactly.\n\n## Step 1: Environment check\n\nRun these checks. Stop with an error message if any fail:\n```bash\ngh --version\ngh auth status\ngh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq ''.nameWithOwner''\n```\nThe repo must be `dotCMS/core`. If not, stop and tell the user to run this from the repo root.\n\n## Step 2: Parse arguments and get issue number\n\nArguments received: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\n**If `--issue <number>` is present**, extract the is","body":"# AI Issue Triage\n\nYou are now the triage orchestrator. Follow these steps exactly.\n\n## Step 1: Environment check\n\nRun these checks. Stop with an error message if any fail:\n```bash\ngh --version\ngh auth status\ngh repo view --json nameWithOwner --jq ''.nameWithOwner''\n```\nThe repo must be `dotCMS/core`. If not, stop and tell the user to run this from the repo root.\n\n## Step 2: Parse arguments and get issue number\n\nArguments received: `$ARGUMENTS`\n\n**If `--issue <number>` is present**, extract the issue number and skip to Step 3.\n\n**If no arguments**, fetch the next issue from the queue:\n```bash\ngh issue list --repo dotCMS/core --search \"is:issue no:assignee -label:\\\"Team : Falcon\\\",\\\"Team : Platform\\\",\\\"Team : Scout\\\",\\\"Team : Maintenance\\\",\\\"Team : Modernization\\\",\\\"Team : Enablement\\\",\\\"Flakey Test\\\" no:parent-issue -linked:pr state:open type:Task,Bug sort:updated-asc\" --json title,number,url --limit 1\n```\n\nExtract the `number` from the first result. If the array is empty, stop and tell the user: \"No issues need triage — queue is empty.\"\n\n## Step 3: Fetch the issue\n\n```bash\ngh issue view <number> --repo dotCMS/core --json number,title,body,labels,assignees,url,projectItems\n```\n\n## Step 4: Pre-flight check\n\nSkip and stop if:\n- Issue has any assignee\n- Issue has any label starting with `Team :`\n- Issue has a parent issue\n\n## Step 5: Create agent team and run three teammates IN PARALLEL\n\n### 5a. Create the team\n\n```\nTeamCreate(team_name: \"triage-<number>\", description: \"Triage pipeline for issue #<number>\")\n```\n\n### 5b. Create the task list\n\nCreate four tasks using `TaskCreate`. The team-router task must be blocked by the code-researcher task.\n\n- Task A: \"Validate issue #<number> completeness\" (assign to validator)\n- Task B: \"Detect duplicates for issue #<number>\" (assign to dup-detector)\n- Task C: \"Research codebase for issue #<number>\" (assign to researcher) — save the task ID\n- Task D: \"Route issue #<number> to team\" (assign to router) — set `addBlockedBy: [Task C ID]`\n\n### 5c. Spawn three teammates in a SINGLE message (parallel)\n\nYou MUST make THREE Task tool calls in a single response. Do not do any research yourself.\n\n**Teammate 1** — `subagent_type: issue-validator`, `team_name: \"triage-<number>\"`, `name: \"validator\"`\nPass the full issue content. Tell it to mark Task A as in_progress, complete it when done, and send results back to you via SendMessage.\n\n**Teammate 2** — `subagent_type: duplicate-detector`, `team_name: \"triage-<number>\"`, `name: \"dup-detector\"`\nPass issue number, title, body, and 3-5 keywords. Tell it to mark Task B as in_progress, complete it when done, and send results back to you via SendMessage.\n\n**Teammate 3** — `subagent_type: code-researcher`, `team_name: \"triage-<number>\"`, `name: \"researcher\"`\nPass issue number, title, full body, inferred type, and repo path (current working directory). Tell it to mark Task C as in_progress, complete it when done, and send results (especially the `Relevant Files` list) back to you via SendMessage.\n\nWait for all three teammates to send their results via SendMessage.\n\n### 5d. Spawn team-router after researcher completes\n\nOnce you receive the researcher''s SendMessage with the `Relevant Files` list, spawn the router teammate:\n\n**Teammate 4** — `subagent_type: team-router`, `team_name: \"triage-<number>\"`, `name: \"router\"`\nPass the `Relevant Files` list from the researcher''s message directly in the prompt. Do not ask it to search for files. Tell it to mark Task D as in_progress, complete it when done, and send the suggested team back to you via SendMessage.\n\nWait for the router to send its result via SendMessage.\n\n### 5e. Shut down teammates and delete team\n\nAfter all four teammates have reported their results:\n\n1. Send `SendMessage(type: \"shutdown_request\")` to all four teammates.\n2. Wait for shutdown confirmations.\n3. Call `TeamDelete()` to clean up the team.\n\n## Step 6: Synthesize and present proposal\n\nCombine the four results into a triage proposal. Use the `Suggested Team` from team-router, complexity from code-researcher.\n\nThe team-router always returns a team — use it as-is. Do not re-check the triage config or do your own routing.\n\nFor priority, map severity to these exact label names:\n- Critical / Show Stopper → `Priority : 1 Show Stopper`\n- High → `Priority : 2 High`\n- Medium / Average → `Priority : 3 Average`\n- Low → `Priority : 4 Low`\n\nShow the full proposal to the user and ask: **Approve? yes / no / edit**\n\n## Step 7: Execute on approval\n\nOn `yes`, run these steps in order:\n\n### 7a. Post the triage comment\n```bash\ngh issue comment <number> --repo dotCMS/core --body \"...\"\n```\n\n### 7b. Add labels (use exact label names from Step 6)\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --repo dotCMS/core --add-label \"Team : X\" --add-label \"Priority : X X X\"\n```\n\n### 7c. Add issue to the AI Triage Pipeline project and set status to Triaged\n\nFirst, get the project number from the repo variable:\n```bash\ngh variable get TRIAGE_PROJECT_NUMBER --repo dotCMS/core\n```\n\nThen get the item ID and field metadata using that number:\n```bash\ngh api graphql -f query=''\nquery {\n  organization(login: \"dotCMS\") {\n    projectV2(number: <TRIAGE_PROJECT_NUMBER>) {\n      id\n      fields(first: 20) {\n        nodes {\n          ... on ProjectV2SingleSelectField {\n            id\n            name\n            options { id name }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n      items(first: 5) { nodes { id } }\n    }\n  }\n}''\n```\n\nThen add the issue to the project:\n```bash\ngh api graphql -f query=''\nmutation {\n  addProjectV2ItemById(input: {\n    projectId: \"<project-id>\"\n    contentId: \"<issue-node-id>\"\n  }) {\n    item { id }\n  }\n}''\n```\n\nGet the issue node ID with:\n```bash\ngh issue view <number> --repo dotCMS/core --json id --jq ''.id''\n```\n\nThen set the Status field to \"Triaged\" using the item ID and field/option IDs discovered above:\n```bash\ngh api graphql -f query=''\nmutation {\n  updateProjectV2ItemFieldValue(input: {\n    projectId: \"<project-id>\"\n    itemId: \"<item-id>\"\n    fieldId: \"<status-field-id>\"\n    value: { singleSelectOptionId: \"<triaged-option-id>\" }\n  }) {\n    projectV2Item { id }\n  }\n}''\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:27:14.685Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub-integrated AI Agents needing automated issue triage and repository management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动问题分类和仓库管理功能的GitHub集成AI代理。","ja":"GitHubに統合されたAIエージェントが自動的な課題の分類とリポジトリ管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 문제 분류 및 저장소 관리 기능이 필요한 GitHub 통합 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de AI integrados con GitHub que necesitan capacidades de triage de problemas automatizados y administración de repositorios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA intégrés à GitHub nécessitant des capacités de triage de problèmes automatisées et de gestion de référentiels.","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-integrierte KI-Agents, die automatisierte Fähigkeiten zur Problemtriage und Repository-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA integrados ao GitHub que necessitam de capacidades de triagem de problemas automatizados e gerenciamento de repositórios.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, интегрированных с GitHub, требующих автоматизированной сортировки проблем и возможностей управления репозиторием.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتكاملين مع GitHub الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات إدارة المشكلات والملحقات التلقائية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform environment checks, parse arguments, and extract issue numbers using GitHub CLI commands like `gh --version` and `gh repo view --json`.","zh":"赋予代理执行环境检查、解析参数和使用GitHub CLI命令（如`gh --version`和`gh repo view --json`）提取问题编号的能力。","ja":"エージェントに環境のチェック、引数の解析、およびGitHub CLIコマンド（例： `gh --version`および`gh repo view --json`）を使用して問題番号を抽出する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 환경을 확인하고, 매개 변수를 분석하고, GitHub CLI 명령어(`gh --version` 및 `gh repo view --json` 같은)를 사용하여 문제 번호를 추출하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar comprobaciones de entorno, analizar argumentos y extraer números de problema utilizando comandos de GitHub CLI como `gh --version` y `gh repo view --json`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des vérifications d''environnement, d''analyser des arguments et d''extraire des numéros de problème en utilisant des commandes GitHub CLI comme `gh --version` et `gh repo view --json`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Umgebungsprüfungen durchzuführen, Argumente zu parsen und Problemmnummern mithilfe von GitHub CLI-Befehlen wie `gh --version` und `gh repo view --json` zu extrahieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar verificações de ambiente, analisar argumentos e extrair números de problemas usando comandos do GitHub CLI como `gh --version` e `gh repo view --json`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять проверки среды, парсить аргументы и извлекать номера проблем с помощью команд GitHub CLI, таких как `gh --version` и `gh repo view --json`.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إجراء فحوصات بيئية وتحليل الحجج واستخراج أرقام المشكلات باستخدام أوامر GitHub CLI مثل `gh --version` و `gh repo view --json`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue triage workflows","Validating repository environments","Extracting issue numbers from command-line arguments"],"zh":["自动化问题分类工作流","验证仓库环境","从命令行参数中提取问题编号"],"ja":["課題の分類ワークフローを自動化する","リポジトリ環境を検証する","コマンドライン引数から問題番号を抽出する"],"ko":["문제 분류 워크플로 자동화","저장소 환경 확인","명령줄 인자로부터 문제 번호 추출"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de triage de problemas","Validación de entornos de repositorio","Extracción de números de problema de argumentos de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de triage de problèmes","Validation des environnements de référentiel","Extraction des numéros de problème à partir d''arguments de ligne de commande"],"de":["Automatisierung von Problemtriage-Workflows","Validierung von Repository-Umgebungen","Extraktion von Problemmnummern aus Befehlszeilenargumenten"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de triagem de problemas","Validar ambientes de repositório","Extrair números de problemas de argumentos de linha de comando"],"ru":["Автоматизация потоков работы по сортировке проблем","Проверка среды репозитория","Извлечение номеров проблем из аргументов командной строки"],"ar":["تأتمة سير عمل فرز المشكلات","تحقق من بيئة المستودع","استخراج أرقام المشكلات من حجج سطر الأوامر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI installation","Limited to repositories with GitHub CLI access","Must be run from the repository root directory"],"zh":["需要安装GitHub CLI","仅限于具有GitHub CLI访问权限的仓库","必须从仓库根目录运行"],"ja":["GitHub CLIのインストールが必要","GitHub CLIへのアクセス権を持つリポジトリのみ","リポジトリのルートディレクトリから実行する必要がある"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 설치가 필요함","GitHub CLI 접근 권한이 있는 저장소에서만 제한됨","저장소 루트 디렉토리에서 실행되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de GitHub CLI","Limitado a repositorios con acceso a GitHub CLI","Debe ejecutarse desde el directorio raíz del repositorio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de GitHub CLI","Limité aux référentiels avec accès à GitHub CLI","Doit être exécuté à partir du répertoire racine du référentiel"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von GitHub CLI","Begrenzt auf Repositorys mit GitHub CLI-Zugriff","Muss aus dem Repository-Stammdirktor ausgeführt werden"],"pt":["Requer instalação do GitHub CLI","Limitado a repositórios com acesso ao GitHub CLI","Deve ser executado a partir do diretório raiz do repositório"],"ru":["Требует установки GitHub CLI","Ограничен репозиториями с доступом к GitHub CLI","Должен быть запущен из корневого каталога репозитория"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت GitHub CLI","محدود بالمستودعات التي لديها وصول إلى GitHub CLI","يجب تشغيله من دليل الجذر للمستودع"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d0655da305e66634744aecb1ea3031d692afa7e7f7c6b89bd875291062995971","qualityScore":44}');
