qué es Railway","alternativas a React","Railway vs React Native","instalación de Railway","guía de configuración de Railway","desarrollo de aplicaciones cross-plataforma","frameworks de React"],"fr":["comment utiliser Railway","quoi est Railway","alternatives à React","Railway vs React Native","installation de Railway","guide de configuration de Railway","développement d''applications cross-plateforme","frameworks React"],"de":["wie man Railway verwendet","was ist Railway","Alternativen zu React","Railway vs React Native","Installation von Railway","Einrichtungsanleitung für Railway","Entwicklung von Cross-Plattform-Anwendungen","React-Frameworks"],"pt":["como usar Railway","o que é Railway","Railway vs React Native","instalar Railway","guia de configuração do Railway","desenvolvimento cross-plataforma com React","plugin Vite para React","código compartilhado em React"],"ru":["как использовать Railway","что такое Railway","Railway vs React Native","установить Railway","руководство по настройке Railway","кроссплатформенная разработка с React","плагин Vite для React","общий код в React"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Railway","ما هو Railway","Railway مقابل React Native","تثبيت Railway","دليل إعداد Railway","التنمية متعددة المنصات مع React","إضافة Vite ل React","رمز مشترك في React"]}},"owner":"onejs","repo":"one","repoPath":"onejs/one","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.892Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"railway","description":">-","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Railway CLI\n\nDeploy and manage Railway cloud platform projects.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nbrew install railway\n# or: npm i -g @railway/cli\n# or: bash <(curl -fsSL cli.new)\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```bash\nrailway login              # Browser-based login\nrailway login --browserless  # For headless/SSH environments (prints pairing code)\nrailway logout             # Disconnect from account\n```\n\n**Environment Variables for CI/CD:**\n- `RAILWAY_TOKEN` - Project token (deploy, redeploy, logs only)\n- `","body":"# Railway CLI\n\nDeploy and manage Railway cloud platform projects.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nbrew install railway\n# or: npm i -g @railway/cli\n# or: bash <(curl -fsSL cli.new)\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n```bash\nrailway login              # Browser-based login\nrailway login --browserless  # For headless/SSH environments (prints pairing code)\nrailway logout             # Disconnect from account\n```\n\n**Environment Variables for CI/CD:**\n- `RAILWAY_TOKEN` - Project token (deploy, redeploy, logs only)\n- `RAILWAY_API_TOKEN` - Account token (full access including init, link)\n\n## Project Management\n\n```bash\nrailway init               # Create new project\nrailway link               # Link current directory to existing project/environment\nrailway service            # Link to specific service in project\nrailway environment        # Switch linked environment (default: production)\n```\n\n## Deployment\n\n```bash\nrailway up                 # Deploy with build logs\nrailway up --detach        # Deploy and return immediately (no logs)\nrailway redeploy           # Redeploy current service\n```\n\n## Local Development\n\n```bash\nrailway run <cmd>          # Run command locally with Railway env vars\nrailway run npm start      # Example: start dev server with Railway vars\nrailway shell              # Open shell with Railway environment loaded\n```\n\n## Logs & Debugging\n\n```bash\nrailway logs               # View service logs\nrailway ssh                # SSH into running service\nrailway ssh -- ls          # Execute single command via SSH\n```\n\n**SSH with specific target:**\n```bash\nrailway ssh --project=<ID> --environment=<ID> --service=<ID>\n```\n\n## Database & Services\n\n```bash\nrailway add                # Provision database (Postgres, MySQL, Redis, MongoDB)\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### Deploy a new project\n```bash\nrailway login\nrailway init\nrailway up\n```\n\n### Link existing project and deploy\n```bash\nrailway login\nrailway link\nrailway up\n```\n\n### Run local dev with production database\n```bash\nrailway link\nrailway run npm run dev\n```\n\n### View logs for debugging\n```bash\nrailway logs\n# or SSH in for interactive debugging\nrailway ssh\n```\n\n## User Invocation\n\n- `/railway` - Show status and common commands\n- `/railway deploy` - Deploy current directory\n- `/railway logs` - View service logs\n- `/railway ssh` - Connect to service\n\n## Agent Response Protocol\n\n**For `/railway` or `/railway status`:**\n1. Check if logged in: `railway whoami`\n2. Check linked project: `railway status`\n3. Report current state and suggest next actions\n\n**For `/railway deploy`:**\n1. Verify logged in and linked\n2. Run `railway up` and report results\n3. On failure, suggest fixes\n\n**For `/railway logs`:**\n1. Run `railway logs` (add `--help` to see filtering options)\n2. Summarize recent activity\n\n**For `/railway ssh`:**\n1. Run `railway ssh` for interactive session\n2. Or `railway ssh -- <command>` for one-off commands\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:14.846Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Deployment Agents needing streamlined project management via Railway CLI","zh":"非常适合需要通过Railway CLI简化项目管理的云部署代理","ja":"Railway CLIを使用してプロジェクト管理をストリームライン化する必要があるクラウドデプロイエージェントに最適","ko":"Railway CLI를 통해 프로젝트 관리를 간소화해야 하는 클라우드 배포 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de implementación en la nube que necesitan una gestión de proyectos simplificada a través de Railway CLI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de déploiement cloud nécessitant une gestion de projet simplifiée via Railway CLI","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Deployment-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Projektverwaltung über Railway CLI benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de implantação em nuvem que precisam de gerenciamento de projetos otimizado via Railway CLI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов развертывания в облаке, которым требуется оптимизированное управление проектами через Railway CLI","ar":"مثالي لعميل एजنت النشر السحابي الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة مشروع مبسطة عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر Railway"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy and manage Railway cloud platform projects using Vite plugin for cross-platform compatibility, handling authentication via browser-based login or headless SSH environments with pairing codes, and leveraging environment variables like RAILWAY_TOKEN for CI/CD pipelines","zh":"赋予代理部署和管理Railway云平台项目的能力，使用Vite插件实现跨平台兼容，通过浏览器登录或headless SSH环境的配对代码处理身份验证，并利用环境变量如RAILWAY_TOKEN实现CI/CD管道","ja":"エージェントがViteプラグインを使用してクロスプラットフォームの互換性を実現し、ブラウザベースのログインまたはヘッドレスSSH環境のペアリングコードを使用した認証を処理し、環境変数RAILWAY_TOKENを使用してCI/CDパイプラインを実現することで、Railwayクラウドプラットフォームプロジェクトの展開と管理を可能にする","ko":"Vite 플러그인을 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 달성하고, 브라우저 로그인 또는 헤드리스 SSH 환경의 페어링 코드를 사용한 인증을 처리하며, 환경 변수 RAILWAY_TOKEN을 사용하여 CI/CD 파이프라인을 구현함으로써, Railway 클라우드 플랫폼 프로젝트의 배포 및 관리를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes para implementar y gestionar proyectos de la plataforma cloud Railway utilizando el plugin Vite para compatibilidad entre plataformas, manejo de autenticación a través de inicio de sesión basado en navegador o entornos SSH sin interfaz gráfica con códigos de emparejamiento, y aprovechando variables de entorno como RAILWAY_TOKEN para pipelines de CI/CD","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer et de gérer des projets de plate-forme cloud Railway en utilisant le plugin Vite pour la compatibilité multiplateforme, la gestion de l''authentification via la connexion basée sur le navigateur ou les environnements SSH sans interface graphique avec des codes d''appairage, et en exploitant des variables d''environnement comme RAILWAY_TOKEN pour les pipelines CI/CD","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Railway-Cloud-Plattform-Projekte mithilfe des Vite-Plugins für Cross-Platform-Kompatibilität zu bereitstellen und zu verwalten, Authentifizierung über browserbasiertes Login oder headless SSH-Umgebungen mit Pairing-Codes zu handhaben und Umgebungsvariablen wie RAILWAY_TOKEN für CI/CD-Pipelines zu nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar e gerenciar projetos da plataforma Railway em nuvem usando o plug-in Vite para compatibilidade cross-plataforma, manipulando autenticação via login baseado em navegador ou ambientes SSH headless com códigos de pareamento, e aproveitando variáveis de ambiente como RAILWAY_TOKEN para pipelines de CI/CD","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать и управлять проектами Railway в облаке, используя плагин Vite для кроссплатформенной совместимости, обрабатывая аутентификацию через браузерный вход или безголовые среды SSH с кодами парирования, и использует переменные окружения, такие как RAILWAY_TOKEN, для конвейеров CI/CD","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من نشر وإدارة مشاريع منصة سحابية Railway باستخدام إضافة Vite لتوافق عبر المنصات، ويتعامل مع المصادقة عبر تسجيل الدخول المبني على المتصفح أو بيئات SSH بدون رأس مع رموز الاقتران، وينفذ متغيرات البيئة مثل RAILWAY_TOKEN لمخططات CI/CD"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying web and native applications with a single Vite plugin","Managing Railway projects through CLI commands for login, logout, and token management","Integrating Railway with CI/CD pipelines using environment variables"],"zh":["使用单个Vite插件部署Web和本地应用程序","通过CLI命令管理Railway项目，包括登录、注销和令牌管理","使用环境变量将Railway与CI/CD管道集成"],"ja":["単一のViteプラグインを使用してWebおよびネイティブアプリケーションを展開する","CLIコマンドを使用してRailwayプロジェクトを管理する、ログイン、ログアウト、トークン管理など","環境変数を使用してRailwayをCI/CDパイプラインに統合する"],"ko":["단일 Vite 플러그인을 사용하여 웹 및 네이티브 애플리케이션을 배포하는 것","CLI 명령을 사용하여 Railway 프로젝트를 관리하는 것, 로그인, 로그아웃, 토큰 관리 등","환경 변수를 사용하여 Railway를 CI/CD 파이프라인에 통합하는 것"],"es":["Implementar aplicaciones web y nativas con un solo plugin Vite","Gestionar proyectos Railway a través de comandos CLI para inicio de sesión, cierre de sesión y gestión de tokens","Integrar Railway con pipelines de CI/CD utilizando variables de entorno"],"fr":["Déployer des applications web et natives avec un seul plugin Vite","Gérer des projets Railway via des commandes CLI pour la connexion, la déconnexion et la gestion des jetons","Intégrer Railway avec des pipelines CI/CD en utilisant des variables d''environnement"],"de":["Web- und Native-Anwendungen mit einem einzigen Vite-Plugin bereitstellen","Railway-Projekte über CLI-Befehle für Anmeldung, Abmeldung und Tokenverwaltung verwalten","Railway in CI/CD-Pipelines mithilfe von Umgebungsvariablen integrieren"],"pt":["Implantação de aplicações web e nativas com um único plug-in Vite","Gerenciamento de projetos Railway por meio de comandos CLI para login, logout e gerenciamento de token","Integração da Railway com pipelines de CI/CD usando variáveis de ambiente"],"ru":["Развертывание веб- и родных приложений с помощью одного плагина Vite","Управление проектами Railway с помощью команд CLI для входа, выхода и управления токеном","Интеграция Railway с конвейерами CI/CD, используя переменные окружения"],"ar":["نشر التطبيقات الويب والأصلية باستخدام إضافة Vite واحدة","إدارة مشاريع سحابية Railway من خلال أوامر CLI لتسجيل الدخول والخروج وإدارة الرموز","دمج سحابية Railway مع مخططات CI/CD باستخدام متغيرات البيئة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway account and project token","Dependent on Vite plugin for cross-platform functionality","Limited to Railway cloud platform projects"],"zh":["需要Railway账户和项目令牌","依赖Vite插件实现跨平台功能","仅限于Railway云平台项目"],"ja":["Railwayアカウントとプロジェクトトークンが必要","Viteプラグインに依存してクロスプラットフォーム機能を実現","Railwayクラウドプラットフォームプロジェクトのみに制限"],"ko":["Railway 계정 및 프로젝트 토큰이 필요","Vite 플러그인에 의존하여 크로스 플랫폼 기능을 구현","Railway 클라우드 플랫폼 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y token de proyecto Railway","Dependiente del plugin Vite para funcionalidad entre plataformas","Limitado a proyectos de la plataforma cloud Railway"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et un jeton de projet Railway","Dépendant du plugin Vite pour la fonctionnalité multiplateforme","Limité aux projets de la plate-forme cloud Railway"],"de":["Benötigt ein Railway-Konto und Projekttoken","Abhängig vom Vite-Plugin für Cross-Platform-Funktionalität","Begrenzt auf Railway-Cloud-Plattform-Projekte"],"pt":["Exige conta Railway e token de projeto","Depende do plug-in Vite para funcionalidade cross-plataforma","Limitado a projetos da plataforma Railway em nuvem"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи Railway и токена проекта","Зависит от плагина Vite для кроссплатформенной функциональности","Ограничен проектами облакной платформы Railway"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب سحابي Railway ورمز للمشروع","يعتمد على إضافة Vite للوظائف عبر المنصات","محدود بمشاريع منصة سحابية Railway"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0b1d143f60e544227737f86b7486e0d88424d18364bfa00083e529fc85821b7f","qualityScore":44}');
