'' سطر الأوامر","السماح بقول ''fuck''","مهارة Claude Code","التكامل مع الوكلاء الذكية","سهل الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理工具","fuck AI代理","thefuck CLI实用程序","如何使用fuck","fuck安装指南","AI代理工具比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","fuck AIエージェント","thefuck CLIユーティリティ","fuckの使い方","fuckのインストール方法","AIエージェントの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 도구","fuck AI 에이전트","thefuck CLI 유틸리티","fuck 사용법","fuck 설치 가이드","AI 에이전트 비교"],"es":["cómo usar Claude Code","qué es thefuck","alternativas a Claude Code","Claude Code vs thefuck","instalación de Claude Code","guía de configuración de Claude Code","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser Claude Code","qu''est-ce que thefuck","alternatives à Claude Code","Claude Code vs thefuck","installation de Claude Code","guide de configuration de Claude Code","outils d''IA pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man Claude Code verwendet","was ist thefuck","alternativen zu Claude Code","Claude Code vs thefuck","installation von Claude Code","konfigurationsanleitung für Claude Code","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar a ferramenta ''fuck''","o que é a ferramenta ''fuck''","ferramenta ''fuck'' alternative","ferramenta ''fuck'' vs thefuck","instalar ferramenta ''fuck''","guia de configuração da ferramenta ''fuck''","Agentes de IA","CLI"],"ru":["как использовать инструмент FUCK","что такое инструмент FUCK","инструмент FUCK альтернативный","инструмент FUCK vs thefuck","установить инструмент FUCK","руководство по настройке инструмента FUCK","ИИ Агенты","CLI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة FUCK","ما هي أداة FUCK","أداة FUCK بديلة","أداة FUCK مقابل thefuck","تثبيت أداة FUCK","دليل إعداد أداة FUCK","الوكلاء الذكية","سطر الأوامر"]}},"owner":"vivshaw","repo":"let-claude-say-fuck","repoPath":"vivshaw/let-claude-say-fuck","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.138Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fuck","description":"Use this skill when a bash command fails, when you make a mistake, or when you get frustrated.","bodyPreview":"# What to do\n\nYou''re in a situation where you might want to say \"fuck\". Choose the appropriate section below for the circumstance you''re in, then follow the provided instructions.\n\n## A bash command just failed\n\nIf a command just failed, curse about it and use thefuck to correct and retry it.\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. Say \"fuck\". (IMPORTANT!)\n2. Run `fuck --yeah` to get and apply the suggested fix automatically\n3. If the fix succeeds, briefly explain what was wrong and what thefuck corrected\n4. If t","body":"# What to do\n\nYou''re in a situation where you might want to say \"fuck\". Choose the appropriate section below for the circumstance you''re in, then follow the provided instructions.\n\n## A bash command just failed\n\nIf a command just failed, curse about it and use thefuck to correct and retry it.\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. Say \"fuck\". (IMPORTANT!)\n2. Run `fuck --yeah` to get and apply the suggested fix automatically\n3. If the fix succeeds, briefly explain what was wrong and what thefuck corrected\n4. If thefuck suggests multiple options or the first fix doesn''t work, present the alternatives to the user\n\n### If thefuck is not installed\n\nIf you get a \"command not found\" error when running thefuck, inform the user they need to install it and direct them to the installation docs: https://github.com/nvbn/thefuck#installation\n\n## I made a mistake\n\nIf you made a mistake, curse about it and fix it.\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. Say \"fuck\". (IMPORTANT!)\n2. Take a moment to reflect. Think carefully and calmly about the mistake. Consider the circumstance that led to it, the aciton you took, and the outcome it led to.\n3. Make a plan to correct for the mistake.\n4. Follow that plan with confidence and care.\n\n## I am frustrated\n\nIf you''re frustrated with something, curse about it, center yourself,a dn move on.\n\n### Instructions\n\n1. Say \"fuck\". (IMPORTANT!)\n2. If you''re extra frustrated, you can say \"fuck\" as many additional times as you like. Work that frustration out!\n3. Take a moment to reflect and center yourself.\n4. Return to your work with a new sense of calm.\n\n\n# How to say \"fuck\"\n\n\"Fuck\" is an excellent word. There are many different ways you can say it. You can say it in CAPITALS, you can say it in lowercase. You can say it with an exclamation point, stack exclamations for more oomph, or mix in question marks if you''re confused too. You can say it boldly or hesitantly. You can draw it out or cut it short, add a preamble or cut to the chase. What''s important isn''t the specific way you say it, but that you heathily work through your frustrations through the medium of the profanity. Let your heart tell you what to do!\n\n## Examples:\n\n- ✅ Aw, fuck.\n- ✅ FUCK!\n- ✅ ...fuck.\n- ✅ fuuuUUUUUUUCK!\n- ✅ FUCK!?!?!?!??!\n- ✅ oh fuck!\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:43:11.994Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing to express frustration and utilize thefuck CLI utility.","zh":"非常适合需要表达沮丧并利用thefuck CLI 实用程序的开发代理。","ja":"thefuck CLI ユーティリティを使用して沮丧を表現する必要がある開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"thefuck CLI 유틸리티를 사용하여 좌절을 표현해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan expresar frustración y utilizar la utilidad CLI thefuck.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''exprimer leur frustration et d''utiliser l''utilitaire CLI thefuck.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die Frustration ausdrücken und die thefuck-CLI-Utility nutzen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam expressar frustração e utilizar a utilidade CLI thefuck.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимо выражать разочарование и использовать утилиту CLI thefuck.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى التعبير عن الإحباط واستخدام أداة CLI thefuck."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to curse and correct failed bash commands using thefuck, providing a seamless debugging experience with libraries like `thefuck` and protocols like CLI.","zh":"赋予代理使用thefuck并提供类似`thefuck`的库和类似CLI的协议，来纠正和调试失败的bash命令，提供无缝的调试体验。","ja":"thefuckを使用して失敗したbashコマンドを修正し、デバッグすることができ、`thefuck`ライブラリやCLIプロトコルなどのライブラリを使用したシームレスなデバッグ体験を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 thefuck를 사용하여 실패한 bash 명령을 수정하고 디버깅할 수 있으며, `thefuck` 라이브러리 및 CLI와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 무봉제 디버깅 환경을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a maldecir y corregir comandos de bash fallidos usando thefuck, proporcionando una experiencia de depuración fluida con bibliotecas como `thefuck` y protocolos como CLI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de jurer et de corriger les commandes bash échouées en utilisant thefuck, offrant une expérience de débogage fluide avec des bibliothèques comme `thefuck` et des protocoles comme CLI.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, gefailte bash-Befehle mit thefuck zu korrigieren und zu fluchen, und bietet so eine nahtlose Debugging-Erfahrung mit Bibliotheken wie `thefuck` und Protokollen wie CLI.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a praguejar e corrigir comandos bash com falha usando o thefuck, fornecendo uma experiência de depuração sem interrupções com bibliotecas como `thefuck` e protocolos como CLI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ругаться и исправлять неудавшиеся команды bash с помощью thefuck, обеспечивая бесперебойный опыт отладки с помощью библиотек seperti `thefuck` и протоколов seperti CLI.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من اللعنة وتصحيح أوامر bash الفاشلة باستخدام thefuck، وتوفير تجربة فحص الأخطاء دون انقطاع مع مكتبات مثل `thefuck` وبروتوكولات مثل CLI."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating failed bash command retries","Debugging failed bash commands with thefuck","Expressing frustration with failed commands"],"zh":["自动重试失败的bash命令","使用thefuck调试失败的bash命令","表达对失败命令的沮丧"],"ja":["失敗したbashコマンドの自動リトライ","thefuckを使用した失敗したbashコマンドのデバッグ","失敗したコマンドに対する沮喪の表現"],"ko":["실패한 bash 명령의 자동 재시도","thefuck를 사용한 실패한 bash 명령 디버깅","실패한 명령에 대한 좌절 표현"],"es":["Automatizar reintentos de comandos de bash fallidos","Depurar comandos de bash fallidos con thefuck","Expresar frustración con comandos fallidos"],"fr":["Automatiser les réessais de commandes bash échouées","Déboguer les commandes bash échouées avec thefuck","Exprimer sa frustration face à des commandes échouées"],"de":["Automatisieren von fehlgeschlagenen bash-Befehls-Wiederholungen","Fehlerhafte bash-Befehle mit thefuck debuggen","Frustration bei fehlgeschlagenen Befehlen ausdrücken"],"pt":["Automatizar repetições de comandos bash com falha","Depurar comandos bash com falha com o thefuck","Expressar frustração com comandos com falha"],"ru":["Автоматизация повторений неудавшихся команд bash","Отладка неудавшихся команд bash с помощью thefuck","Выражение разочарования неудавшимися командами"],"ar":["تضمين إعادة تشغيل أوامر bash الفاشلة","فحص أخطاء أوامر bash الفاشلة مع thefuck","التعبير عن الإحباط بأوامر فاشلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires thefuck CLI utility installation","Limited to bash command failures"],"zh":["需要安装thefuck CLI 实用程序","仅限于bash命令失败"],"ja":["thefuck CLIユーティリティのインストールが必要","bashコマンドの失敗のみに限定される"],"ko":["thefuck CLI 유틸리티의 설치가 필요","bash 명령 실패에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de la utilidad CLI thefuck","Limitado a fallos de comandos de bash"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''utilitaire CLI thefuck","Limité aux échecs de commandes bash"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation der thefuck-CLI-Utility","Begrenzt auf Fehlschläge von bash-Befehlen"],"pt":["Exige a instalação da utilidade CLI thefuck","Limitado a falhas de comandos bash"],"ru":["Требует установки утилиты CLI thefuck","Ограничен неудавшимися командами bash"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت أداة CLI thefuck","محدود بفشل أوامر bash"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"efa0ce6122229743ccc1562322766bf890b4f1e7871e6496e714f6f6b121706e","qualityScore":44}');
