 لأدوات CLI","en":"skillshare"},"description":{"zh":"Skillshare 可以同步所有 AI CLI 工具的技能，如 Claude Code、OpenClaw、OpenCode 等","ja":"Skillshare は Claude Code、OpenClaw、OpenCode などのすべての AI CLI ツールのスキルを同期","ko":"Skillshare 는 Claude Code, OpenClaw, OpenCode 등 모든 AI CLI 도구의 스킬을 동기화","es":"Sincroniza habilidades en herramientas de línea de comandos de IA como Claude Code, OpenClaw y OpenCode con skillshare","fr":"Synchronisez les compétences dans les outils de ligne de commande IA tels que Claude Code, OpenClaw et OpenCode avec skillshare","de":"Synchronisieren Sie Fähigkeiten in KI-Befehlszeilentools wie Claude Code, OpenClaw und OpenCode mit skillshare","pt":"Skillshare é uma ferramenta que sincroniza habilidades em todas as ferramentas CLI de IA, incluindo Claude Code, OpenClaw e OpenCode","ru":"Skillshare - это инструмент, который синхронизирует навыки во всех ИИ CLI инструментах, включая Claude Code, OpenClaw и OpenCode","ar":"Skillshare هي أداة تزامن المهارات على جميع أدوات CLI للذكاء الاصطناعي، بما في ذلك Claude Code و OpenClaw و OpenCode","en":"📚 Sync skills across all AI CLI tools with one command and simplify team sharing. Supporting Claude Code, OpenClaw, OpenCode & more"},"definition":{"en":"📚 Sync skills across all AI CLI tools with one command and simplify team sharing. Supporting Claude Code, OpenClaw, OpenCode & more"},"features":{"zh":["同步所有 AI CLI 工具的技能","支持 Claude Code、OpenClaw、OpenCode 等","简化团队分享","一条命令即可同步技能","支持多种 AI CLI 工具"],"ja":["すべての AI CLI ツールのスキルを同期","Claude Code、OpenClaw、OpenCode などのサポート","チームの共有を簡素化","1 つのコマンドでスキルを同期","複数の AI CLI ツールをサポート"],"ko":["모든 AI CLI 도구의 스킬을 동기화","Claude Code, OpenClaw, OpenCode 등 지원","팀 공유를 간소화","1개의 명령으로 스킬을 동기화","다수의 AI CLI 도구를 지원"],"es":["Sincronización de habilidades en herramientas de línea de comandos de IA","Compatibilidad con Claude Code, OpenClaw y OpenCode","Simplificación del intercambio en equipo","Uso de un solo comando para sincronizar habilidades","Soporte para múltiples herramientas de línea de comandos de IA"],"fr":["Synchronisation des compétences dans les outils de ligne de commande IA","Compatibilité avec Claude Code, OpenClaw et OpenCode","Simplification du partage d''équipe","Utilisation d''une seule commande pour synchroniser les compétences","Prise en charge de plusieurs outils de ligne de commande IA"],"de":["Synchronisierung von Fähigkeiten in KI-Befehlszeilentools","Kompatibilität mit Claude Code, OpenClaw und OpenCode","Vereinfachung des Team-Sharings","Verwendung eines einzigen Befehls zur Synchronisierung von Fähigkeiten","Unterstützung für mehrere KI-Befehlszeilentools"],"pt":["Sincronização de habilidades em todas as ferramentas CLI de IA","Compartilhamento simplificado em equipe","Suporte a Claude Code, OpenClaw e OpenCode","Uso de um comando para sincronizar habilidades","Ferramenta de desenvolvedor para agentes de IA"],"ru":["Синхронизация навыков во всех ИИ CLI инструментах","Упрощение обмена командой","Поддержка Claude Code, OpenClaw и OpenCode","Использование одной команды для синхронизации навыков","Инструмент для разработчиков ИИ агентов"],"ar":["مزامنة المهارات على جميع أدوات CLI للذكاء الاصطناعي","تبسيط المشاركة الفريقية","دعم Claude Code و OpenClaw و OpenCode","استخدام أمر واحد لمزامنة المهارات","أداة مطور لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Skillshare","什么是 AI 智能工具","Skillshare 替代品","Skillshare 与其他工具的比较","Skillshare 安装","Skillshare 设置指南","AI CLI 工具","团队分享工具"],"ja":["Skillshare の使用方法","AI エージェントとは","Skillshare の代替","Skillshare と他のツールの比較","Skillshare のインストール","Skillshare の設定ガイド","AI CLI ツール","チームの共有ツール"],"ko":["Skillshare 를 사용하는 방법","AI 에이전트란","Skillshare 대체","Skillshare 와 다른 도구의 비교","Skillshare 설치","Skillshare 설정 가이드","AI CLI 도구","팀 공유 도구"],"es":["cómo usar skillshare","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a Claude Code","skillshare vs OpenClaw","instalación de skillshare","guía de configuración de skillshare","herramientas de línea de comandos de IA","sincronización de habilidades en IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser skillshare","quoi est un Agent IA","alternatives à Claude Code","skillshare vs OpenClaw","installation de skillshare","guide de configuration de skillshare","outils de ligne de commande IA","synchronisation de compétences en IA"],"de":["wie man skillshare verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Claude Code","skillshare vs OpenClaw","Installation von skillshare","Konfigurationsanleitung für skillshare","KI-Befehlszeilentools","Synchronisierung von Fähigkeiten in KI"],"pt":["como usar skillshare","o que é skillshare","ferramentas cli de ia","alternativas ao openclaw","skillshare vs opencode","instalar skillshare","guia de configuração do skillshare"],"ru":["как использовать skillshare","что такое skillshare","ИИ CLI инструменты","альтернативы openclaw","skillshare vs opencode","установить skillshare","руководство по настройке skillshare"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام skillshare","ما هي skillshare","أدوات cli للذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل openclaw","skillshare مقابل opencode","تثبيت skillshare","دليل إعداد skillshare"]}},"owner":"runkids","repo":"skillshare","repoPath":"runkids/skillshare","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.146Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skillshare","description":"|","version":"v0.16.7","bodyPreview":"# Skillshare CLI\n\nGlobal: `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` → all AI CLIs. Project: `.skillshare/skills/` → repo-local.\nAuto-detects project mode when `.skillshare/config.yaml` exists. Force with `-p` or `-g`.\n\n## Recipes\n\n### Getting Started\n```bash\nskillshare init --no-copy --all-targets --git --skill  # Fresh global setup\nskillshare init -p --targets \"claude,cursor\"            # Fresh project setup\nskillshare init --copy-from claude --all-targets --git  # Import from existing CLI\nskillshare init","body":"# Skillshare CLI\n\nGlobal: `~/.config/skillshare/skills/` → all AI CLIs. Project: `.skillshare/skills/` → repo-local.\nAuto-detects project mode when `.skillshare/config.yaml` exists. Force with `-p` or `-g`.\n\n## Recipes\n\n### Getting Started\n```bash\nskillshare init --no-copy --all-targets --git --skill  # Fresh global setup\nskillshare init -p --targets \"claude,cursor\"            # Fresh project setup\nskillshare init --copy-from claude --all-targets --git  # Import from existing CLI\nskillshare init --discover --select \"windsurf\"          # Add new AI tool later\n```\n### Installing Skills\n```bash\nskillshare install user/repo -s pdf,commit       # Select specific skills\nskillshare install user/repo --all               # Install everything\nskillshare install user/repo --into frontend     # Place in subdirectory\nskillshare install gitlab.com/team/repo          # Any Git host\nskillshare install user/repo --track             # Enable `update` later\nskillshare install user/repo -s pdf -p           # Install to project\nskillshare install                               # Reinstall all tracked remotes from config\nskillshare sync                                  # Always sync after install\n```\n### Creating & Discovering Skills\n```bash\nskillshare new my-skill                          # Create a new skill from template\nskillshare search \"react testing\"                # Search GitHub for skills\nskillshare collect                               # Pull target-local changes back to source\n```\n### Removing Skills\n```bash\nskillshare uninstall my-skill                    # Remove one (moves to trash)\nskillshare uninstall skill-a skill-b             # Remove multiple\nskillshare uninstall -G frontend                 # Remove entire group\nskillshare sync                                  # Always sync after uninstall\n```\n### Team / Organization\n```bash\n# Creator: init project (see Getting Started) → add skills → commit .skillshare/\nskillshare install -p && skillshare sync                  # Member: clone → install → sync\nskillshare install github.com/team/repo --track -p        # Track shared repo\nskillshare push                                           # Cross-machine: push on A\nskillshare pull                                           # Cross-machine: pull on B\n```\n### Controlling Where Skills Go\n```bash\n# SKILL.md frontmatter: targets: [claude]        → only syncs to Claude\nskillshare target claude --add-include \"team-*\"   # glob filter\nskillshare target claude --add-exclude \"_legacy*\"  # exclude pattern\nskillshare target codex --mode copy && skillshare sync --force  # copy mode\n```\nSee [targets.md](references/targets.md) for details.\n### Updates & Maintenance\n```bash\nskillshare check                              # See what has updates\nskillshare update my-skill && skillshare sync  # Update one\nskillshare update --all && skillshare sync     # Update all\nskillshare update --all --diff                 # Show what changed\n```\n### Recovery & Troubleshooting\n```bash\nskillshare trash restore <name> && skillshare sync  # Undo delete\nskillshare sync                                     # Skill missing? Re-sync\nskillshare doctor && skillshare status              # Diagnose issues\nskillshare install user/repo --force                 # Override audit block\nskillshare install user/repo --skip-audit            # Bypass scan entirely\n```\nSee [TROUBLESHOOTING.md](references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md) for more.\n\n## Quick Lookup\n| Commands | Project? |\n|----------|:--------:|\n| `status`, `diff`, `list`, `doctor` | ✓ (auto) |\n| `sync`, `collect` | ✓ (auto) |\n| `install`, `uninstall`, `update`, `check`, `search`, `new` | ✓ (`-p`) |\n| `target`, `audit`, `trash`, `log` | ✓ (`-p`) |\n| `push`, `pull`, `backup`, `restore` | ✗ |\n| `ui`, `upgrade` | ✓ |\n\n## AI Caller Rules\n1. **Non-interactive** — AI cannot answer prompts. Use `--force`, `--all`, `-s`, `--targets`, `--no-copy`, `--all-targets`, `--yes`.\n2. **Sync after mutations** — `install`, `uninstall`, `update`, `collect`, `target` all need `sync`.\n3. **Audit** — `install` auto-scans; CRITICAL blocks. `--force` to override, `--skip-audit` to bypass.\n4. **Uninstall safely** — moves to trash (7 days). `trash restore <name>` to undo. **NEVER** `rm -rf` symlinks.\n5. **Output** — `--json` for structured data, `--no-tui` for plain text, `--dry-run` to preview.\n\n## References\n| Topic | File |\n|-------|------|\n| Init flags | [init.md](references/init.md) |\n| Sync/collect/push/pull | [sync.md](references/sync.md) |\n| Install/update/uninstall/new | [install.md](references/install.md) |\n| Status/diff/list/search/check | [status.md](references/status.md) |\n| Security audit | [audit.md](references/audit.md) |\n| Trash | [trash.md](references/trash.md) |\n| Operation log | [log.md](references/log.md) |\n| Targets | [targets.md](references/targets.md) |\n| Backup/restore | [backup.md](references/backup.md) |\n| Troubleshooting | [TROUBLESHOOTING.md](references/TROUBLESHOOTING.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:37.242Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI CLI Agents needing seamless skill synchronization across multiple tools like Claude Code and Cursor","zh":"适合需要在多个工具（如 Claude Code 和 Cursor）中实现无缝技能同步的 AI CLI Agents","ja":"Claude CodeやCursorなどの複数のツールでシームレスなスキル同期が必要なAI CLIエージェントに適しています","ko":"Claude Code와 Cursor 등의 여러 도구에서 무결점의 스킬 동기화를 필요로 하는 AI CLI 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para AI CLI Agents que necesitan una sincronización perfecta de habilidades entre múltiples herramientas como Claude Code y Cursor","fr":"Idéal pour les AI CLI Agents nécessitant une synchronisation transparente des compétences sur plusieurs outils comme Claude Code et Cursor","de":"Perfekt für AI CLI Agents, die nahtlose Skill-Synchronisierung über mehrere Tools wie Claude Code und Cursor benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes CLI de IA que necessitam de sincronização de habilidades sem interrupções em várias ferramentas como Claude Code e Cursor","ru":"Идеально для агентов CLI ИИ, которым требуется бесперебойная синхронизация навыков в нескольких инструментах, таких как Claude Code и Cursor","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة سطر الأوامر بالذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى تنسيق مهارات متواصل عبر أدوات متعددة مثل Claude Code و Cursor"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to sync skills across all AI CLI tools with one command, simplifying team sharing and supporting protocols like config.yaml, while auto-detecting project mode and force-syncing with flags like -p or -g","zh":"赋予代理以一个命令在所有AI CLI工具中同步技能的能力，简化团队共享并支持诸如config.yaml的协议，同时自动检测项目模式并使用-p或-g等标志强制同步","ja":"エージェントに、1つのコマンドですべてのAI CLIツールでスキルを同期する能力を与え、チームの共有を簡素化し、config.yamlなどのプロトコルをサポートし、プロジェクトモードを自動で検出し、-pまたは-gなどのフラグで強制同期します","ko":"에이전트에게 하나의 명령어로 모든 AI CLI 툴에서 스킬을 동기화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 팀 공유를 간소화하고 config.yaml 같은 프로토콜을 지원하며 프로젝트 모드를 자동으로 감지하고 -p 또는 -g 같은 플래그로 강제 동기화합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes sincronizar habilidades en todas las herramientas AI CLI con un solo comando, simplificando el intercambio en equipo y admitiendo protocolos como config.yaml, mientras detecta automáticamente el modo de proyecto y fuerza la sincronización con flags como -p o -g","fr":"Permet aux agents de synchroniser les compétences sur tous les outils AI CLI avec une seule commande, simplifiant le partage d''équipe et prenant en charge des protocoles comme config.yaml, tout en détectant automatiquement le mode projet et forçant la synchronisation avec des flags comme -p ou -g","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, Skills über alle AI CLI-Tools mit einem Befehl zu synchronisieren, vereinfacht das Team-Sharing und unterstützt Protokolle wie config.yaml, während automatisch der Projektmodus erkannt und mit Flags wie -p oder -g erzwungen wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a sincronizar habilidades em todas as ferramentas CLI de IA com um comando, simplificando o compartilhamento em equipe e suportando protocolos como config.yaml, além de detectar automaticamente o modo de projeto e forçar a sincronização com flags como -p ou -g","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью синхронизировать навыки во всех инструментах CLI ИИ с помощью одной команды, упрощая обмен командой и поддерживая протоколы, такие как config.yaml, а также автоматически обнаруживая режим проекта и принудительно синхронизируя с флагами, такими как -p или -g","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية مزامنة المهارات في جميع أدوات واجهة سطر الأوامر بالذكاء الاصطناعي مع أمر واحد، وبذلك يُبسط مشاركة الفريق ودعم بروتوكولات مثل config.yaml، بالإضافة إلى الكشف التلقائي عن وضع المشروع وتمكين مزامنة قسريّة باستخدام أعلام مثل -p أو -g"},"useCases":{"en":["Synchronizing skills globally with one command","Initializing project-local skills with repo-specific configurations","Importing existing CLI skills for Claude Code or OpenClaw"],"zh":["使用一个命令全局同步技能","使用仓库特定配置初始化项目本地技能","导入现有的CLI技能用于Claude Code或OpenClaw"],"ja":["1つのコマンドでスキルをグローバルに同期する","リポジトリ固有の構成でプロジェクトローカルのスキルを初期化する","Claude CodeまたはOpenClaw用の既存のCLIスキルをインポートする"],"ko":["하나의 명령어로 스킬을 글로벌하게 동기화하는 것","저장소 특정 구성으로 프로젝트 로컬 스킬을 초기화하는 것","Claude Code 또는 OpenClaw를 위한 기존의 CLI 스킬을 가져오는 것"],"es":["Sincronizar habilidades globalmente con un solo comando","Inicializar habilidades locales del proyecto con configuraciones específicas del repositorio","Importar habilidades CLI existentes para Claude Code u OpenClaw"],"fr":["Synchroniser les compétences globalement avec une seule commande","Initialiser les compétences locales au projet avec des configurations spécifiques au dépôt","Importer des compétences CLI existantes pour Claude Code ou OpenClaw"],"de":["Globale Synchronisierung von Skills mit einem Befehl","Initialisierung projektspezifischer Skills mit repo-spezifischen Konfigurationen","Import bestehender CLI-Skills für Claude Code oder OpenClaw"],"pt":["Sincronizar habilidades globalmente com um comando","Inicializar habilidades locais do projeto com configurações específicas do repositório","Importar habilidades CLI existentes para Claude Code ou OpenClaw"],"ru":["Глобальная синхронизация навыков с помощью одной команды","Инициализация навыков проекта с конфигурациями, специфичными для репозитория","Импорт существующих навыков CLI для Claude Code или OpenClaw"],"ar":["مزامنة المهارات على مستوى العالم بأمر واحد","تثبيت مهارات محلية للمشروع مع تكوينات محددة للمستودع","استيراد مهارات واجهة سطر الأوامر الحالية لـ Claude Code أو OpenClaw"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires skillshare configuration files like config.yaml","Dependent on CLI tool compatibility like Claude Code or OpenCode"],"zh":["需要skillshare配置文件，如config.yaml","依赖于CLI工具兼容性，如Claude Code或OpenCode"],"ja":["config.yamlなどのスキルシェア構成ファイルが必要","Claude CodeまたはOpenCodeなどのCLIツールの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["config.yaml 같은 스킬 공유 구성 파일이 필요함","Claude Code 또는 OpenCode 같은 CLI 툴의 호환성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere archivos de configuración skillshare como config.yaml","Depende de la compatibilidad de herramientas CLI como Claude Code u OpenCode"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers de configuration skillshare comme config.yaml","Dépend de la compatibilité des outils CLI comme Claude Code ou OpenCode"],"de":["Erfordert Skillshare-Konfigurationsdateien wie config.yaml","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität der CLI-Tools wie Claude Code oder OpenCode"],"pt":["Requer arquivos de configuração de compartilhamento de habilidades como config.yaml","Depende da compatibilidade da ferramenta CLI, como Claude Code ou OpenCode"],"ru":["Требует конфигурационных файлов для обмена навыками, таких как config.yaml","Зависит от совместимости инструмента CLI, такого как Claude Code или OpenCode"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات تكوين لمشاركة المهارات مثل config.yaml","يعتمد على توافق أداة واجهة سطر الأوامر، مثل Claude Code أو OpenCode"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1e19646d280cc6ca420322511b4eeed3b85d975b2078445716805cad545ff6bf","qualityScore":44}');
