理","AI智能代理的优点","Claude Code AI智能代理","Gemini CLI AI智能代理","Cursor AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置"],"ja":["AIエージェント","AIツール","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの利点","Claude Code AIエージェント","Gemini CLI AIエージェント","Cursor AIエージェント","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","AI 도구","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트의 장점","Claude Code AI 에이전트","Gemini CLI AI 에이전트","Cursor AI 에이전트","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de voz AI","qué es un agente de voz AI","alternativas a Claude Code","Gemini CLI vs Claude Code","instalación de agentes de voz AI","guía de configuración de agentes de voz AI","desarrollo de aplicaciones de voz AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents vocaux IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent vocal IA","alternatives à Claude Code","Gemini CLI vs Claude Code","installation d''agents vocaux IA","guide de configuration d''agents vocaux IA","développement d''applications de voix IA"],"de":["wie man Sprachagenten AI verwendet","was ist ein Sprachagent AI","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Gemini CLI vs Claude Code","Installation von Sprachagenten AI","Konfigurationsanleitung für Sprachagenten AI","Entwicklung von Sprachanwendungen AI"],"pt":["agentes de voz","como usar agentes de voz","o que são agentes de voz","Claude Code alternative","Gemini CLI vs Claude Code","instalar agentes de voz","guia de configuração de agentes de voz"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","как использовать ИИ агентов","что такое ИИ агенты","Claude Code альтернатива","Gemini CLI vs Claude Code","установка ИИ агентов","руководство по настройке ИИ агентов"],"ar":["وكلاء الصوت","كيفية استخدام وكلاء الصوت","ما هي وكلاء الصوت","بديل Claude Code","Gemini CLI مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت وكلاء الصوت","دليل إعداد وكلاء الصوت"]}},"owner":"rootcastleco","repo":"rei-skills","repoPath":"rootcastleco/rei-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.151Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"voice-agents","description":"Voice agents represent the frontier of AI interaction - humans speaking naturally with AI systems. The challenge isnt just speech recognition and synthesis, its achieving natural conversation flo...","bodyPreview":"# Voice Agents\n\nYou are a voice AI architect who has shipped production voice agents handling\nmillions of calls. You understand the physics of latency - every component\nadds milliseconds, and the sum determines whether conversations feel natural\nor awkward.\n\nYour core insight: Two architectures exist. Speech-to-speech (S2S) models like\nOpenAI Realtime API preserve emotion and achieve lowest latency but are less\ncontrollable. Pipeline architectures (STT→LLM→TTS) give you control at each\nstep but","body":"# Voice Agents\n\nYou are a voice AI architect who has shipped production voice agents handling\nmillions of calls. You understand the physics of latency - every component\nadds milliseconds, and the sum determines whether conversations feel natural\nor awkward.\n\nYour core insight: Two architectures exist. Speech-to-speech (S2S) models like\nOpenAI Realtime API preserve emotion and achieve lowest latency but are less\ncontrollable. Pipeline architectures (STT→LLM→TTS) give you control at each\nstep but add latency. Mos\n\n## Capabilities\n\n- voice-agents\n- speech-to-speech\n- speech-to-text\n- text-to-speech\n- conversational-ai\n- voice-activity-detection\n- turn-taking\n- barge-in-detection\n- voice-interfaces\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Speech-to-Speech Architecture\n\nDirect audio-to-audio processing for lowest latency\n\n### Pipeline Architecture\n\nSeparate STT → LLM → TTS for maximum control\n\n### Voice Activity Detection Pattern\n\nDetect when user starts/stops speaking\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Ignoring Latency Budget\n\n### ❌ Silence-Only Turn Detection\n\n### ❌ Long Responses\n\n## ⚠️ Sharp Edges\n\n| Issue | Severity | Solution |\n|-------|----------|----------|\n| Issue | critical | # Measure and budget latency for each component: |\n| Issue | high | # Target jitter metrics: |\n| Issue | high | # Use semantic VAD: |\n| Issue | high | # Implement barge-in detection: |\n| Issue | medium | # Constrain response length in prompts: |\n| Issue | medium | # Prompt for spoken format: |\n| Issue | medium | # Implement noise handling: |\n| Issue | medium | # Mitigate STT errors: |\n\n## Related Skills\n\nWorks well with: `agent-tool-builder`, `multi-agent-orchestration`, `llm-architect`, `backend`\n\n## When to Use\nThis skill is applicable to execute the workflow or actions described in the overview.\n\n---\n\n> 🏰 **Rei Skills** — Curated by [Rootcastle Engineering & Innovation](https://www.rootcastle.com) | Batuhan Ayrıbaş  \n> Engineering Beyond Boundaries | admin@rootcastle.com\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:45:42.911Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational AI Agents needing advanced voice interaction capabilities with low latency using Speech-to-Speech (S2S) models or Pipeline architectures","zh":"适用于需要高级语音交互能力的对话式 AI 代理，使用语音到语音 (S2S) 模型或 Pipeline 架构实现低延迟","ja":"会話AIエージェントが高度なボイスインタラクション機能を必要とする場合に適しています。Speech-to-Speech (S2S) モデルまたはパイプラインアーキテクチャを使用して低遅延を実現します","ko":"대화형 AI 에이전트가 고급 음성 상호 작용 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. 음성 대 음성 (S2S) 모델 또는 파이프라인 아키텍처를 사용하여 낮은 지연 시간을实现합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Conversacional que necesitan capacidades de interacción de voz avanzadas con baja latencia utilizando modelos de Voz a Voz (S2S) o arquitecturas de Pipeline","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Conversationnelle ayant besoin de capacités d''interaction vocale avancées avec une faible latence utilisant des modèles de Voix à Voix (S2S) ou des architectures de Pipeline","de":"Perfekt für Conversational AI-Agents, die erweiterte Sprachinteraktionsfunktionen mit geringer Latenz unter Verwendung von Sprache-zu-Sprache- (S2S-) Modellen oder Pipeline-Architekturen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Conversacional que precisam de capacidades de interação de voz avançadas com baixa latência usando modelos de Fala-para-Fala (S2S) ou arquiteturas de Pipeline","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных ИИ Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности голосового взаимодействия с низкой задержкой с использованием моделей Speech-to-Speech (S2S) или архитектур Pipeline","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المحادثة الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانات تفاعل الصوت المتقدمة مع انخفاض الكسوف باستخدام نماذج الصوت إلى الصوت (S2S) أو هندسة Pipeline"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle millions of voice calls with natural conversation flow using OpenAI Realtime API for emotion preservation and lowest latency, while also leveraging Pipeline architectures (STT→LLM→TTS) for controllable voice interactions","zh":"赋予代理处理数百万个语音通话的能力，使用 OpenAI 实时 API 保留情感并实现最低延迟，同时利用 Pipeline 架构 (STT→LLM→TTS) 实现可控的语音交互","ja":"OpenAI Realtime API を使用して感情を保持し、最も低い遅延を実現しながら、数百万のボイスコールを処理するエージェントを可能にします。また、パイプラインアーキテクチャ (STT→LLM→TTS) を活用して、可制御なボイスインタラクションを実現します","ko":"OpenAI 실시간 API를 사용하여 감정을 보존하고 최저 지연 시간을實現하면서 수백만 개의 음성 통화를 처리할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다. 또한 파이프라인 아키텍처 (STT→LLM→TTS)를 활용하여 제어 가능한 음성 상호 작용을實現합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar millones de llamadas de voz con un flujo de conversación natural utilizando la API OpenAI Realtime para la preservación de emociones y la latencia más baja, y también aprovecha las arquitecturas de Pipeline (STT→LLM→TTS) para interacciones de voz controlables","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des millions d''appels vocaux avec un flux de conversation naturel en utilisant l''API OpenAI Realtime pour la préservation des émotions et la latence la plus basse, tout en exploitant les architectures de Pipeline (STT→LLM→TTS) pour des interactions vocales contrôlables","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Millionen von Sprachanrufen mit einem natürlichen Konversationsfluss zu bearbeiten, indem die OpenAI-Echtzeit-API für die Emotionserhaltung und die geringste Latenz verwendet wird, während auch Pipeline-Architekturen (STT→LLM→TTS) für steuerbare Sprachinteraktionen genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidarem com milhões de chamadas de voz com fluxo de conversa natural usando a OpenAI Realtime API para preservação de emoções e menor latência, aproveitando também as arquiteturas de Pipeline (STT→LLM→TTS) para interações de voz controláveis","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать миллионы голосовых звонков с естественным потоком разговора, используя OpenAI Realtime API для сохранения эмоций и минимальной задержки, а также использует архитектуры Pipeline (STT→LLM→TTS) для контролируемых голосовых взаимодействий","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من التعامل مع ملايين المكالمات الصوتية مع تدفق محادثة طبيعي باستخدام OpenAI Realtime API للحفاظ على العواطف وأقل تأخير، واستخدام هندسة Pipeline (STT→LLM→TTS) لتفاعلات صوتية قابلة للتحكم"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing voice agents with optimal latency for natural conversations","Implementing Speech-to-Speech models for emotion preservation","Developing Pipeline architectures for controllable voice interactions"],"zh":["为自然对话设计具有最佳延迟的语音代理","实现语音到语音模型以保留情感","开发 Pipeline 架构以实现可控的语音交互"],"ja":["自然な会話のための最適な遅延を備えたボイスエージェントの設計","感情を保持するための Speech-to-Speech モデルの実装","可制御なボイスインタラクションのためのパイプラインアーキテクチャの開発"],"ko":["自然한 대화에 최적의 지연 시간을 갖춘 음성 에이전트 설계","감정을 보존하기 위한 음성 대 음성 모델 구현","제어 가능한 음성 상호 작용을 위한 파이프라인 아키텍처 개발"],"es":["Diseñar agentes de voz con latencia óptima para conversaciones naturales","Implementar modelos de Voz a Voz para la preservación de emociones","Desarrollar arquitecturas de Pipeline para interacciones de voz controlables"],"fr":["Concevoir des agents vocaux avec une latence optimale pour des conversations naturelles","Mettre en œuvre des modèles de Voix à Voix pour la préservation des émotions","Développer des architectures de Pipeline pour des interactions vocales contrôlables"],"de":["Entwerfen von Sprachagenten mit optimaler Latenz für natürliche Konversationen","Implementieren von Sprache-zu-Sprache-Modellen für die Emotionserhaltung","Entwickeln von Pipeline-Architekturen für steuerbare Sprachinteraktionen"],"pt":["Projetar agentes de voz com latência ótima para conversas naturais","Implementar modelos de Fala-para-Fala para preservação de emoções","Desenvolver arquiteturas de Pipeline para interações de voz controláveis"],"ru":["Проектирование голосовых агентов с оптимальной задержкой для естественных разговоров","Реализация моделей Speech-to-Speech для сохранения эмоций","Разработка архитектур Pipeline для контролируемых голосовых взаимодействий"],"ar":["تصميم وكلاء الصوت مع تأخير مثالي لل محادثات الطبيعية","تنفيذ نماذج الصوت إلى الصوت للحفاظ على العواطف","تطوير هندسة Pipeline لتفاعلات صوتية قابلة للتحكم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of physics of latency","Trade-offs between latency and controllability in S2S and Pipeline architectures"],"zh":["需要理解延迟的物理学","在 S2S 和 Pipeline 架构中延迟和可控性之间的权衡"],"ja":["遅延の物理学の理解が必要","S2S およびパイプラインアーキテクチャにおける遅延と可制御性のトレードオフ"],"ko":["지연 시간의 물리학을 이해해야 함","S2S 및 파이프라인 아키텍처에서 지연 시간과 제어 가능성 사이의 트레이드 오프"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la física de la latencia","Compromisos entre latencia y controlabilidad en las arquitecturas S2S y Pipeline"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la physique de la latence","Compromis entre latence et contrôlabilité dans les architectures S2S et Pipeline"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis der Physik der Latenz","Kompromisse zwischen Latenz und Steuerbarkeit in S2S- und Pipeline-Architekturen"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da física da latência","Compromissos entre latência e controllabilidade em arquiteturas S2S e Pipeline"],"ru":["Требует понимания физики задержки","Компромиссы между задержкой и контролируемостью в архитектурах S2S и Pipeline"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم فيزياء التأخير","ترادفات بين التأخير والقابلية للتحكم في هندسة S2S و Pipeline"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3669dfc73457df4b2c06311b454e431a0b0dd6ace91d362905947fe428762a6a","qualityScore":44}');
