sarrollo móvil con React Native","actualización de versiones de iOS","compatibilidad con Android y App Store"],"fr":["comment utiliser bump-ios-version","outils d''IA pour le développement mobile","bump-ios-version vs d''autres outils","guide d''installation de bump-ios-version","configuration de bump-ios-version","développement mobile avec React Native","mise à jour des versions d''iOS","compatibilité avec Android et l''App Store"],"de":["wie man bump-ios-version verwendet","KI-Tools für mobile Entwicklung","bump-ios-version vs andere Tools","Installationsanleitung für bump-ios-version","Konfiguration von bump-ios-version","Mobile Entwicklung mit React Native","Aktualisierung von iOS-Versionen","Kompatibilität mit Android und App Store"],"pt":["como usar bump-ios-version","o que é bump-ios-version","bump-ios-version vs outras ferramentas","instalar bump-ios-version","guia de configuração do bump-ios-version","desenvolvimento de apps iOS","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать bump-ios-version","что такое bump-ios-version","bump-ios-version vs другие инструменты","установить bump-ios-version","руководство по настройке bump-ios-version","разработка приложений iOS","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام bump-ios-version","ما هي bump-ios-version","bump-ios-version مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت bump-ios-version","دليل إعداد bump-ios-version","تطوير تطبيقات iOS","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"artsy","repo":"eigen","repoPath":"artsy/eigen","stars":3757,"forks":593,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T20:04:02Z","topics":["android","app","app-store","art","ios","objective-c","react-native","swift"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bump-ios-version","description":"Bump iOS and Xcode versions in Eigen. Use when the user wants to upgrade iOS SDK version, update Xcode version, change simulator version, or update CI configuration for new iOS/Xcode releases.","bodyPreview":"# Bump iOS/Xcode Version\n\nThis skill guides you through bumping the iOS and Xcode version in Eigen.\n\n## Before You Start\n\n**Prompt the user for the target version:**\n\n- Ask which iOS version they want to bump to (e.g., \"26.2\")\n- Ask which Xcode version they want to use (e.g., \"26.2\")\n- Ask which iPhone model to use for simulators (e.g., \"iPhone 17 Pro\")\n\n**Verify version support before making changes:**\n\n### CircleCI Support\n\nCheck supported Xcode versions at: https://circleci.com/developer/mach","body":"# Bump iOS/Xcode Version\n\nThis skill guides you through bumping the iOS and Xcode version in Eigen.\n\n## Before You Start\n\n**Prompt the user for the target version:**\n\n- Ask which iOS version they want to bump to (e.g., \"26.2\")\n- Ask which Xcode version they want to use (e.g., \"26.2\")\n- Ask which iPhone model to use for simulators (e.g., \"iPhone 17 Pro\")\n\n**Verify version support before making changes:**\n\n### CircleCI Support\n\nCheck supported Xcode versions at: https://circleci.com/developer/machine/image/xcode\n\nCurrently supported versions include:\n\n- 26.2, 26.1.1, 26.1, 26.0.1, 26.0\n- 16.4, 16.3, 16.2\n\n### GitHub Actions Support\n\nCheck macOS runner images at: https://github.com/actions/runner-images\n\nFor macOS 15 runners, available Xcode versions include:\n\n- 26.2, 26.1.1, 26.0.1\n- 16.4 (default), 16.3, 16.2, 16.1, 16.0\n\nIf the requested version is not supported by both CI systems, warn the user that CI builds may fail.\n\n### iPhone Device Compatibility\n\nDifferent iOS versions require specific iPhone simulator models. **You must verify the iPhone model is available for the target iOS version in CircleCI''s image manifest.**\n\n**How to verify:**\n\n1. Go to https://circleci.com/docs/guides/test/testing-ios/#supported-xcode-versions\n2. Find the target Xcode version row\n3. Click on \"Installed software\" link in the \"VM Software Manifest\" column\n4. In the manifest, search for the iOS version to see which iPhone simulators are available\n\n**Example compatibility (from CircleCI Xcode 26.2 manifest):**\n\n| iOS Version | Available iPhone Models                                                 |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| iOS 18.x    | iPhone 16 Pro, iPhone 16 Pro Max, iPhone 16, iPhone 16 Plus, iPhone 16e |\n| iOS 26.x    | iPhone 17 Pro, iPhone 17 Pro Max, iPhone 17, iPhone Air, iPhone 16e     |\n\n**Important:** iOS 26 simulators require iPhone 17 series devices. Using iPhone 16 Pro with iOS 26 will fail because it''s not available in the manifest.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Update `ios-config.json` (single source of truth)\n\nUpdate ALL fields in `ios-config.json` at the project root:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"xcode_version\": \"<NEW_XCODE_VERSION>\",\n  \"ios_version\": \"<NEW_IOS_VERSION>\",\n  \"iphone_model\": \"<NEW_IPHONE_MODEL>\",\n  \"simulator_device_type\": \"com.apple.CoreSimulator.SimDeviceType.<DEVICE-TYPE-ID>\",\n  \"simulator_runtime\": \"com.apple.CoreSimulator.SimRuntime.iOS-<MAJOR>-<MINOR>\"\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Update `.circleci/config.yml` (cannot read from JSON at runtime)\n\nCircleCI pipeline parameter defaults must be static YAML values. Update these three values in the `parameters` section:\n\n```yaml\nparameters:\n  xcode_version:\n    type: string\n    default: \"<NEW_XCODE_VERSION>\"\n  simulator_version:\n    type: string\n    default: \"<NEW_IOS_VERSION>\"\n```\n\nAlso update the `device` in the `macos/preboot-simulator` step of the `build-test-app-ios` job:\n\n```yaml\n- macos/preboot-simulator:\n    version: << pipeline.parameters.simulator_version >>\n    platform: \"iOS\"\n    device: \"<NEW_IPHONE_MODEL>\"\n```\n\n### 3. That''s It!\n\nThe following files read directly from `ios-config.json` and need NO manual updates:\n\n- `scripts/ci/ci-setup-export-vars` (reads via `jq`)\n- `scripts/utils/doctor.js` (reads via `fs.readFileSync` + `JSON.parse`)\n- `fastlane/Fastfile` (reads via `File.read` + `JSON.parse`)\n- `.github/actions/setup-ios-environment/action.yml` (reads via `jq`)\n- `.github/workflows/ios-e2e-maestro.yml` (reads via `jq`)\n- `ios/ArtsyTests/Supporting_Files/ARTestHelper.m` (reads via `NSJSONSerialization` from test bundle)\n\n## Summary Checklist\n\n- [ ] Verify target Xcode version is supported by CircleCI\n- [ ] Verify target Xcode version is supported by GitHub Actions\n- [ ] Verify iPhone model is available for target iOS version (check CircleCI manifest)\n- [ ] Update `ios-config.json`\n- [ ] Update `.circleci/config.yml` (xcode_version, simulator_version, preboot-simulator device)\n\n## Testing (done by user)\n\nAfter making changes:\n\n1. Push changes and verify CircleCI builds pass\n2. Verify GitHub Actions E2E tests create the simulator correctly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:26:20.248Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for iOS Development Agents needing to manage and update Xcode versions seamlessly.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝管理和更新Xcode版本的iOS开发代理。","ja":"Xcodeバージョンをシームレスに管理および更新する必要があるiOS開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Xcode 버전을 무결점으로 관리하고 업데이트해야 하는 iOS 개발 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de iOS que necesitan administrar y actualizar versiones de Xcode de manera fluida.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement d''iOS ayant besoin de gérer et de mettre à jour les versions de Xcode de manière transparente.","de":"Perfekt für iOS-Entwicklungsagenten, die Xcode-Versionen nahtlos verwalten und aktualisieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento do iOS que precisam gerenciar e atualizar versões do Xcode de forma transparente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки iOS, которым необходимо управлять и обновлять версии Xcode без проблем.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يطورون تطبيقات iOS ويهتمون بتحديث إصدارات Xcode بشكل متواصل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify version support before making changes, utilizing CircleCI and checking supported Xcode versions, ensuring compatibility with specific iPhone models for simulators, and updating iOS and Xcode versions in Eigen.","zh":"赋予代理人在CircleCI上验证版本支持的能力，然后检查支持的Xcode版本，确保兼容特定的iPhone机型用于模拟器，并在Eigen中更新iOS和Xcode版本。","ja":"エージェントにCircleCI上でバージョンサポートを確認する機能を提供し、サポートされているXcodeバージョンを確認し、シミュレータ用の特定のiPhoneモデルとの互換性を確保し、EigenでiOSおよびXcodeバージョンを更新します。","ko":"에이전트가 CircleCI에서 버전 지원을 확인할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 지원되는 Xcode 버전을 확인하고 시뮬레이터용 특정 iPhone 모델과 호환성을 보장하며 Eigen에서 iOS 및 Xcode 버전을 업데이트합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para verificar el soporte de versiones antes de realizar cambios, utilizando CircleCI y comprobando las versiones de Xcode admitidas, garantizando la compatibilidad con modelos de iPhone específicos para simuladores y actualizando las versiones de iOS y Xcode en Eigen.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour vérifier la prise en charge des versions avant d''apporter des modifications, en utilisant CircleCI et en vérifiant les versions de Xcode prises en charge, en garantissant la compatibilité avec des modèles d''iPhone spécifiques pour les simulateurs et en mettant à jour les versions d''iOS et de Xcode dans Eigen.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Versionsunterstützung vor der Durchführung von Änderungen zu überprüfen, indem sie CircleCI verwenden und die unterstützten Xcode-Versionen überprüfen, die Kompatibilität mit bestimmten iPhone-Modellen für Simulatoren sicherstellen und die iOS- und Xcode-Versionen in Eigen aktualisieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes verifiquem o suporte à versão antes de fazer alterações, utilizando CircleCI e verificando as versões do Xcode suportadas, garantindo a compatibilidade com modelos específicos de iPhone para simuladores e atualizando as versões do iOS e do Xcode no Eigen.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять поддержку версий перед внесением изменений, используя CircleCI и проверяя поддерживаемые версии Xcode, обеспечивая совместимость с определенными моделями iPhone для симуляторов и обновляя версии iOS и Xcode в Eigen.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من دعم الإصدار قبل إجراء التغييرات، مستخدمين CircleCI ومتحققين من إصدارات Xcode المدعومة، وضمان التوافق مع نماذج محددة من iPhone لأجهزة المحاكاة وتنفيذ تحديثات لنظام التشغيل iOS وإصدارات Xcode في Eigen."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating iOS version updates in Eigen","Verifying Xcode version support on CircleCI","Configuring iPhone models for simulator testing"],"zh":["在Eigen中自动执行iOS版本更新","在CircleCI上验证Xcode版本支持","为模拟器测试配置iPhone机型"],"ja":["EigenでのiOSバージョン更新の自動化","CircleCIでのXcodeバージョンサポートの確認","シミュレータテスト用のiPhoneモデルの構成"],"ko":["Eigen에서 iOS 버전 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","CircleCI에서 Xcode 버전 지원 확인","시뮬레이터 테스트를 위한 iPhone 모델 구성"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de versiones de iOS en Eigen","Verificar el soporte de la versión de Xcode en CircleCI","Configurar modelos de iPhone para pruebas de simulador"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de versions d''iOS dans Eigen","Vérifier la prise en charge de la version de Xcode sur CircleCI","Configurer des modèles d''iPhone pour les tests de simulateur"],"de":["Automatisieren der iOS-Version-Updates in Eigen","Überprüfen der Xcode-Version-Unterstützung auf CircleCI","Konfigurieren von iPhone-Modellen für Simulator-Tests"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de versão do iOS no Eigen","Verificar suporte à versão do Xcode no CircleCI","Configurar modelos de iPhone para testes de simulador"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления версий iOS в Eigen","Проверять поддержку версий Xcode в CircleCI","Настроить модели iPhone для тестирования симулятора"],"ar":["توفير تحديثات أوتوماتيكية لإصدارات نظام التشغيل iOS في Eigen","التحقق من دعم إصدارات Xcode في CircleCI","تكوين نماذج من iPhone لاختبارات المحاكاة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to CircleCI for version support checks","Eigen environment necessary for iOS and Xcode version updates","Specific iPhone model selection required for simulator configuration"],"zh":["需要访问CircleCI以进行版本支持检查","需要Eigen环境以更新iOS和Xcode版本","需要特定的iPhone机型选择以进行模拟器配置"],"ja":["バージョンサポート確認のためにCircleCIへのアクセスが必要","iOSおよびXcodeバージョンを更新するためにEigen環境が必要","シミュレータ構成のために特定のiPhoneモデルの選択が必要"],"ko":["버전 지원 확인을 위해 CircleCI에 액세스해야 함","iOS 및 Xcode 버전을 업데이트하기 위해 Eigen 환경이 필요함","시뮬레이터 구성하기 위해 특정 iPhone 모델 선택이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a CircleCI para verificar el soporte de versiones","Entorno de Eigen necesario para las actualizaciones de versiones de iOS y Xcode","Selección de modelo de iPhone específico necesaria para la configuración del simulador"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à CircleCI pour vérifier la prise en charge des versions","Environnement Eigen nécessaire pour les mises à jour des versions d''iOS et de Xcode","Sélection d''un modèle d''iPhone spécifique nécessaire pour la configuration du simulateur"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf CircleCI für die Überprüfung der Versionsunterstützung","Eigen-Umgebung erforderlich für iOS- und Xcode-Version-Updates","Spezifische Auswahl eines iPhone-Modells erforderlich für die Simulator-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao CircleCI para verificações de suporte à versão","Ambiente Eigen necessário para atualizações de versão do iOS e Xcode","Seleção de modelo de iPhone específico necessária para configuração do simulador"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к CircleCI для проверок поддержки версий","Среда Eigen необходима для обновлений версий iOS и Xcode","Требуется выбор конкретной модели iPhone для конфигурации симулятора"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى CircleCI للتحقق من دعم الإصدارات","بيئة Eigen ضرورية لتحديثات إصدارات نظام التشغيل iOS و Xcode","يتطلب اختيار نموذج محدد من iPhone لتكوين جهاز المحاكاة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"24cbad2ad6b2d5796e78537762619949c6ccfe5d00c2e330e4b246aa09886d5b","qualityScore":43}');
