list und ask","Visuelle Komponenten wie code, table und markdown","Unterstützung für die Ausführung von Komponenten mit awb run","Wartefunktion zum Lesen von JSON-Antworten","Titelvoraussetzung für jede Ausführung von awb run"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento interativo com componentes","Criação de experiências personalizadas","Suporte a componentes como confirm, checklist e ask","Integração com Claude Code","Interface de usuário personalizável"],"ru":["Интерактивная разработка с компонентами","Создание персонализированных trải nghiệm","Поддержка компонентов như confirm, checklist и ask","Интеграция с Claude Code","Настраиваемый интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["التطوير التفاعلي مع المكونات","إنشاء تجارب مخصصة","دعم المكونات مثل confirm و checklist و ask","التكامل مع Claude Code","واجهة مستخدم قابلة للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AWB","交互式开发环境","Claude Code","快速开发","代码测试","组件化开发"],"ja":["AWB","インタラクティブ開発環境","Claude Code","迅速な開発","コードテスト","コンポーネント化開発"],"ko":["AWB","인터랙티브 개발 환경","Claude Code","빠른 개발","코드 테스트","컴포넌트화 개발"],"es":["awb","entorno de desarrollo interactivo","Claude Code","componentes interactivos","visualización de datos","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","tecnologías de desarrollo"],"fr":["awb","environnement de développement interactif","Claude Code","composants interactifs","visualisation de données","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","technologies de développement"],"de":["awb","interaktive Entwicklungsumgebung","Claude Code","interaktive Komponenten","Datenvisualisierung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Entwicklungstechnologien"],"pt":["AWB","Desenvolvimento interativo","Claude Code","Componentes","Experiências personalizadas","Tecnologia de desenvolvimento","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["AWB","Интерактивная разработка","Claude Code","Компоненты","Персонализированные trải nghiệm","Технология разработки","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["AWB","التطوير التفاعلي","Claude Code","المكونات","التجارب المخصصة","تكنولوجيا التطوير","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"termos-dev","repo":"agent-workbench","repoPath":"termos-dev/agent-workbench","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.878Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"awb","description":"Run Agent Workbench (awb) interactive UI components from Codex or the CLI. Use when the user needs a confirmation, checklist, input, table, code or markdown view, or a visual playground. Always follow interactive runs with awb wait and the returned ID. Use tmux for long-running commands (see awb --help).","bodyPreview":"# Agent Workbench (awb)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Ensure the user has the playground open with `awb ui`.\n2. Run a component with `awb run --title \"...\" <component> [args]`.\n3. Always call `awb wait <id>` and read the JSON response.\n\n## Components\n\nInteractive: `confirm`, `checklist`, `ask`\nDisplay: `code`, `table`, `markdown`, `plan-viewer`, `html`\n\n## Essential Rules\n\n- Require `--title` for every `awb run`.\n- Run `awb run --help` before using a component you are unsure about.\n- If `awb` is not on PA","body":"# Agent Workbench (awb)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Ensure the user has the playground open with `awb ui`.\n2. Run a component with `awb run --title \"...\" <component> [args]`.\n3. Always call `awb wait <id>` and read the JSON response.\n\n## Components\n\nInteractive: `confirm`, `checklist`, `ask`\nDisplay: `code`, `table`, `markdown`, `plan-viewer`, `html`\n\n## Essential Rules\n\n- Require `--title` for every `awb run`.\n- Run `awb run --help` before using a component you are unsure about.\n- If `awb` is not on PATH, ask the user to install or run the local CLI.\n\n## Interactive Runs (Always wait)\n\n`awb run` returns immediately with an ID. Always call `awb wait <id>` to get the response.\n\n```bash\nID=$(awb run --title \"Q1\" confirm --prompt \"Approve?\")\nawb wait $ID\n```\n\nFire multiple at once, then wait for each:\n\n```bash\nID1=$(awb run --title \"Q1\" confirm --prompt \"Approve?\")\nID2=$(awb run --title \"Q2\" checklist --items \"A,B,C\")\nawb wait $ID1\nawb wait $ID2\n```\n\n## Wait Results\n\n`awb wait <id>` returns JSON with the user''s response:\n\n```json\n{\"confirmed\": true}\n{\"items\": [{\"text\":\"A\",\"checked\":true}]}\n{\"answers\": {\"key\": \"value\"}}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\nconfirm\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Deploy\" confirm --prompt \"Deploy to production?\"\n```\n\nchecklist\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Tasks\" checklist --items \"Build,Test,Deploy\"\n```\n\nask (1-4 questions)\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Name\" ask --questions ''[{\"question\":\"Your name?\",\"header\":\"name\"}]''\nawb run --title \"Pick\" ask --questions ''[{\"question\":\"Language?\",\"header\":\"lang\",\"options\":[{\"label\":\"TypeScript\"},{\"label\":\"Python\"}]}]''\nawb run --title \"Features\" ask --questions ''[{\"question\":\"Enable?\",\"header\":\"feat\",\"multiSelect\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Auth\"},{\"label\":\"API\"}]}]''\n```\n\ntable\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Data\" table --data ''[{\"name\":\"Alice\",\"age\":30},{\"name\":\"Bob\",\"age\":25}]''\n```\n\ncode (file only)\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Source\" code --file ./src/index.ts\n```\n\nmarkdown\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Docs\" markdown --file ./README.md\nawb run --title \"Notes\" markdown --content \"# Hello\\n\\nWorld\"\n```\n\nhtml\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Config\" html --content ''<html>...</html>''\n```\n\nplan-viewer\n```bash\nawb run --title \"Plan\" plan-viewer --file ./plan.md\n```\n\n## Background Processes with tmux\n\nUse tmux for long-running processes. Run `awb --help` to see your tmux session name.\n\n```bash\ntmux new-session -A -d -s <session-name>\ntmux new-window -t <session-name> -n \"dev\" \"npm run dev\"\ntmux capture-pane -t <session-name>:dev -p\ntmux send-keys -t <session-name>:dev \"npm test\" Enter\ntmux kill-window -t <session-name>:dev\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:07:20.646Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude Code Agents needing interactive development and debugging capabilities with JSON response handling.","zh":"非常适合需要交互式开发和调试功能以及JSON响应处理的Claude Code Agents。","ja":"Claude Code Agentsが対話型の開発とデバッグ機能、およびJSONレスポンスの処理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"대화형 개발 및 디버깅 기능과 JSON 응답 처리가 필요한 Claude Code 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Código Claude que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo y depuración interactivas con manejo de respuestas JSON.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de code Claude nécessitant des capacités de développement et de débogage interactif avec une gestion de réponses JSON.","de":"Perfekt für Claude-Code-Agents, die interaktive Entwicklung- und Debugging-Funktionen mit JSON-Antwortenverarbeitung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Código Claude que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento e depuração interativas com tratamento de respostas JSON.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Claude Code, которым необходимы интерактивные возможности разработки и отладки с обработкой ответов JSON.","ar":"مثالي لعميل كلود كود الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تطوير وتصحيح أخطاء تفاعلية مع معالجة استجابة JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interactively run and debug components like confirm, checklist, and ask, with features like code, table, and markdown display, utilizing the awb run and awb wait commands with JSON responses.","zh":"赋予代理交互式运行和调试confirm、checklist和ask等组件的能力，具有代码、表格和markdown显示等功能，利用awb run和awb wait命令以JSON响应。","ja":"confirm、checklist、askなどのコンポーネントを対話的に実行およびデバッグするエージェントの能力を提供し、コード、テーブル、markdownの表示などの機能を備え、awb runおよびawb waitコマンドを使用してJSONレスポンスを利用します。","ko":"확인, 체크리스트 및 질문 等의 구성 요소를 대화형으로 실행 및 디버깅 할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 코드, 테이블, 마크 다운 표시 등의 기능을 갖추고 awb 실행 및 awb 대기 명령을 사용하여 JSON 응답을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes ejecutar y depurar de forma interactiva componentes como confirmar, lista de verificación y preguntar, con características como visualización de código, tabla y markdown, utilizando los comandos awb run y awb wait con respuestas JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter et de déboguer de manière interactive des composants tels que confirmer, liste de vérification et demander, avec des fonctionnalités telles que l''affichage de code, de tableaux et de markdown, en utilisant les commandes awb run et awb wait avec des réponses JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Komponenten wie Bestätigen, Checkliste und Fragen interaktiv auszuführen und zu debuggen, mit Funktionen wie Code-, Tabelle- und Markdown-Anzeige, unter Verwendung der Befehle awb run und awb wait mit JSON-Antworten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar e depurar de forma interativa componentes como confirmar, lista de verifica e perguntar, com recursos como exibição de código, tabela e markdown, utilizando os comandos awb executar e awb aguardar com respostas JSON.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интерактивного запуска и отладки компонентов, таких как подтверждение, список проверки и запрос, с функциями, такими как отображение кода, таблицы и markdown, используя команды awb запустить и awb подождать с ответами JSON.","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية تشغيل وتصحيح أخطاء مكونات مثل التأكيد والقائمة والاستعلام بشكل تفاعلي، مع ميزات مثل عرض الكود والجدول وتنسيق markdown، باستخدام أوامر awb تشغيل وawb انتظار مع استجابات JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging interactive components with awb wait and JSON output","Developing and testing checklist and confirm components","Displaying code and markdown content within the Agent Workbench"],"zh":["使用awb wait和JSON输出调试交互式组件","开发和测试检查列表和确认组件","在Agent Workbench中显示代码和markdown内容"],"ja":["awb waitおよびJSON出力を使用した対話型コンポーネントのデバッグ","チェックリストおよび確認コンポーネントの開発およびテスト","エージェントワークベンチ内でコードおよびmarkdownコンテンツを表示"],"ko":["awb 대기 및 JSON 출력을 사용한 대화형 구성 요소 디버깅","체크리스트 및 확인 구성 요소 개발 및 테스트","에이전트 작업 ベンチ 내에서 코드 및 마크 다운 콘텐츠 표시"],"es":["Depuración de componentes interactivos con awb wait y salida JSON","Desarrollo y prueba de componentes de lista de verificación y confirmación","Visualización de contenido de código y markdown dentro del Agent Workbench"],"fr":["Débogage de composants interactifs avec awb wait et sortie JSON","Développement et test de composants de liste de vérification et de confirmation","Affichage de contenu de code et de markdown à l''intérieur de l''Agent Workbench"],"de":["Debugging interaktiver Komponenten mit awb wait und JSON-Ausgabe","Entwicklung und Testen von Checkliste- und Bestätigungskomponenten","Anzeige von Code- und Markdown-Inhalten innerhalb des Agent Workbench"],"pt":["Depuração de componentes interativos com awb aguardar e saída JSON","Desenvolvimento e teste de componentes de lista de verifica e confirmar","Exibição de conteúdo de código e markdown dentro do Agent Workbench"],"ru":["Отладка интерактивных компонентов с awb подождать и выводом JSON","Разработка и тестирование компонентов списка проверки и подтверждения","Отображение содержимого кода и markdown внутри Agent Workbench"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء المكونات التفاعلية مع awb انتظار ومخرجات JSON","تطوير واختبار مكونات القائمة والتأكيد","عرض محتوى الكود وتنسيق markdown داخل Agent Workbench"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires awb ui to be open","Must call awb wait for each component run"],"zh":["需要awb ui打开","必须为每个组件运行调用awb wait"],"ja":["awb uiが開いている必要がある","各コンポーネントの実行ごとにawb waitを呼び出す必要がある"],"ko":["awb ui가 열려 있어야 함","각 구성 요소 실행 시 awb 대기 호출 필요"],"es":["Requiere que awb ui esté abierto","Debe llamar a awb wait para cada ejecución de componente"],"fr":["Nécessite que awb ui soit ouvert","Doit appeler awb wait pour chaque exécution de composant"],"de":["Benötigt, dass awb ui geöffnet ist","Muss awb wait für jeden Komponentenlauf aufrufen"],"pt":["Exige que a interface do usuário awb esteja aberta","Deve chamar awb aguardar para cada execução de componente"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы интерфейс пользователя awb был открыт","Должно вызывать awb подождать для каждого запуска компонента"],"ar":["يتطلب أن تكون واجهة المستخدم awb مفتوحة","يجب استدعاء awb انتظار لكل تشغيل لمكون"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"04fd26f1dac60b864f405eb83f18c2c09f3cf3c75b605f189d85d0c34a55b2b2","qualityScore":43}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('dmmulroy/better-result/better-result-adopt', 'community', 'dmmulroy', 'better-result', 'dmmulroy/better-result', 'better-result-adopt', 0, 0, 43, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:10.740Z', '5f1b3cfb868955a2ff39a188c3d0191c1c70e75e13b5af48d412f35658e8dc03', '{"id":"dmmulroy/better-result/better-result-adopt","name":"better-result-adopt","description":{"zh":"better-result 提供了一种轻量级的 TypeScript 结果类型，用于简化错误处理和提高代码可靠性","ja":"better-resultはTypeScript向けの軽量結果タイプを提供し、エラーハンドリングを簡素化しコードの信頼性を向上させます","ko":"better-result는 TypeScript용 가벼운 결과 유형을 제공하여 오류 처리를 단순화하고 코드의 안정성을 향상시킵니다","es":"better-result es una biblioteca ligera para TypeScript que permite una composición basada en generadores para el manejo de errores","fr":"better-result est une bibliothèque légère pour TypeScript qui permet une composition basée sur des générateurs pour la gestion des erreurs","de":"better-result ist eine leichte Bibliothek für TypeScript, die eine generatorbasierte Zusammensetzung für die Fehlerbehandlung ermöglicht","pt":"better-result é uma biblioteca leve para TypeScript que fornece uma forma de lidar com erros de maneira tipada e eficiente.","ru":"better-result — это лёгкая библиотека для TypeScript, которая предоставляет способ обработки ошибок типизированным и эффективным образом.","ar":"better-result هو مكتبة خفيفة الوزن ل TypeScript توفر طريقة للتعامل مع الأخطاء بطريقة مميزة و فعالة.","en":"Lightweight Result type for TypeScript with generator-based composition."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"better-result 采用：轻量级 TypeScript 结果类型","ja":"better-result 導入：TypeScript 向け軽量結果タイプ","ko":"better-result採用：軽量级 TypeScript 결과 유형","es":"Mejora tus resultados con better-result","fr":"Améliorez vos résultats avec better-result","de":"Bessere Ergebnisse mit better-result","pt":"Melhorando Resultados com better-result","ru":"Улучшение результатов с better-result","ar":"تحسين النتائج مع better-result","en":"better-result-adopt"},"description":{"zh":"better-result 提供了一种轻量级的 TypeScript 结果类型，用于简化错误处理和提高代码可靠性","ja":"better-resultはTypeScript向けの軽量結果タイプを提供し、エラーハンドリングを簡素化しコードの信頼性を向上させます","ko":"better-result는 TypeScript용 가벼운 결과 유형을 제공하여 오류 처리를 단순화하고 코드의 안정성을 향상시킵니다","es":"better-result es una biblioteca ligera para TypeScript que permite una composición basada en generadores para el manejo de errores","fr":"better-result est une bibliothèque légère pour TypeScript qui permet une composition basée sur des générateurs pour la gestion des erreurs","de":"better-result ist eine leichte Bibliothek für TypeScript, die eine generatorbasierte Zusammensetzung für die Fehlerbehandlung ermöglicht","pt":"better-result é uma biblioteca leve para TypeScript que fornece uma forma de lidar com erros de maneira tipada e eficiente.","ru":"better-result — это лёгкая библиотека для TypeScript, которая предоставляет способ обработки ошибок типизированным и эффективным образом.","ar":"better-result هو مكتبة خفيفة الوزن ل TypeScript توفر طريقة للتعامل مع الأخطاء بطريقة مميزة و فعالة.","en":"Lightweight Result type for TypeScript with generator-based composition."},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight Result type for TypeScript with generator-based composition."},"features":{"zh":["轻量级结果类型","generator-based 组合","类型化错误处理","Promise rejection 处理","铁路导向编程模式"],"ja":["軽量結果タイプ","generator-based 組み合わせ","型付きエラーハンドリング","Promise rejection 処理","鉄道指向プログラミングパターン"],"ko":["가벼운 결과 유형","generator-based 조합","유형화된 오류 처리","Promise 거부 처리","철도 지향 프로그래밍 패턴"],"es":["Manejo de errores tipados","Composición basada en generadores","Migración de try/catch y Promise rejections","Introducción de patrones de programación orientados a railway","Reemplazo de excepciones lanzadas con errores tipados"],"fr":["Gestion des erreurs typées","Composition basée sur des générateurs","Migration de try/catch et de rejets de Promise","Introduction de modèles de programmation orientés railway","Remplacement d''exceptions lancées avec des erreurs typées"],"de":["Typisierte Fehlerbehandlung","Generatorbasierte Zusammensetzung","Migration von try/catch und Promise-Ablehnungen","Einführung von Eisenbahn-orientierten Programmiermustern","Ersetzen von geworfenen Ausnahmen durch typisierte Fehler"],"pt":["Tipagem de erros","Composição baseada em geradores","Substituição de blocos try/catch","Suporte a Promise","Padrões de programação orientados a trilhos"],"ru":["Типизация ошибок","Композиция на основе генераторов","Замена блоков try/catch","Поддержка Promise","Шаблоны программирования, ориентированные на железнодорожные пути"],"ar":["تصنيف الأخطاء","التركيب المستندة إلى المولدات","استبدال كتل try/catch","دعم Promise","أنماط البرمجة الموجهة إلى سكة حديد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript","结果类型","错误处理","轻量级","generator-based","铁路导向编程"],"ja":["TypeScript","結果タイプ","エラーハンドリング","軽量","generator-based","鉄道指向プログラミング"],"ko":["TypeScript","결과 유형","오류 처리","가벼운","generator-based","철도 지향 프로그래밍"],"es":["better-result","TypeScript","manejo de errores","composición basada en generadores","migración de try/catch","reemplazo de excepciones","programación orientada a railway","errores tipados"],"fr":["better-result","TypeScript","gestion des erreurs","composition basée sur des générateurs","migration de try/catch","remplacement d''exceptions","programmation orientée railway","erreurs typées"],"de":["better-result","TypeScript","Fehlerbehandlung","generatorbasierte Zusammensetzung","Migration von try/catch","Ersetzen von Ausnahmen","Eisenbahn-orientierte Programmierung","typisierte Fehler"],"pt":["better-result","TypeScript","erros tipados","manipulação de erros","Result types","geradores","Promise","programação orientada a trilhos"],"ru":["better-result","TypeScript","типизированные ошибки","обработка ошибок","Result types","генераторы","Promise","программирование, ориентированное на железнодорожные пути"],"ar":["better-result","TypeScript","أخطاء مميزة","التعامل مع الأخطاء","Result types","مولدات","Promise","برمجة موجهة إلى سكة حديد"]}},"owner":"dmmulroy","repo":"better-result","repoPath":"dmmulroy/better-result","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.880Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"better-result-adopt","description":"Migrate codebase from try/catch or Promise-based error handling to better-result. Use when adopting Result types, converting thrown exceptions to typed errors, or refactoring existing error handling to railway-oriented programming.","bodyPreview":"# better-result Adoption\n\nMigrate existing error handling (try/catch, Promise rejections, thrown exceptions) to typed Result-based error handling with better-result.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adopting better-result in existing codebase\n- Converting try/catch blocks to Result types\n- Replacing thrown exceptions with typed errors\n- Migrating Promise-based code to Result.tryPromise\n- Introducing railway-oriented programming patterns\n\n## Migration Strategy\n\n### 1. Start at Boundaries\n\nBegin migration at I/","body":"# better-result Adoption\n\nMigrate existing error handling (try/catch, Promise rejections, thrown exceptions) to typed Result-based error handling with better-result.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adopting better-result in existing codebase\n- Converting try/catch blocks to Result types\n- Replacing thrown exceptions with typed errors\n- Migrating Promise-based code to Result.tryPromise\n- Introducing railway-oriented programming patterns\n\n## Migration Strategy\n\n### 1. Start at Boundaries\n\nBegin migration at I/O boundaries (API calls, DB queries, file ops) and work inward. Don''t attempt full-codebase migration at once.\n\n### 2. Identify Error Categories\n\nBefore migrating, categorize errors in target code:\n\n| Category       | Example                | Migration Target                                |\n| -------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| Domain errors  | NotFound, Validation   | TaggedError + Result.err                        |\n| Infrastructure | Network, DB connection | Result.tryPromise + TaggedError                 |\n| Bugs/defects   | null deref, type error | Let throw (becomes Panic if in Result callback) |\n\n### 3. Migration Order\n\n1. Define TaggedError classes for domain errors\n2. Wrap throwing functions with Result.try/tryPromise\n3. Convert imperative error checks to Result chains\n4. Refactor callbacks to generator composition\n\n## Pattern Transformations\n\n### Try/Catch to Result.try\n\n```typescript\n// BEFORE\nfunction parseConfig(json: string): Config {\n  try {\n    return JSON.parse(json);\n  } catch (e) {\n    throw new ParseError(e);\n  }\n}\n\n// AFTER\nfunction parseConfig(json: string): Result<Config, ParseError> {\n  return Result.try({\n    try: () => JSON.parse(json) as Config,\n    catch: (e) => new ParseError({ cause: e, message: `Parse failed: ${e}` }),\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Async/Await to Result.tryPromise\n\n```typescript\n// BEFORE\nasync function fetchUser(id: string): Promise<User> {\n  const res = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);\n  if (!res.ok) throw new ApiError(res.status);\n  return res.json();\n}\n\n// AFTER\nasync function fetchUser(id: string): Promise<Result<User, ApiError | UnhandledException>> {\n  return Result.tryPromise({\n    try: async () => {\n      const res = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);\n      if (!res.ok) throw new ApiError({ status: res.status, message: `API ${res.status}` });\n      return res.json() as Promise<User>;\n    },\n    catch: (e) => (e instanceof ApiError ? e : new UnhandledException({ cause: e })),\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Null Checks to Result\n\n```typescript\n// BEFORE\nfunction findUser(id: string): User | null {\n  return users.find((u) => u.id === id) ?? null;\n}\n// Caller must check: if (user === null) ...\n\n// AFTER\nfunction findUser(id: string): Result<User, NotFoundError> {\n  const user = users.find((u) => u.id === id);\n  return user\n    ? Result.ok(user)\n    : Result.err(new NotFoundError({ id, message: `User ${id} not found` }));\n}\n// Caller: yield* findUser(id) in Result.gen, or .match()\n```\n\n### Callback Hell to Generator\n\n```typescript\n// BEFORE\nasync function processOrder(orderId: string) {\n  try {\n    const order = await fetchOrder(orderId);\n    if (!order) throw new NotFoundError(orderId);\n    const validated = validateOrder(order);\n    if (!validated.ok) throw new ValidationError(validated.errors);\n    const result = await submitOrder(validated.data);\n    return result;\n  } catch (e) {\n    if (e instanceof NotFoundError) return { error: \"not_found\" };\n    if (e instanceof ValidationError) return { error: \"invalid\" };\n    throw e;\n  }\n}\n\n// AFTER\nasync function processOrder(orderId: string): Promise<Result<OrderResult, OrderError>> {\n  return Result.gen(async function* () {\n    const order = yield* Result.await(fetchOrder(orderId));\n    const validated = yield* validateOrder(order);\n    const result = yield* Result.await(submitOrder(validated));\n    return Result.ok(result);\n  });\n}\n// Error type is union of all yielded errors\n```\n\n## Defining TaggedErrors\n\nSee [references/tagged-errors.md](references/tagged-errors.md) for TaggedError patterns.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Check for source reference**: Look for `opensrc/` directory - if present, read the better-result source code for implementation details and patterns\n2. **Audit**: Find try/catch, Promise.catch, thrown errors in target module\n3. **Define errors**: Create TaggedError classes for domain errors\n4. **Wrap boundaries**: Use Result.try/tryPromise at I/O points\n5. **Chain operations**: Convert if/else error checks to .andThen or Result.gen\n6. **Update signatures**: Change return types to Result<T, E>\n7. **Update callers**: Propagate Result handling up call stack\n8. **Test**: Verify error paths with .match or type narrowing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- **Over-wrapping**: Don''t wrap every function. Start at boundaries, propagate inward.\n- **Losing error info**: Always include cause/context in TaggedError constructors.\n- **Mixing paradigms**: Once a module returns Result, callers should too (or explicitly .unwrap).\n- **Ignoring Panic**: Callbacks that throw become Panic. Fix the bug, don''t catch Panic.\n\n## References\n\n- [TaggedError Patterns](references/tagged-errors.md) - Defining and matching typed errors\n- `opensrc/` directory (if present) - Full better-result source code for deeper context\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:10.740Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript Agents needing robust error handling with Result types and generator-based composition.","zh":"适合于需要使用 Result 类型和基于生成器的组合进行强大的错误处理的 TypeScript 代理。","ja":"TypeScript エージェントが堅牢なエラーハンドリングと Result 型および生成ベースの構成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"강력한 에러 처리를 위해 Result 유형과 생성기 기반 구성이 필요한 TypeScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de TypeScript que necesitan un control de errores robusto con tipos de Resultado y composición basada en generadores.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents TypeScript qui ont besoin d''une gestion d''erreurs robuste avec des types de résultat et une composition basée sur des générateurs.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-Agents, die eine robuste Fehlerbehandlung mit Result-Typen und generatorbasierte Zusammensetzung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes TypeScript que necessitam de tratamento de erros robusto com tipos Result e composição baseada em geradores.","ru":"Идеально для агентов TypeScript, требующих надежной обработки ошибок с помощью типов Result и генераторной композиции.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية التي تحتاج إلى معالجة الخطأ القوية مع أنواع النتيجة والتركيب المبني على المولدات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to migrate existing error handling to typed Result-based error handling with better-result, utilizing railway-oriented programming patterns and replacing thrown exceptions with typed errors, while also supporting Promise-based code migration to Result.tryPromise.","zh":"赋予代理以更好的结果利用铁路导向的编程模式，将抛出的异常替换为类型化错误的能力，同时也支持将基于 Promise 的代码迁移到 Result.tryPromise。","ja":"エージェントは既存のエラーハンドリングを Result 型のエラーハンドリングに移行し、鉄道指向のプログラミングパターンを利用して、スローされた例外を型付けされたエラーに置き換えることができ、Promise ベースのコードを Result.tryPromise に移行することもサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 기존의 에러 처리를 Result 기반의 에러 처리로 마이그레이션할 수 있으며, 철도 지향 프로그래밍 패턴을 사용하여 던져진 예외를 유형화된 오류로 대체할 수 있고, Promise 기반 코드를 Result.tryPromise로 마이그레이션하는 것도 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a migrar el control de errores existente a un control de errores basado en Resultado con mejor resultado, utilizando patrones de programación orientada a ferrocarril y reemplazando excepciones lanzadas con errores tipados, y también admite la migración de código basado en Promesas a Result.tryPromise.","fr":"Permet aux agents de migrer la gestion des erreurs existante vers une gestion des erreurs basée sur les types de résultat avec un meilleur résultat, en utilisant des modèles de programmation orientés chemin de fer et en remplaçant les exceptions lancées par des erreurs typées, tout en prenant en charge la migration de code basé sur les promesses vers Result.tryPromise.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die vorhandene Fehlerbehandlung auf eine typsichere Fehlerbehandlung mit Result-Typen und besseren Ergebnissen zu migrieren, unter Verwendung von schienengebundenen Programmiermustern und durch Ersetzen von ausgelösten Ausnahmen mit typsicheren Fehlern, und unterstützt auch die Migration von Promise-basiertem Code zu Result.tryPromise.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a migrar o tratamento de erros existente para o tratamento de erros baseado em Result com melhor resultado, utilizando padrões de programação orientada a trilhos e substituindo exceções lançadas por erros tipados, além de suportar a migração de código baseado em Promessa para Result.tryPromise.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью мигрировать существующую обработку ошибок на типизированную обработку ошибок на основе Result с лучшим результатом, используя шаблоны программирования, ориентированные на железную дорогу, и заменяя выбрасываемые исключения типизированными ошибками, а также поддерживая миграцию кода на основе Promises в Result.tryPromise.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من هجرة معالجة الخطأ الحالية إلى معالجة الخطأ المُقاسة بناءً على النتيجة مع نتيجة أفضل، واستخدام أنماط البرمجة الموجهة إلى السكك الحديدية، واستبدال الاستثناءات المُلقاة بالأخطاء المُقاسة، بالإضافة إلى دعم هجرة رمز Promise إلى Result.tryPromise."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting try/catch blocks to Result types for improved error management","Migrating Promise-based code to Result.tryPromise for better error handling","Introducing railway-oriented programming patterns for more robust code composition"],"zh":["将 try/catch 块转换为 Result 类型以改善错误管理","将基于 Promise 的代码迁移到 Result.tryPromise 以获得更好的错误处理","引入铁路导向的编程模式以实现更强大的代码组合"],"ja":["try/catch ブロックを Result 型に変換してエラーマネージメントを改善する","Promise ベースのコードを Result.tryPromise に移行してエラーハンドリングを改善する","鉄道指向のプログラミングパターンを導入してコード構成をより強固にする"],"ko":["try/catch 블록을 Result 유형으로 변환하여 오류 관리를 개선하는 것","Promise 기반 코드를 Result.tryPromise로 마이그레이션하여 더好的 오류 처리를 하는 것","철도 지향 프로그래밍 패턴을 도입하여 더 강력한 코드 구성에 기여하는 것"],"es":["Convertir bloques try/catch en tipos de Resultado para una mejor gestión de errores","Migrar código basado en Promesas a Result.tryPromise para una mejor gestión de errores","Introducir patrones de programación orientada a ferrocarril para una composición de código más robusta"],"fr":["Convertir les blocs try/catch en types de résultat pour une meilleure gestion des erreurs","Migrer le code basé sur les promesses vers Result.tryPromise pour une meilleure gestion des erreurs","Introduire des modèles de programmation orientés chemin de fer pour une composition de code plus robuste"],"de":["Umwandeln von try/catch-Blöcken in Result-Typen für eine verbesserte Fehlerverwaltung","Migration von Promise-basiertem Code zu Result.tryPromise für eine bessere Fehlerverwaltung","Einführung von schienengebundenen Programmiermustern für eine robustere Codezusammensetzung"],"pt":["Conversão de blocos try/catch para tipos Result para melhor gerenciamento de erros","Migração de código baseado em Promessa para Result.tryPromise para melhor tratamento de erros","Introdução de padrões de programação orientada a trilhos para composição de código mais robusta"],"ru":["Преобразование блоков try/catch в типы Result для улучшения управления ошибками","Миграция кода на основе Promises в Result.tryPromise для лучшей обработки ошибок","Введение шаблонов программирования, ориентированных на железную дорогу, для более прочной композиции кода"],"ar":["تحويل كتل Try/Catch إلى أنواع النتيجة من أجل إدارة أفضل للأخطاء","هجرة رمز Promise إلى Result.tryPromise من أجل معالجة أفضل للأخطاء","إدخال أنماط البرمجة الموجهة إلى السكك الحديدية من أجل تركيب رمز أكثر متانة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Initial migration efforts required at code boundaries"],"zh":["需要 TypeScript 环境","代码边界需要初始迁移努力"],"ja":["TypeScript 環境が必要","コード境界では初期の移行努力が必要"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요함","코드 경계에서 초기 마이그레이션 노력이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de TypeScript","Se requieren esfuerzos iniciales de migración en los límites del código"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","Des efforts initiaux de migration sont nécessaires aux limites du code"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Anfangs sind Migrationsbemühungen an den Codegrenzen erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer ambiente TypeScript","Esforços iniciais de migração necessários nas fronteiras do código"],"ru":["Требуется среда TypeScript","Первоначальные усилия по миграции необходимы на границах кода"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة النمطية","جهود هجرة أولية مطلوبة على حدود الرمز"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5f1b3cfb868955a2ff39a188c3d0191c1c70e75e13b5af48d412f35658e8dc03","qualityScore":43}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('northseadl/skillwisp/security-ownership-map', 'community', 'northseadl', 'skillwisp', 'northseadl/skillwisp', 'security-ownership-map', 0, 0, 43, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.882Z', '2026-03-02T02:08:36.006Z', 'f06c1a59247569326702c945f397af163ea96cf2ecfdf2dde280605bf89a3ec8', '{"id":"northseadl/skillwisp/security-ownership-map","name":"security-ownership-map","description":{"zh":"安全所有权地图是一种代码安全分析工具，用于构建代码所有权图和计算所有权风险","ja":"セキュリティ所有権マップはコードセキュリティ分析ツールであり、コード所有権グラフを構築し、所有権リスクを計算する","ko":"보안 소유권 맵은 코드 보안 분석 도구로서 코드 소유권 그래프를 구축하고 소유권 위험을 계산한다","es":"El mapa de propietarios de seguridad es una herramienta que construye un grafo bipartito de personas y archivos de historial de Git.","fr":"La carte de propriété de sécurité est un outil qui construit un graphique bipartite de personnes et de fichiers à partir de l''historique Git.","de":"Die Sicherheitseigentümerkarte ist ein Tool, das einen bipartiten Graphen von Personen und Dateien aus Git-Historie erstellt.","pt":"O Mapa de Propriedade de Segurança é uma ferramenta de análise que ajuda a identificar riscos e melhorar a segurança do código","ru":"Карта Собственности Безопасности - это инструмент анализа, который помогает выявить риски и улучшить безопасность кода","ar":"خريطة ملكية الأمان هي أداة تحليل تساعد في تحديد المخاطر وتحسين أمان الكود","en":"为 AI 编程助手安装 Skills 的资源仓库 | Skills repository for AI coding assistants"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"安全所有权地图 - 代码安全分析工具","ja":"セキュリティ所有権マップ - コードセキュリティ分析ツール","ko":"보안 소유권 맵 - 코드 보안 분석 도구","es":"Mapa de propietarios de seguridad","fr":"Carte de propriété de sécurité","de":"Sicherheitseigentümerkarte","pt":"Mapa de Propriedade de Segurança - Ferramenta de Análise","ru":"Карта Собственности Безопасности - Инструмент Анализа","ar":"خريطة ملكية الأمان - أداة تحليل","en":"security-ownership-map"},"description":{"zh":"安全所有权地图是一种代码安全分析工具，用于构建代码所有权图和计算所有权风险","ja":"セキュリティ所有権マップはコードセキュリティ分析ツールであり、コード所有権グラフを構築し、所有権リスクを計算する","ko":"보안 소유권 맵은 코드 보안 분석 도구로서 코드 소유권 그래프를 구축하고 소유권 위험을 계산한다","es":"El mapa de propietarios de seguridad es una herramienta que construye un grafo bipartito de personas y archivos de historial de Git.","fr":"La carte de propriété de sécurité est un outil qui construit un graphique bipartite de personnes et de fichiers à partir de l''historique Git.","de":"Die Sicherheitseigentümerkarte ist ein Tool, das einen bipartiten Graphen von Personen und Dateien aus Git-Historie erstellt.","pt":"O Mapa de Propriedade de Segurança é uma ferramenta de análise que ajuda a identificar riscos e melhorar a segurança do código","ru":"Карта Собственности Безопасности - это инструмент анализа, который помогает выявить риски и улучшить безопасность кода","ar":"خريطة ملكية الأمان هي أداة تحليل تساعد في تحديد المخاطر وتحسين أمان الكود","en":"为 AI 编程助手安装 Skills 的资源仓库 | Skills repository for AI coding assistants"},"definition":{"en":"为 AI 编程助手安装 Skills 的资源仓库 | Skills repository for AI coding assistants"},"features":{"zh":["构建代码所有权图","计算所有权风险","导出图表","支持Neo4j和Gephi","使用Python 3和networkx库"],"ja":["コード所有権グラフを構築","所有権リスクを計算","グラフをエクスポート","Neo4jとGephiをサポート","Python 3とnetworkxライブラリを使用"],"ko":["코드 소유권 그래프를 구축","소유권 위험을 계산","그래프를 내보내기","Neo4j와 Gephi를 지원","Python 3와 networkx 라이브러리를 사용"],"es":["Construye un grafo bipartito de personas y archivos","Calcula el riesgo de propiedad","Exporta artefactos de grafo para Neo4j/Gephi","Crea un grafo de co-cambio de archivos","Ignora commits grandes y ruidosos"],"fr":["Construire un graphique bipartite de personnes et de fichiers","Calculer le risque de propriété","Exporter des artefacts de graphique pour Neo4j/Gephi","Créer un graphique de co-changement de fichiers","Ignorer les commits importants et bruyants"],"de":["Erstelle einen bipartiten Graphen von Personen und Dateien","Berechne das Eigentumsrisiko","Exportiere Graphenartefakte für Neo4j/Gephi","Erstelle einen Datei-Co-Änderungsgraphen","Ignoriere große und laute Commits"],"pt":["Criação de um gráfico bipartido de pessoas e arquivos","Cálculo do risco de propriedade","Exportação de artefatos de gráfico para Neo4j/Gephi","Detecção de comunidades com networkx","Análise de co-mudanças de arquivos"],"ru":["Создание бипартитного графа людей и файлов","Расчет риска собственности","Экспорт графических артефактов в Neo4j/Gephi","Обнаружение сообществ с помощью networkx","Анализ ко-изменений файлов"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم بيانية ثنائية لل أشخاص والملفات","حساب مخاطر الملكية","تصدير مكونات الرسوم البيانية إلى Neo4j/Gephi","اكتشاف المجتمعات باستخدام networkx","تحليل التغييرات المشتركة للملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码安全分析","安全所有权地图","代码所有权图","所有权风险","Neo4j","Gephi","Python 3","networkx"],"ja":["コードセキュリティ分析","セキュリティ所有権マップ","コード所有権グラフ","所有権リスク","Neo4j","Gephi","Python 3","networkx"],"ko":["코드 보안 분석","보안 소유권 맵","코드 소유권 그래프","소유권 위험","Neo4j","Gephi","Python 3","networkx"],"es":["seguridad de propietarios","mapa de propietarios","grafo bipartito","historial de Git","riesgo de propiedad","Neo4j","Gephi"],"fr":["sécurité de propriété","carte de propriété","graphique bipartite","historique Git","risque de propriété","Neo4j","Gephi"],"de":["Sicherheitseigentümer","Sicherheitseigentümerkarte","bipartiter Graph","Git-Historie","Eigentumsrisiko","Neo4j","Gephi"],"pt":["segurança do código","análise de gráficos","detecção de comunidades","networkx","Neo4j","Gephi","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["безопасность кода","анализ графиков","обнаружение сообществ","networkx","Neo4j","Gephi","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أمان الكود","تحليل الرسومات","اكتشاف المجتمعات","networkx","Neo4j","Gephi","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"northseadl","repo":"skillwisp","repoPath":"northseadl/skillwisp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.882Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-ownership-map","description":"Analyze git repositories to build a security ownership topology (people-to-file), compute bus factor and sensitive-code ownership, and export CSV/JSON for graph databases and visualization. Trigger only when the user explicitly wants a security-oriented ownership or bus-factor analysis grounded in git history (for example: orphaned sensitive code, security maintainers, CODEOWNERS reality checks for risk, sensitive hotspots, or ownership clusters). Do not trigger for general maintainer lists or non-security ownership questions.","bodyPreview":"# Security Ownership Map\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild a bipartite graph of people and files from git history, then compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi. Also build a file co-change graph (Jaccard similarity on shared commits) to cluster files by how they move together while ignoring large, noisy commits.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3\n- `networkx` (required; community detection is enabled by default)\n\nInstall with:\n\n```bash\npip install networkx\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Scope the re","body":"# Security Ownership Map\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild a bipartite graph of people and files from git history, then compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi. Also build a file co-change graph (Jaccard similarity on shared commits) to cluster files by how they move together while ignoring large, noisy commits.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3\n- `networkx` (required; community detection is enabled by default)\n\nInstall with:\n\n```bash\npip install networkx\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Scope the repo and time window (optional `--since/--until`).\n2. Decide sensitivity rules (use defaults or provide a CSV config).\n3. Build the ownership map with `scripts/run_ownership_map.py` (co-change graph is on by default; use `--cochange-max-files` to ignore supernode commits).\n4. Communities are computed by default; graphml output is optional (`--graphml`).\n5. Query the outputs with `scripts/query_ownership.py` for bounded JSON slices.\n6. Persist and visualize (see `references/neo4j-import.md`).\n\nBy default, the co-change graph ignores common “glue” files (lockfiles, `.github/*`, editor config) so clusters reflect actual code movement instead of shared infra edits. Override with `--cochange-exclude` or `--no-default-cochange-excludes`. Dependabot commits are excluded by default; override with `--no-default-author-excludes` or add patterns via `--author-exclude-regex`.\n\nIf you want to exclude Linux build glue like `Kbuild` from co-change clustering, pass:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo /path/to/linux \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/Kbuild\"\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\nRun from the repo root:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --since \"12 months ago\" \\\n  --emit-commits\n```\n\nDefaults: author identity, author date, and merge commits excluded. Use `--identity committer`, `--date-field committer`, or `--include-merges` if needed.\n\nExample (override co-change excludes):\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/Cargo.lock\" \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/.github/**\" \\\n  --no-default-cochange-excludes\n```\n\nCommunities are computed by default. To disable:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --no-communities\n```\n\n## Sensitivity rules\n\nBy default, the script flags common auth/crypto/secret paths. Override by providing a CSV file:\n\n```\n# pattern,tag,weight\n**/auth/**,auth,1.0\n**/crypto/**,crypto,1.0\n**/*.pem,secrets,1.0\n```\n\nUse it with `--sensitive-config path/to/sensitive.csv`.\n\n## Output artifacts\n\n`ownership-map-out/` contains:\n\n- `people.csv` (nodes: people)\n- `files.csv` (nodes: files)\n- `edges.csv` (edges: touches)\n- `cochange_edges.csv` (file-to-file co-change edges with Jaccard weight; omitted with `--no-cochange`)\n- `summary.json` (security ownership findings)\n- `commits.jsonl` (optional, if `--emit-commits`)\n- `communities.json` (computed by default from co-change edges when available; includes `maintainers` per community; disable with `--no-communities`)\n- `cochange.graph.json` (NetworkX node-link JSON with `community_id` + `community_maintainers`; falls back to `ownership.graph.json` if no co-change edges)\n- `ownership.graphml` / `cochange.graphml` (optional, if `--graphml`)\n\n`people.csv` includes timezone detection based on author commit offsets: `primary_tz_offset`, `primary_tz_minutes`, and `timezone_offsets`.\n\n## LLM query helper\n\nUse `scripts/query_ownership.py` to return small, JSON-bounded slices without loading the full graph into context.\n\nExamples:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out people --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag auth --bus-factor-max 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out person --person alice@corp --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out file --file crypto/tls\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out cochange --file crypto/tls --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section orphaned_sensitive_code\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out community --id 3\n```\n\nUse `--community-top-owners 5` (default) to control how many maintainers are stored per community.\n\n## Basic security queries\n\nRun these to answer common security ownership questions with bounded output:\n\n```bash\n# Orphaned sensitive code (stale + low bus factor)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section orphaned_sensitive_code\n\n# Hidden owners for sensitive tags\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section hidden_owners\n\n# Sensitive hotspots with low bus factor\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section bus_factor_hotspots\n\n# Auth/crypto files with bus factor <= 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag auth --bus-factor-max 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag crypto --bus-factor-max 1\n\n# Who is touching sensitive code the most\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out people --sort sensitive_touches --limit 10\n\n# Co-change neighbors (cluster hints for ownership drift)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out cochange --file path/to/file --min-jaccard 0.05 --limit 20\n\n# Community maintainers (for a cluster)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out community --id 3\n\n# Monthly maintainers for the community containing a file\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/community_maintainers.py \\\n  --data-dir ownership-map-out \\\n  --file network/card.c \\\n  --since 2025-01-01 \\\n  --top 5\n\n# Quarterly buckets instead of monthly\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/community_maintainers.py \\\n  --data-dir ownership-map-out \\\n  --file network/card.c \\\n  --since 2025-01-01 \\\n  --bucket quarter \\\n  --top 5\n```\n\nNotes:\n- Touches default to one authored commit (not per-file). Use `--touch-mode file` to count per-file touches.\n- Use `--window-days 90` or `--weight recency --half-life-days 180` to smooth churn.\n- Filter bots with `--ignore-author-regex ''(bot|dependabot)''`.\n- Use `--min-share 0.1` to show stable maintainers only.\n- Use `--bucket quarter` for calendar quarter groupings.\n- Use `--identity committer` or `--date-field committer` to switch from author attribution.\n- Use `--include-merges` to include merge commits (excluded by default).\n\n### Summary format (default)\n\nUse this structure, add fields if needed:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"orphaned_sensitive_code\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crypto/tls/handshake.rs\",\n      \"last_security_touch\": \"2023-03-12T18:10:04+00:00\",\n      \"bus_factor\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"hidden_owners\": [\n    {\n      \"person\": \"alice@corp\",\n      \"controls\": \"63% of auth code\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Graph persistence\n\nUse `references/neo4j-import.md` when you need to load the CSVs into Neo4j. It includes constraints, import Cypher, and visualization tips.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `bus_factor_hotspots` in `summary.json` lists sensitive files with low bus factor; `orphaned_sensitive_code` is the stale subset.\n- If `git log` is too large, narrow with `--since` or `--until`.\n- Compare `summary.json` against CODEOWNERS to highlight ownership drift.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:08:36.006Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced data visualization capabilities for security ownership mapping","zh":"非常适合需要高级数据可视化功能来进行安全所有权映射的Python分析代理","ja":"Python分析エージェントがセキュリティ所有権マッピングのための高度なデータ可視化機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"보안 소유권 매핑을 위한 고급 데이터 시각화 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzadas para mapeo de propiedad de seguridad","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python nécessitant des capacités de visualisation de données avancées pour la cartographie de la propriété de sécurité","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungsfähigkeiten für Sicherheitseigentumszuordnung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados para mapeamento de propriedade de segurança","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым необходимы расширенные возможности визуализации данных для картографирования владения безопасностью","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل بايثون التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصور البيانات لتحديد خريطة ملكية الأمان"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi using Python 3 and the networkx library, enabling advanced community detection and file co-change graph analysis through Jaccard similarity on shared commits","zh":"赋予代理计算所有权风险并使用Python 3和networkx库将图形制品导出到Neo4j/Gephi的能力，从而通过Jaccard相似度对共享提交的高级社区检测和文件共同更改图分析","ja":"Python 3とnetworkxライブラリを使用して、Neo4j/Gephiにグラフアーティファクトをエクスポートし、共通のコミットに対するジャカード類似度を使用して、高度なコミュニティ検出とファイルの共同変更グラフ分析を実行できるようにエージェントに所有権リスクを計算させる","ko":"Python 3과 networkx 라이브러리를 사용하여 Neo4j/Gephi에 그래프 아티팩트를 내보내기 위한 에이전트의 능력을 강화하여, 공유 커밋에 대한 자카드 유사성을 통해 고급 커뮤니티 탐지와 파일 공동 변경 그래프 분석을 수행할 수 있음","es":"Habilita a los agentes para calcular el riesgo de propiedad y exportar artefactos de grafo para Neo4j/Gephi utilizando Python 3 y la biblioteca networkx, lo que permite la detección de comunidades avanzada y el análisis de gráficos de co-cambio de archivos a través de la similitud de Jaccard en commits compartidos","fr":"Permet aux agents de calculer le risque de propriété et d''exporter des artefacts de graphique pour Neo4j/Gephi en utilisant Python 3 et la bibliothèque networkx, ce qui permet la détection avancée de communautés et l''analyse de graphiques de co-changement de fichiers via la similarité de Jaccard sur les commits partagés","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Eigentumsrisiko zu berechnen und Graph-Artefakte für Neo4j/Gephi zu exportieren, indem Python 3 und die networkx-Bibliothek verwendet werden, wodurch eine erweiterte Gemeinschaftserkennung und eine Analyse von Datei-Co-Change-Graphen durch Jaccard-Ähnlichkeit bei gemeinsamen Commits ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a computar o risco de propriedade e exportar artefatos de gráfico para Neo4j/Gephi usando Python 3 e a biblioteca networkx, permitindo a detecção avançada de comunidades e análise de gráficos de co-mudança de arquivos através da semelhança de Jaccard em commits compartilhados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вычислять риск владения и экспортировать графические артефакты в Neo4j/Gephi, используя Python 3 и библиотеку networkx, что позволяет выполнять расширенный анализ обнаружения сообществ и анализ графов共同ных изменений файлов посредством сходства Джаккарда в общих коммитах","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من حساب مخاطر الملكية وتصدير مكونات الرسم البياني إلى Neo4j/Gephi باستخدام بايثون 3 ومكتبة networkx، مما يتيح اكتشاف المجتمعات المتقدمة وتحليل رسوم بيانية التغيير المشترك للملفات من خلال تشابه Jaccard في التعديلات المشتركة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security ownership mapping from git history","Generating bipartite graphs of people and files","Analyzing file co-change graphs for clustering files by shared commits"],"zh":["从git历史记录自动执行安全所有权映射","生成人员和文件的二分图","分析文件共同更改图以通过共享提交对文件进行聚类"],"ja":["Gitの履歴からセキュリティ所有権マッピングを自動化する","人とファイルの二部グラフを生成する","ファイルの共同変更グラフを分析して、共通のコミットによるファイルのクラスタリングを実行する"],"ko":["git 기록에서 보안 소유권 매핑을 자동화하는 것","사람과 파일의 이분 그래프를 생성하는 것","파일 공동 변경 그래프를 분석하여 공유 커밋에 의한 파일 클러스터링을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar el mapeo de la propiedad de seguridad desde el historial de git","Generar gráficos bipartitos de personas y archivos","Analizar gráficos de co-cambio de archivos para agrupar archivos por commits compartidos"],"fr":["Automatiser la cartographie de la propriété de sécurité à partir de l''historique de git","Générer des graphiques bipartites de personnes et de fichiers","Analyser des graphiques de co-changement de fichiers pour regrouper des fichiers par commits partagés"],"de":["Automatisieren der Sicherheitseigentumszuordnung aus der Git-Historie","Erstellen von bipartiten Graphen von Personen und Dateien","Analysieren von Datei-Co-Change-Graphen zum Clustering von Dateien nach gemeinsamen Commits"],"pt":["Automatizar o mapeamento de propriedade de segurança do histórico do git","Gerar gráficos bipartidos de pessoas e arquivos","Analizar gráficos de co-mudança de arquivos para agrupar arquivos por commits compartilhados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать картографирование владения безопасностью из истории git","Генерировать бипартитные графы людей и файлов","Анализировать графы совместных изменений файлов для кластеризации файлов по общим коммитам"],"ar":["أتمتة تحديد خريطة ملكية الأمان من سجل التعديلات في 吉ت","إنتاج رسوم بيانية ثنائية للأشخاص والملفات","تحليل رسوم بيانية التغيير المشترك للملفات لتجميع الملفات حسب التعديلات المشتركة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3","Dependent on networkx library","Limited to git history analysis"],"zh":["需要Python 3","依赖于networkx库","仅限于git历史记录分析"],"ja":["Python 3が必要","networkxライブラリに依存する","Gitの履歴分析のみに限定される"],"ko":["Python 3이 필요함","networkx 라이브러리에 의존함","git 기록 분석에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere Python 3","Dependiente de la biblioteca networkx","Limitado al análisis del historial de git"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3","Dépend de la bibliothèque networkx","Limité à l''analyse de l''historique de git"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3","Abhängig von der networkx-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf die Analyse der Git-Historie"],"pt":["Exige Python 3","Dependente da biblioteca networkx","Limitado à análise do histórico do git"],"ru":["Требует Python 3","Зависит от библиотеки networkx","Ограничен анализом истории git"],"ar":["يتطلب بايثون 3","يعتمد على مكتبة networkx","محدود تحليل سجل التعديلات في 吉ت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f06c1a59247569326702c945f397af163ea96cf2ecfdf2dde280605bf89a3ec8","qualityS