pt":["Arquitetura de microsserviços .NET","Escalabilidade e flexibilidade melhoradas","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos ágeis","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a contêineres e orquestração"],"ru":["Архитектура микросервисов .NET","Улучшенная масштабируемость и гибкость","Разработка гибких приложений","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка контейнеров и оркестровки"],"ar":["بنية مايكروسيرفيس .NET","تحسين قابلية التوسع والتكامل","تطوير تطبيقات سريعة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم الحاويات وتنسيقها"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 AI 工具","什么是 .NET 微服务架构","finish-phase 案例研究","AI 工具安装","微服务架构示例","finish-phase 与其他框架的比较","AI 工具设置指南","使用 finish-phase 的好处"],"ja":["AI エージェントの使い方","什么是 .NET マイクロサービス アーキテクチャ","finish-phase の事例研究","AI エージェントのインストール","マイクロサービス アーキテクチャのデモンストレーション","finish-phase と他のフレームワークの比較","AI エージェントの設定ガイド","finish-phase を使用するメリット"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용법","什么是 .NET 마이크로 서비스 아키텍처","finish-phase 사례 연구","AI 에이전트 설치","마이크로 서비스 아키텍처 데모","finish-phase 와 다른 프레임워크의 비교","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","finish-phase 사용의 이점"],"es":["cómo usar agentes de AI","qué es arquitectura de microservicios","alternative a herramientas de AI","herramientas de AI vs competidores","instalación de agentes de AI","guía de configuración de microservicios"],"fr":["comment utiliser les agents IA","quoi est l''architecture de microservices","alternative aux outils IA","outils IA vs concurrents","installation d''agents IA","guide de configuration de microservices"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents verwendet","was ist .NET-Microservices-Architektur","Alternative zu KI-Tools","KI-Tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von KI-Agents","Einrichtungsanleitung für Microservices"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","arquitetura de microsserviços .NET","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","escalabilidade e flexibilidade","como usar finish-phase","finish-phase vs outros frameworks","instalar finish-phase"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","архитектура микросервисов .NET","разработка приложений","масштабируемость и гибкость","как использовать finish-phase","finish-phase vs другие фреймворки","установить finish-phase"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بنية مايكروسيرفيس .NET","تطوير التطبيقات","قابلية التوسع والتكامل","كيفية استخدام finish-phase","finish-phase مقابل إطارات أخرى","تثبيت finish-phase"]}},"owner":"cooper538","repo":"eshop-demo","repoPath":"cooper538/eshop-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.893Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"finish-phase","description":"Manually complete a phase and update phase.md. Use when you want to manually review/edit phase completion, or when auto-detection didnt trigger.","bodyPreview":"# Finish Phase\n\nManually complete a phase by updating its status and scope checklist. Use this when:\n- You want to manually review/edit scope checklist before marking complete\n- Auto-detection in `/finish-task` didn''t trigger (e.g., already on main branch)\n- You want to add notes to the phase''s Notes section\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/finish-phase 03              # Complete phase 03\n/finish-phase 03 --dry-run    # Preview changes without applying\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `$1` - Phase number (e.g., `03`, `3`, `","body":"# Finish Phase\n\nManually complete a phase by updating its status and scope checklist. Use this when:\n- You want to manually review/edit scope checklist before marking complete\n- Auto-detection in `/finish-task` didn''t trigger (e.g., already on main branch)\n- You want to add notes to the phase''s Notes section\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/finish-phase 03              # Complete phase 03\n/finish-phase 03 --dry-run    # Preview changes without applying\n```\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `$1` - Phase number (e.g., `03`, `3`, `phase-03`)\n- `--dry-run` - Preview changes without modifying files\n- `$ARGUMENTS` - Full arguments passed to the skill\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Parse Arguments\n\nExtract phase number from arguments:\n- Phase number: `03`, `3`, or `phase-03` → normalize to `03`\n\n```bash\n# Extract phase number\nPHASE_NUM=$(echo \"$ARGUMENTS\" | grep -oE ''[0-9]+'' | head -1)\nPHASE_NUM=$(printf \"%02d\" \"$PHASE_NUM\")\n```\n\n### Step 2: Locate Phase Directory\n\nFind the phase specification file:\n\n```bash\nPHASE_DIR=$(find specification -maxdepth 1 -type d -name \"phase-${PHASE_NUM}-*\" | head -1)\n```\n\nIf not found, show available phases and exit.\n\n### Step 3: Check Task Status\n\nRead all tasks in the phase and check their status:\n\n```bash\nfor task_file in \"$PHASE_DIR/tasks/\"task-*.md; do\n    # Extract status from each task\ndone\n```\n\nReport:\n- Total tasks\n- Completed tasks\n- Pending/in-progress tasks (warn if any)\n\nIf there are incomplete tasks, ask user for confirmation:\n> \"Phase has X incomplete tasks. Are you sure you want to mark the phase as complete?\"\n\n### Step 4: Preview Changes\n\nShow what will be changed:\n\n1. **Phase Status** - Current → `✅ completed`\n2. **Scope Checklist** - Which items will be checked off based on task names\n\nDisplay preview:\n```\n📋 Phase XX Completion Preview\n\nStatus: ⚪ pending → ✅ completed\n\nScope checklist updates:\n- [x] SharedKernel package (matched: task-01 SharedKernel)\n- [x] Contracts package (matched: task-02 Contracts)\n- [ ] Some other item (no match found)\n\nTasks: 5/5 completed\n\nApply changes? (y/n)\n```\n\n### Step 5: Apply Changes\n\nIf user approves (or `--dry-run` not specified):\n\n1. Update phase.md status to `✅ completed`\n2. Check off matched scope items\n3. Optionally ask if user wants to add notes\n\n### Step 6: Commit Changes\n\n```bash\ngit add \"$PHASE_DIR/phase.md\"\ngit commit -m \"[${PHASE_NUM}-00] docs: mark phase as completed\" --no-verify\n```\n\n### Step 7: Final Report\n\n```\n✅ Phase XX marked as completed!\n\nUpdated:\n- Status: ✅ completed\n- Scope: X/Y items checked\n\nGit commit: [XX-00] docs: mark phase as completed\n\nNext steps:\n- /task-status - see remaining phases\n- /start-task XX - start next phase''s first task\n```\n\n## Manual Scope Editing\n\nIf scope matching isn''t accurate, inform user:\n> \"Some scope items couldn''t be automatically matched. You can manually edit the phase.md file to check them off.\"\n\nOffer to open the file:\n> \"Would you like me to show you the scope section for manual review?\"\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Message |\n|-------|---------|\n| Phase not found | \"Phase XX not found. Available: phase-01, phase-02...\" |\n| Already completed | \"Phase XX is already marked as completed.\" |\n| No tasks exist | \"Phase XX has no tasks. Create tasks first with /phase-breakdown XX\" |\n\n## Safety Rules\n\n1. NEVER mark phase complete if user declines after incomplete task warning\n2. ALWAYS show preview before making changes\n3. ALWAYS commit changes after modifying phase.md\n4. NEVER modify task files (only phase.md)\n\n## Example Session\n\n```\nUser: /finish-phase 01\n\nClaude: 📂 Found phase: specification/phase-01-foundation/phase.md\n\nChecking tasks...\n- task-01: ✅ completed\n- task-02: ✅ completed\n- task-03: ✅ completed\n- task-04: ✅ completed\n- task-05: ✅ completed\n\nAll 5 tasks completed!\n\n📋 Phase 01 Completion Preview\n\nStatus: ⚪ pending → ✅ completed\n\nScope checklist updates:\n- [x] SharedKernel package (matched: task-01)\n- [x] Contracts package (matched: task-02)\n- [x] EShop.Common (matched: task-05)\n\nApply changes? (y/n)\n\nUser: y\n\nClaude: ✅ Phase 01 marked as completed!\n\nCommitted: [01-00] docs: mark phase as completed\n\nNext steps:\n- /task-status - see remaining phases\n- /phase-breakdown 02 - prepare next phase\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:10:24.272Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Agile Workflow Agents requiring manual phase completion and scope checklist management in .NET microservices architecture","zh":"适用于需要手动完成阶段和管理范围清单的 Agile Workflow 代理","ja":"Agile Workflow 代理の手動でステージを完了し、範囲の清単を管理する必要がある場合に適","ko":"Agile Workflow 代理가 수동으로 단계를 완료하고 범위의 목록을 관리해야 하는 경우에 적","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Flujo de Trabajo Ágil que requieren la finalización de fases manuales y la administración de listas de verificación de alcance en la arquitectura de microservicios .NET","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Workflow Agile nécessitant une completion de phase manuelle et une gestion de listes de vérification d''étendue dans l''architecture de microservices .NET","de":"Ideal für Agile-Workflow-Agents, die manuelle Phasenabschluss und Bereichs-Prüflisten-Verwaltung in der .NET-Mikrodienst-Architektur erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho Ágil que exigem conclusão manual de fases e gerenciamento de lista de escopo em arquitetura de microsserviços .NET","ru":"Идеально для агентов Agile Workflow, требующих ручного завершения фаз и управления списком объема в архитектуре микросервисов .NET","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء في تدفق العمل المتماسك الذين يتطلبون إكمال مرحلة يدوي وتدبير قائمة النطاق في بنية微خدمات .NET"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manually update phase status and scope checklists, leveraging `/finish-phase` commands with options like `--dry-run` for previewing changes, and utilizing Notes sections for added context, all within a .NET microservices framework","zh":"能够让代理手动更新阶段状态和范围清单，利用 `/finish-phase` 命令和选项如 `--dry-run` 预览更改，并利用 Notes 部分添加上下文，所有这些都在 .NET 微服务架构中","ja":"ステージの状態と範囲の清単を手動で更新することができる、 `/finish-phase` コマンドとオプション如 `--dry-run` を利用して更改をプレビューし、Notes 部分を利用して上下文を追加することができるすべての .NET 微服务架构中","ko":"수동으로 단계 상태와 범위의 목록을 업데이트할 수 있으며, `/finish-phase` 명령과 옵션을 사용하여 변경을 미리 보기하고, Notes 섹션을 사용하여 추가적인 컨텍스트를 추가할 수 있으며, 모두 .NET 微服务架构에서","es":"Habilita a los agentes a actualizar manualmente el estado de la fase y las listas de verificación de alcance, aprovechando los comandos `/finish-phase` con opciones como `--dry-run` para previsualizar los cambios, y utilizando las secciones de Notas para agregar contexto adicional, todo dentro de un marco de microservicios .NET","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour manuellement le statut de phase et les listes de vérification d''étendue, en exploitant les commandes `/finish-phase` avec des options comme `--dry-run` pour prévisualiser les modifications, et en utilisant les sections de Notes pour ajouter un contexte supplémentaire, le tout dans un cadre de microservices .NET","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, den Phasenstatus und Bereichs-Prüflisten manuell zu aktualisieren, indem sie Befehle wie `/finish-phase` mit Optionen wie `--dry-run` zur Vorschau von Änderungen nutzen und die Notizabschnitte für zusätzlichen Kontext verwenden, alles innerhalb eines .NET-Mikrodienst-Frameworks","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar manualmente o status da fase e as listas de escopo, utilizando comandos `/finish-phase` com opções como `--dry-run` para visualizar as alterações, e utilizando seções de Notas para adicionar contexto, tudo dentro de um framework de microsserviços .NET","ru":"Позволяет агентам вручную обновлять статус фазы и списки объема, используя команды `/finish-phase` с опциями, такими как `--dry-run` для предварительного просмотра изменений, и используя разделы заметок для добавления контекста, все в рамках архитектуры микросервисов .NET","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديث حالة المرحلة وقوائم النطاق يدويًا، باستخدام أوامر `/finish-phase` مع خيارات مثل `--dry-run` لمعاينة التغييرات، واستخدام أقسام الملاحظات لإضافة سياق، كل ذلك داخل إطار عمل microservices .NET"},"useCases":{"en":["Manually completing phases with custom scope checklists","Previewing phase completion changes using `--dry-run`","Adding notes to phase Notes sections for enhanced tracking"],"zh":["手动完成阶段并使用自定义范围清单","使用 `--dry-run` 预览阶段完成更改","将添加的上下文添加到阶段的 Notes 部分中以增强跟踪"],"ja":["ステージを手動で完了し、カスタムの範囲の清単を使用する"," `--dry-run` を利用してステージの完了更改をプレビューする","ステージの Notes 部分に追加の上下文を追加することで跟踪を強化する"],"ko":["수동으로 단계를 완료하고 사용자 정의 범위의 목록을 사용하여"," `--dry-run`을 사용하여 단계의 완료를 미리 보기하는","단계의 Notes 섹션에 추가적인 컨텍스트를 추가하여 더 강한 트래킹을 하는"],"es":["Finalizar fases manualmente con listas de verificación de alcance personalizadas","Previsualizar los cambios de finalización de fase utilizando `--dry-run`","Agregar notas a las secciones de Notas de la fase para un seguimiento mejorado"],"fr":["Terminer manuellement les phases avec des listes de vérification d''étendue personnalisées","Prévisualiser les modifications de completion de phase en utilisant `--dry-run`","Ajouter des notes aux sections de Notes de phase pour un suivi amélioré"],"de":["Phasen manuell mit benutzerdefinierten Bereichs-Prüflisten abschließen","Änderungen der Phasenabschluss mit `--dry-run` vorab anzeigen","Notizen in den Notizabschnitten der Phasen für eine verbesserte Nachverfolgung hinzufügen"],"pt":["Concluindo fases manualmente com listas de escopo personalizadas","Visualizando alterações de conclusão de fases usando `--dry-run`","Adicionando notas às seções de Notas da fase para acompanhamento aprimorado"],"ru":["Ручное завершение фаз с настраиваемыми списками объема","Предварительный просмотр изменений завершения фазы с помощью `--dry-run`","Добавление заметок в разделы заметок фазы для улучшенного отслеживания"],"ar":["إكمال المراحل يدويًا بالقوائم المخصصة","معاينة التغييرات لإكمال المرحلة باستخدام `--dry-run`","إضافة ملاحظات إلى أقسام الملاحظات للتعقب المحسن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual intervention for phase completion",".NET microservices architecture dependency","Limited to phases with defined scope checklists"],"zh":["需要手动干预来完成阶段",".NET 微服务架构依赖","仅限于具有定义范围清单的阶段"],"ja":["ステージを完了するために手動干預が必要である",".NET 微服务架構依赖","定義された範囲の清単を有するステージのみを制限する"],"ko":["단계를 완료하기 위해 수동으로干預가 필요",".NET 微服务架构에 의존","정의된 범위의 목록을 가진 단계만을 제한"],"es":["Requiere intervención manual para la finalización de la fase","Dependencia de la arquitectura de microservicios .NET","Limitado a fases con listas de verificación de alcance definidas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intervention manuelle pour la completion de phase","Dépendance de l''architecture de microservices .NET","Limité aux phases avec des listes de vérification d''étendue définies"],"de":["Benötigt manuelle Eingriffe für den Phasenabschluss",".NET-Mikrodienst-Architektur-Abhängigkeit","Begrenzt auf Phasen mit definierten Bereichs-Prüflisten"],"pt":["Exige intervenção manual para conclusão de fases","Dependência da arquitetura de microsserviços .NET","Limitado a fases com listas de escopo definidas"],"ru":["Требует ручного вмешательства для завершения фаз","Зависимость от архитектуры микросервисов .NET","Ограничен фазами с определенным списком объема"],"ar":["يتطلب تدخلًا يدويًا لإكمال المراحل","اعتماد بنية微خدمات .NET","محدود بالمراحل التي تحتوي على قوائم نطاق محددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"887ea8829d5476d95d287285e497204650ef00735ef91ddb6a2ee197a02147a0","qualityScore":43}');
