x avec react","recettes de jeu avec react three fiber"],"de":["wie man react three fiber verwendet","was ist reactive-polling","KI-Tools für Spiele","react three fiber vs a-frame","installation von react three fiber","konfigurationsanleitung für react three fiber","spieleentwicklung mit react","rezepte für spiele mit react three fiber"],"pt":["reactive-polling","React Three Fiber","desenvolvimento de jogos","jogos dinâmicos","atualizações em tempo real","ferramentas de IA","como usar reactive-polling","reactive-polling vs outras técnicas"],"ru":["reactive-polling","React Three Fiber","разработка игр","динамические игры","обновления в режиме реального времени","ИИ Агенты","как использовать reactive-polling","reactive-polling vs другие техники"],"ar":["التحديث التفاعلي","React Three Fiber","تطوير الألعاب","الألعاب الديناميكية","التحديثات في الوقت الفعلي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام التحديث التفاعلي","التحديث التفاعلي مقابل تقنيات أخرى"]}},"owner":"verekia","repo":"r3f-gamedev","repoPath":"verekia/r3f-gamedev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.975Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reactive-polling","description":"Poll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes.","bodyPreview":"# Reactive Polling\n\nPoll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes.\n\n## Technique\n\nCreate a `useReactive` hook that uses `useFrame` to periodically check a selector function. When the value changes, update React state to trigger a re-render. Throttle with a configurable FPS.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- Selector function returns the value to watch\n- Compare with previous value to detect changes\n- Only update state when value actually changes\n- Throttle polling with `useFrame`''","body":"# Reactive Polling\n\nPoll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes.\n\n## Technique\n\nCreate a `useReactive` hook that uses `useFrame` to periodically check a selector function. When the value changes, update React state to trigger a re-render. Throttle with a configurable FPS.\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- Selector function returns the value to watch\n- Compare with previous value to detect changes\n- Only update state when value actually changes\n- Throttle polling with `useFrame`''s `fps` option\n- Use sparingly for values that don''t change frequently\n\n## Usage\n\n```tsx\nconst useReactive = <T,>(selector: () => T, fps = 30): T => {\n  const [reactiveValue, setReactiveValue] = useState<T>(selector())\n  const previousValueRef = useRef(reactiveValue)\n\n  useFrame(\n    () => {\n      const newValue = selector()\n      if (previousValueRef.current !== newValue) {\n        previousValueRef.current = newValue\n        setReactiveValue(newValue)\n      }\n    },\n    { fps }\n  )\n\n  return reactiveValue\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst isAboveZero = useReactive(() => position.y > 0)\n```\n\n---\n\nThis skill is part of [verekia](https://x.com/verekia)''s [**r3f-gamedev**](https://github.com/verekia/r3f-gamedev).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:55:06.692Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient React state updates through reactive polling mechanisms.","zh":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient React state updates through reactive polling mechanisms.","ja":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient React state updates through reactive polling mechanisms.","ko":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient React state updates through reactive polling mechanisms.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan actualizaciones de estado de React eficientes a través de mecanismos de sondeo reactivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de mises à jour d''état React efficaces via des mécanismes de sondage réactifs.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die effiziente React-Zustandsaktualisierungen durch reaktive Polling-Mechanismen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de atualizações de estado do React eficientes por meio de mecanismos de polling reativos.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы эффективные обновления состояния React посредством реактивных механизмов опроса.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تحديثات كفؤة لحالة React من خلال آليات استطلاع تفاعلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to poll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes, utilizing the `useReactive` hook and `useFrame` for throttling with configurable FPS, while leveraging selector functions for value comparison.","zh":"Empowers agents to poll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes, utilizing the `useReactive` hook and `useFrame` for throttling with configurable FPS, while leveraging selector functions for value comparison.","ja":"Empowers agents to poll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes, utilizing the `useReactive` hook and `useFrame` for throttling with configurable FPS, while leveraging selector functions for value comparison.","ko":"Empowers agents to poll for changes to any value and trigger React re-renders when it changes, utilizing the `useReactive` hook and `useFrame` for throttling with configurable FPS, while leveraging selector functions for value comparison.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a sondear cambios en cualquier valor y desencadenar nuevas representaciones de React cuando cambia, utilizando el gancho `useReactive` y `useFrame` para limitar con FPS configurable, mientras aprovecha las funciones de selector para la comparación de valores.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger les modifications de toute valeur et de déclencher des nouvelles représentations de React lorsqu''elle change, en utilisant l''accroche `useReactive` et `useFrame` pour le throttling avec un FPS configurable, tout en exploitant les fonctions de sélection pour la comparaison de valeurs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, auf Änderungen jedes Wertes zu prüfen und React-Neuzeichnungen auszulösen, wenn dieser sich ändert, unter Nutzung des Hakens `useReactive` und `useFrame` für Drosselung mit konfigurierbaren FPS, während Selektor-Funktionen für den Wertevergleich genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a fazer o polling para alterações em qualquer valor e acionar re-renders do React quando ele muda, utilizando o gancho `useReactive` e `useFrame` para limitação com FPS configurável, aproveitando funções seletoras para comparação de valores.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью опроса изменений любого значения и запуска повторного рендеринга React при его изменении, используя хук `useReactive` и `useFrame` для ограничения с настраиваемым FPS, а также использует функции-селекторы для сравнения значений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استطلاع التغييرات لأي قيمة وتحفيز إعادة عرض React عند تغييرها، باستخدام_hook `useReactive` و `useFrame` للتحديد مع إعدادات FPS قابلة للتكوين، مع الاستفادة من وظائف اختيار للقيمة المقارنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating React state updates based on external value changes","Generating dynamic UI components with real-time data updates","Debugging complex React applications with efficient re-render triggering"],"zh":["Automating React state updates based on external value changes","Generating dynamic UI components with real-time data updates","Debugging complex React applications with efficient re-render triggering"],"ja":["Automating React state updates based on external value changes","Generating dynamic UI components with real-time data updates","Debugging complex React applications with efficient re-render triggering"],"ko":["Automating React state updates based on external value changes","Generating dynamic UI components with real-time data updates","Debugging complex React applications with efficient re-render triggering"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de estado de React en función de cambios de valores externos","Generar componentes de interfaz de usuario dinámicos con actualizaciones de datos en tiempo real","Depurar aplicaciones React complejas con un desencadenamiento de volver a representar eficiente"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour d''état React en fonction des modifications de valeurs externes","Générer des composants d''interface utilisateur dynamiques avec des mises à jour de données en temps réel","Déboguer des applications React complexes avec un déclenchement de re-représentation efficace"],"de":["Automatisieren von React-Zustandsaktualisierungen basierend auf Änderungen externer Werte","Erzeugen von dynamischen Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Echtzeit-Datenaktualisierungen","Fehlersuche in komplexen React-Anwendungen mit effizientem Neuzeichnen-Auslösen"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de estado do React com base em alterações de valores externos","Gerar componentes de interface do usuário dinâmicos com atualizações de dados em tempo real","Depurar aplicações React complexas com disparo eficiente de re-renderização"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновлений состояния React на основе изменений внешних значений","Генерация динамических компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с обновлениями данных в реальном времени","Отладка сложных приложений React с эффективным запуском повторного рендеринга"],"ar":["تتميم تحديثات حالة React آليًا بناءً على تغييرات القيم الخارجية","توليد مكونات واجهة المستخدم الديناميكية مع تحديثات البيانات في الوقت الفعلي","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات React المعقدة مع تشغيل إعادة العرض الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and React Three Fiber integration","Dependent on the `useFrame` function for throttling","Limited to React-based applications"],"zh":["Requires React and React Three Fiber integration","Dependent on the `useFrame` function for throttling","Limited to React-based applications"],"ja":["Requires React and React Three Fiber integration","Dependent on the `useFrame` function for throttling","Limited to React-based applications"],"ko":["Requires React and React Three Fiber integration","Dependent on the `useFrame` function for throttling","Limited to React-based applications"],"es":["Requiere la integración de React y React Three Fiber","Depende de la función `useFrame` para el throttling","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de React et de React Three Fiber","Dépend de la fonction `useFrame` pour le throttling","Limité aux applications basées sur React"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration von React und React Three Fiber","Hängt von der Funktion `useFrame` für die Drosselung ab","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige integração do React e React Three Fiber","Dependente da função `useFrame` para limitação","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React"],"ru":["Требует интеграции React и React Three Fiber","Зависит от функции `useFrame` для ограничения","Ограничен для приложений на основе React"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل React و React Three Fiber","يعتمد على وظيفة `useFrame` للتحديد","محدود للتطبيقات المعتمدة على React"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6cfd58cdd5e514369d4d3c08c5d2a50ca0c37bfd06b98151b865209654a9499d","qualityScore":43}');
