дактирование кода с помощью Python"],"ar":["تنسيق تلقائي للمنشورات","تحسين محركات البحث مع React","التكامل مع Node.js و CLI","دعم عدة صيغ ملفات","تحرير الكود باستخدام Python"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI工具格式化博客文章","什么是博客文章格式化器","AI工具替代品","博客文章格式化器与竞争对手比较","如何安装博客文章格式化器","博客文章格式化器设置指南"],"ja":["ブログ投稿をフォーマットする方法","ブログ投稿フォーマッターとは","AIエージェントの代替品","ブログ投稿フォーマッターと競合製品の比較","ブログ投稿フォーマッターのインストール方法","ブログ投稿フォーマッターの設定ガイド"],"ko":["블로그 포스트를 형식화하는 방법","블로그 포스트 형식화기란","AI 에이전트의 대체품","블로그 포스트 형식화기와 경쟁사 제품 비교","블로그 포스트 형식화기를 설치하는 방법","블로그 포스트 형식화기 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de formateo","qué es un formateador de posts de blog","Agentes de IA para blogging","formateador de posts de blog alternativa","instalación de herramientas de formateo","guía de configuración de formateador de posts de blog"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils de formatage","qu''est-ce qu''un outil de formatage de billets de blog","Outils d''IA pour le blogging","outils de formatage de billets de blog alternative","installation d''outils de formatage","guide de configuration d''outils de formatage de billets de blog"],"de":["wie man Formatierungstools verwendet","was ist ein Blog-Post-Formatter","KI-Tools für Bloggen","Blog-Post-Formatter Alternative","Installation von Formatierungstools","Einrichtungsanleitung für Blog-Post-Formatter"],"pt":["como usar formatador de postagens de blog","o que é formatador de postagens de blog","formatador de postagens de blog alternativa","formatador de postagens de blog vs competidor","instalar formatador de postagens de blog","guia de configuração do formatador de postagens de blog","desenvolvimento web com React e Node.js","otimização de SEO para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать форматтер постов в блоге","что такое форматтер постов в блоге","форматтер постов в блоге альтернатива","форматтер постов в блоге vs конкурент","установить форматтер постов в блоге","руководство по настройке форматтера постов в блоге","веб-разработка с помощью React и Node.js","оптимизация SEO для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مصمم منشورات المدونة","ما هو مصمم منشورات المدونة","مصمم منشورات المدونة بديل","مصمم منشورات المدونة مقابل منافس","تثبيت مصمم منشورات المدونة","دليل إعداد مصمم منشورات المدونة","تطوير الويب باستخدام React و Node.js","تحسين محركات البحث لالمطورين"]}},"owner":"santosrai","repo":"santosrai.github.io","repoPath":"santosrai/santosrai.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.990Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"blog-post-formatter","description":"Format blog content into properly structured markdown files for Next.js portfolio blog. Use when user wants to: (1) Format raw blog content into markdown with frontmatter, (2) Create new blog posts from topics or titles, (3) Generate blog post files with proper metadata (title, excerpt, date, author) and save to _posts/ directory. Automatically generates excerpts, converts titles to kebab-case filenames, and ensures proper frontmatter format.","bodyPreview":"Format blog content into properly structured markdown files for the Next.js portfolio website. All blog posts are stored in `_posts/` directory and automatically processed by the site''s MDX system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- **File location**: `_posts/{slug}.md` (slug is kebab-case of title)\n- **Frontmatter format**: See [references/post-structure.md](references/post-structure.md)\n- **Template**: See [assets/template.md](assets/template.md)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Format Existing Content\n\nWhen user pro","body":"Format blog content into properly structured markdown files for the Next.js portfolio website. All blog posts are stored in `_posts/` directory and automatically processed by the site''s MDX system.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n- **File location**: `_posts/{slug}.md` (slug is kebab-case of title)\n- **Frontmatter format**: See [references/post-structure.md](references/post-structure.md)\n- **Template**: See [assets/template.md](assets/template.md)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Format Existing Content\n\nWhen user provides raw blog content:\n\n1. **Extract or generate title**:\n   - If first line is a heading (H1), use it as title\n   - If content starts with text, extract first sentence or generate from content\n   - Ensure title is clear and descriptive\n\n2. **Generate excerpt**:\n   - Extract first meaningful paragraph (150-200 characters)\n   - Remove markdown formatting from excerpt\n   - If no suitable paragraph, generate summary from first few sentences\n   - Keep excerpt concise and engaging\n\n3. **Set metadata**:\n   - **Date**: Use current date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format if not provided\n   - **Author**: Default to `''Santosh Rai''` (wrapped in single quotes)\n   - **Title**: Wrap in single quotes in frontmatter\n\n4. **Format content**:\n   - Do NOT include an H1 heading in the content (the page component already displays the title from frontmatter)\n   - Start content directly with paragraphs or H2 headings\n   - Preserve user''s original markdown formatting\n   - Validate markdown syntax (code blocks, lists, links)\n\n5. **Generate filename**:\n   - Convert title to kebab-case (lowercase, hyphens for spaces)\n   - Remove special characters, keep only alphanumeric and hyphens\n   - Example: \"Understanding JavaScript\" → `understanding-javascript.md`\n\n6. **Save file**: Write to `_posts/{slug}.md`\n\n### 2. Create New Post\n\nWhen user provides topic/title:\n\n1. **Generate frontmatter**:\n   - Use provided title or generate from topic\n   - Create excerpt placeholder or generate from topic description\n   - Set date to current date\n   - Set author to `''Santosh Rai''`\n\n2. **Create structure**:\n   - Do NOT add an H1 heading (the page component already displays the title from frontmatter)\n   - Start content directly with paragraphs or H2 headings\n   - Add placeholder sections or basic outline\n   - Use template from `assets/template.md` as starting point\n\n3. **Save file**: Write to `_posts/{slug}.md`\n\n### 3. Auto-Generation Rules\n\n**Excerpt generation**:\n- Extract first paragraph (up to 200 characters)\n- Remove markdown syntax (links, bold, code)\n- If paragraph is too short, include next sentence\n- Ensure excerpt is complete and grammatically correct\n\n**Title to slug conversion**:\n- Convert to lowercase\n- Replace spaces with hyphens\n- Remove special characters (keep only alphanumeric and hyphens)\n- Remove leading/trailing hyphens\n- Examples:\n  - \"What is JavaScript?\" → `what-is-javascript`\n  - \"Design Patterns With VBA\" → `design-patterns-with-vba`\n  - \"Simple calculator in javascript using MVC pattern\" → `simple-calculator-in-javascript-using-mvc-pattern`\n\n**Date format**: Always use `YYYY-MM-DD` (e.g., `''2024-01-20''`)\n\n## Frontmatter Format\n\nAll posts must include this exact frontmatter structure:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: ''Post Title''\nexcerpt: ''Brief description''\ndate: ''YYYY-MM-DD''\nauthor: ''Santosh Rai''\n---\n```\n\n**Important**: All values must be wrapped in single quotes.\n\n## Validation\n\nBefore saving, verify:\n- Frontmatter has all required fields (title, excerpt, date, author)\n- Date is in YYYY-MM-DD format\n- All frontmatter values are wrapped in single quotes\n- Content does NOT start with an H1 heading (title is displayed from frontmatter)\n- Filename is valid kebab-case slug\n- File will be saved in `_posts/` directory\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example 1: Format existing content**\n```\nUser: \"Here''s my blog post about JavaScript closures...\"\n\nOutput: Creates _posts/javascript-closures.md with:\n- Title extracted/generated from content\n- Excerpt from first paragraph\n- Current date\n- Properly formatted markdown\n```\n\n**Example 2: Create new post**\n```\nUser: \"Create a blog post about React hooks\"\n\nOutput: Creates _posts/react-hooks.md with:\n- Title: \"React Hooks\"\n- Generated excerpt about React hooks\n- Current date\n- Basic structure starting with content (no H1 heading)\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- **Post structure details**: See [references/post-structure.md](references/post-structure.md) for complete format specification and examples\n- **Template**: See [assets/template.md](assets/template.md) for reusable blog post template\n\n## Integration\n\nThe formatted files integrate automatically with the existing blog system:\n- `lib/mdx.ts` reads all `.md` files from `_posts/`\n- Posts are sorted by date (newest first)\n- Individual posts accessible at `/blog/[slug]`\n- Blog listing at `/blog` displays all posts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:02:32.858Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Management Agents needing advanced markdown formatting capabilities for Next.js portfolio websites.","zh":"非常适合需要高级markdown格式化功能的内容管理代理，用于Next.js作品集网站。","ja":"Next.jsのポートフォリオサイト向けに高度なMarkdown形式の機能を必要とするコンテンツ管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Next.js 포트폴리오 웹사이트를 위한 고급 마크다운 형식 기능을 필요로 하는 콘텐츠 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de contenido que necesitan capacidades de formato de marca avanzadas para sitios web de portfolio de Next.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de contenu nécessitant des capacités de mise en forme de markdown avancées pour les sites web de portfolio Next.js.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Management-Agents, die erweiterte Markdown-Formatierungs-Funktionen für Next.js-Portfolio-Websites benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conteúdo que necessitam de capacidades de formatação de markdown avançadas para sites de portfólio Next.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления контентом, которым требуются расширенные возможности форматирования markdown для сайтов-портфолио Next.js.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المحتوى التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات تنسيق markdown متقدمة لمواقع محفظة Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to format blog content into properly structured markdown files using MDX system, with support for frontmatter format and kebab-case slug generation, streamlining content processing for Next.js websites.","zh":"赋予代理以使用MDX系统格式化博客内容为正确结构化的markdown文件的能力，支持frontmatter格式和kebab-case slug生成，简化Next.js网站的内容处理。","ja":"MDXシステムを使用して、フロントマター形式とケバブケーススラッグ生成をサポートして、ブログコンテンツを正しく構造化されたMarkdownファイルに整形する機能をエージェントに与え、Next.jsのウェブサイトのコンテンツ処理を簡素化します。","ko":"MDX 시스템을 사용하여 블로그 콘텐츠를 적절하게 구조화된 마크다운 파일로 형식화하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, 프론트매터 형식과 케밥 케이스 슬러그 생성을 지원하여 Next.js 웹사이트의 콘텐츠 처리를 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dar formato a contenido de blog en archivos markdown estructurados correctamente utilizando el sistema MDX, con soporte para formato frontmatter y generación de slug en kebab-case, simplificando el procesamiento de contenido para sitios web de Next.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents de formater le contenu du blog en fichiers markdown structurés correctement en utilisant le système MDX, avec une prise en charge du format frontmatter et de la génération de slug en kebab-case, rationalisant le traitement du contenu pour les sites web Next.js.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Blog-Inhalt in ordnungsgemäß strukturierte Markdown-Dateien zu formatieren, indem sie das MDX-System verwenden, mit Unterstützung für Frontmatter-Format und Kebab-Case-Slug-Generierung, wodurch der Inhaltverarbeitungsprozess für Next.js-Websites rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a formatar o conteúdo do blog em arquivos markdown estruturados corretamente usando o sistema MDX, com suporte ao formato frontmatter e geração de slug em kebab-case, otimizando o processamento de conteúdo para sites Next.js.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью форматировать контент блога в правильно структурированные файлы markdown с помощью системы MDX, с поддержкой формата frontmatter и генерацией slug в формате kebab-case, оптимизируя обработку контента для сайтов Next.js.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنسيق محتوى المدونة في ملفات markdown منظمّة بشكل صحيح باستخدام نظام MDX، مع دعم تنسيق frontmatter وجيل عناوين slug بالشكل kebab-case، مما يُيسّر معالجة المحتوى لمواقع Next.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Formatting existing blog content for Next.js compatibility","Automating markdown file generation with proper frontmatter","Standardizing blog post structure using template.md"],"zh":["格式化现有的博客内容以兼容Next.js","使用正确的frontmatter自动生成markdown文件","使用template.md标准化博客文章结构"],"ja":["Next.jsと互換性のある既存のブログコンテンツを整形する","正しいフロントマターでMarkdownファイルを自動生成する","template.mdを使用してブログ記事の構造を標準化する"],"ko":["Next.js와 호환되는 기존 블로그 콘텐츠를 형식화하는 것","올바른 프론트매터로 마크다운 파일을 자동 생성하는 것","template.md를 사용하여 블로그 게시물 구조를 표준화하는 것"],"es":["Formato de contenido de blog existente para compatibilidad con Next.js","Automatización de la generación de archivos markdown con frontmatter adecuado","Estandarización de la estructura de publicaciones de blog utilizando plantilla.md"],"fr":["Mise en forme de contenu de blog existant pour la compatibilité avec Next.js","Automatisation de la génération de fichiers markdown avec frontmatter approprié","Standardisation de la structure des publications de blog en utilisant template.md"],"de":["Formatierung von bestehendem Blog-Inhalt für Next.js-Kompatibilität","Automatisierung der Generierung von Markdown-Dateien mit ordnungsgemäßen Frontmatter","Standardisierung der Blog-Beitrag-Struktur unter Verwendung von template.md"],"pt":["Formatar conteúdo de blog existente para compatibilidade com Next.js","Automatizar a geração de arquivos markdown com frontmatter apropriado","Padronizar a estrutura de postagens de blog usando template.md"],"ru":["Форматировать существующий контент блога для совместимости с Next.js","Автоматизировать генерацию файлов markdown с правильным frontmatter","Стандартизировать структуру постов в блоге с помощью template.md"],"ar":["تنسيق محتوى مدونة موجود لتحقيق التوافق مع Next.js","توفير آلي لإنشاء ملفات markdown مع تنسيق frontmatter مناسب","تقديم معيار لتنظيم هيكل منشورات المدونة باستخدام template.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to _posts/ directory","Limited to Next.js portfolio websites with MDX system","Dependent on specific frontmatter format and template.md structure"],"zh":["需要访问_posts/目录","仅限于使用MDX系统的Next.js作品集网站","依赖于特定的frontmatter格式和template.md结构"],"ja":["_posts/ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","MDXシステムを使用したNext.jsのポートフォリオサイトのみに限定","特定のフロントマター形式とtemplate.md構造に依存"],"ko":["_posts/ 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","MDX 시스템을 사용하는 Next.js 포트폴리오 웹사이트로 제한됩니다.","특정 프론트매터 형식 및 template.md 구조에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio _posts/","Limitado a sitios web de portfolio de Next.js con sistema MDX","Dependiente de un formato frontmatter específico y estructura de template.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire _posts/","Limité aux sites web de portfolio Next.js avec système MDX","Dépendant d''un format frontmatter spécifique et d''une structure de template.md"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis _posts/","Begrenzt auf Next.js-Portfolio-Websites mit MDX-System","Abhängig von einem spezifischen Frontmatter-Format und template.md-Struktur"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório _posts/","Limitado a sites de portfólio Next.js com sistema MDX","Dependente de formato frontmatter específico e estrutura template.md"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу _posts/","Ограничен для сайтов-портфолио Next.js с системой MDX","Зависит от конкретного формата frontmatter и структуры template.md"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل _posts/","محدود لمواقع محفظة Next.js بنظام MDX","يعتمد على تنسيق محدد لfrontmatter وهيكل template.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"25eab15d5f7dbf2598685c764cc73d0e8245e1dd3c26d9ef94810945847cb9e5","qualityScore":43}');
