heit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento com Laravel AI SDK","Integração com AI Agents","Melhoria da produtividade","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento avançadas","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Разработка с помощью Laravel AI SDK","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Повышение производительности","Продвинутые инструменты разработки","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["التطوير باستخدام Laravel AI SDK","التكامل مع أدوات الإيجاد الاصطناعي","تعزيز الإنتاجية","أدوات تطوير متقدمة","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Fortify 开发 AI 代理","什么是 AI 代理","Fortify vs 其他 AI 代理开发工具","Fortify 安装","Fortify 设置"],"ja":["Fortify で AI エージェントを開発する方法","AI エージェントとは何か","Fortify vs 其他 AI エージェント開発ツール","Fortify をインストールする方法","Fortify を設定する方法"],"ko":["Fortify 를 사용하여 AI 에이전트를 개발하는 방법","AI 에이전트란 무엇인가","Fortify vs 其他 AI 에이전트 개발 도구","Fortify 를 설치하는 방법","Fortify 를 설정하는 방법"],"es":["cómo usar Fortify","qué es AI Agent","Fortify vs Laravel","instalación de Fortify","guía de configuración de Fortify","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","desarrollo de proyectos con AI","Laravel AI SDK","Fortify para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser Fortify","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent IA","Fortify vs Laravel","installation de Fortify","guide de configuration de Fortify","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","développement de projets avec IA","SDK d''IA de Laravel","Fortify pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man Fortify verwendet","was ist ein AI Agent","Fortify vs Laravel","Installation von Fortify","Konfigurationsanleitung für Fortify","AI-Tools für Entwickler","Entwicklung von Projekten mit AI","AI-SDK von Laravel","Fortify für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar Fortify","o que é Fortify","Fortify alternative","Fortify vs Laravel","instalar Fortify","guia de configuração do Fortify","desenvolvimento com AI Agents"],"ru":["как использовать Fortify","что такое Fortify","Fortify альтернатива","Fortify vs Laravel","установить Fortify","руководство по настройке Fortify","разработка с ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Fortify","ما هي Fortify","بديل Fortify","Fortify مقابل Laravel","تثبيت Fortify","دليل إعداد Fortify","التطوير مع أدوات الإيجاد الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"joshcirre","repo":"larrykonn","repoPath":"joshcirre/larrykonn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.999Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"developing-with-fortify","description":"Laravel Fortify headless authentication backend development. Activate when implementing authentication features including login, registration, password reset, email verification, two-factor authentication (2FA/TOTP), profile updates, headless auth, authentication scaffolding, or auth guards in Laravel applications.","bodyPreview":"# Laravel Fortify Development\n\nFortify is a headless authentication backend that provides authentication routes and controllers for Laravel applications.\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Laravel Fortify patterns and documentation.\n\n## Usage\n\n- **Routes**: Use `list-routes` with `only_vendor: true` and `action: \"Fortify\"` to see all registered endpoints\n- **Actions**: Check `app/Actions/Fortify/` for customizable business logic (user creation, password validation, etc.)\n- **Confi","body":"# Laravel Fortify Development\n\nFortify is a headless authentication backend that provides authentication routes and controllers for Laravel applications.\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Laravel Fortify patterns and documentation.\n\n## Usage\n\n- **Routes**: Use `list-routes` with `only_vendor: true` and `action: \"Fortify\"` to see all registered endpoints\n- **Actions**: Check `app/Actions/Fortify/` for customizable business logic (user creation, password validation, etc.)\n- **Config**: See `config/fortify.php` for all options including features, guards, rate limiters, and username field\n- **Contracts**: Look in `Laravel\\Fortify\\Contracts\\` for overridable response classes (`LoginResponse`, `LogoutResponse`, etc.)\n- **Views**: All view callbacks are set in `FortifyServiceProvider::boot()` using `Fortify::loginView()`, `Fortify::registerView()`, etc.\n\n## Available Features\n\nEnable in `config/fortify.php` features array:\n\n- `Features::registration()` - User registration\n- `Features::resetPasswords()` - Password reset via email\n- `Features::emailVerification()` - Requires User to implement `MustVerifyEmail`\n- `Features::updateProfileInformation()` - Profile updates\n- `Features::updatePasswords()` - Password changes\n- `Features::twoFactorAuthentication()` - 2FA with QR codes and recovery codes\n\n> Use `search-docs` for feature configuration options and customization patterns.\n\n## Setup Workflows\n\n### Two-Factor Authentication Setup\n\n```\n- [ ] Add TwoFactorAuthenticatable trait to User model\n- [ ] Enable feature in config/fortify.php\n- [ ] Run migrations for 2FA columns\n- [ ] Set up view callbacks in FortifyServiceProvider\n- [ ] Create 2FA management UI\n- [ ] Test QR code and recovery codes\n```\n\n> Use `search-docs` for TOTP implementation and recovery code handling patterns.\n\n### Email Verification Setup\n\n```\n- [ ] Enable emailVerification feature in config\n- [ ] Implement MustVerifyEmail interface on User model\n- [ ] Set up verifyEmailView callback\n- [ ] Add verified middleware to protected routes\n- [ ] Test verification email flow\n```\n\n> Use `search-docs` for MustVerifyEmail implementation patterns.\n\n### Password Reset Setup\n\n```\n- [ ] Enable resetPasswords feature in config\n- [ ] Set up requestPasswordResetLinkView callback\n- [ ] Set up resetPasswordView callback\n- [ ] Define password.reset named route (if views disabled)\n- [ ] Test reset email and link flow\n```\n\n> Use `search-docs` for custom password reset flow patterns.\n\n### SPA Authentication Setup\n\n```\n- [ ] Set ''views'' => false in config/fortify.php\n- [ ] Install and configure Laravel Sanctum\n- [ ] Use ''web'' guard in fortify config\n- [ ] Set up CSRF token handling\n- [ ] Test XHR authentication flows\n```\n\n> Use `search-docs` for integration and SPA authentication patterns.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Custom Authentication Logic\n\nOverride authentication behavior using `Fortify::authenticateUsing()` for custom user retrieval or `Fortify::authenticateThrough()` to customize the authentication pipeline. Override response contracts in `AppServiceProvider` for custom redirects.\n\n### Registration Customization\n\nModify `app/Actions/Fortify/CreateNewUser.php` to customize user creation logic, validation rules, and additional fields.\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\nConfigure via `fortify.limiters.login` in config. Default configuration throttles by username + IP combination.\n\n## Key Endpoints\n\n| Feature                | Method   | Endpoint                                    |\n|------------------------|----------|---------------------------------------------|\n| Login                  | POST     | `/login`                                    |\n| Logout                 | POST     | `/logout`                                   |\n| Register               | POST     | `/register`                                 |\n| Password Reset Request | POST     | `/forgot-password`                          |\n| Password Reset         | POST     | `/reset-password`                           |\n| Email Verify Notice    | GET      | `/email/verify`                             |\n| Resend Verification    | POST     | `/email/verification-notification`          |\n| Password Confirm       | POST     | `/user/confirm-password`                    |\n| Enable 2FA             | POST     | `/user/two-factor-authentication`           |\n| Confirm 2FA            | POST     | `/user/confirmed-two-factor-authentication` |\n| 2FA Challenge          | POST     | `/two-factor-challenge`                     |\n| Get QR Code            | GET      | `/user/two-factor-qr-code`                  |\n| Recovery Codes         | GET/POST | `/user/two-factor-recovery-codes`           |"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:05:22.103Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Laravel Developer Agents needing to implement and customize headless authentication backends.","zh":"非常适合需要实现和自定义无头身份验证后端的Laravel开发者代理。","ja":"Laravel Developerエージェントがヘッドレス認証バックエンドを実装してカスタマイズする必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"헤드리스 인증 백엔드를 구현하고 사용자 지정하는 Laravel 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollador de Laravel que necesitan implementar y personalizar backends de autenticación sin cabeza.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développeur Laravel ayant besoin de mettre en œuvre et de personnaliser les backends d''authentification sans tête.","de":"Perfekt für Laravel-Entwickleragenten, die headless-Authentifizierungs-Backends implementieren und anpassen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Desenvolvedores Laravel que precisam implementar e personalizar backends de autenticação headless.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков Laravel, которым необходимо внедрять и настраивать бэкенды аутентификации без головной части (headless).","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مطوري Laravel الذين يحتاجون إلى تنفيذ وتخصيص واجهات نظام المصادقة الخلفية من النوع Headless."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to introspect Fortify routes using `list-routes` with vendor filtering, customize authentication logic in `app/Actions/Fortify/`, and access comprehensive documentation through `search-docs` for Laravel Fortify patterns.","zh":"使代理能够使用带有供应商过滤的`list-routes`introspect Fortify路由，自定义`app/Actions/Fortify/`中的身份验证逻辑，并通过`search-docs`访问有关Laravel Fortify模式的全面文档。","ja":"`list-routes`でベンダーフィルタリングを使用してFortifyルートをインスペクトし、`app/Actions/Fortify/`の認証ロジックをカスタマイズし、`search-docs`を使用してLaravel Fortifyパターンの包括的なドキュメントにアクセスできるようにします。","ko":"대리人が `list-routes`를 사용하여 판매자 필터링과 함께 Fortify 경로를 검사하고, `app/Actions/Fortify/`의 인증 논리를 사용자 지정하며, `search-docs`를 통해 Laravel Fortify 패턴에 대한 포괄적인 문서에 액세스할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes introspeccionar rutas de Fortify utilizando `list-routes` con filtrado de proveedor, personalizar la lógica de autenticación en `app/Actions/Fortify/` y acceder a la documentación completa a través de `search-docs` para patrones de Laravel Fortify.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''introspecter les routes Fortify en utilisant `list-routes` avec un filtrage de fournisseur, de personnaliser la logique d''authentification dans `app/Actions/Fortify/` et d''accéder à une documentation complète via `search-docs` pour les modèles de Laravel Fortify.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Fortify-Routen mit `list-routes` und Anbieterfilterung zu introspeziieren, Authentifizierungslogik in `app/Actions/Fortify/` anzupassen und umfassende Dokumentation über `search-docs` für Laravel-Fortify-Muster zu erhalten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes introspecionem as rotas do Fortify usando `list-routes` com filtro de vendor, personalizem a lógica de autenticação em `app/Actions/Fortify/` e acessem documentação abrangente através de `search-docs` para padrões do Laravel Fortify.","ru":"Позволяет агентам интроспектировать маршруты Fortify с использованием `list-routes` с фильтрацией по поставщику, настраивать логику аутентификации в `app/Actions/Fortify/` и получать доступ к исчерпывающей документации через `search-docs` для шаблонов реализации Laravel Fortify.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من فحص مسارات Fortify الداخلية باستخدام `list-routes` مع التصفية حسب المورد، وتخصيص منطق المصادقة في `app/Actions/Fortify/`، والوصول إلى وثائق شاملة عبر `search-docs` لأنماط Laravel Fortify."},"useCases":{"en":["Listing registered Fortify endpoints with vendor filtering","Customizing user creation and password validation actions","Documentation retrieval for Fortify implementation patterns"],"zh":["带有供应商过滤的注册Fortify端点列表","自定义用户创建和密码验证操作","用于Fortify实现模式的文档检索"],"ja":["ベンダーフィルタリングを使用した登録されたFortifyエンドポイントのリスト","ユーザー作成とパスワード検証アクションのカスタマイズ","Fortify実装パターンのドキュメントの取得"],"ko":["판매자 필터링과 함께 등록된 Fortify 엔드포인트 목록","사용자 생성 및 비밀번호 유효성 검사 작업 사용자 지정","Fortify 구현 패턴에 대한 문서 검색"],"es":["Listado de puntos finales de Fortify registrados con filtrado de proveedor","Personalización de acciones de creación de usuarios y validación de contraseñas","Recuperación de documentación para patrones de implementación de Fortify"],"fr":["Liste des points de terminaison Fortify enregistrés avec filtrage de fournisseur","Personnalisation des actions de création d''utilisateurs et de validation de mots de passe","Récupération de la documentation pour les modèles d''implémentation de Fortify"],"de":["Auflistung der registrierten Fortify-Endpunkte mit Anbieterfilterung","Anpassung von Benutzererstellungs- und Passwortvalidierungsaktionen","Abruf von Dokumentationen für Fortify-Implementierungsmuster"],"pt":["Listagem de endpoints registrados do Fortify com filtro de vendor","Personalização de ações de criação de usuário e validação de senha","Recuperação de documentação para padrões de implementação do Fortify"],"ru":["Перечисление зарегистрированных конечных точек Fortify с фильтрацией по поставщику","Настройка действий создания пользователя и проверки пароля","Получение документации по шаблонам реализации Fortify"],"ar":["سرد نقاط نهاية Fortify المسجلة مع التصفية حسب المورد","تخصيص إجراءات إنشاء المستخدم والتحقق من صحة كلمة المرور","استرجاع الوثائق لأنماط تنفيذ Fortify"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Laravel application context","Dependent on Fortify package installation","Limited to headless authentication backend functionality"],"zh":["需要Laravel应用程序上下文","依赖于Fortify软件包安装","仅限于无头身份验证后端功能"],"ja":["Laravelアプリケーションコンテキストが必要","Fortifyパッケージのインストールに依存","ヘッドレス認証バックエンドの機能に限定"],"ko":["Laravel 애플리케이션 컨텍스트가 필요","Fortify 패키지 설치에 종속","헤드리스 인증 백엔드 기능에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere contexto de aplicación de Laravel","Dependiente de la instalación del paquete Fortify","Limitado a la funcionalidad de backend de autenticación sin cabeza"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte d''application Laravel","Dépend de l''installation du package Fortify","Limité à la fonctionnalité de backend d''authentification sans tête"],"de":["Erfordert Laravel-Anwendungskontext","Abhängig von der Installation des Fortify-Pakets","Begrenzt auf headless-Authentifizierungs-Backend-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer o contexto de uma aplicação Laravel","Dependente da instalação do pacote Fortify","Limitado à funcionalidade de backend de autenticação headless"],"ru":["Требует контекста приложения Laravel","Зависит от установки пакета Fortify","Ограничено функциональностью бэкенда аутентификации без головной части (headless)"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تطبيق Laravel","يعتمد على تثبيت حزمة Fortify","يقتصر على وظيفة نظام المصادقة الخلفية من النوع Headless"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d7dfca5fad472ae64de40ec550f9ba9606ba34c23129e18f3daabc894e1c7014","qualityScore":43}');
